"capaz de entrar en lugares seguros es mucho más útil."

#. ~ Description of profession "Lockpicking (Beginner)" for male
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Whether it was for fun, innocent utility, or criminal intent, you learned "
"the basics of how to silently pick locks.  Now, being able to get into "
"secured places just got a lot more useful."
msgstr ""
"Ya sea por diversión, por utilidad inocente o por intención delictiva, "
"aprendiste lo básico para forzar cerraduras de forma silenciosa. Ahora, ser "
"capaz de entrar en lugares seguros es mucho más útil."

#. ~ Description of profession "Offroad Driving" for female
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Whether you're into dirtbikes, ATVs, or dune buggies, you have experience "
"driving on terrain that isn't well-suited to wheels."
msgstr ""

