#. ~ Description of profession "Parkour" for female
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've practiced parkour for many years, and made the world your "
"playground.  It wouldn't be a lie to say that running is your life.  Which "
"is good, because now that the end has come, you're running for your life."
msgstr ""
"Practicaste parkour por muchos años y convertiste al mundo en tu parque de "
"juegos. No sería mentira decir que correr es tu vida. Y está muy bien, "
"porque ahora que llegó el fin, vas a correr por tu vida."

#. ~ Description of profession "Parkour" for male
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
