msgstr "¡Te falla la respiración!"

#. ~ Death message of effect type "Buzzed, Tipsy, Drunk, Wasted, Dead Drunk"
#. ~ Death message of effect type "Opioid Painkillers, Opioid Buzz, Opioid High, Heavy Opioid High, Nodding Out, Opioid Overdose, Severe Opioid Overdose"
#: data/json/effects.json
