#. ~ Description of effect type "Eye Irritation"
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Mild Eye Irritation, Eye Irritation, Major Eye Irritation, Severe Eye Irritation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your eyes are watering."
