"completely flat.  Every side of every surface is on display.  You look down "
"at your hands; you can see the front, the back, the insides and outsides of "
"every vein and bone, all in the same place on one surface.  You can't "
"imagine what has happened to your eyes to let you understand what you are "
"seeing.  Or your brain."
