#. ~ Description of furniture "crystalline flower"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid "A crystalline structure that resembles a plant."
msgstr "Una estructura cristalina que se asemeja a una planta."

#. ~ Description of furniture "impaled officer"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid ""
"A dead body encased in high-tech armor hanging in the air.  Their form seems "
"twisted and refracted in the light of the strange glowing crystal that has "
"seeped out of the ground and impaled their body."
msgstr ""
"El cuerpo muerto enfundado en una armadura de alta tecnología en el aire. Su "
"forma parece estar torcida y refractada en la luz de un extraño cristal "
"brillante que ha salido del suelo y a empalado su cuerpo."

#. ~ Description of furniture "impaled mercenary"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid ""
"A dead body encased in military armor hanging in the air.  Their form seems "
"twisted and refracted in the light of the strange glowing crystal that has "
"seeped out of the ground and impaled their body."
msgstr ""
"El cuerpo muerto enfundado en una armadura militar en el aire. Su forma "
"parece estar torcida y refractada en la luz de un extraño cristal brillante "
"que ha salido del suelo y a empalado su cuerpo."

#. ~ Description of furniture "wafting anemone"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid ""
"A fleshy white protuberance growing from the floor, with a cluster of "
"tendrils protruding from it.  It looks almost exactly like a sea anemone, "
"even waving gently as though underwater."
msgstr ""
"Una protuberancia blanca y carnosa que crece en el suelo, con un grupo de "
"zarcillos que salen de ella. Se parece casi exactamente a una anémona de "
"mar, incluso se agita suavemente como si estuviera bajo el agua."

#. ~ Description of furniture "gasping tube"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid ""
"A meaty green stalactite with a thickened hide like that of a starfish, "
"extending from the floor to the ceiling.  In the center is a series of ports "
"somewhat like mouths, from which pour bursts of a vile-smelling gas."
msgstr ""
"Una carnosa estalactita verde con una piel engrosada como la de una estrella "
"de mar, que se extiende desde el suelo hasta el techo. En el centro hay una "
"serie de orificios que parecen bocas, de los que brotan ráfagas de un gas "
"apestoso."

#. ~ Description of furniture "scarred lump"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid ""
"A pile of nondescript alien flesh, twitching and belching strange gases out "
"of injured orifices."
msgstr ""
"Un montón de carne alienígena anodina, que se retuerce y eructa extraños "
"gases por los orificios heridos."

#. ~ Description of furniture "slimy pod"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid ""
"A slick, translucent pod suspended on a thin stalk.  It is covered in a "
"thick mucus, obscuring whatever is floating in the gel-like substance inside."
msgstr ""
"Una vaina resbaladiza y translúcida suspendida en un tallo delgado. Está "
"cubierta por una espesa mucosidad, que oscurece lo que está flotando en la "
"sustancia gelatinosa del interior."

#. ~ Description of furniture "twitching frond"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid ""
"A spine resembling moth antennae juts from the ground, swaying gently in the "
"air.  Every so often, a cascade of energy arcs along it and discharges into "
"the ceiling."
msgstr ""
"Una columna vertebral que se asemeja a las antenas de una polilla sobresale "
"del suelo y se balancea suavemente en el aire. De vez en cuando, una cascada "
"de energía se arquea a lo largo de ella y se descarga en el techo."

#. ~ Description of furniture "empty spike"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid ""
"A strange otherworldly spike that refracts light in strange ways.  The body "
"no longer rests on it."
msgstr ""
"Un extraño pico de otro mundo que refracta la luz de manera extraña. El "
"cuerpo ya no esta en el."

#. ~ Description of furniture "resin pod"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid ""
"A translucent pod suspended on a thin stalk.  Inside is a clean, clear, "
"resinous-looking fluid.  You could fairly easily tear it from the stalk and "
"take it with you."
msgstr ""
"Una vaina translúcida suspendida en un tallo delgado. En el interior hay un "
"fluido limpio, claro y de aspecto resinoso. Podrías arrancarlo del tallo y "
"llevártelo contigo."

#. ~ Description of furniture "organ pod"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid ""
"A translucent pod suspended on a thin stalk.  Inside you can see the dimly "
"outlined shape of human organs, floating in some kind of preservative goo."
msgstr ""
"Una vaina translúcida suspendida en un tallo delgado. En el interior se "
"puede ver la forma poco marcada de los órganos humanos, flotando en algún "
"tipo de sustancia conservante."

#. ~ Description of furniture "glowing tendril"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid ""
"A willowy tendril growing from the floor, gently waving back and forth.  A "
"faint light spills from it."
msgstr ""
"Un zarcillo de sauce que crece desde el suelo y se agita suavemente de un "
"lado a otro. Una débil luz brota de él."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_MISSING_BODY" in furniture "empty spike"'s examine action
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid "The body is gone but it can't have gone far, you need to destroy it."
msgstr ""
"El cuerpo ya no esta pero no puede haber ido muy lejos, necesitas destruirlo."

#. ~ Description of furniture "less than nothing"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid "There is nothing here.  Not even time or space."
msgstr "No hay nada aquí. Ni siquiera espacio o tiempo."

#. ~ Description of furniture "fleshy altar"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid ""
"This pulsing protuberance juts from the floor, its sides covered in scaled, "
"oozing skin.  The surface is flat, but undulates softly.  A handful of "
"unidentifiable appendages reach from the sides, suggesting a sort of "
"nightmarish robotic surgical bed."
msgstr ""

