#. ~ Description of furniture "traffic light"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid ""
"A signaling device positioned at road intersections and pedestrian crossings "
"to control the flow of traffic, but it's useless without electricity."
msgstr ""
"Un dispositivo de señalización ubicado en las intersecciones de carreteras y "
"cruces peatonales para controlar los flujos de tráfico, pero es inútil sin "
"electricidad."

#. ~ Description of furniture "scrap metal bridge"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid "A simple bridge made of riveted sheet metal."
msgstr "Un simple puente de hojas de metal remachadas."

#. ~ Description of furniture "cardboard roof"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-terrains.json
msgid ""
"A sloped roof made of cardboard boxes, stuffed with scrap cardboard and "
"paper and layered atop each other.  Sheets of plastic are carefully arranged "
"on top to shed water.  It looks like it could last a season or two at least "
"before crumbling."
msgstr ""
"Un techo inclinado hecho de cajas de cartón, rellenadas con restos de cartón "
"y papel superpuestas. Encima hay láminas de plástico colocadas "
"cuidadosamente para evitar el agua. Parece que podría durar una o dos "
"temporadas al menos, antes de desmoronarse."

