msgid ""
"A smartcard reader.  It sports the stylized symbol of an atom and a truck.  "
"You could swipe a transporter's badge near it to unlock the gates."
msgstr ""
"Un lector de tarjetas inteligentes. Lleva el símbolo estilizado de un átomo "
"y un camión. Puedes pasar la tarjeta de un transportista cerca de él para "
"desbloquear las puertas."

#. ~ Description of terrain "Maintenance: blue zone card reader"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-mechanisms.json
msgid ""
"A smartcard reader.  It sports the stylized symbol of an atom and a wrench "
"on a blue background.  You could swipe a maintenance employee badge near it "
