#. ~ Description of ".50 BMG Match"
#: data/json/items/ammo/50.json
msgid ""
".50 BMG ammunition with a lead-cored FMJ bullet.  The .50 BMG is a very "
"powerful rifle round designed for anti-aircraft use, later adapted to anti-"
"vehicular and anti-personnel roles.  Its stupendous energy and armor "
"piercing capabilities make it one of the most deadly rounds available, "
"offset only by its drastic recoil and noise."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of ".50 BMG M33 Ball"
#: data/json/items/ammo/50.json
msgid ""
".50 BMG ammunition with a mild steel cored 661gr FMJ bullet.  The .50 BMG is "
"a very powerful rifle round designed for anti-aircraft use, later adapted to "
"anti-vehicular and anti-personnel roles.  Its stupendous energy and armor "
"piercing capabilities make it one of the most deadly rounds available, "
"offset only by its drastic recoil and noise."
msgstr ""
"Munición .50 BMG con una bala FMJ de 661gr con núcleo de acero suave. La .50 "
"BMG es una munición de fusil muy potente diseñada para uso antiaéreo, que "
"posteriormente se adaptó a las funciones antivehicular y antipersonal. Su "
"estupenda energía y su capacidad para perforar blindajes la convierten en "
"una de las municiones más mortíferas disponibles, compensada únicamente por "
"su drástico retroceso y su ruido."

