#. ~ Description of "RA110 5x50mm flechette"
#: data/json/items/ammo/5x50.json
msgid ""
"The Rivtech 5x50mm flechette round is a fin-stabilized steel needle packed "
"into a plastic sabot which breaks apart shortly after the round clears the "
"chamber.  The resulting cartridge is far lighter and produces lower recoil "
"than a conventional round, while the projectile makes up for its low mass "
"with extreme velocity and long range."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "5x50mm flechette, reloaded"
#: data/json/items/ammo/5x50.json
msgid ""
"The Rivtech 5x50mm flechette round is a fin-stabilized steel needle packed "
"into a plastic sabot which breaks apart shortly after the round clears the "
"chamber.  The resulting cartridge is far lighter and produces lower recoil "
"than a conventional round, while the projectile makes up for its low mass "
"with extreme velocity and long range.  This one has been hand-reloaded by a "
"lucky survivor or perhaps a pre-Cataclysm corporate spy, leading to slightly "
"inferior performance compared to factory-produced ammo."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "RA119 5x50mm penetrator"
