msgid ""
"A subsonic cartridge derived from the 7.62x25mm, designed for silenced "
"firearms.  It offers good armor penetration at the cost of slightly less "
"damage."
msgstr ""
"Un cartucho subsónico derivado del 7.62x25mm, diseñado para armas "
"silenciosas. Ofrece una buena penetración de armadura a coste de menor daño."

