msgstr "Encender flecha"

#. ~ Description of "flaming arrow"
#: data/json/items/ammo/arrows.json
msgid ""
"This arrow has a flaming rag wrapped around the shaft near the head.  You "
"should shoot it soon before it burns through the rag and fuel."
msgstr ""
"Esta flecha tiene un trapo en llamas cerca de su punta. Tienes que "
"dispararla rápido antes de que consuma el trapo y el combustible."

#. ~ Description of "flammable arrow"
#: data/json/items/ammo/arrows.json
