#. ~ Description of "sling-ready Molotov cocktail"
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid ""
"A bottle of flammable liquid with a long fuse inserted, ready to be used in "
"a staff sling with a modified cradle.  To throw this item without a sling, "
"use it light the fuse.  You will, of course, need a lighter or matches in "
"your inventory to do this.  After lighting it, throw it to cause fires."
msgstr ""
"Una botella de líquido inflamable con una mecha larga insertada, lista para "
"ser utilizada en una eslinga de bastón con una cuna modificada. Para lanzar "
"este objeto sin una honda, úsalo encendiendo la mecha. Por supuesto, "
"necesitarás un mechero o cerillas en tu inventario para hacerlo. Después de "
"encenderla, lánzala para provocar incendios."

#. ~ Description of "sling-ready improvised grenade"
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid ""
"A grenade made from explosives sealed inside a metal canister, modified with "
"a retaining fuse for use in a staff sling with a modified cradle.  To throw "
"this item without a sling, use it to snap the fuse and activate the "
"grenade.  You will then have 5 seconds before it explodes; throwing it would "
"be a good idea."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "sling-ready small improvised grenade"
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid ""
"A grenade made from explosives sealed inside a small metal canister, "
"modified with a retaining fuse for use in a staff sling.  To throw this item "
"without a sling, use it to snap the fuse and activate the grenade.  You will "
"then have 5 seconds before it explodes; throwing it would be a good idea."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "sling-ready improvised HE grenade"
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid ""
"A grenade made from high explosive sealed inside a metal canister, modified "
"with a retaining fuse for use in a staff sling with a modified cradle.  To "
"throw this item without a sling, use it to snap the fuse and activate the "
"grenade.  You will then have some amount of time before it explodes; "
"throwing it would be a good idea."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "sling-ready grenade"
#: data/json/items/ammo/sling-ready_grenade.json
msgid ""
"A military-grade fragmentary hand grenade, modified with a retaining fuse "
"for use in a staff sling with a modified cradle.  To throw this item without "
"a sling, use it to snap the fuse and activate the grenade.  You will then "
"have five seconds before it explodes; throwing it would be a good idea."
msgstr ""
"Una granada de mano fragmentaria de grado militar, modificada con una "
"espoleta de retención para su uso en una eslinga de bastón con cuna "
"modificada. Para lanzar este objeto sin una eslinga, utilízalo para encajar "
"la espoleta y activar la granada. A continuación, tendrás cinco segundos "
"antes de que explote; lanzarla sería una buena idea."

