#. ~ Description of "disconnected arcade machine"
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
msgid ""
"A bulky upright arcade cabinet, brightly painted and slightly worn with "
"age.  Ready to be plugged in and played."
msgstr ""
"Un voluminoso armario arcade vertical, pintado de forma brillante y "
"ligeramente desgastado por el paso del tiempo. Listo para ser enchufado y "
"jugar."

#. ~ Description of "disconnected mitre saw"
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
msgid ""
"A circular sawblade on an arm that can slide and rotate in several "
"directions, this is a staple tool for nearly any carpentry.  Needs to be "
"placed and plugged into a power source."
msgstr ""
"Una hoja de sierra circular en un brazo que puede deslizarse y girar en "
"varias direcciones, es una herramienta básica para casi cualquier "
"carpintería. Se puede colocar y enchufar a una fuente de alimentación."

#. ~ Description of "disconnected large water purifier"
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
msgid ""
"A device that effectively sterilizes water, but it doesn't take batteries.  "
"You'll need to connect it to a power source."
msgstr ""
"Un dispositivo que esteriliza agua de manera efectiva, pero no  usa "
"baterías. Necesitaras conectarlo a la corriente."

#. ~ Description of "disconnected electric oven"
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
msgid ""
"A disconnected electric convection-based oven, commonly used for heating and "
"cooking food.  Plug it into a vehicle or power grid to get cooking."
msgstr ""
"Un horno eléctrico desconectado basado en convección, comúnmente utilizado "
"para calentar y cocinar alimentos. Conectalo a un vehículo o red eléctrica "
"para empezar a cocinar."

#. ~ Description of "disconnected planer"
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
msgid ""
"A hefty tool that will take in a board and cut it smooth and flat to a "
"specific width, particularly great if working with raw lumber stock, but "
"also good just for shaving wood down to size.  Needs to be placed and "
"plugged into a power source."
msgstr ""
"Una herramienta robusta que toma una tabla, la corta lisa y plana a una "
"anchura específica, particularmente buena si se trabaja con madera en bruto, "
"pero también es buena sólo para reducir el tamaño de la madera. Se puede "
"colocar y enchufar a una fuente de alimentación."

#. ~ Description of "disconnected standing directed floodlight"
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
msgid ""
"A large, heavy light designed to illuminate a wide semicircle in a chosen "
"direction when plugged into a power outlet."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "disconnected standing floodlight"
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
msgid ""
"A large, heavy light designed to illuminate wide areas when plugged into a "
"power outlet."
msgstr ""
"Una luz grande y pesada diseñada para iluminar áreas amplias cuando está "
"conectada a un enchufe."

#. ~ Description of "oxygen concentrator"
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
msgid ""
"A machine capable of generating pure oxygen from the air.  Can be placed and "
"plugged into a power source."
msgstr ""
"Una maquina capaz de generar oxigeno puro del aire. Se puede colocar y "
"conectar a la corriente eléctrica."

#. ~ Description of "high pressure compressor unit"
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
msgid ""
"A machine designed to compress an input gas to a very high pressure.  Can be "
"placed and plugged into a power source."
msgstr ""
"Una maquina diseñada para comprimir un gas de entrada en uno de muy alta "
"presión. Se puede colocar y conectar a la corriente eléctrica."

#. ~ Description of "disconnected drill press"
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
msgid ""
"A powerful drill mounted on a slide that lets it drop precisely down.  "
"Useful in all kinds of projects, from industrial fabrication to home "
"woodworking.  Needs to be placed and plugged into a power source."
msgstr ""
"Un potente taladro montado sobre una corredera que le permite descender con "
"precisión. Útil en todo tipo de proyectos, desde la fabricación industrial "
"hasta la carpintería doméstica. Se puede colocar y enchufar a una fuente de "
"alimentación."

#. ~ Description of "disconnected band saw"
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
msgid ""
"A ribbonlike sawblade runs in a single direction in this tool, allowing "
"precise cuts at almost any angle.  Needs to be placed and plugged into a "
"power source."
msgstr ""
"Una hoja de sierra en forma de cinta se desplaza en una sola dirección en "
"esta herramienta, permitiendo cortes precisos en casi cualquier ángulo. Se "
"puede colocar y enchufar a una fuente de alimentación."

#. ~ Description of "disconnected table saw"
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
msgid ""
"A rotating sawblade set into a large, flat table.  Used for making straight, "
"measured cuts, it's a key tool in any carpenter's arsenal.  Needs to be "
"placed and plugged into a power source."
msgstr ""
"Una hoja de sierra giratoria colocada en una gran mesa plana, para realizar "
"cortes rectos medidos, una herramienta clave en el arsenal de cualquier "
"carpintero. Se puede colocar y enchufar a una fuente de alimentación."

#. ~ Description of "disconnected box battery charger"
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
msgid ""
"A small device for recharging batteries integrated into a small wooden "
"storage compartment.  When plugged in and powered, it will slowly charge all "
"rechargeable batteries (battery cells, lead-acid batteries, etc) placed "
"directly within its storage space."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño aparato para recargar baterías integrado en un pequeño "
"compartimento de madera. Cuando se configura como un aparato y se enciende, "
"cargará lentamente todas las baterías recargables (celdas de batería, "
"baterías de plomo-ácido, etc.) colocadas directamente dentro de su espacio "
"de almacenamiento."

#. ~ Description of "disconnected jointer"
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
msgid ""
"A table-shaped tool with a rotating blade that will cut down, smooth out, "
"and square off a board to make it nice and smooth.  Needs to be placed and "
"plugged into a power source."
msgstr ""
"Una herramienta en forma de mesa con una cuchilla giratoria que cortará, "
"alisará y cuadrará una tabla para dejarla muy suave y bonita. Se necesita "
"colocar y enchufar a una fuente de alimentación."

#. ~ Description of "disconnected standing lamp"
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
msgid ""
"A tall standing lamp that provides illumination when plugged into a power "
"outlet."
msgstr ""
"Una lampara de pie alta que provee iluminación cuando se enchufa a la "
"corriente."

#. ~ Description of "disconnected foot locker recharging station"
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
msgid ""
"A universal recharging station integrated into a steel storage compartment.  "
"When plugged in and powered, it will steadily charge all rechargeable "
"batteries (battery cells, lead-acid batteries, etc) placed directly within "
"its storage space."
msgstr ""
"Una estación de recarga universal integrada en un compartimento de "
"almacenamiento de acero. Cuando se configura como un aparato y se enciende, "
"cargará de forma constante todas las baterías recargables (celdas de "
"batería, baterías de plomo, etc.) colocadas directamente en su espacio de "
"almacenamiento."

#. ~ Description of "disconnected wall light"
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
msgid "A wall light that provides illumination when plugged into a grid."
msgstr ""
"Una lampara de pared que provee iluminación cuando se conecta a una red "
"eléctrica."

#. ~ Description of "disconnected arc furnace"
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
msgid ""
"An arc furnace designed to burn a powdery mix of coke and limestone to "
"create calcium carbide.  Needs to be placed and plugged into a power source."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "disconnected autoclave"
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
msgid ""
"An autoclave, used to sterilize equipment with pressurized steam.  It "
"requires a massive amount of power, so it will need to be plugged into a "
"power grid."
msgstr ""
"Un autoclave, usado para esterilizar equipamiento con vapor presurizado. "
"Requiere una masiva cantidad de energía para operar, por lo que tendrá que "
"conectarse a una red eléctrica."

#. ~ Description of "disconnected lathe"
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
msgid ""
"An industrial-grade lathe, for turning chunks of metal and other hard things "
"into round chunks of metal and other hard things.  Needs to be placed and "
"plugged into a power source."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "wall wiring"
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
msgid "Electric wires used to run power through walls."
msgstr ""
"Los cables eléctricos utilizados para pasar la energía a través de las "
"paredes."

#. ~ Description of "disconnected hydraulic press"
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
msgid ""
"If you really want to squash something a lot, this is exactly the right "
"industrial tool for you.  Needs to be placed and plugged into a power source."
msgstr ""
"Si realmente quieres aplastar algo mucho, esta sería exactamente la "
"herramienta industrial adecuada para ti. Necesita ser colocada y enchufada a "
"una fuente de alimentación."

#. ~ Description of "disconnected air compressor"
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
msgid ""
"This durable tank is topped with a motor that will cram as much air into the "
"tank as possible.  Needs to be placed and plugged into a power source."
msgstr ""
"Este resistente depósito está provisto de un motor que introduce la mayor "
"cantidad de aire posible dentro. Se puede colocar y enchufar a una fuente de "
"alimentación."

#. ~ Description of "disconnected router table"
#: data/json/items/appliances.json
msgid ""
"This table has an inset router, a rotating motor with an exchangeable blade "
"head for cutting specific profiles and grooves.  Needs to be placed and "
"plugged into a power source."
msgstr ""
"Esta mesa cuenta con una fresadora de inserción, un motor giratorio con un "
"cabezal de cuchilla intercambiable para cortar perfiles, ranuras específicas "
"y demás. Se puede colocar y enchufar a una fuente de alimentación."

