#. ~ Description of "large belt loop"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A MOLLE-compatible loop for attaching large tools and weapons to a load-"
"bearing vest."
msgstr ""
"Un lazo MOLLE compatible para enganchar grandes herramientas y armas para un "
"chaleco de carga."

#. ~ Description of "small belt loop"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A MOLLE-compatible loop for attaching small tools to a load-bearing vest."
msgstr ""
"Un lazo MOLLE compatible para enganchar pequeñas herramientas para un "
"chaleco de carga."

#. ~ Description of "medium belt loop"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A MOLLE-compatible loop for attaching tools and some weapons to a load-"
"bearing vest."
msgstr ""
"Un lazo MOLLE compatible para enganchar herramientas y algunas armas para un "
"chaleco de carga."

#. ~ Description of "triple stacker ammo pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A collection of 6 pockets, 3 wide and 2 deep, designed to hold rifle "
"magazines and keep them accessible and secure.  Has MOLLE straps for "
"attaching to a vest or can be strapped directly to your chest."
msgstr ""
"Una combinación de 6 bolsillos, 3 anchos y 2 profundos, diseñados para "
"albergar cargadores de rifle y mantenerlos accesibles y seguros. Dispone de "
"correas MOLLE para fijarse a un chaleco o puede atarse directamente al pecho."

#. ~ Description of "ammo satchel"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A fabric ammo bag worn at the waist.  It is capable of holding a single "
"large magazine close at hand."
msgstr ""
"Una bolsa de tejido para munición que se pone en la cintura y te permite "
"tener un cargador a mano."

#. ~ Description of "chest ammo pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A fabric ammo pouch that can be strapped to your chest and hold a single "
"magazine close at hand."
msgstr ""
"Una bolsa de tejido para munición que puede ser atada a tu pecho y permite "
"tener un cargador a mano."

#. ~ Description of "leg ammo pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A fabric ammo pouch that can be strapped to your leg and hold two magazines "
"close at hand."
msgstr ""
"Una bolsa de tejido para munición que puede ser atada a tu pierna y permite "
"tener dos cargadores a mano."

#. ~ Description of "large quiver"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A large leather quiver trimmed with metal, worn on the back, that can hold a "
"large amount of arrows or crossbow bolts.  It's even long enough for atlatl "
"or fishing spears."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "large pipe quiver"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A large makeshift quiver fashioned from 3 pipes, worn on the back.  Heavier "
"and thinner than a typical large quiver, it can't hold as many arrows, "
"though it's still long enough for fishing or atlatl spears."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "gas mask pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A large pouch capable of holding a gas mask and an additional filter, "
"keeping both accessible and secure.  Has MOLLE straps for attaching to a "
"belt or vest."
msgstr ""
"Una gran bolsa capaz de albergar una máscara de gas y un filtro adicional, "
"manteniendo ambos accesibles y seguros. Dispone de correas MOLLE para "
"sujetarse a un cinturón o chaleco."

#. ~ Description of "large birchbark quiver"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A large quiver woven from strips of birchbark, worn on the back, that can "
"hold a large number of arrows or crossbow bolts.  It's long enough to also "
"store atlatl and fishing spears."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "leather chest ammo pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A leather ammo pouch that can be strapped to your chest and hold a single "
"magazine close at hand."
msgstr ""
"Una funda de cuero para munición que puede atarse al pecho y mantener un "
"único cargador a mano."

#. ~ Description of "quiver"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A leather quiver worn at the waist that can hold twelve arrows or sixteen "
"bolts."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "nylon quiver"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A lighter and more durable quiver made of nylon, with straps to attach to a "
"MOLLE system."
msgstr ""
"Una aljaba más ligera y duradera hecha de nailon, con correas para sujetar a "
"un sistema MOLLE."

#. ~ Description of "tactical tool pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A low profile pouch designed to keep your tools accessible and secure.  Has "
"MOLLE straps for attaching to a vest or can be strapped directly to your "
"chest."
msgstr ""
"Una funda de bajo perfil diseñada para mantener sus herramientas accesibles "
"y seguras. Dispone de correas MOLLE para fijarla a un chaleco o puede atarse "
"directamente al pecho."

#. ~ Description of "simple cloth quiver"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A makeshift back-worn quiver jury-rigged out of fabric too soft to really do "
"the job well.  It can't hold as many arrows as a proper large quiver, but "
"it's better than nothing."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "pipe quiver"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A makeshift quiver fashioned from sections of pipe strapped together and "
"worn at the waist.  Heavier and thinner than a typical quiver, it can only "
"hold six arrows or eight bolts."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "H2O pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A pouch designed to hold a water bottle with an additional front tactical "
"pocket.  Has MOLLE straps for attaching to a belt or vest."
msgstr ""
"Una bolsa diseñada para albergar una botella de agua con un bolsillo frontal "
"táctico adicional. Dispone de correas MOLLE para sujetarse a un cinturón o "
"chaleco."

#. ~ Description of "tactical grenade pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A pouch designed to hold one hand grenade, keeping it both accessible and "
"secure.  Has MOLLE straps for attaching to a belt or vest."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "tactical shotshell pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A pouch designed to hold shotgun shells or .308 rounds, keeping them "
"accessible and secure.  Has MOLLE straps for attaching to a belt or vest."
msgstr ""
"Una funda diseñada para guardar cartuchos de escopeta o cartuchos .308, "
"manteniéndolos accesibles y seguros. Dispone de correas MOLLE para sujetarse "
"a un cinturón o chaleco."

#. ~ Description of "gadget pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A pouch designed to keep gadgets and small items accessible and secure.  Has "
"MOLLE straps for attaching to a belt or vest."
msgstr ""
"Una bolsa diseñada para mantener tus aparatos y pequeños objetos accesibles "
"y seguros. Dispone de correas MOLLE para fijarla a un cinturón o a un "
"chaleco."

#. ~ Description of "canteen pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A pouch designed to keep your canteen accessible and secure.  Has MOLLE "
"straps for attaching to a belt or vest."
msgstr ""
"Una bolsa diseñada para mantener su cantimplora accesible y segura. Dispone "
"de correas MOLLE para fijarla al cinturón o al chaleco."

#. ~ Description of "tactical radio pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A pouch designed to keep your radio accessible and secure.  Has MOLLE straps "
"for attaching to a belt or vest."
msgstr ""
"Una bolsa diseñada para mantener su radio accesible y segura. Dispone de "
"correas MOLLE para fijarla a un cinturón o a un chaleco."

#. ~ Description of "birchbark quiver"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "A quiver woven from strips of birch bark, worn at the waist."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "ankle ammo pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A small fabric ammo pouch that can be strapped to your ankle and hold a "
"single small magazine.  It's a bit awkward to use."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "ammo pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A small pouch that can be used to store most types of small ammunition; "
"rockets, however, will not fit.  Use insert to store ammunition."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña bolsa que puede ser usada para almacenar la mayoría de los tipos "
"de municiones pequeñas, los misiles sin embargo no caben. Use insertar para "
"almacenar la munición."

#. ~ Description of "multi-function quiver"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A specialized quiver with a bag and straps to store a takedown bow as well "
"as a small pouch for archery accessories, perfect for a bowhunter on the go."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "tactical holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A sturdy holster designed to be worn vertically, to keep a small profile on "
"a tactical vest.  This makes it a little more awkward to draw from than a "
"normal holster."
msgstr ""
"Una funda robusta diseñada para ser usada verticalmente, permitiendo "
"mantener un perfil pequeño en un chaleco táctico. Esto hace que sea un poco "
"más incómoda de sacar que una funda normal."

#. ~ Description of "leather ammo satchel"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A sturdy leather ammo bag worn at the waist.  It is capable of holding a "
"single large magazine close at hand."
msgstr ""
"Una robusta bolsa de munición de cuero para llevarse en la cintura. Puede "
"contener un solo cargador grande a la mano."

#. ~ Description of "flashlight pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A tiny pouch designed to keep your flashlight accessible and secure.  Has "
"MOLLE straps for attaching to a belt or vest."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña funda diseñada para mantener su linterna accesible y segura. "
"Dispone de correas MOLLE para fijarla al cinturón o al chaleco."

#. ~ Description of "javelin bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"An deep leather bag with a wide mouth, designed to store javelins within "
"easy reach."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "denim quiver"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"An improvised back-worn quiver that can hold a small number of arrows.  The "
"material isn't ideal for the job, but it's better than plain cotton."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "breacher load bearing vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "Breaching shotgun magnets."
msgstr "Imanes para escopeta de caza."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "H2O pouch"
msgid_plural "H2O pouches"
msgstr[0] "bolsa de H20"
msgstr[1] "bolsas de H20"
msgstr[2] "bolsas de H20"

#. ~ Description of "chest rig"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"Popularized during the Vietnam War, chest rigs like these are typically "
"plain, barebones affairs consisting of three or more pouches in a row, with "
"straps to secure them on your chest.  This one can hold four magazines in "
"its pouches."
msgstr ""
"Popularizados durante la guerra de Vietnam, los chalecos de munición como "
"estos son tipicamente simples objetos compactos que consisten en tres o más "
"bolsillos en una fila, con correas para asegurarlos a tu pecho. Este puede "
"almacenar cuatro cargadores en sus bolsillos."

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "load bearing vest with sling"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "heavy load bearing vest with sling"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "breacher load bearing vest"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "survivor harness"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/utility.json
msgid "Rifle sling."
msgstr "Eslinga de rifle."

#. ~ "holster_prompt" action message of item "ammo satchel"
#. ~ "holster_prompt" action message of item "chest ammo pouch"
#. ~ "holster_prompt" action message of item "chest rig"
#. ~ "holster_prompt" action message of item "ankle ammo pouch"
#. ~ "holster_prompt" action message of item "leg ammo pouch"
#. ~ "holster_prompt" action message of item "leather ammo satchel"
#. ~ "holster_prompt" action message of item "leather chest ammo pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "Stash ammo"
msgstr "Almacenar munición"

#. ~ "holster_prompt" action message of item "tac vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "Stash item"
msgstr "Almacenar objecto"

#. ~ "holster_prompt" action message of item "javelin bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "Stash javelins"
msgstr "Almacenar jabalinas"

#. ~ Description of "tac vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"This light vest is meant to carry your magazines, shells and pistols.  They "
"are popular amongst law enforcement, but less so than combination tactical "
"vests incorporating Kevlar."
msgstr ""
"Este chaleco ligero está pensado para llevar tus cargadores, cartuchos y "
"pistolas. Son populares entre las fuerzas del orden, pero menos que los "
"chalecos tácticos combinados que incorporan Kevlar."

#. ~ Description of "light load bearing vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"This lightweight harness covered in MOLLE webbing is designed to attach a "
"few pouches, holsters and other PALS compatible accessories.  Preferred by "
"some soldiers over directly attaching accessories to a ballistic vest as "
"they can then be easily separated."
msgstr ""
"Este ligero arnés recubierto de correas en malla MOLLE está diseñada para "
"fijar unos pocos bolsillos, fundas y otros accesorios compatibles con PALS. "
"Algunos soldados lo prefieren en lugar de fijar directamente los accesorios "
"al chaleco balístico, ya que así pueden separarse fácilmente."

#. ~ Description of "heavy load bearing vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"This massive vest covered in MOLLE webbing is designed to attach a large "
"number of pouches, holsters and other PALS compatible accessories.  "
"Preferred by some soldiers over directly attaching accessories to a "
"ballistic vest as they can then be easily separated."
msgstr ""
"Este enorme chaleco lleno de correas MOLLE está diseñado para colgar muchas "
"bolsas, fundas y otros accesorios PALS compatibles. Algunos soldados "
"prefieren usar este arnés en lugar de colgar los accesorios directamente en "
"el chaleco balístico, ya que pueden ser fácilmente quitados."

#. ~ Description of "heavy load bearing vest with sling"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"This massive vest covered in MOLLE webbing is designed to attach a large "
"number of pouches, holsters and other PALS compatible accessories.  "
"Preferred by some soldiers over directly attaching accessories to a "
"ballistic vest as they can then be easily separated.  This one has a single "
"point sling wrapped around the shoulders using a system to keep your weapon "
"extra secure."
msgstr ""
"Este enorme chaleco lleno de correas MOLLE está diseñado para colgar mucha "
"cantidad de bolsas, fundas y otros accesorios PALS compatibles. Algunos "
"soldados prefieren usar este arnés en lugar de colgar los accesorios "
"directamente en el chaleco balístico, ya que pueden ser fácilmente quitados. "
"Este tiene un correa alrededor de los hombros para mantener tu arma más "
"segura."

#. ~ Description of "breacher load bearing vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"This massive vest covered in MOLLE webbing is designed to attach a large "
"number of pouches, holsters and other PALS compatible accessories.  This one "
"has a single point sling wrapped around the shoulders using a system to keep "
"your weapon extra secure, as well as a set of strong magnets attached to the "
"torso and waist to hold a breaching shotgun."
msgstr ""
"Este enorme chaleco cubierto de cinchas MOLLE está diseñado para acoplarle "
"un gran número de bolsas, fundas y otros accesorios compatibles con PALS. "
"Este chaleco cuenta con una eslinga de un solo punto envuelta alrededor de "
"los hombros mediante un sistema para mantener tu arma extra segura, así como "
"un conjunto de fuertes imanes fijados al torso y a la cintura para sujetar "
"una escopeta de caza."

#. ~ Description of "load bearing vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"This vest covered in MOLLE webbing is designed to attach pouches, holsters "
"and other PALS compatible accessories.  Preferred by some soldiers over "
"directly attaching accessories to a ballistic vest as they can then be "
"easily separated."
msgstr ""
"Este arnés recubierto de correas en malla MOLLE está diseñada para fijar "
"bolsillos, fundas y otros accesorios compatibles con PALS. Algunos soldados "
"lo prefieren en lugar de fijar directamente los accesorios al chaleco "
"balístico, ya que así pueden separarse fácilmente."

#. ~ Description of "load bearing vest with sling"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"This vest covered in MOLLE webbing is designed to attach pouches, holsters "
"and other PALS compatible accessories.  Preferred by some soldiers over "
"directly attaching accessories to a ballistic vest as they can then be "
"easily separated.  This one has a single point sling wrapped around the "
"shoulders using a system to keep your weapon extra secure."
msgstr ""
"Este chaleco revestido de cintas MOLLE está diseñado para sujetar bolsas, "
"fundas y otros accesorios compatibles con PALS. Algunos soldados lo "
"prefieren en lugar de sujetar directamente los accesorios a un chaleco "
"balístico, ya que así pueden quitarse fácilmente. Este tiene una eslinga de "
"un solo punto envuelta alrededor de los hombros usando un sistema para "
"mantener tu arma extra segura."

