#. ~ Description of "MOLLE webbing belt"
#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
msgid ""
"A 2-inch nylon webbing belt commonly used by military forces.  MOLLE-"
"compatible pouches can be attached to the webbing for extra storage."
msgstr ""
"Cinturón cincha de nylon de 2 pulgadas comúnmente utilizado por las fuerzas "
"militares. Las fundas compatibles con MOLLE se pueden acoplar a las correas "
"para obtener más espacio."

#. ~ Description of "police duty belt"
#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
msgid ""
"A black leather belt used by police officers.  It has several pouches and a "
"holder for a baton."
msgstr ""
"Cinturón de cuero negro utilizado por los policías. Tiene varias fundas y un "
"soporte para el bastón."

#. ~ Description of "broad belt"
#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
msgid "A broad, buckled leather belt."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "obi"
#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
msgid ""
"A broad, decorative sash wrapped around the waist, usually to secure a "
"kimono."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "tool belt"
#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
msgid ""
"A common belt with pockets, loops and sheaths to store up to seven tools or "
"blades.  Widely used by handymen and electricians."
msgstr ""
"Un cinturón común con bolsillos, lazos y fundas para almacenar hasta siete "
"herramientas o cuchillas. Ampliamente utilizado por los manitas y los "
"electricistas."

#. ~ Description of "leather belt"
#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
msgid ""
"A leather belt.  Designed to look good and hold up a pair of pants, but you "
"should be able to attach a small tool or weapon to one of the belt loops."
msgstr ""
"Un cinturón de cuero. Diseñado para lucir bien y sostener un par de "
"pantalones, pero debería poder sujetar una pequeña herramienta o arma a una "
"de las trabillas del cinturón."

#. ~ Description of "suspenders"
#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
msgid ""
"A pair of black suspenders, which reach over the wearer's shoulders and hook "
"to their waist.  Gives a wonderful western feel!"
msgstr ""
"Un par de tirantes negros que llegan a los hombros del portador y se "
"enganchan a su cintura. Da una maravillosa sensación de vaquero."

#. ~ Description of "holster suspenders"
#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
msgid "A pair of leather suspenders with a holster placed near the stomach."
msgstr "Un par de tirantes de cuero con una funda colocada cerca del estómago."

#. ~ Description of "leather suspenders"
#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
