msgstr[1] "trajes de superviviente"
msgstr[2] "trajes de superviviente"

#. ~ Description of "survivor boots"
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/custom_boots.json
msgid ""
"A pair of custom-made boots constructed of thick Kevlar and a chemical "
"resistant layer, featuring steel toes for extra protection.  Keeps your feet "
"safe from the myriad dangers of the apocalypse."
msgstr ""
"Un par de botas construidas con grueso kevlar, una capa resistente a los "
"químicos y suelas de acero como protección adicional. Mantienen tus pies a "
"salvo de la multitud de peligros del apocalipsis."

#. ~ Description of "winter survivor boots"
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/custom_boots.json
msgid ""
"A pair of customized, Kevlar-armored boots with a chemical-resistant layer "
"and steel toes.  Warm thanks to the real fur lining, and quite protective "
"due to the thick materials, though perhaps a little hard to move in."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "faux fur winter survivor boots"
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/custom_boots.json
msgid ""
"A pair of customized, Kevlar-armored chemical-resistant boots with steel "
"toes.  Warm thanks to the faux-fur lining, and quite protective due to the "
"thick materials, though perhaps a little hard to move in."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "custom swim fin boot attachments"
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/custom_boots.json
msgid ""
"A pair of rubber flippers worn on the feet, which improve swimming speed "
"while greatly impeding the wearer's ability to walk.  This pair was reduced "
"in volume and weight and has to be attached to diving boots with necessary "
"attachment points."
