#. ~ Description of "nomad bodymesh"
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/custom_underwear.json
msgid ""
"A simple, thin, skintight layer of breathable fabric that protects your "
"skin.  It has integrated feet and precisely placed rubberized pads to "
"protect critical points from impact and abrasion, and has been reinforced "
"with a loose mesh of advanced polymer threads."
msgstr ""
"Una capa sencilla, fina y ajustada de tejido transpirable que protege la "
"piel. Cuenta con pies integrados y almohadillas de goma colocadas con "
"precisión para proteger los puntos críticos tanto de los impactos como de la "
"electricidad, y se ha reforzado con una malla suelta de hilos de polímero "
"avanzado."

#. ~ Description of "nomad bodyglove"
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/custom_underwear.json
msgid ""
"A simple, thin, skintight layer of breathable fabric that protects your "
"skin.  It has integrated feet and precisely placed rubberized pads to "
"protect critical points from impact and abrasion."
msgstr ""
"Una sencilla y fina capa de tejido transpirable que protege tu piel. Tiene "
"pies integrados y almohadillas de goma colocadas con precisión para proteger "
"los puntos críticos de los impactos y la abrasión."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/custom_underwear.json
