#. ~ Description of "light gloves"
#: data/json/items/armor/gloves.json
msgid "A pair of cloth gloves."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "wrist warmers"
#: data/json/items/armor/gloves.json
msgid ""
"A pair of cloth mitts that cover the wrists and palms but leave the fingers "
"free."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "cut-resistant gloves"
#: data/json/items/armor/gloves.json
msgid ""
"A pair of cut-resistant gloves, useful for butchery or routine work with "
"bladed objects."
msgstr ""
"Un par de guantes resistentes a los cortes, útiles para la carnicería o el "
"trabajo rutinario con objetos cortantes."

#. ~ Description of "bag mitts"
#: data/json/items/armor/gloves.json
msgid "A pair of disposable plastic bags, adapted to be used as gloves."
msgstr ""
"Un par de bolsas desechables de plástico, adaptadas para usarse como guantes."

#. ~ Description of "biosilicified chitin gauntlets"
#: data/json/items/armor/gloves.json
msgid ""
"A pair of fingerless gauntlets crafted from the carefully cleaned and pruned "
"biosilicified exoskeletons of acidic ants.  Acid-resistant but brittle."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "airsoft gloves"
#: data/json/items/armor/gloves.json
msgid ""
"A pair of fingerless gloves with hard plastic reinforcing the backs of the "
"hands to protect against BB pellets and other light projectiles."
msgstr ""
"Un par de guantes sin dedos con plástico duro reforzando la parte trasera de "
"las manos para protegerla contra las bolitas BB y otros proyectiles ligeros."

#. ~ Description of "tactical gloves"
#: data/json/items/armor/gloves.json
msgid ""
"A pair of flame- and cut-resistant aramid fabric gloves.  Commonly used by "
"police and military units."
msgstr ""
"Un par de guantes de tejido de aramida resistentes a las llamas y a los "
"cortes. Comúnmente utilizados por la policía y las unidades militares."

#. ~ Description of "EOD overhand protectors"
#: data/json/items/armor/gloves.json
msgid ""
"A pair of fragmentation resistant pads for wearing over the backs of one's "
"hands, providing protection from shrapnel in case things go wrong.  Sold as "
"an accessory for explosive ordnance disposal suits, but not often used due "
"to the difficulty in armoring the entire hand and retaining dexterity."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "chitin gauntlets"
#: data/json/items/armor/gloves.json
msgid ""
"A pair of gauntlets made from arthropod exoskeleton.  Though intricately "
"articulated and padded by unsclerotized material, they do not cover the tips "
"of the fingers."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "chainmail gloves"
#: data/json/items/armor/gloves.json
msgid "A pair of gloves made of interlocking rings of steel wire."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "leather gauntlets"
