#. ~ Description of "ten-gallon hat"
#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
msgid ""
"These may not be the Great Plains, but you can still be the Boss with this "
"high-crowned, wide-brimmed hat."
msgstr ""
"Tal vez no estés en las Grandes Llanuras pero de todas maneras puedes "
"sentirte el Jefe con este sombrero de copa alta y ala ancha."

#. ~ Description of "cowboy hat"
#: data/json/items/armor/hats.json
msgid ""
"Whether yer hunting varmints, fixing up the ranch, or heading into the "
