#. ~ Description of "western gun belt"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A Western-style gun belt as worn by cowboys and gunfighters in the movies "
"and on TV. Has loops across the back to hold spare ammo.  Activate to "
"holster/draw a gun."
msgstr ""
"Una funda de estilo del viejo oeste como la que llevan los vaqueros y los "
"pistoleros en las películas. Tiene huecos en la espalda para guardar la "
"munición de repuesto. Activar para enfundar/desenfundar un arma."

#. ~ Description of "large nylon holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A belt holster consisting of a loop and strap intended for use with larger "
"firearms, but made with nylon instead of leather.  Activate to holster/draw "
"a gun"
msgstr ""
"Una funda de cinturón con una hebilla del cinturón y correa para llevar "
"armas grandes, pero hecha con nailon en vez de cuero. Activar para enfundar/"
"desenfundar un arma."

#. ~ Description of "large holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A belt holster consisting of a loop and strap intended for use with larger "
"firearms.  Slightly more cumbersome than a standard holster due to the "
"straps that hold it flat against your leg.  Activate to holster/draw a gun."
msgstr ""
"Una funda de cinturón con una hebilla del cinturón y correa para llevar "
"armas grandes. Un poco más incómoda que una funda normal debido a las "
"correas que la mantienen contra tu pierna.  Activar para enfundar/sacar un "
"arma."

#. ~ Description of "shoulder holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A comfortable quick-draw holster for larger pistols.  One side holsters a "
"gun, and the other side holds two magazines.  Activate to holster/draw a gun."
msgstr ""
"Una cómoda funda de extracción rápida para pistolas grandes. En un lado se "
"enfunda una pistola y en el otro se guardan dos cargadores. Activar para "
"enfundar/desenfundar un arma."

#. ~ Description of "fast draw holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A comfortable quick-draw holster for small guns.  Activate to holster/draw a "
"gun."
msgstr ""
"Una cómoda funda de extracción rápida para armas pequeñas. Se activa para "
"enfundar/desenfundar un arma."

#. ~ Description of "single point sling"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A harness going over your shoulder and across your chest.  Designed to "
"connect to a rifle at a single point with the rifle hanging off your front.  "
"Great for fighting, not great for travel.  Activate to holster/draw your "
"weapon."
msgstr ""
"Un arnés que va por encima del hombro y a través del pecho. Diseñado para "
"conectarse a un rifle en un solo punto con el rifle colgando de su frente. "
"Es ideal para luchar, pero no para viajar. Activar para enfundar/sacar el "
"arma."

#. ~ Description of "baldric holsters"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A leather harness which can hold up to six pistol-sized guns in total, "
"available for quick drawing.  Historically, similar harnesses were used by "
"pirates to carry multiple loaded flintlock pistols at once, as reloading "
"them is a lengthy process.  Activate to holster/draw a gun."
msgstr ""
"Un arnés de cuero que puede contener hasta seis pistolas en total, listas "
"para ser desenfundadas rápidamente. Históricamente, los piratas utilizaban "
"arneses similares para llevar varias pistolas de chispa cargadas a la vez, "
"ya que recargarlas era un proceso largo. Actívala para enfundar/desenfundar "
"un arma."

#. ~ Description of "back holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A leather holster, big enough for a rifle or other large gun.  Designed to "
"be strapped to the back.  Activate to holster/draw a gun."
msgstr ""
"Una funda de cuero suficientemente grande como para poner un rifle u otra "
"arma grande. Diseñada para atarse a la espalda. Activarla para enfundar/"
"desenfundar un arma."

#. ~ Description of "holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A leather strap worn on the hip for holding pistol-sized guns.  Activate to "
"holster/draw a gun."
msgstr ""
"Una correa de cuero que se lleva en la cadera para sujetar armas del tamaño "
"de una pistola. Se activa para enfundar/desenfundar un arma."

#. ~ Description of "drone-tech harness"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A modified army harness, repurposed to carry several small and a single "
"medium sized drone alongside the tools to maintain them."
msgstr ""
"Un arnés de ejército modificado, reutilizado para transportar varios drones "
"pequeños y un solo dron de tamaño mediano junto con las herramientas para "
"mantenerlos."

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "drone-tech harness"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "A series of connectors meant to hold a medium sized drone on your back."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "drone-tech harness"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "A series of connectors meant to store a small drone."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "ankle holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A small concealed holster worn on the ankle.  It is awkward to use without "
"practice.  Activate to holster/draw a small pistol."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña funda que se oculta en el tobillo. Difícil de usar si no estás "
"acostumbrado. Activar para enfundar/sacar una pequeña pistola."

#. ~ Description of "bow sling"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A somewhat complicated set of straps and fabric to keep your bow close to "
"hand and (mostly) out of harm's way.  Activate to holster/draw your bow."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto algo complicado de correas y telas para mantener tu arco a mano "
"y (casi) protegido. Actívalo para enfundar/desenfundar tu arco."

#. ~ Description of "belly band holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A wide elastic belly belt with a built-in holster for a pistol and a spare "
"magazine.  It is very awkward to use without practice.  Activate to holster/"
"draw a gun."
msgstr ""
"Un cinturón elástico ancho con una funda incorporada para una pistola y un "
"cargador de repuesto. Es muy incómodo de usar sin práctica. Activar para "
"enfundar/desenfundar un arma."

#. ~ Description of "deep concealment holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"An elastic band with numerous provisions for concealing a very small pistol "
"close to the body.  It is awkward to use without practice.  Activate to "
"holster/draw a gun."
msgstr ""
"Una banda elástica con numerosas sujecciones para ocultar una pistola muy "
"pequeña cerca del cuerpo. Incómodo de usar sin práctica. Activar para "
"enfundar/sacar un arma."

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "drone-tech harness"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "Gadget pouch"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "nylon holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"Holster made from nylon, rather than leather.  A bit stronger and lighter, "
"but not as fashionable.  Activate to draw/holster a gun."
msgstr ""
"Funda hecha de nailon, en vez de cuero. Un poco mas resistente y ligera, "
"pero bastante fea. Activar para desenfundar/enfundar un arma."

#. ~ Brief name of a pocket in item "drone-tech harness"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "Medium drone strap"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "drone-tech harness"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "Quick access pouches."
msgstr "Bolsillos de acceso rápido"

#. ~ Brief name of a pocket in item "drone-tech harness"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "Small drone holder"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "drone-tech harness"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "Tool clip"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "front-to-back double holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"Two holsters attached together by a strap, one in front of the other.  The "
"placement means that drawing a gun out of the front holster is slower than "
"the other holster.  Activate to holster/draw a gun."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "side-by-side double holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"Two holsters attached together by a strap, right next to each other.  The "
"placement means that drawing guns out of either one is slower than a regular "
"holster.  Activate to holster/draw a gun."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "nylon front-to-back double holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"Two nylon holsters attached together by a strap, one in front of the other.  "
"The placement means that drawing a gun out of the front holster is slower "
"than the other holster.  Activate to holster/draw a gun."
msgstr ""
"Dos fundas de nailon enganchadas juntas en una correa, una delante de la "
"otra. El emplazamiento significa que desenfundar un arma delante es mas "
"lento que la otra funda. Activar para enfundar/desenfundar un arma."

#. ~ Description of "nylon side-by-side double holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"Two nylon holsters attached together by a strap, right next to each other.  "
"The placement means that drawing guns out of either one is slower than a "
"regular holster.  Activate to holster/draw a gun."
msgstr ""
"Dos fundas de nailon enganchadas juntas en una correa, una al lado de la "
"otra. El emplazamiento significa que desenfundar cualquiera de las armas es "
"mas lento que una funda normal. Activar para enfundar/desenfundar un arma."

