#. ~ Description of "plate leg guards"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid ""
"A full assembly of platemail for the legs.  Steel cuisses, poleyns, and "
"greaves, with leather straps to secure each piece and connect it as part of "
"a set."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "turnout trousers"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid ""
"A heavy pair of protective overalls worn by firefighters as protection "
"against heat."
msgstr ""
"Un par de monos protectores pesados que llevan los bomberos para protegerse "
"del calor."

#. ~ Description of "chainmail skirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid ""
"A knee-length skirt made of interlocking steel rings.  It can be adjusted to "
"be worn as outerwear."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "chainmail skirt (loose)"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid ""
"A knee-length skirt made of interlocking steel rings.  It can be adjusted to "
"be worn closer to the body."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "Kevlar leggings"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of Kevlar leggings designed to protect the legs from abrasion when "
"riding a motorcycle."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "bronze greaves"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "A pair of bronze shin and knee guards with a simple leather lining."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "chitin greaves"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of guards for the lower legs and knees made from the exoskeletons of "
"insects."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "2-by-shin guards"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of improvised shin guards made from broken pieces of a plank that are "
"tied to your shins with rags and string."
msgstr ""
"Un par de guardas para proteger las canillas, improvisadas con pedazos rotos "
"de tablones de madera, atadas a las canillas con trapos y cuerdas."

#. ~ Description of "tire greaves"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of improvised shin guards made from thick chunks of rubber strung "
"together and tied over the legs."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "armored jeans"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of jeans reinforced with extra fabric and metal sheets.  It's not the "
"most durable armor, but it offers decent protection."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "knee pads"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "A pair of knee pads made of stout plastic and spandex."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "biosilicified chitin greaves"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of leg guards crafted from the carefully cleaned and pruned "
"biosilicified exoskeletons of acidic ants.  Acid-resistant but brittle."
msgstr ""
"Un par de perneras creadas con exoesqueletos de hormigas ácidas, "
"cuidadosamente limpiados y biosilicificados.Resistentes al ácido pero "
"frágiles."

#. ~ Description of "plastic shin guards"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of polyurethane leg guards with neoprene backing.  These were used in "
"sport, policing, and even on some job sites."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "fencing pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of reinforced pants used by fencers to prevent injuries.  They don't "
"cover the lower leg."
msgstr ""
"Pantalones reforzados utilizados por los esgrimistas para evitar lesiones. "
"No cubren la parte inferior de la pierna."

#. ~ Description of "motorcycle jeans"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of thick jeans interwoven with Kevlar for added durability and "
"sporting integrated kneepads and flank protection, typically worn by "
"motorcyclists to protect from road rash."
msgstr ""
"Un par de jeans gruesos entretejidos con kevlar para agregarle durabilidad y "
"con rodilleras integradas y protección lateral. Lo utilizan comúnmente los "
"motociclistas para protegerse de las caídas."

#. ~ Description of "chainsaw chaps"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of tough chaps made of Kevlar.  Chainsaw kickbacks are potentially "
"fatal; personal protective equipment like these chaps help protect your "
"femoral arteries.  The layered Kevlar is designed to fray on contact with "
"the chain and bind up the tool."
msgstr ""
"Un par de chaparreras hechas de kevlar. Los retrocesos de las motosierras "
"son potencialmente fatales; los equipos de protección personal como estas "
"chaparreras ayudan a proteger las arterias femorales. El Kevlar laminado "
"está diseñado para deshilacharse al contacto con la cadena y atar la "
"herramienta."

#. ~ Description of "leather chaps"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of tough leather chaps, meant to tie on over pants for extra "
"protection."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "leather leg guards"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid ""
"A set of soft leather cuisses, poleyns, and greaves that strap on over the "
"legs, providing excellent protection from cutting and stabbing attacks."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "cut-resistant cephalopod sleeves"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid ""
"A set of tubes of loosely woven Kevlar which should fit over a cephalopod's "
"many arms."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "tire tasset (loose)"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid ""
"A skirt made of salvaged chunks of rubber strung together and tied around "
"the waist.  It can be adjusted to fit closer to the body."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "tire tasset"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
