#. ~ Description of "clip-on tie"
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid ""
"A clip-on necktie with blue and silver stripes.  It's quick and easy to put "
"on, and really, who's going to know the difference?"
msgstr ""
"Una corbata de clip con rayas azules y plateadas. Es rápida y fácil de "
"poner, y realmente, ¿quién va a notar la diferencia"

#. ~ Description of "clown wig"
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid "A colorful and ridiculous wig fit for a clown."
msgstr "Una peluca colorida y ridícula digna de un payaso."

#. ~ Description of "golden crown"
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid "A delicate golden crown."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "gum blanket"
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid ""
"A fabric sheet which has been coated in liquid rubber, allowing it to serve "
"as a raincoat, a work surface, or with a little know-how, part of an "
"improvised shelter."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "golden crown"
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid "A golden crown for the monarch of survivors."
msgstr "Una corona dorada para el monarca de los supervivientes."

#. ~ Description of "wedding veil"
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid "A lacy white wedding veil."
msgstr "Un velo de encaje blanco de boda."

#. ~ Description of "rolled fur sleeping bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid ""
"A large sleeping bag lined with fur, with a strap for carrying it on your "
"back when not in use.  Who needs a tent?  Activate it to unroll it so you "
"can use it for warmth."
msgstr ""
"Un gran saco de dormir forrado de piel, con una correa para llevarlo a la "
"espalda cuando no se usa. ¿Quién necesita una tienda de campaña? Actívalo "
"para desenrollarlo y poder usarlo para calentarte"

#. ~ Description of "fur sleeping bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid ""
"A large sleeping bag lined with fur, with a strap for carrying it on your "
"back when not in use.  Who needs a tent?  It is currently unrolled; activate "
"it roll it up for easy storage."
msgstr ""
"Un gran saco de dormir forrado de piel, con una correa para llevarlo a la "
"espalda cuando no se usa. ¿Quién necesita una tienda de campaña? Actualmente "
"está desenrollado; actívalo y se enrollará para guardarlo fácilmente."

#. ~ Description of "rolled sleeping bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid ""
"A large sleeping bag that covers you head to toe, with a strap for carrying "
"it on your back when not in use.  This one is medium weight.  Activate it to "
"unroll it so you can use it for warmth."
msgstr ""
"Un gran saco de dormir que te cubre de pies a cabeza, con una correa para "
"llevarlo a la espalda cuando no lo uses. Este es de peso medio. Actívalo "
"para desenrollarlo y poder utilizarlo para abrigarte"

#. ~ Description of "necktie"
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid ""
"A length of fabric typically looped around the collar of a dress shirt.  "
"Knowing how to properly tie it takes some practice, but it's an important "
"skill to learn.  Clip-ons are for children."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "Boston-Chan wig"
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid "A long blue hair wig for the Boston-Chan costume."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "skinny tie"
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid ""
"A necktie much narrower than usual, popularized by mid-century rock "
"musicians and an enduring symbol of subculture ever since, it can "
"nonetheless still serve as a high-class accessory."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "plastic vampire fangs"
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid "A pair of white vampire fangs made of plastic."
msgstr "Un par de colmillos blancos de vampiro hechos de plástico."

#. ~ Description of "tarpaulin"
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid ""
"A plastic sheet with several grommets for securing it with rope or cord.  "
"Useful for improvised rain protection."
msgstr ""
"Una tela plástica con varias arandelas para asegurarla con una soga o una "
"cuerda. Útil para improvisar un techo durante la lluvia."

#. ~ Description of "protective mouthpiece"
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid ""
"A protective piece of equipment commonly used by athletes, worn inside the "
"mouth to protect your teeth."
msgstr ""
"Una pieza de protección utilizada habitualmente por los deportistas. Se "
"lleva dentro de la boca para proteger los dientes"

#. ~ Description of "clown nose"
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid "A red rubber nose, the sort often worn by clowns."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "tefillin (head)"
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
