#. ~ Description of "armored jean jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "A denim jacket reinforced with sheet metal plates."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "armored jean vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "A denim vest reinforced with sheet metal plates."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "leather cuirass"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "A durable breastplate made of thick leather."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "tire armor jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"A heavy leather jacket reinforced with chunks of thick rubber tire.  Thick "
"and highly resistant to blunt force."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "armored riding jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"A heavy-duty leather jacket with sheet metal plates secured over it for "
"increased protection."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "motorcycle armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"A light jacket made of a stretch mesh covered in plastic pads meant for "
"motorcyclists.  Made to be much more comfortable to wear than leather "
"alternatives, but the underlying spandex isn't protective at all."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "fencing jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"A padded jacket with a zipper on the back, used by fencers to prevent "
"accidents."
msgstr ""
"Chaqueta acolchada con cremallera en la espalda, utilizada por los "
"esgrimistas para evitar accidentes."

#. ~ Description of "carpet cuirass"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"A rectangular length of tough carpet with a hole cut out for your head and "
"tied around the waist.  It's decently protective for its weight and quite "
"the fashion statement."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "padded vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"A sleeveless cotton shirt with fabric sewn overtop for extra protection."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "bronze cuirass"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"A solid breastplate made from bronze.  It's weaker than steel, but still "
"quite protective."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "plate cuirass"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"A solid steel breastplate.  Even as full armor went into decline, cuirasses "
"remained in use among cavalry in Europe."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "hard chest guard"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "A solid vest of plastic padding protecting your torso."
msgstr "Un sólido chaleco de plástico que protege tu torso."

#. ~ Description of "underarm protector"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"A sturdy cotton plastron that protects much of the torso, the dominant "
"shoulder, and underarm while fencing."
msgstr ""
"Un robusto plastrón de algodón que protege gran parte del torso, el hombro "
"dominante, y la axila mientras se hace la valla."

#. ~ Description of "padded sweatshirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"A thick cotton sweatshirt with fabric sewn overtop, providing a modicum of "
"extra protection."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "lamé"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"A thin, lightweight conductive vest with the zipper on the back used by "
"fencers for electronic scoring.  Its outer layer is a woven mix of sturdy "
"cotton and stainless steel strands."
msgstr ""
"Un chaleco conductor delgado y ligero con la cremallera en la espalda "
"utilizado por los esgrimistas para la puntuación electrónica. Su capa "
"exterior es una mezcla tejida de hilos de algodón resistente y acero "
"inoxidable."

#. ~ Description of "armored leather vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid "An armored vest made from thick leather and metal plates."
msgstr "Un chaleco blindado hecho de cuero grueso y placas de metal."

#. ~ Description of "tire cuirass"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"An improvised breastplate made from thick chunks of rubber secured by simple "
"strings."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "chainmail vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"Armor made of countless links of steel wire woven into the shape of a vest.  "
"It's flexible enough to fit under outerwear, and can be adjusted for a "
"looser fit."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "chainmail vest (loose)"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"Armor made of countless links of steel wire woven into the shape of a vest.  "
"It's lightweight enough to fit under outerwear, and can be adjusted for a "
"closer fit."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "lorica segmentata"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"Body armor in the ancient roman style, made of overlapping metal strips "
"connected to internal leather straps."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "mirror armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"Broad steel plates known as mirrors have been fitted onto a leather vest, "
"providing a fair amount of protection to the body.  The design was once "
"popular throughout Asia and the Middle East, and might work best over "
"chainmail or cloth armor."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "football armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"Heavy polycarbonate armor for your upper torso.  Normally worn by football "
"players."
msgstr ""
"Armadura pesada de policarbonato para la parte superior del torso. "
"Normalmente lo llevan los jugadores de fútbol."

#. ~ Description of "crude paper breastplate"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"Jury-rigged body armor made from thickly-stacked paper and rolls of duct "
"tape."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "riot guard"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"Padded plastic armor for the hips, torso, and shoulders.  If it were "
"combined with some arm and shin guards, it'd be a full set of riot armor.  "
"It sports MOLLE webbing for accessory attachments, and the word POLICE is "
"painted across the front."
msgstr ""

