#. ~ Description of "Sleep Mode CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A CBM that completely shuts down all communication between the user's brain "
"and the rest of their body when they fall asleep, preventing them from "
"waking up under any circumstance until their natural sleep cycle completes.  "
"An inability to trigger its effects manually makes it useless as an "
"anesthesia substitute."
msgstr ""
"Este MBC anula por completo toda la comunicación entre el cerebro del "
"usuario y el resto de su cuerpo cuando se queda dormido, impidiendo que se "
"despierte bajo cualquier circunstancia hasta que se complete su ciclo "
"natural de sueño. La imposibilidad de activar sus efectos manualmente lo "
"hace inútil como sustituto de la anestesia."

#. ~ Description of "Recoil Compensators CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A CBM that contains shock absorbers and kinetic braces which greatly reduce "
"the recoil of guns."
msgstr ""
"Este MBC contiene unos amortiguadores y soportes cinéticos que reducen mucho "
"el retroceso de las armas de fuego."

#. ~ Description of "Acidic Discharge CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A CBM that has been breached in several places.  Some acid is leaking from "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Un MBC que se ha roto en varios lugares. Algún tipo de ácido está goteando."

#. ~ Description of "abstract faulty bionic module"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A CBM that is broken beyond repair; you can't do anything with it."
msgstr "Este MBC no se puede reparar, no puedes hacer nada con el."

#. ~ Description of "Power Storage CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A Compact Bionics Module consisting of a miniaturized battery which "
"increases the user's maximum bionic power by 100 units.  Once installed, it "
"will likely require some sort of charger CBM to power it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "Power Storage Mk. II CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A Compact Bionics Module consisting of a miniaturized battery which "
"increases the user's maximum bionic power by 250 units.  Once installed, it "
"will likely require some sort of charger CBM to power it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "Battery System CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A battery draining attachment to make use of the energy contained in normal, "
"everyday batteries."
msgstr ""
"Un sistema de carga de baterías biónicas, que permite utilizar la energía "
"contenida en las baterías normales y habituales."

#. ~ Description of "Internal Chronometer CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A bionic module containing an atomic clock, complete with a silent alarm "
"clock function."
msgstr ""
"Un módulo biónico que contiene un reloj atómico completo, con función de "
"despertador silencioso."

#. ~ Description of "Sonic Resonator CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A bionic module that allows the user's entire body to resonate at very high "
"power, creating a short-range shockwave.  While it will not do much damage "
"to creatures, solid objects such as walls and doors will be damaged."
msgstr ""
"Un módulo biónico que permite que todo el cuerpo del usuario resuene a muy "
"alta potencia, creando una onda de choque de corto alcance. Aunque no "
"causará mucho daño a las criaturas, los objetos sólidos como las paredes y "
"las puertas serán dañados."

#. ~ Description of "Infrared Vision CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A bionic module that extends the user's range of vision into the infrared, "
"allowing them to see warm-blooded creatures in the dark and through smoke."
msgstr ""
"Un módulo biónico que amplía el rango de visión infrarroja, permitiendo al "
"usuario ver criaturas de sangre caliente en la oscuridad y a través del humo."

#. ~ Description of "Shockwave Generator CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A bionic module that generates a powerful shockwave, knocking back all "
"nearby creatures.  Targets are stunned briefly, take damage and additional "
"stun upon impact with impassable terrain, and knock back any creatures they "
"collide with."
msgstr ""
"Un módulo que genera una onda de choque poderosa, empujando todas las "
"criaturas cercanas. Los objetivos serán dañados, aturdidos brevemente, "
"golpeados en el impacto contra el terreno intransitable, y empujarán a otras "
"criaturas con las que choquen."

#. ~ Description of "Protective Lenses CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A bionic package that seals the user's eye sockets with highly-protective "
"mirrored lenses which can retract into their frames at will."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "Active Defense System CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A bionic that projects a thin forcefield around the user's body.  Everything "
"loses velocity when penetrating this field, which results in a reduced "
"amount of dealt damage at the cost of user's bionic energy.  Bullets and "
"stabbing attacks will lose more velocity than cutting attacks, and those in "
"turn more than bashing attacks."
msgstr ""
"Un que biónico proyecta un fino campo de fuerza alrededor del cuerpo del "
"usuario. Todo pierde velocidad al atravesar este campo, lo que se traduce en "
"una reducción de la cantidad de daño infligido a costa de la energía biónica "
"del usuario. Las balas y los ataques de arma blanca perderán más velocidad "
"que los ataques de corte y éstos, a su vez, más que los ataques contundentes."

#. ~ Description of "Radioactive Leak CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A broken CBM that has been leaking radiation into its user.  The danger "
"seems to have been sealed off during the removal process, but you definitely "
"shouldn't put it back."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "Taste Fouler CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A broken and mis-wired module that would cause food and drink to taste "
"terrible if installed."
msgstr ""
"Un módulo roto y mal conectado que causa que la comida y la bebida tengan un "
"gusto horrible si se instala."

#. ~ Description of "Electromagnetic Leak CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A broken implant that sends electromagnetic impulses that reduce other "
"implants' capacity to store charge."
msgstr ""
"Un implante roto que envía impulsos electromagnéticos que reducen la "
"capacidad de otros implantes para almacenar energía."

#. ~ Description of "Power Overload CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A bunch of defective power circuits that are prone to short-circuiting."
msgstr ""
"Un montón de circuitos de energía defectuosos que son propensos a los "
"cortocircuitos."

#. ~ Description of "Flashbang Generator CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A combination of LEDs and speakers that create a flash and sound comparable "
"to a flashbang grenade, deafening and blinding nearby enemies."
msgstr ""
"Una combinación de LEDs y altavoces que crean un destello y un sonido "
"comparable al de una granada de destello, ensordeciendo y cegando a los "
"enemigos cercanos."

#. ~ Description of "Shotgun Arm CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A concealed, single shot 12 gauge shotgun that is implanted inside the left "
"forearm.  Perfect in a pinch."
msgstr ""
"Una escopeta escondida de un solo tiro del calibre 12 que se implanta dentro "
"del antebrazo izquierdo. Perfecta en caso de necesidad."

#. ~ Description of "Monomolecular Blade CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A deadly foot-long blade made of advanced material that is installed inside "
"the forearm, capable of being extended through the back of the user's wrist "
"at the cost of a small amount of power.  Though exceptionally sharp, it will "
"prevent the user from holding anything else while extended."
msgstr ""
"Una cuchilla mortal hecha de materiales avanzados que esta instalada dentro "
"de tu antebrazo, capaz de ser extendida a través de la muñeca del usuario "
"con un coste pequeño de energía biónica. Aunque excepcionalmente afilada, no "
"te permitirá agarrar nada con la mano cuando este extendida."

#. ~ Description of "Bionic Visual Impairment CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A defective bionic that impairs vision."
msgstr "Un biónico defectuoso que afecta la visión."

#. ~ Description of "Blood Filter CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A filtration system that is installed in the heart and can actively filter "
"out chemical impurities, primarily drugs, with limited impact on viruses.  "
"Note that it is not a targeted filter; ALL drugs in the system will be "
"affected."
msgstr ""
"Un sistema de filtración que se instala en el corazón y puede filtrar "
"activamente las impurezas químicas, principalmente los fármacos, con un "
"impacto limitado en los virus. Tenga en cuenta que no es un filtro dirigido; "
"TODOS los fármacos del sistema se verán afectados."

#. ~ Description of "Repair Nanobots CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A fleet of tiny, dormant robots.  While activated, they will flit about the "
"user's body, repairing damage and stopping bleeding at the cost of power.  "
"Excessive use of this CBM can depress the immune system."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "Electrical Discharge CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A formerly-functional CBM that is now a mess of naked wires and burnt "
"resistors."
msgstr ""
"Un MBC que funcionaba que ahora es una maraña de cables pelados y "
"resistencias quemadas."

#. ~ Description of "Cloaking System CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A high-power system that uses a set of cameras and LEDs to make the user "
"blend into their surroundings, rendering them fully invisible to eyes and "
"optical sensors.  However, this doesn't prevent detection from other means "
"such as infrared, sonar, etc."
msgstr ""
"Un sistema de gran potencia que utiliza un conjunto de cámaras y LEDs para "
"que el usuario se mimetice con su entorno, haciéndolo totalmente invisible a "
"los ojos y a los sensores ópticos. Sin embargo, esto no impide la detección "
"por otros medios, como los infrarrojos, el sonar, etc."

#. ~ Description of "Teleportation Unit CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A highly experimental unit that folds space over short distances, instantly "
"transporting the user's body up to 25 feet in a random direction at the cost "
"of much power.  Note that prolonged or frequent use may have dangerous side "
"effects."
msgstr ""
"Una unidad altamente experimental pliega el espacio en distancias cortas, "
"transportando instantáneamente el cuerpo del usuario hasta 7.5 metros en una "
"duración aleatoria a costa de mucha energía. Tenga en cuenta que el uso "
"prolongado o frecuente puede tener efectos secundarios peligrosos."

#. ~ Description of "Hydraulic Muscles CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A hydraulic muscle support system that when active, increases the user's "
"strength by 20."
msgstr ""
"Un sistema de apoyo muscular hidráulico que, cuando está activo, aumenta la "
"fuerza a 20."

#. ~ Description of "Bionic-Induced Deformity CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A jumble of broken metal pieces that were removed during reconstructive "
"surgery."
msgstr ""
"Un amasijo de piezas metálicas rotas que fueron retiradas durante la cirugía "
"reconstructiva."

#. ~ Description of "Wire-Induced Stiffness CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A length of poorly installed wiring that would cause stiffness."
msgstr "Un tramo de cableado mal instalado que causaría rigidez."

#. ~ Description of "Endocrine Enervator CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A malfunctioning bionic that causes fatigue by altering the unfortunate "
"user's brain chemistry."
msgstr ""
"Un biónico que funciona mal causa cansancio al alterar la química cerebral "
"del desafortunado usuario."

#. ~ Description of "Noisemaker CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A malfunctioning bionic.  When installed, it occasionally emits a loud burst "
"of noise."
msgstr ""
"Un biónico que funciona mal. Cuando se alimenta, de vez en cuando emite una "
"fuerte explosión de ruido."

#. ~ Description of "Leaky Bionic CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A mess of pierced pipes and broken seals, something unpleasant is leaking "
"from it."
msgstr ""
"Un lío de tuberías perforadas y sellos rotos, algo desagradable se está "
"filtrando."

#. ~ Description of "Thalamic Buffer CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A microcomputer which is meant to be housed inside the skull and wired to "
"the thalamus, where it helps the user proritize and filter sensory input.  "
"It grants +2 perception while active, but -1 when not.  This bionic is "
"integrated into the brain and cannot be removed once installed."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "Fingerhack CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A miniature electrohack, surgically embedded in a finger of the user's right "
"hand.  This is an all-purpose hacking unit used to override control panels "
"and the like, but not computers.  Computer proficiency is important, and a "
"failed use may cause damage."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "Water Extraction Unit CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A module containing nanotubes that are embedded in the palm of the user's "
"hand to pump any available fluid out of a dead body, cleanse it of "
"impurities, and convert it into potable water.  Water container not included."
msgstr ""
"Un módulo que contiene nanotubos que se incrustan en la palma de la mano "
"para bombear cualquier líquido disponible de un cadáver, limpiarlo de "
"impurezas y convertirlo en agua potable. No se incluye el contenedor de agua."

#. ~ Description of "Alarm System CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A motion-detecting alarm system will notice almost all movement within a "
"fifteen-foot radius, and will silently alert the user.  This is very useful "
"during sleep, or if the user suspects a cloaked pursuer."
msgstr ""
"Un sistema de alarma que detectará el movimiento en un radio de cuatro "
"metros y alertará discretamente al usuario. Esto es muy útil durante el "
"sueño, o si el usuario sospecha de un perseguidor camuflado."

#. ~ Description of "Weather Reader CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A multitude of scientific instruments and sensors collects environmental "
"data.  The data are compiled and presented as a simple readout of the "
"current weather.  It also passively tells the user their external "
"temperature."
msgstr ""
"Una multitud de instrumentos y sensores científicos recogen datos "
"medioambientales. Los datos son compilados y presentados como una simple "
"lectura del clima actual. También le dice pasivamente al usuario su "
"temperatura externa."

#. ~ Description of "Dielectric Capacitance System CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A network of miniature piezoelectric capacitors, implanted throughout the "
"user's body to protect from external electrical discharge."
msgstr ""
"Una red de condensadores piezoeléctricos en miniatura, implantados en todo "
"el cuerpo para proteger de las descargas eléctricas externas."

#. ~ Description of "Internal Climate Control CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A network of thermal piping which eases the effects of high and low ambient "
"temperatures once activated."
msgstr ""
"Una red de tuberías térmicas que alivia los efectos de las altas y bajas "
"temperaturas ambientales una vez activado,"

#. ~ Description of "Bionic Eyes CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A pair of artificial eyes with internal cameras and bioconnectors that link "
"them to the optic nerve.  These will cure almost any vision problem so long "
"as they're active, but will render the user blind if unpowered.  They also "
"feature zoom lenses that allow the user to see much farther, and can even "
"act as a scope when using ranged weapons."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "Squeaky Ankles CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A pair of defective bionics that make squeaking noises."
msgstr "Un par de biónicos defectuosos que hacen ruidos de chirrido."

#. ~ Description of "Visual Disruptor CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A pair of defective ocular bionics that cause visual distortion and "
"pixelation."
msgstr ""
"Un par de biónicos oculares defectuosos que causan distorsión visual y "
"pixelación."

#. ~ Description of "Self-Locking Thumbs CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A pair of faulty, self-locking thumb bionics."
msgstr "Un par de biónicos para el pulgar, defectuosos y con autobloqueo."

#. ~ Description of "Finger Lighter CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A pair of powerful fire starters which extend from the tip of both hands' "
"index fingers."
msgstr ""
"Un par de poderosos iniciadores de fuego que se extienden desde la punta de "
"los dedos índices de ambas manos."

#. ~ Description of "Unified Power System CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A port that hooks up to the user's power system.  Objects that run on a "
"power bank can now directly draw charge from the user's bionic power supply."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "Electromagnetic Unit CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A powerful implanted electromagnet that allows the user to indiscriminately "
"pull all nearby magnetic objects towards them.  Unlucky bystanders might be "
"injured or killed by flying objects."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "EMP Projector CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A ranged EMP generator system that is implanted in the user's right arm and "
"hand.  The system fires precise, single-target pulses that require time to "
"aim.  Extremely effective against electronic targets, but mostly useless "
"otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Un sistema generador de EMP a distancia que se implanta en el brazo y la "
"mano derecha del usuario. El sistema dispara pulsos precisos de un solo "
"objetivo que requieren tiempo para apuntar. Extremadamente efectivo contra "
"objetivos electrónicos pero mayormente inútil para otros menesteres."

#. ~ Description of "Cable Charger System CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A retractable set of electrical leads.  While active, it will recharge "
"bionic power when connected to a battery via jumper cable."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "Recycler Unit CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A series of filters and reservoirs implanted into the urinary tract, "
"allowing the user's body to reclaim water from metabolic waste while the "
"device is active.  The result is a greatly reduced need for hydration."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "Cerebral Booster CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A set of bionic coprocessors that are implanted in the user's brain, "
"granting a +2 bonus to intelligence while powered, but a -1 penalty when "
"not.  It takes over and replaces numerous cognitive functions once installed "
"and cannot be removed."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "Wired Reflexes CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A set of bionic nerve stimulators that greatly enhance reaction times, "
"granting a +2 bonus to dexterity when active, and a -1 penalty when not."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "Close Quarters Battle CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A set of bionic processors and databanks, loaded with martial arts combat "
"programs.  While active, the CQB module will improve the user's hand-to-hand "
"combat skills, but prevents them from improving them through combat "
"experience."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de procesadores biónicos y bancos de datos, cargados con "
"programas de combate de artes marciales. Mientras esté activo, el módulo CQB "
"mejorará las habilidades de combate cuerpo a cuerpo del usuario, pero le "
"impide mejorarlas mediante la experiencia de combate."

#. ~ Description of "Uncanny Dodge CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A set of bionic processors that augment the user's nervous system, allowing "
"them to dodge attacks beyond normal human capability."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de procesadores biónicos que aumentan el sistema nervioso del "
"usuario, permitiéndole esquivar ataques más allá de la capacidad humana "
"normal."

#. ~ Description of "Synaptic Accelerator CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A set of bionic stimulators that enhance the user's nervous system, granting "
"a 10% boost to speed."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de estimuladores biónicos que mejoran el sistema nervioso, dando "
"un 10% de impulso a su velocidad."

#. ~ Description of "Leukocyte Breeder System CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A set of bionic stimulators which augment the user's haematopoiesis system, "
"allowing them to accelerate white blood cell production using bionic power.  "
"It is designed for continuous use and may cause unpleasant side effects when "
"turned off."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de estimuladores biónicos que aumentan el sistema de "
"hematopoyesis del usuario, permitiéndole acelerar la producción de glóbulos "
"blancos usando energía biónica. Está diseñado para un uso continuo y puede "
"causar efectos secundarios desagradables cuando se apaga."

#. ~ Description of "Integrated Multimeter CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A set of electrical leads to be embedded in the user's fingers, connected to "
"a multimeter unit in their hand.  Allows the user to measure voltage, "
"resistance, and current using their fingertips, and provides slight "
"protection against electric shocks."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "Enhanced Memory Banks CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A set of highly-advanced quantum storage drives used to enhance memory.  "
"While active, they increase the rate that the user learns skills.  Once it "
"is installed, it will partially replace the functionality of the "
"hippocampus, and thus cannot be removed without risk of severe permanent "
"amnesia and difficulty forming new memories."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "Taste Modifier CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A set of highly-sensitive sensors implanted in the user's mouth, combined "
"with a sophisticated analyzer.  While active, it will block all unpleasant "
"taste and texture at the cost of bionic energy."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de sensores de alta sensibilidad implantados en la boca del "
"usuario, combinados con un sofisticado analizador. Mientras esta activado, "
"bloqueará todo sabor y textura desagradables a costa de usar energía biónica."

#. ~ Description of "Titanium Skeletal Bracing CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A set of hinges, springs, and other synthetic augments for the skeletal "
"structure.  These artificial enhancers strengthen the knees and elbows, "
"allowing the user to carry more weight.  The reinforcement also provides 2 "
"bashing armor to the torso, legs and arms."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de bisagras, resortes y otros aumentos sintéticos para la "
"estructura esquelética. Estas mejoras artificiales fortalecen las rodillas y "
"los codos, lo que permite al usuario llevar más peso. El refuerzo también "
"proporciona 2 puntos de armadura contra golpes en el torso, piernas y brazos."

#. ~ Description of "Cranial Reinforcement CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A set of interlocking subdermal plates, slightly cushioned where they "
"overlap, which bolt securely to the skull and cervical vertebrae to provide "
"a modicum of protection from trauma."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "Muscle Augmentation CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A set of myomer fibers that enhance the user's muscular system, granting a "
"+2 bonus to strength when active, but a -1 penalty when not."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "Thermal Dissipation CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A set of powerful heatsinks and supermaterials woven into the user's flesh.  "
"While powered, this system will prevent external heat damage up to 2000 "
"degrees Fahrenheit.  Note that this does not affect the internal body "
"temperature."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de poderosos disipadores térmicos y supermateriales se tejen en "
"la carne del usuario. Cuando esta encendido, este sistema evitará daños por "
"calor externo hasta los 1093 grados Celsius. Tenga en cuenta que esto no "
"afecta a la temperatura interna del cuerpo."

#. ~ Description of "Terranian Sonar CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A set of precision sonar equipment, implanted in the user's feet to allow "
"the detection of below-ground movement, buried traps, and unstable terrain."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de equipo sonar de precisión, implantado en los pies para "
"permitir la detección de movimientos bajo tierra, trampas enterradas y "
"terrenos inestables."

#. ~ Description of "Joint Servo CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A set of servomotors installed on the leg joints to provide power-assisted "
"movement.  They are optimized for running, but walking also requires less "
"effort while this bionic is active.  However, when it's offline it will "
"hamper the user's movement."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de servomotores que se instalan en las articulaciones de las "
"piernas para proporcionar un movimiento asistido. Están optimizados para "
"correr, pero caminar también requiere menos esfuerzo mientras este biónico "
"está activado. Sin embargo, cuando está desconectado, obstaculizará el "
"movimiento del usuario."

#. ~ Description of "Visceral Armorgel CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A set of small packets of sintered gel which are to be installed inside the "
"thoracic and abdominal cavities to protect the organs and spine.  "
"Functionally, this will not reduce incoming damage, but instead allow the "
"user to withstand greater injury to the torso."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "Directional EMP CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A set of small parabolic EMP field generators that are mounted in the palm "
"of the user's right hand.  They can be used to instantly fire a wide, but "
"short-ranged blast which will disable electronics and robots."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de pequeños generadores de campo EMP parabólicos que se montan "
"en la palma de la mano derecha del usuario. Estos pueden ser usados para "
"disparar instantáneamente una amplia, pero de corto alcance explosión que "
"desactivará la electrónica y los robots."

#. ~ Description of "Fingertip Razors CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A set of ten double-edged, four centimeter long razor-sharp claws that are "
"implanted underneath the fingernails.  They deal a small amount of unarmed "
"slashing damage whenever the user's fingertips are uncovered."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de diez garras de doble filo, de cuatro centímetros de largo, "
"que se implantan debajo de las uñas. Estas garras causarán una pequeña "
"cantidad de daño por corte sin armas cuando las puntas de los dedos del "
"usuario no están cubiertas."

#. ~ Description of "Radiation Biomonitor CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A set of tiny implanted sensors which can diagnose the presence and severity "
"of acute radiation syndrome.  They are also able to detect ionizing "
"radiation within the user's environment."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "Joint Torsion Ratchet CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A set of torsion ratchets that replace the user's joints to slowly generate "
"power when they move.  These can be toggled to generate more power, but "
"movement will require more effort."
msgstr ""
"Unos engranajes reemplazan las articulaciones del usuario para generar "
"lentamente energía al moverse. Pueden activarse para generar más energía, "
"pero el movimiento requerirá más esfuerzo."

#. ~ Description of "Calorie Tracker CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A small medical implant that passively tracks your calorie expenditure and "
"consumption."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño implante médico que monitoriza pasivamente la ingesta y el "
"consumo de calorías."

#. ~ Description of "Remote Controller CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A small module that connects to the user's brain and allows them to "
"interface with nearby devices with wireless capabilities."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño módulo que se conecta al cerebro del usuario y le permite "
"interactuar con dispositivos cercanos con capacidades inalámbricas."

#. ~ Description of "Intravenous Needletip CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A small tube with a retractable needle that terminates in a net of tiny "
"hoses instead of a plunger.  When installed, it allows the user to draw "
"substances directly into their bloodstream akin to a regular syringe."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño tubo con una aguja retráctil que termina en una red de pequeñas "
"mangueras en lugar de un émbolo. Cuando este instalado, permitirá al usuario "
"extraer sustancias directamente a su corriente sanguínea como una jeringa "
"normal."

#. ~ Description of "Cranial Flashlight CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A small, but powerful LED flashlight that is mounted between the user's eyes."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña pero potente linterna LED que se monta entre los ojos del "
"usuario."

#. ~ Description of "Finger-Mounted Laser CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A small, high-powered laser that is embedded in the user's fingertip.  This "
"long-range weapon is not incredibly damaging, but is very accurate, and has "
"the potential to start fires."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño láser de alta potencia que está incrustado en la punta del dedo. "
"Esta arma de largo alcance no es increíblemente dañina, pero es muy precisa, "
"y tiene el potencial de iniciar incendios."

#. ~ Description of "Integrated Circuitry Toolset CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A soldering iron, multimeter, and set of fine screwdrivers implanted in the "
"user's hands.  Contains all the tools required for manipulating bench-scale "
"electrical circuits, and provides slight protection against electric shocks."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "Adrenaline Pump CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A stimulator system that is implanted alongside the adrenal glands, allowing "
"the user to trigger their body's adrenaline response at the cost of some "
"bionic power."
msgstr ""
"Un sistema estimulador que se implanta junto a las glándulas suprarrenales, "
"lo que permite al usuario desencadenar la respuesta de adrenalina de su "
"cuerpo con un coste de potencia biónica."

#. ~ Description of "Integrated Multitool CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A surgically-implanted set of compact tools and a welder which runs off the "
"user's power banks.  Includes screwdriving heads, a multi-purpose knife, a "
"low-power impact wrench and a nail prying tool."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de herramientas compactas implantadas quirúrgicamente y un "
"soldador que funciona con los bancos de energía del usuario. Incluye "
"cabezales para atornillar, una navaja multiusos, una llave de impacto de "
"baja potencia y una herramienta para arrancar clavos."

#. ~ Description of "Radiation Scrubber System CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A system of advanced piezomechanical blood filters that are implanted "
"throughout the body, allowing the user to purge themself of absorbed "
"radiation at the cost of some bionic power."
msgstr ""
"Un sistema de avanzados filtros piezomecánicos de sangre que se implantan en "
"todo el cuerpo, permitiendo al usuario purgar la radiación absorbida a costa "
"de energía biónica."

#. ~ Description of "Air Filtration System CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A system of complex filters to be installed throughout the user's airways.  "
"These will restrict breathing slightly, but will offer decent protection "
"from smoke, dust, and airborne contaminants when unpowered, and unparalleled "
"protection when powered."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "Autonomous Surgical Scalpels CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A system of surgical-grade scalpels that is implanted in the user's "
"fingers.  They allow for automated precise cuts and can be used as a high-"
"quality butchering tool."
msgstr ""
"Un sistema de bisturís de grado quirúrgico que se implanta en los dedos del "
"usuario. Permiten realizar cortes precisos automatizados y pueden ser "
"utilizados como una herramienta de descuartizado de alta calidad."

#. ~ Description of "Offensive Defense System CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A thin forcefield gets projected around the user's body, continually "
"draining power.  This field does not deflect attacks, but rather delivers a "
"strong shock, damaging unarmed attackers and those with a conductive weapon."
msgstr ""
"Un delgado campo de fuerza se proyecta alrededor del cuerpo del usuario, "
"drenando continuamente la energía. Este campo no desvía los ataques, sino "
"que da una fuerte descarga eléctrica, dañando a los atacantes desarmados y a "
"los que tienen un arma conductora."

#. ~ Description of "Subaquatic Navigation System CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A tiny device implanted in the inner ear.  When active, it will periodically "
"generate ultrasonic pulses which aid in navigation, provided the user is "
"underwater and able to hear."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "Infolink CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A wireless communications device that integrates with the ear canal to "
"enable hands-free communication over radio waves."
msgstr ""

