#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A cookbook professing itself to be for those seeking \"daring and "
"sophisticated flavors.\"  The book exhorts the reader to defy convention and "
"break the rules, and then presents a number of useful rules and conventions "
"for preparing food."
msgstr ""
"Un libro de cocina que dice ser para aquellos que buscan \"sabores atrevidos "
"y sofisticados\". El libro exhorta al lector a desafiar las convenciones y a "
"romper las reglas, y luego presenta una serie de reglas y convenciones "
"útiles para preparar la comida."

#. ~ Description of "Glamopolitan"
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A full-size glossy women's magazine.  There are a few unoriginal recipes and "
"some simple cooking tips somewhere in between the fashion photos and the sex "
"advice columns."
msgstr ""
"Una brillante revista femenina de tamaño considerable. Hay algunas recetas "
"poco originales y algunos consejos de cocina sencillos entre las fotos de "
"moda y las columnas de consejos sexuales."

#. ~ Description of "Cooking on a Budget"
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A nice cookbook that goes beyond recipes and into the chemistry of food."
msgstr ""
"Un bonito libro de cocina que va más allá de las recetas, cubriendo también "
"la química de la comida."

#. ~ Description of "Blood for the Greater Good"
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A recipe book compiled by blood-as-food advocate Alžbeta Bátoriová.  The "
"consumption of blood is a taboo among members of many Abrahamic religions, "
"but they aren't going to stop you now.  This book has bonus material for "
"those with particular tastes."
msgstr ""
"Un libro de recetas recopilado por la defensora de la sangre como alimento "
"Alžbeta Bátoriová. El consumo de sangre es un tabú entre los miembros de "
"muchas religiones abrahámicas, pero no lo van a impedir ahora. Este libro "
"tiene material extra para aquellos con gustos particulares."

#. ~ Description of "Ye Scots Beuk o Cuikery"
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A semi-translated Gaelic cookbook from sixteenth century Scotland.  While a "
"bit difficult to read, as there are a disquieting number of illustrations of "
"people stabbing each other mixed with rants about 'True Scotsmen', it "
"provides insights into medieval Scottish cuisine and culture."
msgstr ""
"Un libro de cocina gaélica semitraducido de la Escocia del siglo XVI. Aunque "
"es un poco difícil de leer, ya que hay un número inquietante de "
"ilustraciones de personas apuñalándose unas a otras mezcladas con discursos "
"sobre el \"Verdadero Escocés\", proporciona información sobre la cocina y la "
"cultura escocesa medieval."

#. ~ Description of "Sushi Made Easy"
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A simple text for the aspiring sushi lover, this easy-to-read guide is "
"filled with lots of helpful illustrations for everything from basic rice "
"preparation to setting a proper Japanese table."
msgstr ""
"Un texto sencillo para el aspirante a amante del sushi, esta guía de fácil "
"lectura está repleta de ilustraciones útiles para todo, desde la preparación "
"básica del arroz hasta el montaje de una mesa japonesa adecuada."

#. ~ Description of "Native American Foodways"
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A thick hardcover book about the history and future of Indigenous American "
"cuisine.  As much recipe collection as manifesto."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "Tasting India"
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A thick hardcover book as much about Indian culture as it is a cookbook, "
"clearly written with adoration."
msgstr ""
"Un libro grueso de tapa dura, que es en igual medida un libro de cocina como "
"de cultura india, claramente escrito con adoración."

