msgstr[0] "Un Puñado de Polvo"
msgstr[1] "copias de Un Puñado de Polvo"
msgstr[2] "copias de Un Puñado de Polvo"

#. ~ Variant name of item "Judaica softcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A Short History of the Jewish People: From Legendary Times to to Modern "
"Statehood"
msgid_plural ""
"copies of A Short History of the Jewish People: From Legendary Times to to "
"Modern Statehood"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "Siddur"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A Siddur, or prayerbook, contains the set order of prayers for Jewish "
"religious services.  This one is comprehensive, divided into morning, "
"afternoon, and evening prayers for both weekdays and Shabbat, along with "
"separate sections for minor and major holidays."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "Hell in Jewish Literature" of item "Judaica hardcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A analysis of rabbinic discussions of Gehinnom, the Jewish afterlife for the "
"cleansing of sins, including how big it is, how hot it is, who goes there, "
"how long they stay there, whether there is any relief from their punishments "
"in the meantime, and exactly what shape Gehinnom is."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "experimental novel"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A bizarre play about the philosophy of existential absurdity.  Or maybe it's "
"about two guys waiting for their friend to show up.  It's confusing."
msgstr ""
"Una obra extraña acerca de la filosofía del absurdo existencial. O tal vez "
"sea acerca de dos tipos esperando a a que su amigo aparezca. Es confusa."

#. ~ Description of variant "Zohar: The Book of Splendor: Basic Readings from the Kabbalah" of item "Judaica softcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A book of Jewish mysticism often attributed to the great rabbi Shimon bar "
"Yochai, the Zohar is the central work of Kabbalah.  This is an abridged "
"version containing selected passages from the full text."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "book of classic literature"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A book of classic literature, timeless and enjoyable but a bit dense to read."
msgstr ""
"Un libro de literatura clásica, atemporal y entretenido pero un poco denso "
"de leer."

#. ~ Description of variant "Mimekor Yisrael, Book One: The National Tales" of item "Judaica hardcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A collection of Jewish folktales, from Ashmedai king of demons to golem-"
"making rabbis, from the Torah scholar who showed Aristotle the futility of "
"philosophy to how Satan refused to bow to Adam because Adam was created from "
"the dust of the earth, from martyrs murdered by Christian persecutors to "
"General Joab single-handedly killing two thousand Amalekites so that when "
"the blood ran out like a river through the city gates his troops knew to "
"stop besieging the city and assault it, and dozens more besides."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "book of essays"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A collection of essays by various authors from around the world, including "
"works by Churchill, Mailer, Eco, and Voltaire."
msgstr ""
"Una colección de ensayos de varios autores de todo el mundo, incluyendo "
"trabajos de Churchill, Mailer, Eco y Voltaire."

#. ~ Description of variant "Miriam's Tambourine: Jewish Folktales from Around the World" of item "Judaica softcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A collection of over fifty Jewish folktales, from classics like the story of "
"Miriam's well or Rabbi Loew and the golem or the life of the Baal Shem Tov, "
"to Jewish versions of modern cultural classics like Snow White or Sinbad."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "book of plays"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A collection of plays by various authors from around the world, including "
"scripts by Wilde, Beckett, Checkov, and Shakespeare."
msgstr ""
"Una colección de obras teatrales de diversos autores de todo el mundo, "
"incluyendo obras de Wilde, Beckett, Chéjov y Shakespeare."

#. ~ Description of "book of poetry"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A collection of poetry by various authors from around the world, including "
"writings by Dickinson, Goethe, Thoreau, and Yeats."
msgstr ""
"Una colección de poesía por varios autores de todo el mundo, incluyendo "
"piezas de Dickinson, Goethe, Thoreau y Yeats."

#. ~ Description of variant "OU Manual for Checking Fruits and Vegetables" of item "Judaica hardcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A comprehensive guide to checking produce for insect infestation and how to "
"prepare produce according to Jewish dietary law."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "Megillat Esther: The Book of Esther" of item "Judaica softcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A comprehensive work for celebrating Purim, this book contains the complete "
"Book of Esther in Hebrew, multiple English translations, commentary on each "
"of its chapters, and commentary on certain verses by a group of Conservative "
"rabbis.  Cursed be Haman (booo)!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "Standing Again at Sinai: Judaism from a Feminist Perspective" of item "Judaica softcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A critique of Jewish practice by a Jewish feminist theologian."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "mystery novel"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A detective investigates an unusual murder in a secluded location."
msgstr "Un detective investiga un inusual asesinato en un lugar aislado."

#. ~ Description of variant "Reviving Synagogue Communities Using Smart Tech" of item "Judaica softcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A discussion of ways to use modern technology to alleviate the "
"administrative burden on clergy and synagogue staff but without losing the "
"human touch that leads to a proper religious community."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "black box transcript"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A full flight log for a military aircraft.  Nothing of interest stands out."
msgstr ""
"El registro completo de vuelo de un avión militar. No encuentras nada de "
"interés."

#. ~ Description of "buddy novel"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A gripping tale of two friends struggling to survive on the streets of New "
"York City."
msgstr ""
"Una absorvente historia de dos amigos luchando por sobrevivir en las calles "
"de la ciudad de Nueva York."

#. ~ Description of "Atwixt a Brace of Cacti"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A grizzled clodhopper interviews a mess of rangehands, flummoxing longhorns "
"and tenderfoot alike in a flusteration of jawing."
msgstr ""
"Un patán canoso le hace una entrevista a un revoltijo de montañeses, "
"vaqueros despistados y principiantes de esa calaña en un sermoneo "
"conmocionante."

#. ~ Description of "erotic novel"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A hackneyed fictional narrative concealing low-grade literary smut."
msgstr ""
"Una narrativa ficticia y estereotipada que esconde obscenidades literarias "
"de bajo nivel."

#. ~ Description of "grimoire"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A hefty book with a thick leather cover and metal clasps.  Both covers are "
"completely empty, though on the first page there is an author's name written "
"in English: \"Abdul Alhazred\"; below it the book title is written in "
"Arabian: \"العزيف\", and below it in Greek: \"Νεκρονομικόν\".  The book "
"looks very old and sinister."
msgstr ""
"Un libro robusto con una gruesa cubierta de cuero y cierres metálicos. Las "
"dos tapas están completamente vacías, aunque en la primera página hay un "
"nombre de autor escrito en inglés: \"Abdul Alhazred\"; debajo, el título del "
"libro está escrito en árabe: \"العزيف\", y debajo en griego: "
"\"Νεκρονομικόν\". El libro parece muy antiguo y siniestro."

#. ~ Description of variant "From the Maccabees to the Mishnah" of item "Judaica softcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A history of the development of Rabbinic Judaism, from the Jewish Revolt in "
"the first century to the writing of the Mishnah, and how Judaism and "
"Christianity fully separated."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "photo album"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A leather album full of photos of somebody's family.  You don't know any of "
"the people in them, but seeing these pictures still makes you think of "
"happier times."
msgstr ""
"Un álbum de cuero de fotos de alguna familia. No conoces a ninguno de los "
"que aparecen en ellas, pero mirar las fotos te hace pensar en tiempos más "
"felices."

#. ~ Description of variant "On the Doorposts of Your House" of item "Judaica hardcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A list of prayers, meditations, and rituals for use at home, from lighting "
"the Shabbat candles to welcoming a new child into the household."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "Stinky Bart Puts on Starch"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A local bandit, driven by sadistic impulses, begins offering unlicensed "
"dentistry to brave frontiersmen with few options and fewer teeth."
msgstr ""
"Un bandido local, impulsado por impulsos sádicos, comienza a ofrecer "
"odontología sin licencia a los valientes fronterizos con pocas opciones y "
"menos dientes."

#. ~ Description of variant "The Observant Life: The Wisdom of Contemporary Judaism for Contemporary Jews" of item "Judaica hardcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A long discussion of the ways in which Judaism's ancient rituals, "
"traditions, and ethical practices are still relevant and meaningful in the "
"modern world.  Unfortunately, there's no discussion of post-apocalyptic "
"Judaism."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "patient treatment records"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A massive stack of medical records that contain every gory detail."
msgstr ""
"Una enorme pila de registros médicos que contienen cada detalle sangriento."

#. ~ Description of variant "When Bad Things Happen to Good People" of item "Judaica softcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A meditation on meaningless tragedy and why the disaster and sorrow in the "
"world is unevenly distributed.  Written decades before the Cataclysm, but "
"the author was obviously on to something."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "Rural Digest-Examiner"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A newsweekly covering regional events.  There is an article on the winter's "
"snowstorms and several letters to the editor concerning the community "
"response."
msgstr ""
"Una revista semanal que cubre eventos regionales. Hay un artículo sobre las "
"tormentas de nieve invernales y varias cartas al editor acerca de la "
"respuesta de la comunidad."

#. ~ Description of "frequency list"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A notepad with a number of frequencies scribbled on it."
msgstr "Un libreta con un número de frecuencias garabateadas."

#. ~ Description of "Cat's Cradle"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A paperback edition of Kurt Vonnegut's fourth novel, in which the threat of "
"nuclear destruction isn't much of an influence on human nature."
msgstr ""
"Una edición en rústica de la cuarta novela de Kurt Vonnegut, en la que la "
"amenaza de la destrucción nuclear no influye mucho en la naturaleza humana."

#. ~ Description of "satire novel"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A political satire of the pre-apocalypse world.  Looking back on it from "
"this side of Armageddon makes it seem all the more ridiculous."
msgstr ""
"Una sátira política del mundo pre-apocalíptico. Mirándola ahora desde este "
"lado del Armagedón, la hace parecer mucho más ridículo."

#. ~ Description of variant "Beyond Breaking the Glass: A Spiritual Guide to Your Jewish Wedding, Revised Edition" of item "Judaica softcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A practical guide to throwing a Jewish wedding, including checklists, a "
"timeline, and ways to make traditional rituals resonate with modern wedding "
"guests."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "Siddur Tisha b'Av" of item "Judaica hardcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A prayerbook for Tisha b'Av, the most solemn day in the Jewish year.  This "
"one also contains the full text of the book of Lamentations and selected "
"commentaries."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "drama novel"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A real book for real adults."
msgstr "Un libro serio para adultos serios."

#. ~ Description of "ruined book"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A ruined book.  Someone has thoroughly ruined this book by ripping pages out "
"and covering the remainder in… is that paint?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "Jewish Publication Society Torah Commentary: Deuteronomy" of item "Judaica hardcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A series of Torah commentaries written by scholars and academics, containing "
"the traditional Hebrew text, a translation, and various notes.  This volume "
"is for the book of Deuteronomy."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "Jewish Publication Society Torah Commentary: Exodus" of item "Judaica hardcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A series of Torah commentaries written by scholars and academics, containing "
"the traditional Hebrew text, a translation, and various notes.  This volume "
"is for the book of Exodus."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "Jewish Publication Society Torah Commentary: Genesis" of item "Judaica hardcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A series of Torah commentaries written by scholars and academics, containing "
"the traditional Hebrew text, a translation, and various notes.  This volume "
"is for the book of Genesis."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "Jewish Publication Society Torah Commentary: Leviticus" of item "Judaica hardcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A series of Torah commentaries written by scholars and academics, containing "
"the traditional Hebrew text, a translation, and various notes.  This volume "
"is for the book of Leviticus."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "Jewish Publication Society Torah Commentary: Numbers" of item "Judaica hardcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A series of Torah commentaries written by scholars and academics, containing "
"the traditional Hebrew text, a translation, and various notes.  This volume "
"is for the book of Numbers."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "Coming to Terms with America: Essays on Jewish History, Religion, and Culture" of item "Judaica hardcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A series of fifteen essays by Jonathan Sarna on Jews' attempt to be both "
"distinctively Jewish but also definitely American, covering the American "
"Revolution through to contemporary times."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "Ranch Prospectus"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A short paper of the economic viability of constructing an agricultural "
"outpost."
msgstr ""
"Un artículo corto sobre la viabilidad económica de construir un puesto "
"agrícola."

#. ~ Description of "Visions in Solitude"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A small book detailing 'visions' a prisoner had on death row."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño libro detallando las \"revelaciones\" que tuvo un prisionero en "
"el corredor de la muerte."

#. ~ Description of "priest's diary"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A small book filled with journal entries in Latin.  You can read Latin, "
"right?"
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño libro lleno de entradas en latín de un diario. Puedes leer en "
"latín, ¿verdad?"

#. ~ Description of "war novel"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A story about a Bosnian citizen who goes through many hardships and near "
"death during the breakup of Yugoslavia."
msgstr ""
"Una historia sobre un ciudadano bosnio que pasa por muchas dificultades y "
"está a punto de morir durante la desintegración de Yugoslavia."

#. ~ Description of "crime novel"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A story about three people in the fictional city of Los Santos: a gangster, "
"an upper-class man, and a psychopath.  They eventually band together to pull "
"off the biggest heist in the city's history"
msgstr ""
"Una historia sobre tres personas en la ciudad ficticia de Los Santos: un "
"gángster, un hombre de clase alta y un psicópata. Al final se unen para "
"llevar a cabo el mayor atraco de la historia de la ciudad"

#. ~ Description of "comic book"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A super-hero comic."
msgstr "Un comic de superheroes."

#. ~ Description of variant "A Short History of the Jewish People: From Legendary Times to to Modern Statehood" of item "Judaica softcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A survey-level study of Jewish history, from Biblical times through to the "
"1990s.  At only 250 pages long, it is by necessity very brief on any "
"individual topic."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "thriller novel"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A suspenseful tale of betrayal and revenge."
msgstr "Una historia de suspense con engaños y venganzas."

#. ~ Description of "road novel"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A tale about a group of friends who wander the USA in the 1960s against a "
"backdrop of jazz, poetry and drug use."
msgstr ""
"Una historia acerca de un grupo de amigos que viajan por EE.UU. en la década "
"de 1960, con un transfondo de jazz, poesía y uso de drogas."

#. ~ Description of "spy novel"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A tale of intrigue and espionage among Nazis, no, Commies, no, Iraqis!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "war novel"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A thrilling narrative of survival in a prisoner of war camp during the "
"Second World War, filled with riveting subplots about rat farming and "
"dysentery."
msgstr ""
"Una emocionante narrativa sobre la supervivencia en un campo de prisioneros "
"de guerra durante la Segunda Guerra Mundial, llena de fascinantes subtramas "
"sobre la cría de ratas y la disentería."

#. ~ Description of "collector's edition book"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "A unique, valuable book that has been kept as a collector's item."
msgstr ""
"Un libro único y valioso que ha sido almacenado como un objeto de "
"coleccionista."

#. ~ Description of "The Vendetta Riders"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"A wild young man, fast on the draw, who thinks he has nothing to lose, falls "
"in with a group of gun runners."
msgstr ""
"Un joven salvaje, rápido al desenfundar, cree que no tiene nada que perder, "
"se une a un grupo de traficantes de armas."

#. ~ Description of "crime novel"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"After their diamond heist goes wrong, the surviving criminals begin to "
"suspect that one of them is a police informant."
msgstr ""
"Después de que el robo de diamantes saliera mal, los criminales "
"supervivientes empiezan a sospechar que uno de ellos es un informante de la "
"policía."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "Along Came a Rider"
msgid_plural "copies of Along Came a Rider"
msgstr[0] "Y Llegó Un Jinete"
msgstr[1] "copias de Y Llegó Un Jinete"
msgstr[2] "copias de Y Llegó Un Jinete"

#. ~ Description of variant "I and Thou" of item "Judaica softcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"An English translation of Martin Buber's philosophical work on the "
"relationships of human beings to each other and to God."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "The Way of Humanity: According to Chasidic Teachings" of item "Judaica softcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"An English translation of lectures given by Martin Buber on six traditional "
"Chasidic stories from the 18th and 19th centuries."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "The Guide for the Perplexed" of item "Judaica hardcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"An English translation of the great sage Rabbi Moses ben Maimon's work "
"finding common points between natural philosophy and Talmudic scholarship.  "
"Contains the famous Thirteen Principles of Faith, accepted by many Jews as a "
"summary of the fundamental beliefs of Judaism."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "In This Hour" of item "Judaica hardcover"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
