msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "toad in a hole"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"A cooked egg served inside a piece of toast, not to be confused with the "
"English recipe of the same name."
msgstr ""
"Un huevo cocido servido dentro de una tostada, que no debe confundirse con "
"la receta inglesa del mismo nombre."

#. ~ Description of "johnnycake"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "A dense and tasty fried bread treat."
msgstr "Una densa y sabrosa golosina de pan frito."

#. ~ Description of "hardtack"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"A dry, virtually tasteless bread product capable of remaining edible without "
"spoilage for vast lengths of time.  So hard it is inedible by itself."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "juvenile sourdough starter"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"A floury paste that is slowly fermenting.  Someday it will be sourdough."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "freshly fed sourdough starter"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"A floury paste with sourdough starter mixed in.  It needs a day to recover "
"its strength before it can be used again."
msgstr ""
"Una pasta harinosa con masa madre mezclada. Necesita un día para recuperar "
"su fuerza antes de poder volver a utilizarla."

#. ~ Description of "bread"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"A humble piece of bread, one of the single most important staple foods of "
"human civilization since the dawn of agriculture."
msgstr ""
"Un humilde pedazo de pan, uno de los alimentos básicos más importantes de la "
"civilización humana desde el inicio de la agricultura."

#. ~ Description of "sourdough starter"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"A precious mix of flour, water, molds, and bacteria from the air.  When you "
"add flour and water to it, after a few hours it froths and rises."
msgstr ""
"Una preciosa mezcla de harina, agua, moho y bacterias del aire. Cuando se le "
"añade harina y agua, al cabo de unas horas hace espuma y sube."

#. ~ Description of "corn tortilla"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "A round, thin flatbread made from finely ground corn flour."
msgstr "Una masa plana y redonda hecha de harina de maíz finamente molida."

#. ~ Description of "flour tortilla"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "A round, thin flatbread made from finely ground wheat flour."
msgstr "Una masa plana y redonda hecha de harina de trigo finamente molida."

#. ~ Description of "peanut butter toast"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"A slathering of peanut butter gives more heartiness and calories to a slice "
"of toast."
msgstr ""
"Una capa de mantequilla de cacahuete da más cuerpo y calorías a una rebanada "
"de pan tostado."

#. ~ Description of "toast"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"A slice of bread with heat applied to crisp it up.  It's a bit dry and would "
"likely go better with some toppings."
msgstr ""
"Una rebanada de pan con calor aplicado para que quede crujiente. Es un poco "
"seco y probablemente iría mejor con algunos aderezos."

#. ~ Description of "buttered toast"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "A slice of toast with butter spread on top to make it taste better."
msgstr ""
"Una rebanada de pan tostado con mantequilla extendida por encima para que "
"sepa mejor."

#. ~ Description of "jam toast"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"A slice of toast with jam added, to make it less dry and to add more flavor."
msgstr ""
"Una rebanada de pan tostado con mermelada añadida, para hacerla menos seca y "
"darle más sabor."

#. ~ Description of "PBJ toast"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"A slice of toast with peanut butter and jelly on top, with added butter for "
"flavor."
msgstr ""
"Una rebanada de pan tostado con mantequilla de cacahuete y mermelada por "
"encima, con mantequilla añadida para darle sabor."

#. ~ Description of "soggy hardtack"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"A soggy, virtually tasteless bread product that has soaked up enough water "
"that it won't hurt your teeth when you chew it."
msgstr ""
"Un producto de pan empapado y prácticamente insípido que ha absorbido "
"suficiente agua como para no dañar tus dientes al masticarlo."

#. ~ Description of "garlic bread"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "Bread cooked with garlic, oil, and seasonings."
msgstr "Pan cocido con ajo, aceite y condimentos."

#. ~ Description of "frybread"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"Delicious fried flatbread.  While it's not pre-contact food, it's a popular "
"treat in many Native American households, especially as ingredient for "
"Indian tacos at Powwows or for Thanksgiving."
msgstr ""
"Pan plano deliciosamente frito. Aunque no es comida previa al contacto, es "
"un popular postre en muchas casas de Nativos Americanos, especialmente como "
"ingrediente para tacos Indios en Powwows o para el día de acción de gracias."

#. ~ Description of "wastebread"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"Flour is a commodity these days and to deal with that, most survivors resort "
"to mixing it with leftovers of other ingredients and baking it all into "
"bread.  It's filling, and that's what matters."
msgstr ""
"La harina es una mercancía hoy en día y para hacer frente a eso, la mayoría "
"de los supervivientes recurren a mezclarla con restos de otros ingredientes "
"y hornearlo todo en forma de pan. Es saciante, y eso es lo que importa."

#. ~ Description of "biscuit"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"Hardtack's much more palatable descendant, thanks in large part to the "
"addition of milk in the recipe.  Crumbly on the outside, soft on the inside, "
"and delicious all the way through."
msgstr ""
"El descendiente del Hardtack es mucho más sabroso, gracias en gran parte a "
"la adición de leche en la receta. Desmenuzable por fuera, suave por dentro y "
"delicioso hasta el final."

#. ~ Description of "cornbread"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"Healthy and filling cornbread, a Native American recipe that quickly became "
"a staple of U.S. cuisine."
msgstr ""
"Un pan de maíz sano y saciante, una receta de los nativos americanos que se "
"convirtió rápidamente en un elemento básico de la cocina estadounidense."

#. ~ Description of "sourdough bread"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"Healthy and filling, with a sharper taste and thicker crust than yeast-only "
"bread."
msgstr ""
"Sano y llena bastante, con un sabor más agudo y una corteza más gruesa que "
"el pan de levadura."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "PBJ toast"
