"crema con ácido cítrico, un queso típico italiano untable."

#. ~ Description of "pecorino"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/dairy.json
msgid ""
"A slice of pecorino, famous Italian hard cheese used in pasta carbonara."
msgstr ""
"Un trozo de queso de oveja, famoso queso duro italiano usado en la pasta "
"carbonara."

#. ~ Description of "quesadilla"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/dairy.json
msgid "A tortilla filled with cheese and lightly grilled."
msgstr "Una tortilla mexicana rellena con queso y levemente tostada."

#. ~ Description of "raw butter"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/dairy.json
msgid ""
"A white stick of raw milkfat and milk solids, made directly from cow's milk."
msgstr ""
"Una barra blanca de grasa y sólidos de leche cruda, hecha directamente de "
"leche de vaca."

#. ~ Description of "butter"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/dairy.json
msgid ""
"A yellow stick of milkfat and milk solids, usually made from cow's milk."
msgstr ""
"Una barra amarilla de grasa y sólidos lácteos, normalmente hecha de leche de "
"vaca."

#. ~ Description of "reconstituted milk"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/dairy.json
msgid ""
"Baby cow food, appropriated for adult humans.  This milk has been "
"reconstituted from powder.  Spoils rapidly."
msgstr ""
"Alimento de vaca para bebés, apropiado para humanos adultos. Esta leche ha "
"sido reconstituida a partir de polvo. Se estropea rápidamente."

#. ~ Description of "milk"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/dairy.json
msgid "Baby cow food, appropriated for human consumption.  Spoils rapidly."
msgstr ""
"Alimento para vacas pequeñas, apropiado para el consumo humano. Se estropea "
"rápidamente."

#. ~ Description of "chocolate milk"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/dairy.json
msgid ""
"Baby cow food, with chocolate added for human enjoyment.  Spoils rapidly."
msgstr ""
"Alimento para vacas bebés, con chocolate añadido para el disfrute humano. Se "
"estropea rápidamente."

#. ~ Description of "ghee"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/dairy.json
msgid ""
"Clarified butter, free from milk solids and water.  Will last a very long "
"time."
msgstr ""
"Mantequilla clarificada, libre de sólidos de leche y agua. Durará mucho "
"tiempo."

#. ~ Description of "condensed milk"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/dairy.json
msgid ""
"Cow's milk that has been partly dehydrated and sweetened.  A key ingredient "
"in many sweets."
msgstr ""
"Leche de vaca parcialmente deshidratada y endulzada. Un ingrediente clave en "
"muchos dulces."

#. ~ Description of "heavy cream"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/dairy.json
msgid "Cream that has been skimmed from the top of raw milk left to sit."
msgstr ""
"La nata que se ha descremado de la parte superior de la leche cruda y se ha "
"dejado reposar."

#. ~ Description of "whipped cream"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/dairy.json
msgid "Cream that has been whipped, perfect for frosting cakes and pies."
msgstr "Nata montada, perfecta para cubrir tartas y pasteles."

#. ~ Description of "powdered cheese"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/dairy.json
msgid ""
"Dehydrated cheese powder, the kind found in mac & cheese boxes or bulk foods "
"products.  Will keep for an extremely long time."
msgstr ""
"Queso en polvo deshidratado, el típico que se usa en cajas de mac y queso o "
"productos de comida rápida. Se conserva durante un extremadamente largo "
"periodo de tiempo."

#. ~ Description of "powdered milk"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/dairy.json
msgid "Dehydrated milk powder.  Mix with water to make drinkable milk."
msgstr ""
"Leche en polvo deshidratada. Mézclela con agua para hacer leche bebible."

#. ~ Description of "yogurt"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/dairy.json
msgid "Delicious fermented dairy.  It tastes of vanilla."
msgstr "Delicioso producto lácteo fermentado. Sabe a vainilla."

#. ~ Description of "fried mozzarella sticks"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/dairy.json
msgid "Fried mozzarella cheese sticks, yum.  They lack sauce though."
msgstr "Palos fritos de mozzarella con queso, rico. Aunque les falta la salsa."

#. ~ Description of "rehydrated cheese"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/dairy.json
msgid "Goopy cheese sauce made by rehydrating cheese powder."
msgstr "Salsa de queso pegajosa hecha de queso en polvo deshidratado."

#. ~ Description of "hard cheese"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/dairy.json
msgid ""
"Hard, dry cheese made to last, unlike modern processed cheese.  Will make "
"you thirsty though."
msgstr ""
"Queso duro y seco hecho para ser duradero, a diferencia de los modernos "
"quesos procesados. Te va a dar bastante sed, eso sí."

#. ~ Description of "tiramisù"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/dairy.json
msgid ""
"It is an Italian spoon dessert based on savoiardi soaked in coffee and "
"covered with a cream composed of mascarpone and eggs."
msgstr ""
"Un postre italiano de cuchara hecho con galleta mojada en café y cubierto "
"con crema compuesta de mascarpone y huevos."

#. ~ Description of "curdled milk"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/dairy.json
msgid ""
"Milk that has been curdled with vinegar and rennet.  It still needs to be "
"salted and drained of whey."
msgstr ""
"Leche cuajada con vinagre y cuajo. Todavía hay que salarla y escurrir el "
"suero."

#. ~ Description of "evaporated milk"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/dairy.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "Milk that's had about 60% of its water removed prior to canning."
msgstr ""
"Leche a la que se le ha quitado alrededor del 60% del agua antes del "
"enlatado."

#. ~ Description of "pudding"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/dairy.json
msgid "Sugary, fermented dairy.  A wonderful treat."
msgstr "Lácteos azucarados y fermentados. Una delicia."

#. ~ Description of "buttermilk"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/dairy.json
msgid ""
"This is cultured milk defatted either due to churning or curdling.  Spoils "
"quickly."
msgstr ""
"Esta es leche cultivada desgrasada, ya sea por batido o cuajado. Se pudre "
"rápidamente."

#. ~ Description of "shelf stable milk"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/dairy.json
msgid ""
"This is milk that has been pasteurized at much higher temperatures than "
"normal.  It tastes slightly different, but, unopened, will last far longer "
"than regular milk."
msgstr ""
"Esta leche ha sido pasteurizada a temperaturas muy superiores a la normal. "
"Tiene un gusto un poco diferente, pero, sin abrir, puede durar mucho más que "
"la leche normal."

#. ~ Description of "raw milk"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/dairy.json
msgid ""
"This is raw, unhomogenized and unpasteurized milk from a cow.  It couldn't "
"be any fresher unless you drank it straight from the cow, which might upset "
"it.  Depending on your dietary sensibilities, you might want to pasteurize "
"or even boil this before drinking."
msgstr ""
"Esta es leche cruda, no homogeneizada y no pasteurizada de una vaca. No "
"podría ser más fresca a menos que se beba directamente de la vaca, lo que "
"podría alterarla. Dependiendo de tu sensibilidad dietética, puede que "
"quieras pasteurizar o incluso hervirla antes de beberla."

#. ~ Description of "cottage cheese"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/dairy.json
msgid ""
"Unaged curdled milk and whey, made by draining cheese rather than pressing "
"like cheese curds.  The retained whey keeps the curds loose and soft, giving "
"a somewhat soupy texture to this lower calorie variety of cheese."
msgstr ""
"Leche cuajada y suero sin madurar, que se elabora escurriendo el queso en "
"lugar de prensarlo como la cuajada. El suero retenido mantiene la cuajada "
"suelta y blanda, lo que confiere una textura algo caldosa a esta variedad de "
"queso con menos calorías."

#. ~ Description of "cottage cheese with fruit"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/dairy.json
msgid ""
"Unaged curdled milk and whey, made by draining cheese rather than pressing "
"like cheese curds.  The retained whey keeps the curds loose and soft, giving "
"a somewhat soupy texture to this lower calorie variety of cheese.  By adding "
"fruits to it you've made what might be a full meal."
msgstr ""
"Leche cuajada y suero sin madurar, que se elabora escurriendo el queso en "
"lugar de prensarlo como la cuajada. El suero retenido mantiene la cuajada "
"suelta y blanda, lo que da una textura algo caldosa a esta variedad de queso "
"con menos calorías. Al añadirle frutas se consigue lo que podría ser una "
"comida completa."

#. ~ Description of "cottage cheese with savory vegetables"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/dairy.json
msgid ""
"Unaged curdled milk and whey, made by draining cheese rather than pressing "
"like cheese curds.  The retained whey keeps the curds loose and soft, giving "
"a somewhat soupy texture to this lower calorie variety of cheese.  By adding "
"savory vegetables to it you've made what might be a full meal."
msgstr ""
"Leche cuajada y suero sin madurar, que se elabora escurriendo el queso en "
"lugar de prensarlo como la cuajada. El suero retenido mantiene la cuajada "
"suelta y blanda, lo que da una textura algo caldosa a esta variedad de queso "
"con menos calorías. Al añadirle frutas se consigue lo que podría ser una "
"comida completa."

