#. ~ Description of "razorclaw roe"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid "A blobby clump of roe the size of grapes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "cluster of giant frog eggs"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid ""
"A clump of very large frog eggs, reeking of ammonia.  They look almost like "
"peeled grapes, except that each is the size of an orange."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "roach egg"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid "A fist-sized egg from a giant roach.  Incredibly gross."
msgstr ""
"Un huevo del tamaño de tu puño de una cucaracha gigante. Increíblemente "
"asqueroso."

#. ~ Description of "locust egg"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid "A fist-sized egg from a locust."
msgstr "Un huevo del tamaño de un puño de una langosta."

#. ~ Description of "plague vector egg"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid "A fist-sized egg from a plague vector.  Incredibly gross."
msgstr ""
"Un huevo del tamaño de un puño de un vector de plaga. Increíblemente "
"asqueroso."

#. ~ Description of "vegetable omelet"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid "A fluffy beaten egg pancaked over with cheese and vegetables inside."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "omelet"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid "A fluffy beaten egg pancaked over with cheese inside."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "supreme omelet"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid ""
"A fluffy beaten egg pancaked over with cheese, vegetables, and meat all "
"stuffed inside.  The mother of all omelets."
msgstr ""
"Un huevo blando batido con pancake empanado con queso, vegetales y carne. La "
"madre de todas las tortillas."

#. ~ Description of "boiled egg"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid "A hard-boiled egg, still in its shell.  Portable and nutritious!"
msgstr ""
"Es un huevo duro hervido, todavía con la cáscara. ¡Transportable y nutritivo!"

#. ~ Description of "ladybug egg"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid ""
"A ladybug egg.  It looks like a huge yellow rice grain.  You can see a "
"translucent, hungry larva inside."
msgstr ""
"Un huevo de mariquita. Parece un enorme grano de arroz amarillo. Se puede "
"ver una larva translúcida y hambrienta en su interior."

#. ~ Description of "cluster of frog eggs"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid "A large clump of gelatinous frog eggs."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "roe"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid "A large half-translucent glob with a mutant fish fry inside."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "acid ant egg"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid ""
"A large, heavy acid ant egg, the size of a softball.  Extremely nutritious, "
"but incredibly gross."
msgstr ""
"Un huevo de hormiga grande y pesado, del tamaño de una pelota de softball. "
"Extremadamente nutritivo, pero increíblemente asqueroso."

#. ~ Description of "ant egg"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid ""
"A large, heavy ant egg, the size of a softball.  Extremely nutritious, but "
"incredibly gross."
msgstr ""
"Un huevo de hormiga grande y pesado, del tamaño de una pelota de softball. "
"Extremadamente nutritivo, pero increíblemente asqueroso."

#. ~ Description of "fire ant egg"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid ""
"A large, heavy fire ant egg, the size of a softball.  Extremely nutritious, "
"but incredibly gross."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "centipede egg"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid ""
"A large, soft egg of a mutant centipede.  Inside, you can already see a "
"bundle of spindly legs, twitching in anticipation."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "water strider egg"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid ""
"A large, sticky, and wet water strider egg.  You should probably put it back "
"in the water."
msgstr ""
"Un huevo grande, pegajoso y húmedo de strider acuático. Probablemente "
"deberías devolverlo al agua."

#. ~ Description of "antlion egg"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid "A large, white antlion egg.  There is something hard inside."
msgstr "Un gran huevo blanco de hormiga. Hay algo duro dentro."

#. ~ Description of "grasshopper egg"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid ""
"A long, white, pill-shaped grasshopper egg.  Inside you can see two "
"twitching legs."
msgstr ""
"Un huevo de saltamontes largo, blanco y con forma de píldora. En su interior "
"se pueden ver dos patas que se mueven."

#. ~ Description of "mole cricket egg"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid ""
"A mole cricket egg covered in bits of sand and dirt.  It's brown with a few "
"black dots on it."
msgstr ""
"Un huevo de grillo topo cubierto de trozos de arena y tierra. Es de color "
"marrón con algunos puntos negros."

#. ~ Description of "bird egg"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid "A nutritious egg laid by a bird."
msgstr "Un huevo nutritivo puesto por un pájaro."

#. ~ Description of "unfertilized bird egg"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid ""
"A nutritious egg laid by a bird.  This one is unfertilized and probably from "
"a farm."
msgstr ""
"Un huevo nutritivo puesto por un pájaro. Este no está fecundado y "
"probablemente procede de una granja."

#. ~ Description of "robin egg"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid ""
"A nutritious egg laid by a robin.  The shell is colored a distinctive light "
"blue."
msgstr ""
"Un nutritivo huevo puesto por un petirrojo. La cáscara tiene un color azul "
"claro característico."

#. ~ Description of "pickled egg"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid ""
"A pickled egg.  Rather salty, but tastes good and lasts for a long time."
msgstr ""
"Un huevo al escabeche. Bastante salado, pero tiene buen sabor y dura mucho "
"tiempo."

#. ~ Description of "menemen"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid ""
"A popular traditional Turkish dish which includes eggs, tomato, green "
"peppers, and spices such as ground black and red pepper cooked in olive oil."
msgstr ""
"Un plato tradicional turco muy popular que incluye huevos, tomate, pimientos "
"verdes y especias como pimienta negra y roja molida cocinados en aceite de "
"oliva."

#. ~ Description of "caviar and egg sandwich"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid ""
"A simple sandwich with sliced, hard boiled eggs and mayo to balance out the "
"saltiness of the caviar.  Scandinavian breakfast staple."
msgstr ""
"Un sencillo sándwich con huevos duros en rodajas y mayonesa para equilibrar "
"el sabor salado del caviar. Un desayuno escandinavo básico."

#. ~ Description of "seasoned fried eggs"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid "A tasty fried egg, with seasoning added to taste!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "wasp egg"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid ""
"A white, flexible wasp egg.  It looks like a pristine grain of rice the size "
"of your palm."
msgstr ""
"Un huevo de avispa blanco y flexible. Parece un grano de arroz prístino del "
"tamaño de tu palma."

#. ~ Description of "reptile egg"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid "An egg laid by one of reptile species found in New England."
msgstr ""
"Un huevo puesto por una de las especies de reptiles que se encuentran en "
"Nueva Inglaterra."

#. ~ Description of "roe"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid "Common roe from an unknown fish."
msgstr "Hueva común de algún pez desconocido."

#. ~ Description of "deluxe fried eggs"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid ""
"Deluxe sunny-side up eggs fried with a runny yolk and just a bit of crisp on "
"the edges with cheese or a vegetable, garnish and condiment."
msgstr ""
"Huevos fritos de lujo fritos con una yema líquida y sólo un poco crujiente "
"en los bordes con queso o alguna verdura, guarnición y condimento."

#. ~ Description of "deluxe fried egg sandwich"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid ""
"Deluxe sunny-side up eggs fried with a runny yolk and just a bit of crisp on "
"the edges.  Made into a sandwich, just like Sunday morning."
msgstr ""
"Huevos fritos de lujo fritos con una yema líquida y un poco crujiente en los "
"bordes. Hechos en un sándwich, como el Domingo por la mañana."

#. ~ Description of "post apocalyptic 'caviar'"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid ""
"Fish eggs that have been cured in a salty brine.  Can be vacuum sealed to "
"preserve freshness.  Technically caviar only came from a specific type of "
"Sturgeon roe but the FDA allows all cured fish to be referred to as caviar."
msgstr ""
"Huevos de pescado curados en una salmuera salada. Pueden sellarse al vacío "
"para conservar su frescura. Técnicamente, el caviar sólo procede de un tipo "
"específico de huevas de esturión, pero la FDA permite denominar caviar a "
"todo el pescado curado."

#. ~ Description of "scrambled eggs"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid "Fluffy and delicious scrambled eggs."
msgstr "Huevos revueltos suaves y deliciosos."

#. ~ Description of "egg salad"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid "Hard-boiled eggs, mixed into a salad.  Can be made into a sandwich!"
msgstr ""
"Huevos duros, mezclados en una ensalada. ¡Puede hacerse en un sándwich."

#. ~ Description of "praying mantis egg case"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid ""
"Praying mantis eggs glued to each other inside a strange-looking case.  It "
"resembles a trilobite or a woodlouse."
msgstr ""
"Huevos de mantis religiosa pegados entre sí dentro de un estuche de aspecto "
"extraño. Se parece a un trilobite o a una cochinilla."

#. ~ Description of "rehydrated egg"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid ""
"Rehydrated eggs.  You can use them instead of eggs when cooking, provided "
"you don't care that they have lost their complete shape."
msgstr ""
"Rehydrated eggs.  You can use them instead of eggs when cooking, provided "
"you don't care that they have lost their complete shape."

#. ~ Description of "curing roe"
#. ~ Description of "curing roe (obsolete)"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
#: data/json/obsoletion_and_migration/obsoletion.json
msgid ""
"Roe in the process of becoming fully cured with salt, capable of becoming "
"homemade caviar.  The flavor is slowly developing at this stage, and is "
"currently significantly unpleasant due to the residual salt.  Activate it "
"once completed to make use of the final product."
msgstr ""
"Hueva en proceso de curado completo con sal, capaz de convertirse en caviar "
"casero. El sabor se está desarrollando lentamente en esta etapa, y "
"actualmente es significativamente desagradable debido a la sal residual. "
"Actívelo una vez completado para aprovechar el producto final."

#. ~ Description of "fried eggs"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid ""
"Sunny-side up eggs fried with a runny yolk and just a bit of crisp on the "
"edges."
msgstr ""
"Huevos fritos con una yema líquida y sólo un poco de crujiente en los bordes."

#. ~ Description of "fried egg sandwich"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid ""
"Sunny-side up eggs fried with a runny yolk and just a bit of crisp on the "
"edges.  Made into a sandwich, just like Sunday morning."
msgstr ""
"Huevos fritos con la yema líquida y un poco crujiente en los bordes. Hechos "
"en un sándwich, como el Domingo por la mañana."

#. ~ Description of "seasoned scrambled eggs"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid "Tasty scrambled eggs, with seasoning to taste!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "black widow egg"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid "The egg of a black widow."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "butterfly egg"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
