#. ~ Description of "water beetle egg"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid "The egg of a water beetle, usually found near aquatic grass."
msgstr ""
"El huevo de un escarabajo de agua, normalmente se encuentran en la hierba "
"cerca del agua."

#. ~ Description of "water scorpion egg"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid "The egg of a water scorpion, usually found near aquatic grass."
msgstr ""
"El huevo de un escorpión de agua, normalmente se encuentran en la hierba "
"cerca del agua. "

