#. ~ Snippet of item "homeopathic pill"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A Lachesis mutus pill, prepared through the dilution of the venom of the "
"bushmaster snake with 10^1000 parts water.  These pills are claimed to be an "
"effective treatment for sore throat."
msgstr ""
"Una pastilla Lachesis mutus, preparada a través de la disolución de veneno "
"de una víbora cascabel en 10^1000 partes de agua. Estas pastillas dicen ser "
"efectiva en el tratamiento del dolor de garganta."

#. ~ Description of "broad-spectrum antibiotics"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A broad-spectrum antibacterial medication designed to prevent or stop the "
"spread of infection.  It contains nearly toxic levels of antibiotics, but "
"can treat any bacterial infections you may encounter.  One dose lasts twelve "
"hours."
msgstr ""
"Un medicamento antibacteriano de amplio espectro diseñado para prevenir o "
"detener la propagación de la infección. Contiene niveles casi tóxicos de "
"antibióticos, pero puede tratar cualquier infección bacteriana que puedas "
"encontrar. Una dosis dura doce horas."

#. ~ Description of "antiparasitic drug"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A broad-spectrum chemical tablet designed to eliminate parasitic "
"infestations in living creatures.  Though designed for use on pets and "
"livestock, it will likely work on humans as well."
msgstr ""
"Un comprimido químico de amplio espectro, diseñada para eliminar las plagas "
"parasitarias en los seres vivos.  A pesar de estar diseñada para las "
"mascotas y el ganado, también puede funcionar en humanos."

#. ~ Description of "skunk spray neutralizing solution"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A combination of hydrogen peroxide, baking soda, and dish soap that works "
"together to transform skunk spray thiocetates into odorless acids."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "fluoxetine"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A common and popular antidepressant.  It will elevate mood, and can "
"profoundly alter the effects of other drugs.  It is only rarely habit-"
"forming, though adverse reactions are not uncommon."
msgstr ""
"Un antidepresivo común y popular. Elevará el estado de ánimo, y puede "
"afectar profundamente la acción de otras drogas. Rara vez crea hábito, "
"aunque las reacciones adversas no son raras."

#. ~ Description of "antacid tablet"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A common stomach soother in flavored tablet form.  Makes you less likely to "
"vomit."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "debug chloroform soaked rag"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A debug item that lets you put NPCs (or yourself) to sleep."
msgstr ""
"Un objeto para depurar que te permite dormir a los PNJs (o a ti mismo)."

#. ~ Description of "alprazolam"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A fast-acting benzodiazepine with a powerful sedative effect.  It is "
"dangerously addictive, and withdrawal from regular use should be gradual."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "flavored bone meal tablet"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A homemade calcium supplement made out of bone meal.  Due to some sweeteners "
"mixed in to counteract the powdery texture and the taste of ash, it's almost "
"as palatable as the pre-Cataclysm tablets."
msgstr ""
"Un suplemento de calcio casero hecho de harina de hueso.  Debido a algún "
"endulzante que ha sido mezclado para contrarrestar la textura de polvo y el "
"gusto a ceniza, es casi tan apetitoso como una píldora de antes del "
"Cataclismo."

#. ~ Description of "bone meal tablet"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A homemade calcium supplement made out of bone meal.  Tastes horrible and is "
"hard to swallow but it does its job."
msgstr ""
"Suplemento de calcio casero hecho de harina de huesos. Sabe horrible y es "
"difícil de tragar, pero cumple su función."

#. ~ Description of "homeopathic pill"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A homeopathic pill, prepared through the repeated dilution of an active "
"ingredient with water.  The label purports that these pills are able to "
"maintain general wellness."
msgstr ""
"Una píldora homeopática, preparada mediante la disolución repetida de un "
"ingrediente activo con agua. La etiqueta afirma que estas píldoras son "
"capaces de mantener el bienestar general."

#. ~ Description of "Dakin's solution"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A makeshift antiseptic made from bleach and water.  The volatile chlorine "
"compounds break down quickly, so it won't stay good for long."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "cocaine topical cream"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A medical cream that provides both vascular restriction and anesthetic "
"properties.  It won't get you high, but if used too frequently it may still "
"be habit-forming."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "cigarette"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A mixture of dried tobacco leaf, pesticides, and chemical additives, rolled "
"into a filtered paper tube.  Stimulates mental acuity and reduces appetite.  "
"Highly addictive and hazardous to health, but lung cancer is kind of the "
"least of your concerns at this point."
msgstr ""
"Una mezcla de tabaco seco, pesticidas y aditivos químicos, enrollados en un "
"papel tubular con filtro. Estimula la agudeza mental y reduce el apetito. "
"Muy adictivo y dañino para la salud pero el cáncer de pulmón es la menor de "
"tus preocupaciones en este momento."

#. ~ Description of "narrow-spectrum antibiotics"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A narrow-spectrum antibiotic used to suppress infections and prevent them "
"from spreading.  It isn't broad enough to purge most infections outright, "
"but it boosts the body's resistance against them.  One dose lasts twelve "
"hours."
msgstr ""
"Un antibiótico de espectro reducido que se utiliza para suprimir las "
"infecciones y evitar que se propaguen. No es lo suficientemente amplia como "
"para purgar la mayoría de las infecciones, pero aumenta la resistencia del "
"cuerpo contra ellas. Una dosis dura doce horas."

#. ~ Description of "flu shot"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A pharmaceutical flu shot designed for mass vaccinations, still in its "
"packaging.  Purported to provide immunity to influenza, for the flu season "
"for which it was developed."
msgstr ""
"Una vacuna farmacéutica para la gripe, diseñada para vacunaciones en masa, "
"todavía en su paquete original.  Supuestamente te hace inmune a la gripe "
"para la temporada que fue diseñada."

#. ~ Description of "potassium iodide tablet"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A potassium iodide tablet.  If taken prior to exposure, they help to "
"mitigate injury caused by radiation absorption."
msgstr ""
"Un comprimido de yoduro de potasio.  Si lo ingieres antes de estar expuesto "
"a la radiación, te puede ayudar a mitigar el daño y la absorción."

#. ~ Description of "oxycodone"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A potent opioid pain relief medication in an immediate release tablet.  "
"Oxycodone is highly addictive."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "hemostatic powder"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A powdered antihemorrhagic compound that reacts with blood to immediately "
"form a gel-like substance that stops bleeding."
msgstr ""
"Un compuesto antihemorrágico en polvo que reacciona ante la sangre para "
"formar inmediatamente una sustancia con consistencia de gel que detiene el "
"sangrado."

#. ~ Description of "antiseptic powder"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A powdered form of chemical antiseptic, this bismuth formic iodide cleans "
"wounds quickly and painlessly."
msgstr ""
"Una forma en polvo de antiséptico químico, este yoduro fórmico de bismuto "
"limpia las heridas rápidamente y sin dolor."

#. ~ Description of "antiseptic"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A powerful antiseptic commonly used to disinfect wounds."
msgstr "Un potente antiséptico comúnmente utilizado para desinfectar heridas."

#. ~ Description of "antifungal drug"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A powerful chemical tablet designed to eliminate fungal infections in living "
"creatures.  One dose lasts four hours."
msgstr ""
"Potente comprimido químico diseñado para eliminar las infecciones fúngicas "
"en seres vivos. Una dosis dura 4 horas."

#. ~ Description of "lithium tablet"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A prescription mood stabilizer in the form of lithium carbonate.  This drug "
"has long been used to treat bipolar disorder, and if taken once daily, helps "
"to dampen the severity of mood swings."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "dextroamphetamine"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A prescription stimulant commonly prescribed for attention deficit disorder, "
"often with levoamphetamine included.  It can be addictive if abused."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "zolpidem"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A prescription-strength sedative with a variety of psychoactive side "
"effects.  Used in the treatment of insomnia."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "hand-rolled cigarette"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A roll-your-own cigarette.  Stimulates mental acuity and reduces appetite.  "
"Despite being hand crafted, it's still highly addictive and hazardous to "
"health."
msgstr ""
"Un cigarrillo liado con tabaco y papel de liar. Estimula la agudeza mental y "
"reduce el apetito. A pesar de ser casero, sigue siendo muy adictivo y dañino "
"para la salud."

#. ~ Description of "naloxone"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A small plastic device with a nozzle on one end and a plunger on the other.  "
"The drug inside can be administered nasally to rapidly reverse and block the "
"effect of opioids, which could save someone's life during an overdose."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "injectable iron"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A small vial of dark yellow liquid containing soluble iron for injection."
msgstr ""
"Pequeño vial de líquido amarillo oscuro que contiene hierro soluble "
"inyectable."

#. ~ Description of "vitamin C supplement"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A small white tablet promising more vitamin C than a human can conceivably "
"absorb."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "saline solution"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A solution of sterilized water and salt for intravenous infusion or washing "
"contaminants from one's eyes."
msgstr ""
"Una solución de agua esterilizada y sal para infusión intravenosa o para "
"limpiar de contaminantes los ojos."

#. ~ Description of "opium tar"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A sticky blob of painkiller derived from the poppy plant.  It lacks the "
"potency of a modern pharmaceutical formulation, but is every bit as "
"addictive."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "diazepam"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A strong benzodiazepine drug used to treat muscle spasms, anxiety, seizures, "
"and panic attacks."
msgstr ""
"Una poderosa droga benzodiazepina utilizada para tratar los espasmos "
"musculares, la ansiedad, las convulsiones y los ataques de pánico."

#. ~ Description of "epinephrine autoinjector"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A syringe filled with a shot of epinephrine, also called adrenaline.  It "
"serves as a powerful stimulant when you inject yourself with it.  Asthmatics "
"can use it in an emergency to clear an asthma attack."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "tramadol"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A tablet containing 50mg of a slow-acting opioid.  It is slow-acting and "
"relatively mild, but will last much longer than other opioids."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "Prussian blue tablet"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A tablet containing oxidized ferrous ferrocyanide salts.  Capable of purging "
"nuclear contaminants from the body if taken after radiation exposure."
msgstr ""
"Un comprimido que contiene sales ferrocianuras ferrosas oxidadas.  Es capaz "
"de purgar del cuerpo los contaminantes nucleares si se toma después de la "
"exposición a la radiación."

#. ~ Description of "pink tab"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A tiny pink tabs resembling a postage stamp, dosed with some sort of drug.  "
"Really only useful for entertainment.  Will cause hallucinations."
msgstr ""
"Diminutas pestañas rosadas parecidas a los sellos postales, ya dosificadas "
"con algún tipo de droga. En realidad sólo son útiles para el "
"entretenimiento. Causarán alucinaciones."

#. ~ Description of "calcium tablet"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A white calcium tablet.  Widely used by elderly people with osteoporosis as "
"a method to supplement calcium before the apocalypse."
msgstr ""
"Un comprimido blanco de calcio.  Antes del apocalipsis era comúnmente usadao "
"por gente anciana con osteoporosis como una manera de suplementar el calcio."

#. ~ Description of "acetaminophen"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Acetaminophen, a mild painkiller that works well in conjunction with NSAID-"
"based painkillers like aspirin.  Take to relieve pain and swelling."
msgstr ""
"Acetaminofeno, un analgésico suave que funciona bien en combinación con "
"analgésicos a base de AINE como la aspirina. Tomar para aliviar el dolor y "
"la inflamación."

#. ~ Description of "cough syrup"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Acetaminophen, dextromethorphan HBr, and diphenhydramine served in the form "
"of a foul-tasting syrup.  It promises to fight flu symptoms like coughs, "
"fever, and body aches, and thanks to the inclusion of a potent "
"antihistamine, it should fight allergies and put you to sleep as well."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "aspirin"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Acetylsalicylic acid, an NSAID that can treat pain and fever.  It is a blood "
"thinner, and may exacerbate bleeding."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet of item "homeopathic pill"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"An Aesculus hippocastanum homeopathic pill, prepared through the dilution of "
"horse chestnut with 10^30 parts water.  These pills are meant to treat "
"dysentery and hemorrhoids."
msgstr ""
"Una pastilla homeopática Aesculus hippocastanum, preparada a través de la "
"disolución de castaña de Indias con 10^30 partes de agua. Se supone que esta "
"pastilla trata la disentería y las hemorroides."

#. ~ Snippet of item "homeopathic pill"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"An Allium cepa homeopathic pill, prepared through the dilution of one part "
"onion with 10^30 parts water.  The label states that these pills can "
"ameliorate symptoms of asthma, gastrointestinal disorders, and bronchitis.  "
"You briefly wonder if it can cure fungal infections."
msgstr ""
"Una pastilla homeopática Allium cepa, preparada a través de la disolución de "
"una parte de cebolla en 10^30 partes de agua. La etiqueta establece que esta "
"pastilla puede aliviar los síntomas del asma, desórdenes gastrointestinales "
"y bronquitis. Por un momento, te preguntas si curará las infecciones "
"fúngicas."

#. ~ Snippet of item "homeopathic pill"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"An Arsenicum album homeopathic pill, prepared through the dilution of one "
"part arsenic trioxide with 10^24 parts water.  Purported to treat anxiety, "
"various digestive disorders, and arsenic poisoning."
msgstr ""
"Una pastilla homeopática Arsenicum, preparada a través de la disolución de "
"una parte de trióxido de arsénico en 10^24 partes de agua. Pensada para "
"tratar la ansiedad, varios desórdenes digestivos y el envenenamiento por "
"arsénico."

#. ~ Snippet of item "homeopathic pill"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"An Arum tryphillum homeopathic pill, prepared through the dilution of the "
"jack-in-the-pulpit plant with 10^30 parts water.  The label claims that the "
"pills are able to treat voice loss."
msgstr ""
"Una pastilla homeopática Arum tryphillum, preparada a través de la "
"disolución de la planta Arisaema triphyllum en 10^400 partes de agua. La "
"etiqueta dice que la pastilla es capaz de tratar la pérdida de la voz."

#. ~ Snippet of item "homeopathic pill"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"An Oscillococcinum homeopathic pill, prepared through the dilution of one "
"part duck offal with 10^400 parts water.  The label purports that these "
"pills are able to treat flu-like symptoms and maintain general wellness."
msgstr ""
"Una pastilla homeopática Oscillococcinum, preparada a través de la "
"disolución de una parte de achuras de pato en 10^400 partes de agua. La "
"etiqueta afirma que esta pastilla es capaz de tratar los síntomas similares "
"a la gripe y mantener el bienestar general."

#. ~ Description of "morphine"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"An addictive narcotic used to treat intense pain in hospital settings.  "
"You'll need a syringe to inject it, but it will take effect almost "
"immediately."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "nicotine patch"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"An adhesive patch that promises to fight cravings and help smokers quit by "
"slowly delivering nicotine into the body over the course of 16 hours as a "
"replacement for smoking."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "Panaceus"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"An apple-red gel capsule the size of your thumbnail, filled with a thick, "
"oily liquid that shifts from black to purple at unpredictable intervals, "
"flecked with tiny gray dots.  Given the place you got it from, it's either "
"very potent, or highly experimental.  Holding it, all the little aches and "
"pains seem to fade, just for a moment…"
msgstr ""
"Una cápsula roja de gel del tamaño de tu pulgar, rellena con un líquido "
"espeso y aceitoso que cambia entre el púrpura y el negro a intervalos "
"impredecibles, lleno de lunares grises pequeños. Pensando el lugar de donde "
"lo sacaste, puede ser muy potente, o muy experimental. Al sostenerlo, todos "
"los pequeños dolores parecen desaparecer, solo por un momento…"

#. ~ Description of "injectable prophylactic antivenom"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"An experimental, cutting-edge antivenom in the form of a small amber vial, "
"designed to be injected a few hours before venom exposure.  It was developed "
"in top secret by the military in response to increasing biological/chemical "
"warfare."
msgstr ""
"Un antiveneno experimental de vanguardia en forma de pequeños frascos de "
"ámbar, diseñado para ser inyectado unas horas antes de la exposición al "
"veneno. Fue desarrollado en secreto por los militares en respuesta al "
"aumento de la guerra biológica/química."

#. ~ Description of "heroin"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"An extremely strong opioid narcotic derived from morphine.  It is incredibly "
"addictive, the risk of overdose is extreme, and the drug is contraindicated "
"for nearly all medical purposes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "wintergreen oil"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"An ointment infused with wintergreen oil.  Has mild antiseptic properties, "
"and can ease the pain caused by wounds."
msgstr ""
"Es un bálsamo infundido con aceite de gaulteria. Tiene propiedades "
"antisépticas leves y puede aliviar el dolor causado por heridas."

#. ~ Description of "codeine"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"An opioid in tablet form, used in the suppression of pain, cough, and other "
"ailments.  While relatively weak for a narcotic, it is still addictive, with "
"a potential for overdose."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "diphenhydramine"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"An over-the-counter allergy medication.  These tablets are meant to be taken "
"once per day and can cause drowsiness."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "melatonin tablet"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"An over-the-counter melatonin supplement.  One tablet before bed is commonly "
"recommended to improve sleep quality, especially for those suffering from "
"sleep deprivation."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "chlorpromazine"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Anti-psychotic medication.  Used to stabilize brain chemistry, it can arrest "
"hallucinations and other symptoms of psychosis.  Carries a sedative effect."
msgstr ""
"Medicamentos antipsicóticos. Utilizado para estabilizar la química cerebral, "
"puede detener las alucinaciones y otros síntomas de la psicosis. Tiene un "
"efecto sedante."

#. ~ Description of "antibiotics"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Antibacterial medication designed to prevent or stop the spread of "
"infection.  It's the safest way to cure any infections you might have.  One "
"dose lasts twelve hours."
msgstr ""
"Un medicamento antibacterial vendido bajo receta, usado para prevenir o "
"detener una infección. Es la manera más segura de curar las infecciones que "
"puedas haber contraído. Una dosis dura doce horas."

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "myopia contact lenses (weekly)"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "myopia transition contact lenses (weekly)"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "myopia contact lenses (daily)"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "myopia transition contact lenses (daily)"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "hyperopia contact lenses (weekly)"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "hyperopia transition contact lenses (weekly)"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "hyperopia contact lenses (daily)"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "hyperopia transition contact lenses (daily)"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "bifocal contact lenses (weekly)"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "bifocal transition contact lenses (weekly)"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "bifocal contact lenses (daily)"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "bifocal transition contact lenses (daily)"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "plano transition contact lenses (weekly)"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "plano transition contact lenses (daily)"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Apply contact lenses"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "cattail jelly"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Clear jelly harvested from cattails.  Can be used to protect a wound from "
"contamination, and works as a painkiller."
msgstr ""
"Es gelatina extraída de juncos. Puede usarse para proteger una herida de la "
"contaminación y funciona como analgésico."

#. ~ Description of "cannabis shatter"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Concentrated cannabis extract, commonly known as dabs.  This particular "
"style of concentrate is in a thin sheet and shatters like glass at room "
"temperature.  Arguably one of the better styles of concentrate compared to "
"wax, crumble, or distillate.  Normal cannabis contains around 20% THC; this "
"shatter should be around 55% THC."
msgstr ""
"Extracto de cannabis concentrado, comúnmente conocido como dabs. Este tipo "
"de concentrado en particular es una fina lámina que se quiebra como el "
"vidrio a temperatura ambiente. En teoría es uno de los mejores estilos de "
"concentrado comparado con la cera, migajas o destilados.  El cannabis normal "
"contiene cerca del 20% de THC, este concentrado esta cerca del 55%."

#. ~ Description of "cannabis wax"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Concentrated cannabis extract, commonly known as dabs.  This particular "
"style of concentrate is yellow and waxy at room temperature.  Normal "
"cannabis contains around 20% THC; this wax should be around 45% THC."
msgstr ""
"Extracto de cannabis concentrado, comúnmente conocido como dabs. Este tipo "
"de concentrado en particular es amarillo y tiene la consistencia de la cera "
"a temperatura ambiente. El cannabis normal contiene cerca del 20% de THC, "
"esta cera esta cerca del 45%."

#. ~ Description of "cannabis distillate"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Concentrated cannabis extract.  This style of extract goes through the most "
"processing, eliminating most if not all harmful ingredients.  Normal "
"cannabis contains around 20% THC; this distillate should be around 88% THC.  "
"Can be smoked using a refillable electronic cigarette."
msgstr ""
"Extracto concentrado de cannabis.  Este tipo de extracto ya pasó por la "
"mayor parte del proceso, eliminando casi todos o la mayoría de los "
"ingredientes dañinos.  El cannabis normal contiene cerca del 20% de THC, "
"este destilado debe esta cerca del 88%.  Puede ser fumado utilizando un "
"cigarrillo electrónico."

#. ~ Description of "bismuth subsalicylate"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Creamy pink syrup that tastes of bubblegum and chalk.  It is used to treat "
"digestive issues such as nausea and heartburn."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "cocaine"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Crystalline extract of the coca leaf, or at least, a white powder with some "
"of that in it.  It is a highly addictive stimulant."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Dakin's solution"
msgid_plural "Dakin's solution"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "non-drowsy cough syrup"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Daytime cold and flu medication consisting primarily of dextromethorphan HBr "
"and acetaminophen.  It promises to suppress coughing, aching, headaches and "
"fever without causing excessive drowsiness."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "crack"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Deprotonated cocaine crystals, incredibly addictive and deleterious to brain "
"chemistry."
msgstr ""
"Cristales de cocaína desprotonados, increíblemente adictivos y deletéreos "
"para la química cerebral."

#. ~ Description of "hydrogen peroxide"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Dilute hydrogen peroxide, a liquid sold for household cleaning and first "
"aid, though it's not the most effective antiseptic.  It foams a little when "
"in contact with organic matter, but is otherwise harmless."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "gummy vitamin"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Essential dietary nutrients conveniently packaged in a fruit-flavored chewy "
"candy form.  An option of last resort when a balanced diet is not possible.  "
"Excess use can cause hypervitaminosis."
msgstr ""
"Nutrientes dietéticos esenciales convenientemente envasados en forma de "
"caramelo masticable con sabor a fruta. Una opción de último recurso cuando "
"no es posible seguir una dieta equilibrada. Su uso excesivo puede causar "
"hipervitaminosis."

#. ~ Description of "multivitamin"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Essential dietary nutrients conveniently packaged in pill form.  An option "
"of last resort when a balanced diet is not possible.  Excess use can cause "
"hypervitaminosis."
msgstr ""
"Nutrientes dietarios esenciales, convenientemente agrupados en forma de "
"píldora. Una opción de último recurso cuando no se puede llevar una dieta "
"balanceada. Su exceso puede ocasionar hipervitaminosis."

#. ~ Description of "ibuprofen"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Ibuprofen, a mild NSAID analgesic.  It relieves pain and swelling, but "
"raises blood pressure more than other NSAIDs."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "rolling tobacco"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Loose, fine-cut tobacco leaves.  Popular in Europe and among hipsters.  "
"Highly addictive and hazardous to health.\n"
"Can either be rolled into a cigarette with some rolling papers or smoked "
"through a pipe."
msgstr ""
"Hojas sueltas de tabaco de corte fino. Popular en Europa y entre los "
"hipsters. Muy adictivo y dañino para la salud.\n"
"Con papel de liar se puede hacer un cigarrillo, o se pueden fumar con una "
"pipa."

#. ~ Description of "makeshift antiseptic"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Makeshift antiseptic made from ethanol.  It can be used to disinfect wounds, "
"though it's not as effective as the real thing."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "joint"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Marijuana, cannabis, pot.  Whatever you want to call it, it's rolled up in a "
"piece of paper and ready for smokin'."
msgstr ""
"Marihuana, cannabis, hierba, como quieras llamarlo. Está enrollado en un "
"trozo de papel y listo para fumar."

#. ~ Description of "metaprolol"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Metaprolol, a classic beta blocker.  It lowers blood pressure and decouples "
"heart rate from stressful events such as anxiety or pain."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "chewing tobacco"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Mint-flavored chewing tobacco.  While absolutely terrible for your health, "
"it was once a favorite amongst baseball players, cowboys, and other macho "
"types."
msgstr ""
"Tabaco masticable con sabor a menta. Aunque es absolutamente terrible para "
"tu salud, fue muy utilizado por los jugadores de béisbol, vaqueros y otros "
"machos."

#. ~ Description of "naproxen"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Naproxen, a slow-acting over-the-counter pain medicaton.  It takes up to an "
"hour to kick in, but lasts longer than other NSAIDs."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "caffeine pill"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Once favored by truckers and students who couldn't get a prescription and "
"didn't want to break the law, of these pills is equivalent to a strong cup "
"of coffee."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Panaceus"
msgid_plural "Panaceii"
msgstr[0] "Panacea"
msgstr[1] "Panaceii"
msgstr[2] "Panaceii"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Prussian blue tablet"
msgid_plural "Prussian blue tablets"
msgstr[0] "comprimido de azul de Prusia"
msgstr[1] "comprimidos de azul de Prusia"
msgstr[2] "comprimidos de azul de Prusia"

#. ~ Description of "cigar"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Rolled, cured tobacco leaf, addictive and hazardous to health."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "bifocal contact lenses (daily)"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Small plastic case with two daily-use soft contact lenses, buffered in "
"saline solution.  They are a great replacement for wearing glasses and sit "
"comfortably on the surface of the eye.  The lenses are designed to help "
"anyone with <color_light_blue>both nearsightedness and farsightedness</"
"color>, and should be discarded after <color_light_blue>16 hours</color> of "
"use."
msgstr ""
"Pequeño estuche de plástico con dos lentes de contacto blandas de uso "
"diario, almacenadas en solución salina. Son una genial alternativa para usar "
"gafas y se ajustan cómodamente en la superficie del ojo. Las lentes están "
"diseñadas para ayudar a cualquier persona con <color_light_blue>tanto miopía "
"como hipermetropía</color>, y deben ser desechadas después "
"<color_light_blue>de 16 horas</color> de uso."

#. ~ Description of "myopia contact lenses (daily)"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Small plastic case with two daily-use soft contact lenses, buffered in "
"saline solution.  They are a great replacement for wearing glasses and sit "
"comfortably on the surface of the eye.  They sit comfortably on the surface "
"of the eye.  The lenses are designed to help anyone with "
"<color_light_blue>nearsightedness</color>, and should be discarded after "
"<color_light_blue>16 hours</color> of use."
msgstr ""
"Pequeño estuche de plástico con dos lentes de contacto blandas de uso "
"diario, almacenadas en solución salina. Son una genial alternativa para usar "
"gafas y se ajustan cómodamente en la superficie del ojo. Se ajustan "
"cómodamente en la superficie del ojo. Las lentes están diseñadas para ayudar "
"a cualquier persona con <color_light_blue>miopía</color>, y deben ser "
"desechadas después de<color_light_blue> 16 horas</color> de uso."

#. ~ Description of "hyperopia contact lenses (daily)"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Small plastic case with two extended-wear soft contact lenses, buffered in "
"saline solution.  They are a great replacement for wearing glasses and sit "
"comfortably on the surface of the eye.  The lenses are designed to help "
"anyone with <color_light_blue>farsightedness</color>, and should be "
"discarded after <color_light_blue>16 hours</color> of use."
msgstr ""
"Pequeño estuche de plástico con dos lentes de contacto blandas de uso "
"prolongado, almacenadas en solución salina. Son una genial alternativa para "
"usar gafas y se ajustan cómodamente en la superficie del ojo. Las lentes "
"están diseñadas para ayudar a cualquier persona con "
"<color_light_blue>hipermetropía </color>, y deben ser desechadas después "
"<color_light_blue>de 16 horas </color>de uso."

