#. ~ Description of "protein bar"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/protein.json
msgid ""
"A dense, chewy protein bar made from toasted grains with some fats and "
"sweeteners to bind it all into a portable little snack."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "protein powder"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/protein.json
msgid ""
"A powder consisting chiefly of dried protein.  Eating it in its current "
"state would be an unpleasant experience, to say the least."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "protein shake"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/protein.json
msgid ""
"A thick and tasty beverage made from pure refined protein and nutritious "
"fruit."
msgstr ""
"Es una bebida sabrosa y espesa hecha con proteína refinada y alguna fruta "
"nutritiva."

#. ~ Description of "fortified protein shake"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/protein.json
msgid ""
"A thick and tasty beverage made from pure refined protein and nutritious "
"fruit.  It has been supplemented with extra vitamins and minerals."
msgstr ""
"Una bebida sabrosa y espesa hecha con proteína refinada y alguna fruta "
"nutritiva. Ha sido complementada con más vitaminas y minerales."

#. ~ Description of "protein smoothie"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/protein.json
msgid ""
"A thick and tasty smoothie made from pure refined protein and nutritious "
"fruit mixed into milk."
msgstr ""
"Un batido espeso y sabroso hecho de proteína pura refinada y fruta nutritiva "
"mezclada con leche."

#. ~ Description of "protein drink"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/protein.json
msgid ""
"A thin slurry of refined protein mixed with water.  While quite nutritious, "
"it is not particularly tasty."
msgstr ""
"Un líquido espeso hecho de proteína refinada mezclada con agua. Aunque es "
"bastante nutritivo, no es sabroso."

#. ~ Description of "fortified milk"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/protein.json
msgid ""
"Milk enriched with protein powder, it's extra healthy and doesn't taste too "
"bad."
msgstr ""
"La leche enriquecida con proteína en polvo, es extra saludable y no tiene "
"mal sabor."

