msgstr "Una deliciosa pizza con queso derretido por encima."

#. ~ Description of "deluxe cooked oatmeal"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid ""
"A filling and nutritious New England classic that has been improved with the "
"addition of extra wholesome ingredients."
msgstr ""
"Un clásico de Nueva Inglaterra, saciante y nutritivo, que ha sido mejorado "
"con la adición de ingredientes saludables adicionales."

#. ~ Description of "cooked oatmeal"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid ""
"A filling and nutritious New England classic that has sustained pioneers and "
"captains of industry alike."
msgstr ""
"Un clásico de Nueva Inglaterra, llena bastante y es nutritivo siendo el "
"sustento tanto de los pioneros como de los reyes de los negocios."

#. ~ Description of "flour"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid ""
"A fine powder made of ground wheat.  It's great for baking, not so good raw."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "raw lasagne pasta"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid ""
"A pasta sheet used in making lasagne.  It could be eaten raw if you're "
"desperate, but is much better cooked."
msgstr ""
"Una hoja de pasta usada para hacer lasaña. Se puede comer cruda si estás "
"desesperado, pero está mucho mejor cocinada."

#. ~ Description of "brownie"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "A rich chocolate brownie, just like how grandma used to bake them."
msgstr "Un rico brownie de chocolate,  como la abuela solía hornearlos."

#. ~ Description of "maple pie"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "A sweet and delicious baked pie with pure maple syrup."
msgstr "Un dulce y delicioso pastel horneado con puro jarabe de arce."

#. ~ Description of "granola"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid ""
"A tasty and nutritious mixture of oats, honey, and other ingredients that "
"has been baked until crisp."
msgstr ""
"Una mezcla sabrosa y nutritiva de avena, miel y otros ingredientes que han "
"sido horneados hasta estar crujientes."

#. ~ Description of "raw spaghetti pasta"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid ""
"A type of pasta usually used when preparing spaghetti.  It could be eaten "
"raw if you're desperate, but is much better cooked."
msgstr ""
"Un tipo de pasta que se utiliza normalmente para preparar espaguetis. Se "
"puede comer cruda si estás desesperado, pero está mucho mejor cocinada."

#. ~ Description of "blodplättar"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid ""
"Blodplättar is not your average pancake.  It does not taste of blood at all "
"and it tastes like a crispier black pudding."
msgstr ""
"El Blodplättar no es el típico panqueque. No sabe a sangre en absoluto y "
"sabe como un pudín más crujiente."

#. ~ Description of "cheese grits"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "Boiled cornmeal with cheese to add a little more flavor."
msgstr "Harina de maíz hervida con queso para añadir un poco mas de sabor."

#. ~ Description of "grits"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "Boiled cornmeal, a simple type of porridge."
msgstr "Harina de maíz hervida, un tipo simple de gachas."

#. ~ Description of "fruit waffle"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid ""
"Crunchy and delicious waffles with real maple syrup, made sweeter and "
"healthier with the addition of wholesome fruit."
msgstr ""
"Gofres deliciosos y crujientes con verdadero jarabe de arce, hechos más "
"dulces y saludables con la adición de fruta."

#. ~ Description of "cracker"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "Dry and salty, these crackers will leave you quite thirsty."
msgstr "Secas y saladas, estas galletitas te van a dejar bastante sediento."

#. ~ Description of "instant oatmeal"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid ""
"Dry flakes of flattened grain.  Tasty and nutritious when cooked, they are "
"ideal for making porridge or granola."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "coarse oatmeal"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid ""
"Dry oats, ground coarsely in preparation for making porridge.  Unlike "
"instant oats, these are not pre-steamed, meaning they aren't ready for human "
"consumption and will take quite some time to cook."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "brioche"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "Filling bread buns, taste good with tea on a Sunday morning breakfast."
msgstr ""
"Bollos de pan saciantes, están buenos con té para el desayuno de un Domingo "
"por la mañana."

#. ~ Description of "fruit pancake"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid ""
"Fluffy and delicious pancakes with real maple syrup, made sweeter and "
"healthier with the addition of wholesome fruit."
msgstr ""
"Panqueques suaves y deliciosos con verdadero jarabe de arce, hecho más dulce "
"y saludable con la adición de fruta."

#. ~ Description of "pancake"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "Fluffy and delicious pancakes with real maple syrup."
msgstr "Panqueques suaves y deliciosos con verdadero jarabe de arce."

