#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "French toast"
msgid_plural "French toast"
msgstr[0] "Tostada francesa"
msgstr[1] "Tostada francesa"
msgstr[2] "Tostada francesa"

#. ~ Description of "boiled noodles"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "Fresh wet noodles.  Fairly bland, but fills you up."
msgstr "Fideos recién hervidos. Bastante insípidos pero te van a llenar."

#. ~ Description of "waffle"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid ""
"Hey it's waffle time, it's waffle time.  Won't you have some waffles of mine?"
msgstr ""
"Eh, es la hora de los gofres, la hora de los gofres. ¿No quieres algunos "
"gofres míos?"

#. ~ Description of "raw macaroni"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "It could be eaten raw if you're desperate, but is much better cooked."
msgstr ""
"Se puede comer crudo si estás desesperado, pero estan mucho mejor cocinados."

#. ~ Description of "sponge cake"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "Plain, fluffy cake."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "French toast"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "Slices of bread dipped in a milk and egg mixture then fried."
msgstr ""
"Rebanadas de pan mojadas en una mezcla de leche y huevo y luego fritas."

#. ~ Description of "fast noodles"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "So-called ramen noodles.  Can be eaten raw."
msgstr "Llamados fideos ramen. Se pueden comer crudos."

#. ~ Description of "oyster cracker"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid ""
"These bite-sized crackers go well with soups, but will make you thirsty on "
"their own."
msgstr ""
"Estas galletas del tamaño de un bocado van bien con las sopas, pero te darán "
"sed por sí solas."

#. ~ Description of "space cake"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid ""
"This cake's destiny is to take you on a gnarly trip.  There is cake, and you "
"will be baked."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "'special' brownie"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "This is definitely not how grandma used to bake them."
msgstr "Definitivamente, no es la misma receta que hacía la abuela."

#. ~ Description of "cloutie dumplings"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid ""
"This traditional Scottish treat is a sweet and filling little boiled cake "
"studded with dried fruit."
msgstr ""
"Esta golosina tradicional de Escocia es una pequeña tarta hervida dulce y "
"saciante, adornada con frutas secas."

#. ~ Description of "wheat snack bread"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "Wheat Snack Bread, a delicious snack made from wheat."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "mac & cheese"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "When the cheese starts flowing, Kraft gets your noodle going."
msgstr "Cuando el queso comienza a fluir, Kraft pone en marcha tus fideos."

#. ~ Description of "boiled grain"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid ""
"Whole wheat or barley kernels that have been boiled in water.  Very bland on "
"their own, but will do if you can't prepare them in a different way."
msgstr ""
"Granos de trigo o cebada enteros que han sido hervidos en agua. Muy "
"insípidos por sí solos, pero servirán si no puedes prepararlos de otra "
"manera."

