#. ~ Description of "vacuum-packed bag"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A bag of vacuum-packed food."
msgstr "Una bolsa para envasar comida al vacío."

#. ~ Description of "large paper bag"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A big bag made of sturdy paper, great for everything from collecting yard "
"waste to bulk storage of construction materials."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "cement bag"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A big bag made of woven plastic.  Simple instructions printed on the side "
"explain how to make mortar for all your masonry needs."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "plastic bag"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A big plastic bag."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "plastic tub"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A big, square plastic bucket usually used for carrying ice cream."
msgstr ""
"Un gran cubo cuadrado de plástico que se usa normalmente para llevar helado."

#. ~ Description of "large plastic bucket"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A bright orange plastic bucket about the size of your torso."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "large clay pot"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A bulky and heavy clay pot with a waterproofed hide lid, meant to store "
"water, but can carry other liquids in a pinch."
msgstr ""
"Una olla grande y pesada de arcilla con una tapa hermética, hecha para "
"almacenar agua pero puede llevar otros líquidos en caso de necesidad."

#. ~ Description of "plastic jerrycan"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A bulky plastic jerrycan, meant to carry fuel, but can carry other liquids "
"in a pinch."
msgstr ""
"Un bidón voluminoso de plástico, hecho para llevar gasolina, pero puede "
"contener otros líquidos en caso de necesidad."

#. ~ Description of "egg carton"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A cardboard container with 12 individual cavities for storing eggs."
msgstr ""
"Un contenedor de cartón con 12 huecos individuales para almacenar huevos."

#. ~ Description of "styrofoam cup"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A cheap, disposable cup with a plastic lid and straw."
msgstr "Un vasito descartable y barato con tapa plástica y pajita."

#. ~ Description of "clay bowl"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A clay bowl with a waterproofed hide lid.  Can be used as a container or as "
"a tool.  Holds 250 mL of liquid."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "clay jug"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A clay container with a lid, used to hold and pour liquids."
msgstr ""
"Un recipiente de arcilla con una tapa, usado para almacenar y servir "
"líquidos."

#. ~ Description of "wooden bowl"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A crude-looking wooden bowl which can hold some liquid."
msgstr ""
"Un cuenco de madera de aspecto tosco que puede contener algo de líquido."

#. ~ Description of "balloon"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A deflated balloon.  This could be used as a makeshift water container."
msgstr ""
"Un globo desinflado. Esto podría ser usado como un contenedor de agua "
"improvisado."

#. ~ Description of "IFAK pouch"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A fabric pouch designed to contain a personalized trauma kit.  These "
"supplies are used to address immediate life-threatening conditions."
msgstr ""
"Una bolsa de tejido diseñada para contener un kit de trauma personalizado.  "
"Estos suministros se utilizan para hacer frente a situaciones de vida o "
"muerte."

#. ~ Description of "individual patrol officer kit"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A first aid kit designed for patrolling police officers, contents selected "
"for dealing with hemorrhaging injuries such as gunshot wounds.  Comes in a "
"sealed pouch."
msgstr ""
"Un botiquín de primeros auxilios diseñado para los agentes de policía que "
"patrullan, cuyo contenido ha sido seleccionado para tratar las lesiones "
"hemorrágicas, como las heridas de bala. Viene en una bolsa sellada."

#. ~ Description of "heavy punching bag sack"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A five-foot-long cylindrical leather sack, a foot in diameter, with "
"attachment points at the top.  With some bags of sand, some chains, and a "
"bunch of blankets, you could hang it from the ceiling as a heavy punching "
"bag."
msgstr ""
"Una bolsa cilíndrica de cuero de más o menos un metro y medio de largo y "
"30cm de diámetro, con puntos de anclaje para colgarla en el techo. Con "
"algunas bolsas de arena, cadenas y varias mantas podrías colgarla del techo "
"y tener una bolsa grande de boxeo."

#. ~ Description of "clay canister"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A fragile clay vessel with a waterproofed hide lid.  It can be used to make "
"crude impact grenades or to store liquid."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "bucket"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A galvanized bucket for peanuts, chilled wine, iced beer, lobster, crab "
"legs, French fries, animal feed, farm use, tailgating, crafts, planting "
"flowers, holding gift baskets, containing a fruit basket and herbs, loose "
"item storage, or as an ice bucket."
msgstr ""
"Un cubo galvanizado para cacahuetes, vino frío, cerveza helada, langosta, "
"patas de cangrejo, patatas fritas, alimento para animales, uso en granjas, "
"cargar cosas, artesanías, plantar flores, celebración de cestas de regalo, "
"contener una cesta de frutas y hierbas, almacenamiento de artículos sueltos "
"o como un cubo de hielo."

#. ~ Description of "condom"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A gentleman's balloon.  A single-use life preventer.  A thumbless latex "
"mitten.  This could be used as a makeshift water container, but otherwise "
"it's anyone's guess what it's for."
msgstr ""
"Un globo de caballero. Un chaleco salvavidas de un solo uso. Un guante de "
"látex sin pulgar. Podría usarse como un contenedor de agua improvisado, pero "
"por lo demás, cualquiera puede adivinar para qué sirve."

#. ~ Description of "paper carton"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A half-gallon carton constructed of a paper, aluminum, and plastic "
"laminate.  It has a threaded cap to keep liquid from leaking out."
msgstr ""
"Una caja de 1.9 litros construida con un laminado de papel, aluminio y "
"plástico. Tiene una tapa roscada para evitar que el líquido se escape."

#. ~ Description of "milk carton"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A half-gallon carton constructed of thick, waterproof paper.  It has a "
"threaded cap to keep the contents from leaking out."
msgstr ""
"Un cartón de 1.8 litros construido con papel impermeable y grueso. Tiene una "
"tapa a rosca para evitar que el contenido se derrame."

#. ~ Description of "0.5 L glass jar"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A half-liter glass jar with a metal screw top lid, used for canning.  "
"Preserves its contents from rot until opened (assuming it was sterile before "
"sealing)."
msgstr ""
"Un tarro de vidrio de medio litro con una tapa metálica de rosca, usado para "
"enlatar. Preserva el contenido de la putrefacción hasta su apertura. "
"(asumiendo que fuera estéril antes de sellarlo)."

#. ~ Description of "bottle gourd"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A hard, watertight container made from a dried bottle gourd.  Can be used "
"similar to a canteen or just for storing liquids."
msgstr ""
"Un duro contenedor hermético hecho con una calabaza botella seca. Se puede "
"usar como una cantimplora o simplemente para guardar líquidos."

#. ~ Description of "garbage bag"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A hefty plastic bag made to carry lots of trash."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "wooden box"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A hefty wooden box.  Great for storing items."
msgstr "Una resistente caja de madera. Ideal para guardar objetos."

#. ~ Description of "30 gallon plastic barrel"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A huge plastic barrel with a watertight lid."
msgstr "Un enorme barril de plástico con una tapa hermética."

#. ~ Description of "steel drum (100 L)"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A huge steel barrel with a watertight lid."
msgstr "Un enorme barril de acero con una tapa hermética."

#. ~ Description of "large dry bag"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A huge watertight bag made of strong plastic.  Commonly used in activities "
"with high risk of wetting the equipment, such as kayaking."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "body bag"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A human-sized rectangular bag made of strong plastic, with a zipper in the "
"middle.  Intended to hold a dead body."
msgstr ""
"Una bolsa rectangular grande de tamaño humano, hecha de plástico resistente, "
"con una cremallera en el medio. Usada para guardar un cadáver."

#. ~ Description of "aluminum tank (100 L)"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A large aluminum tank, traditionally used to store fuel."
msgstr ""
"Un tanque de aluminio, tradicionalmente usado para contener combustible"

#. ~ Description of "woven plastic sack"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A large and sturdy bag made out of plastic canvas.  These are frequently "
"used as sandbags, or for storing gravel."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "canvas sack"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A large and sturdy canvas sack."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "metal tank (60 L)"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A large metal tank for holding liquids.  Useful for crafting."
msgstr ""
"Un tanque de metal grande que puede contener líquidos. Útil para la "
"fabricación."

#. ~ Description of "2.5 L canteen"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A large plastic water canteen, with a 2.5 liter capacity and carrying strap."
msgstr ""
"Una cantimplora grande de plástico, con una capacidad de 2.5 litros y una "
"correa para el transporte."

#. ~ Description of "large biogas tank"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A large tank of biogas, commonly used for heating."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "large propane tank"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A large tank of propane, commonly used for heating."
msgstr ""
"Un depósito de propano grande, comúnmente utilizado para la calefacción."

#. ~ Description of "large tin can"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A large tin can, like what beans come in.  Holds a substantial amount of "
"food."
msgstr ""
"Una lata de hojalata grande, como las judías que vienen en ella. Contiene "
"una cantidad sustancial de comida."

#. ~ Description of "gallon can"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A large tin with a handle and a cap, meant for holding camp fuel or some "
"other oil.  Looks like it could store just over a gallon."
msgstr ""
"Una lata grande con un mango y un tapón, pensada para contener combustible "
"de camping o cualquier otro aceite. Parece poder contener hasta 3.7 litros."

#. ~ Description of "large waterskin"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A large watertight leather bag with a carrying strap, can hold 5 liters of "
"water."
msgstr ""
"Una bolsa hermética grande de cuero con una correa para llevarla, puede "
"contener hasta 5 litros de agua."

#. ~ Description of "large wooden box"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A large wooden crate.  Sturdy, but still light enough to be moved."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "wooden tankard"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A low-tech solution for all your guzzling needs.  Drink responsibly."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "skull bowl"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A macabre-looking bowl made from the upper part of a skull."
msgstr "Un cuenco de aspecto macabro hecho con la parte superior de un cráneo."

#. ~ Description of "aluminum tank (200 L)"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A massive aluminum tank, traditionally used to store fuel."
msgstr ""
"Un tanque de aluminio masivo, tradicionalmente usado para contener "
"combustible"

#. ~ Description of "steel drum (200 L)"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A massive steel barrel with a watertight lid."
msgstr "Un barril de acero muy grande con tapa hermética."

#. ~ Description of "extra large biogas tank"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A massive tank of biogas, commonly used for heating a home or vehicle."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "extra large propane tank"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A massive tank of propane, commonly used for heating a home or vehicle."
msgstr ""
"Un tanque muy grande de propano, comúnmente utilizado para calentar una casa "
"o un vehículo."

#. ~ Description of "medium tin can"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A medium tin can, like what soup comes in."
msgstr "Una lata de hojalata mediana, como en la que vienen las sopas."

#. ~ Description of "medium biogas tank"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A medium-sized tank of biogas, commonly used for barbeques."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "medium propane tank"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A medium-sized tank of propane, commonly used for barbeques."
msgstr "Un depósito de propano medio, comúnmente utilizado para barbacoas."

#. ~ Description of "metal paint can"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A metal paint can, able to hold a gallon of liquid."
msgstr "Un bote de pintura metálico capaz de almacenar 3.7 litros de liquido."

#. ~ Description of "plastic canteen"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A military-style water canteen with a 1.5 liter capacity.  Commonly worn at "
"the hip."
msgstr ""
"Una cantimplora de tipo militar con una capacidad de 1.5 litros. Comúnmente "
"se lleva colgada en la cadera."

#. ~ Description of "foil wrapper"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A piece of aluminum foil, large enough to wrap around something.  You could "
"also cook food in it."
msgstr ""
"Un trozo de papel de aluminio, lo suficientemente grande como para envolver "
"algo. También puedes cocinar comida en él."

#. ~ Description of "first aid kit box"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A plastic box designed to contain a first aid kit."
msgstr ""
"Una caja de plástico diseñada para contener un kit de primeros auxilios."

#. ~ Description of "lunchbox"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A plastic box, commonly used to store lunch and utensils to eat it with."
msgstr ""
"Una caja de plástico, comúnmente usada para guardar comida y utensilios para "
"comer."

#. ~ Description of "plastic paint can"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A plastic paint can, able to hold a gallon of liquid."
msgstr ""
"Un bote de plástico de pintura, capaz de almacenar 3.7 litros de liquido."

#. ~ Description of "microcentrifuge tube"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A plastic tube with a little built in snap-cap, a great way to store a tiny "
"amount of liquid.  Great for Jell-O shots if 1 mL is enough of a shot for "
"you.  Cool people call these \"eppies\"."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "zipper bag"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A resealable, watertight transparent plastic bag roomy enough to hold a "
"sandwich.  Known generically as a Ziploc bag, it can be sealed and opened "
"with a press-together mechanism similar to a zipper."
msgstr ""
"Una bolsa de plástico impermeable que se puede sellar de nuevo con "
"suficiente espacio para guardar un bocadillo. Conocidas genéricamente como "
"bolsa Ziplog, se puede sellar y abrir con un mecanismo de presión similar a "
"un zipper."

#. ~ Description of "gallon-sized zipper bag"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A resealable, watertight transparent plastic bag, extra-large size.  Known "
"generically as a Ziploc bag, it can be sealed and opened with a press-"
"together mechanism similarly to a zipper."
msgstr ""
"Una bolsa de plástico impermeable, tamaño extra grande, que se puede sellar "
"de nuevo con suficiente espacio para guardar un bocadillo. Conocidas "
"genéricamente como bolsa Ziplog, se puede sellar y abrir con un mecanismo de "
"presión similar a un zipper."

#. ~ Description of "steel keg"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A reusable heavy steel keg, used for shipping beer.  It has a capacity of 50 "
"liters."
msgstr ""
"Un barril reutilizable de acero pesado, utilizado para el envío de cerveza.  "
"Tiene una capacidad de 50 litros."

#. ~ Description of "aluminum keg"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A reusable lightweight aluminum keg, used for shipping beer.  It has a "
"capacity of 50 liters."
msgstr ""
"Un barril de aluminio ligero reutilizable, utilizado para el envío de "
"cerveza.  Tiene una capacidad de 50 litros."

#. ~ Description of "sealed condom"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A sealed condom wrapper, activate to open it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "clay cup"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A simple clay cup used for holding liquid."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "coconut bowl"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A single half of a coconut with the meat removed.  Usable as a bowl to hold "
"some liquid."
msgstr ""
"Una mitad de coco con la pulpa removida. Utilizable como un recipiente para "
"contener líquido."

#. ~ Description of "hydration pack"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A slim and lightweight insulated plastic bladder worn on the back or within "
"a hydration pouch in a backpack.  It has a large pocket and a capped mouth "
"for filling with liquid, with a hose that allows the wearer to drink hands-"
"free."
msgstr ""
"Una bolsa de plástico aislante, delgada y ligera, que se lleva en la espalda "
"o dentro de una bolsa de hidratación en una mochila. Tiene un gran bolsillo "
"y una boca con tapa para llenarla de líquido con una manguera que permite al "
"usuario beber sin tener que usar las manos."

#. ~ Description of "canvas bag"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A small bag made of canvas.  Looks fine to store dried herbs in."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña bolsa hecha de lona. Parece que está preparado para almacenar "
"hierbas secas."

#. ~ Description of "radio car box"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A small box with an image of a toy car printed on the front.  The text "
"written on the side says it comes with a remote control and batteries "
"included."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña caja con la imagen de un coche de juguete impreso en el frontal. "
"El texto escrito en el lateral indica que el control remoto y las baterías "
"están incluidas."

#. ~ Description of "robot kit box"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A small box with an image of children building robots."
msgstr "Una pequeña caja con la imagen de un niño construyendo robots."

#. ~ Description of "STEM kit box"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A small box with an image of children building things."
msgstr "Una pequeña caja con la imagen de un niño construyendo cosas."

#. ~ Description of "maker kit box"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A small box with an image of children building things.  It's labelled "
"'Makerspace Learner Kit'."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña caja con la imagen de un niño construyendo cosas. Tiene una "
"etiqueta que dice 'Equipo de aprendizaje Makerspace'."

#. ~ Description of "cardboard snack box"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A small cardboard box for housing snacks.  Sized so you can take it on the "
"go."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña caja de cartón para alojar aperitivos. De un tamaño que permite "
"llevarla a todas partes."

#. ~ Description of "small cardboard box"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A small cardboard box.  No bigger than a foot in dimension.  Can be folded."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña caja de cartón.  No más grande que un pie de dimensión.  Se "
"puede plegar."

#. ~ Description of "cardboard roll"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A small cardboard roll used to conveniently store materials such as tape or "
"toilet paper."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño rollo de cartón usado convenientemente para almacenar materiales "
"como cinta o papel higiénico."

#. ~ Description of "pencil case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A small fabric container with a zipper.  Commonly used by children to store "
"school supplies."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño contenedor de tela con cremallera. Usado comúnmente por niños "
"para guardar material escolar."

#. ~ Description of "small folded cardboard box"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A small folded cardboard box.  No bigger than a foot in dimension.  Can be "
"assembled."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña caja de cartón plegada.  No más grande que un pie de dimensión.  "
"Se puede armar."

#. ~ Description of "small glass seasoning bottle"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A small glass bottle, the kind seasoning comes in."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "plastic supplement bottle"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A small green pill bottle with a screw top."
msgstr "Un pequeño bote de pastillas verde con tapa de rosca."

#. ~ Description of "cigar case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A small handmade wood and leather case meant to hold one or two cigars."
msgstr ""
"Un estuche de madera y cuero pequeño hecho a mano, diseñado para contener "
"uno o dos puros."

#. ~ Description of "small metal box"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A small metal box.  It could hold even the densest of items."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña caja de metal. Podía contener incluso los objetos más densos."

#. ~ Description of "large metal box"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A small metal crate.  The slim profile makes storage a little bit easier."
msgstr ""
"Una caja grande de metal. El perfil delgado hace que el almacenamiento sea "
"un poco más fácil."

#. ~ Description of "metal tank (2 L)"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A small metal tank for gasoline or other liquids.  Useful for crafting."
msgstr ""
"Un tanque de metal pequeño para líquidos o gases. Útil para la fabricación."

#. ~ Description of "plastic prescription bottle"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A small orange pill bottle with a white screw top."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño bote de pastillas de color naranja con un tapón de rosca blanco."

#. ~ Description of "small plastic seasoning bottle"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A small plastic bottle, the kind seasoning comes in."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "flyer stand"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A small stand made to show off various flyers."
msgstr "Un pequeño soporte hecho para mostrar varios panfletos."

#. ~ Description of "pressurized canister"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A small tank for containing pressurized gases."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "small biogas tank"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A small tank of biogas, commonly used for camping stoves and torches."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "small propane tank"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A small tank of propane, commonly used for camping stoves and torches."
msgstr ""
"Un depósito de propano pequeño, comúnmente utilizado para estufas y "
"antorchas de camping."

#. ~ Description of "small tin can"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A small tin can, like what tuna comes in."
msgstr "Una lata de hojalata pequeña, como en la que viene el atún."

#. ~ Description of "small waterskin"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A small watertight leather bag with a carrying strap, can hold 1.5 liters of "
"water."
msgstr ""
"Una bolsa hermética pequeña de cuero con una correa para llevarla. Puede "
"contener hasta de 1.5 litros de agua."

#. ~ Description of "plastic painkiller bottle"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A small white pill bottle with a screw top."
msgstr "Un pequeño bote de pastillas blancas con tapa de rosca."

#. ~ Description of "tiny wooden box"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A small wooden box with a cap and two small handles."
msgstr "Una pequeña caja de madera con tapa y dos pequeñas asas."

#. ~ Description of "small wooden box"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A small wooden box.  Beautifully made, perhaps it could hold something "
"precious."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña caja de madera. Muy estilizada, tal vez podría contener algo "
"precioso."

#. ~ Description of "small plastic bag"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A small, open plastic bag.  Essentially trash."
msgstr "Una pequeña bolsa de plástico abierta. Esencialmente basura."

#. ~ Description of "IV bag"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A small, sealed plastic bag for liquids used in intravenous therapy."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña bolsa de plástico sellada para los líquidos utilizados en la "
"terapia intravenosa."

#. ~ Description of "small MRE bag"
#. ~ Description of "MRE dessert bag"
#. ~ Description of "MRE spread bag"
#. ~ Description of "MRE jam bag"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A small, sturdy, plastic and aluminum container of multi-layered "
"construction, with detailed nutritional information about its contents."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño y robusto recipiente de plástico y aluminio de construcción "
"multicapa, con información nutricional detallada sobre su contenido."

#. ~ Description of "plastic cup"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A small, vacuum-formed cup."
msgstr "Una pequeña copa formada al vacío."

#. ~ Description of "nylon bag"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A square nylon bag designed to carry a folded portable stove."
msgstr ""
"Una bolsa cuadrada de nailon diseñada para llevar un hornillo portátil."

#. ~ Description of "shot glass"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A standard 1.5 ounce shot glass."
msgstr "Un vaso shot estándar de 1,5 onzas."

#. ~ Description of "gallon jug"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A standard plastic jug used for milk and household cleaning chemicals.  Some "
"may be factory-sealed to increase shelf life."
msgstr ""
"Una jarra de plástico normal que se usa para la leche y productos de "
"limpieza del hogar. Algunas pueden estar selladas de fábrica para aumentar "
"su vida útil."

#. ~ Description of "steel jerrycan"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A steel jerrycan, meant to carry fuel, but can carry other liquids in a "
"pinch."
msgstr ""
"Un bidón de hierro, hecho para llevar gasolina, pero puede contener otros "
"líquidosen caso de necesidad."

#. ~ Description of "metal box"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A strong metal box.  Great for packing your heaviest items."
msgstr ""
"Una caja metálica resistente. Ideal para empacar sus artículos más pesados."

#. ~ Description of "cardboard box"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A sturdy cardboard box, about the size of a banana box.  Great for packing.  "
"Can be folded."
msgstr ""
"Una caja de cartón resistente, del tamaño de una caja de plátanos.  Genial "
"para guardar cosas.  Se puede plegar."

#. ~ Description of "folded cardboard box"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A sturdy folded cardboard box.  Great for packing.  Can be assembled."
msgstr ""
"Una robusta caja de cartón plegada.  Ideal para guardar cosas.  Se puede "
"armar."

#. ~ Description of "small paper bag"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A sturdy paper bag, just about the right size for packing a lunch in."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "MRE bag"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A sturdy plastic and aluminum container of multi-layered construction, with "
"detailed nutritional information about its contents."
msgstr ""
"Un robusto recipiente de plástico y aluminio de construcción multicapa, con "
"información nutricional detallada sobre su contenido."

#. ~ Description of "graduated cylinder"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A tall, narrow glass cylinder with precise markings for measuring fluid "
"quantities.  An important science tool, it is also useful for anal-retentive "
"chefs."
msgstr ""
"Un cilindro de vidrio alto y estrecho con marcas precisas para medir las "
"cantidades de fluidos. Una importante herramienta científica, también es "
"útil para los cocineros con retención anal."

#. ~ Description of "3 L glass jar"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A three-liter glass jar with a metal screw top lid, used for canning.  "
"Preserves its contents from rot until opened."
msgstr ""
"Un tarro de vidrio de tres litros con una tapa de metal con rosca, usado "
"para enlatar. Preserva el contenido de la putrefacción hasta su apertura."

#. ~ Description of "glass vial"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A tiny glass ampoule commonly used to store medication in liquid form."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "large plastic bottle"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A two-liter plastic bottle that can hold a lot of soda, or, nowadays, boiled "
"water."
msgstr ""
"Una botella de plástico de dos litros que puede contener un montón de "
"refrescos, o, en estos días, agua hervida."

#. ~ Description of "reinforced large cardboard box"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A very large cardboard box, doubled up with a second layer of cardboard and "
"lots of duct tape.  It can't be folded anymore."
msgstr ""
"iUna caja de cartón muy grande, con doble capa de cartón y mucha cinta "
"americana. Ahora ya no se puede plegar."

#. ~ Description of "large cardboard box"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A very large cardboard box, the sort children would have loved to hide in, "
"when there were still children.  Can be folded."
msgstr ""
"Una caja de cartón muy grande, de las que a los niños les hubiera gustado "
"esconderse, cuando aún eran niños.  Se puede plegar."

#. ~ Description of "large folded cardboard box"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A very large folded cardboard box, the sort children would have loved to "
"hide in, when there were still children.  Can be assembled."
msgstr ""
"Una caja de cartón plegada muy grande, del tipo en el que a los niños les "
"hubiera encantado esconderse, cuando aún eran niños.  Se puede armar."

#. ~ Description of "small cardboard box of tea bags"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A very small cardboard box with a tea brand's logo on it."
msgstr "Una caja de cartón muy pequeña con una marca de té escrita en ella."

#. ~ Description of "wooden canteen"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A water canteen made from wood, secured by metal bands and sealed with wax "
"or pitch.  Holds 1.5 liters and has a simple carry strap."
msgstr ""
"Una cantimplora hecha de madera para almacenar agua, reforzada con bandas de "
"metal y sellada con cera o brea. Puede contener hasta 1.5 litros y tiene una "
"correa para llevarla."

#. ~ Description of "waterproof camera case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A waterproof case designed for a standard camera.  Will protect your camera "
"from water damage entirely."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "waterproof smartphone case"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A waterproof case designed for a standard smartphone.  Will protect your "
"smartphone from water damage entirely."
msgstr ""
"Una funda impermeable diseñada para un smartphone estándar. Lo protegerá de "
"los daños causados por el agua."

#. ~ Description of "glass bottle"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A watertight glass bottle, holds 750 mL of liquid."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "waterskin"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A watertight leather bag with a carrying strap, can hold 3 liters of water."
msgstr ""
"Una bolsa hermética de cuero con una correa para llevarla, puede contener "
"hasta 3 litros de agua."

#. ~ Description of "small plastic bottle"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A watertight plastic bottle, holds 250 mL of liquid."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "tiny plastic bottle"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A watertight plastic bottle, holds 30 mL of liquid."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "plastic bottle"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A watertight plastic bottle, holds 500 mL of liquid.  Some may be factory-"
"sealed to increase shelf life."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "wooden bucket"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"A wooden bucket.  Carefully chiseled out of a hardwood log section, almost "
"like a dugout canoe.  Holds 5 liters of water and has a wooden carrying "
"handle."
msgstr ""
"Un cubo de madera cincelado cuidadosamente a partir de una sección de leño "
"de madera dura, casi como una piragua. Puede contener 5 litros de agua y "
"tiene un asa de madera para transportarlo."

#. ~ Description of "survival kit box"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "An aluminum box designed to contain a small survival kit."
msgstr ""
"Una caja de aluminio diseñada para contener un kit de supervivencia pequeño."

#. ~ Description of "aluminum can"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "An aluminum can, like what soda comes in."
msgstr "Una lata de aluminio, como la de los refrescos."

#. ~ Description of "foil cup"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"An improvised foldable cup made from aluminum foil.  It can contain liquid "
"and is usable for boiling water."
msgstr ""
"Una taza improvisada y plegable hecha con papel de aluminio. Puede contener "
"líquido y sirve para hervir agua."

#. ~ Description of "condiment bottle"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"An inverted plastic bottle for condiments.  Preserves its contents from rot "
"until opened."
msgstr ""
"Una botella de plástico invertida para condimentos. Preserva el contenido de "
"la putrefacción hasta su apertura."

#. ~ Description of "oversize folded cardboard box"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"An oversize cardboard box, big enough to fit some longer items.  Great for "
"storage.  Can be assembled."
msgstr ""
"Una caja de cartón de gran tamaño, lo suficientemente grande como para que "
"quepan algunos artículos más largos. Ideal para el almacenamiento. Puede "
"armarse."

#. ~ Description of "oversize cardboard box"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"An oversize cardboard box, big enough to fit some longer items.  Great for "
"storage.  Can be folded."
msgstr ""
"Una caja de cartón de gran tamaño, lo suficientemente grande como para que "
"quepan algunos artículos más largos. Ideal para el almacenamiento. Puede ser "
"plegada."

#. ~ Description of "reinforced oversize cardboard box"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"An oversize cardboard box, doubled up with a second layer of cardboard and "
"lots of duct tape.  It can't be folded anymore."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "oversize metal box"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"An oversize metal box, big enough to fit some longer items.  The slim "
"profile makes storage a little bit easier."
msgstr ""
"Una caja metálica de gran tamaño, lo suficientemente grande como para que "
"quepan algunos artículos más grandes. El perfil delgado hace que el "
"almacenamiento sea un poco más fácil."

#. ~ Description of "oversize wooden box"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid ""
"An oversize wooden box, big enough to fit some longer items.  Great for "
"storage."
msgstr ""
"Una caja de madera de gran tamaño, lo suficientemente grande como para que "
"quepan algunos artículos más largos. Ideal para almacenar cosas"

