msgstr "Un zafiro brillante."

#. ~ Description of "tourmaline"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A sparkling tourmaline."
msgstr "Una turmalina brillante."

#. ~ Description of "dead flare"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A spent magnesium flare.  It is essentially trash."
msgstr "Una bengala de magnesio usada. Es esencialmente basura."

#. ~ Description of "pinecone"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A spiny pod from a pine tree."
msgstr "Una vaina espinosa de un pino."

#. ~ Description of "accounting records"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A stack of various forms and papers with credits and debits listed all over "
"them, detailing transactions and purchases.  Reading over them, all of the "
"balances are mismatched, and a significant amount of money is missing."
msgstr ""
"Una pila de diferentes formularios y papeles con créditos y débitos listados "
"por todas partes, detallando transacciones y compras. Al leerlos, todos los "
"saldos no coinciden y falta una cantidad significativa de dinero."

#. ~ Description of "accounting records"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A stack of various forms and papers with credits and debits listed all over "
"them, detailing transactions and purchases.  Reading over them, everything "
"is in good order, whoever did these is skilled at their job."
msgstr ""
"Una pila de diferentes formularios y papeles con créditos y débitos listados "
"por todas partes, detallando transacciones y compras. Leyendo sobre ellos, "
"todo está en orden, quien los hizo es hábil en su trabajo."

#. ~ Description of "nanofabricator template (UHMWPE)"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A state-of-the-art optical storage system, containing the instruction set "
"required for the fabrication of advanced armor materials.  This seems to "
"just be routines for working with the materials, not actual armor schematics."
msgstr ""
"Un sistema de almacenamiento óptico de última generación, que contiene el "
"conjunto de instrucciones necesarias para la fabricación de materiales de "
"blindaje avanzados. Parece que solo se trata de rutinas para trabajar con "
"los materiales, no de esquemas de blindaje reales."

#. ~ Description of "nanofabricator template (silicon photonics)"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A state-of-the-art optical storage system, containing the instruction set "
"required for the fabrication of complex silicon photonic circuitry.  The "
"data within was once clearly worth millions, but now, you are not sure if "
"it's anything more than a fancy, high-tech paperweight."
msgstr ""
"Un sistema de almacenamiento óptico de última generación, que contiene el "
"conjunto de instrucciones necesarias para la fabricación de complejos "
"circuitos fotónicos de silicio. Los datos que contiene valian claramente "
"millones, pero ahora no estás seguro de que sea algo más que un elegante "
"pisapapeles de alta tecnología."

#. ~ Description of "nanofabricator template"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A state-of-the-art optical storage system, containing the instruction set to "
"replicate itself."
msgstr ""
"Un sistema de almacenamiento óptico de última generación, que contiene un "
"conjunto de instrucciones para autoreplicarse."

#. ~ Description of "nanofabricator template"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A state-of-the-art optical storage system.  This small slate of transparent "
"glass holds, inscribed as a miniature pattern, the instructions required to "
"create an item through a nanofabricator."
msgstr ""
"Un sistema de almacenamiento óptico de última generación. Esta pequeña "
"pizarra de cristal transparente contiene, inscrito como un patrón en "
"miniatura, las instrucciones necesarias para crear un objeto a través de un "
"nanofabricador."

#. ~ Description of "steel plate"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A steel armor plate, specifically engineered for use in a bullet-resistant "
"vest."
msgstr ""
"Una placa de armadura de acero, diseñada específicamente para ser usada en "
"chalecos antibalas."

#. ~ Description of "RAM"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A stick of memory.  Useful in advanced electronics crafting."
msgstr "Un módulo de memoria. Útil para fabricar electrónica avanzada."

#. ~ Description of "alder bark"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A strip of bark pulled from an alder tree.  Used in the production of "
"topical hemostatics."
msgstr ""
"Una tira de corteza extraída de un árbol de aliso. Se utiliza en la "
"producción de hemostáticos tópicos."

#. ~ Description of "stylish wallet"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A stylish flat case used to carry items such as currency, identification "
"documents, laminated cards, and other small items."
msgstr ""
"Un elegante estuche plano utilizado para llevar artículos como moneda, "
"documentos de identificación, tarjetas laminadas y otros artículos pequeños."

#. ~ Description of "radio repeater mod"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A system designed to convert a radio station into an autonomous repeater."
msgstr ""
"Un sistema diseñado para convertir una estación de radio en un repetidor "
"autónomo."

#. ~ Description of "adobe mortar"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A thick, pasty mud, low in sand content to reduce crumbling once dry.  Used "
"to glue larger, heavier pieces of mud and clay together."
msgstr ""
"Un barro espeso y pastoso, con bajo contenido de arena para reducir el "
"desmoronamiento una vez seco. Se utiliza para pegar piezas más grandes y "
"pesadas de barro y arcilla."

#. ~ Description of "rubber cement"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A tin of adhesive typically used to glue rubber together.  It forms a less "
"rigid bond than typical superglue, making it ideal for projects requiring "
"flexibility.  Typically smelly and toxic."
msgstr ""
"Una lata de adhesivo que se utiliza normalmente para pegar caucho. Forma una "
"unión menos rígida que el típico superglue, por lo que es ideal para "
"proyectos que requieren flexibilidad. Suele ser maloliente y tóxico."

#. ~ Description of "fertilizer"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A token representing fertilization of a plant."
msgstr "Ficha que representa la fecundación de una planta."

#. ~ Description of "pipe cleaner"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A tool designed to clean the interior surface of pipes, bottles, and similar "
"objects.  This one is thin enough to be used for cleaning firearm barrels "
"from dirt and fouling."
msgstr ""
"Una herramienta diseñada para limpiar la superficie interior de tuberías, "
"botellas y objetos similares. Esta es lo suficientemente delgada como para "
"ser usada para limpiar cañones de armas de fuego de tierra y suciedad."

#. ~ Description of "burnt out torch"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A torch that has consumed all its fuel; it can be recrafted into another "
"torch."
msgstr ""
"Una antorcha que ya ha consumido todo su combustible. Puede ser reutilizada "
"para hacer una antorcha nueva."

#. ~ Description of "cigar butt"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A true gentleman always finishes his cigars."
msgstr "Un verdadero caballero siempre se termina sus puros."

#. ~ Description of "shrapnel"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A twisted shard of jagged metal."
msgstr "Un fragmento retorcido de metal dentado."

#. ~ Description of "duct tape wallet"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A wallet made entirely out of duct tape."
msgstr "Una cartera hecha completamente con cinta americana."

#. ~ Description of "leather wallet"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A wallet made of leather."
msgstr "Una cartera hecha de cuero."

#. ~ Description of "INCIDENT REPORT: IMMERSION-27A"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A white piece of paper on official-looking stationary.  It seems to be an "
"internal report of some kind."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "cash card"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A yellow plastic card used to electronically store money.  It holds up to 2 "
"million dollars."
msgstr ""
"Una tarjeta de plástico amarilla que se utiliza para almacenar dinero "
"electrónicamente. Puede contener hasta 2 millones de dólares."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "ANOMALOUS ARTIFACT REPORT"
msgid_plural "ANOMALOUS ARTIFACT REPORT"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "circular sawblade"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"An 8\" circular sawblade.  You could make a saw with it, or throw it.  "
"Wielding it without sturdy gloves is a bad idea."
msgstr ""
"Una hoja de sierra circular de 8 pulgadas. Puedes hacer una sierra con ella, "
"o lanzarla. Empuñarla sin guantes resistentes es una mala idea."

#. ~ Description of "t-substrate sample"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"An acrylic cube cast around a small black crystal.  It's tepid to the touch."
msgstr ""
"Un cubo de acrílico fundido alrededor de un pequeño cristal negro.Está tibio "
"al tacto."

#. ~ Description of "amplifier head"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"An amplifier head.  Typically paired with a speaker cabinet for amplifying "
"musical instruments.  Basically only good for spare parts now."
msgstr ""
"Un cabezal amplificador. Típicamente emparejado con un gabinete de altavoces "
"para amplificar instrumentos musicales. Básicamente sólo sirve para piezas "
"de repuesto ahora."

#. ~ Description of "household dishwasher"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"An appliance used to clean dishes, not of much use without power and water.  "
"Can be placed as an appliance."
msgstr ""
"Un electrodoméstico utilizado para limpiar la vajilla, no tiene mucha "
"utilidad sin energía y agua. Se puede colocar como un electrodoméstico."

#. ~ Description of "household washing machine"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"An appliance used to wash laundry, not of much use without power and water.  "
"Can be placed as an appliance."
msgstr ""
"Un electrodoméstico utilizado para lavar la ropa, no tiene mucha utilidad "
"sin energía y agua. Puede colocarse como un electrodoméstico."

#. ~ Description of "hard steel plate"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"An armor plate made of very thick steel, specifically engineered for use in "
"a bullet-resistant vest."
msgstr ""
"Un blindaje hecho de un acero muy grueso, específicamente diseñado para ser "
"usado en un chaleco antibalas."

#. ~ Description of "clockwork"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "An assortment of miniscule gears and other clockwork gubbins."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "cash register"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"An electronic device for registering and calculating sales transactions.  It "
"doesn't seem to be working."
msgstr ""
"Un dispositivo electrónico para registrar y calcular las transacciones de "
"venta. Parece que no funciona."

#. ~ Description of "empty canister"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"An empty canister, which may have once held tear gas or other substances."
msgstr ""
"Un bote vacío, que alguna vez puede haber contenido gas lacrimógeno y otras "
"sustancias."

#. ~ Description of "dog tag"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"An identification tag for a pet, engraved with their name and their owner's "
"address and phone number.  It says \"<dog_name>\"."
msgstr ""
"Una chapita de identificación para una mascota, grabada con su nombre y la "
"dirección y teléfono del dueño. Dice \"<dog_name>\"."

#. ~ Description of "straw doll"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "An old straw doll, made to look like a woman in a dress."
msgstr "Una muñeca vieja de paja, parecida a una mujer con un vestido."

#. ~ Description of "biollante bud"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"An unopened biollante flower, brilliant purple in color.  It may still have "
"its sap-producing organ intact."
msgstr ""
"Un capullo cerrado de una flor de biollante, de un púrpura brillante. Tal "
"vez todavía contenga intacto el órgano generador de savia."

#. ~ Variant name of item "body pillow"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "Boston-Chan body pillow"
msgid_plural "Boston-Chan body pillows"
msgstr[0] "almohada de cuerpo Boston-Chan"
msgstr[1] "almohadas de cuerpo Boston-Chan"
msgstr[2] "almohadas de cuerpo Boston-Chan"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "DARPA hard case"
msgid_plural "DARPA hard cases"
msgstr[0] "estuche duro DARPA"
msgstr[1] "estuches duros DARPA"
msgstr[2] "estuches duros DARPA"

#. ~ Description of "soy and wheat dough"
#. ~ Description of "soy and wheat dough (obsolete)"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
#: data/json/obsoletion_and_migration/obsoletion.json
msgid ""
"Dough made from cooked and mashed soybeans and wheat flour, wrapped in wet "
"paper.  If left to dry for some time, it'll grow koji mold, as necessary for "
"making soy sauce."
msgstr ""
"Masa hecha con soja cocinada, triturada y harina de trigo, envuelta en papel "
"húmedo. Si se deja secar durante algún tiempo, crecerá el moho koji, "
"necesario para hacer salsa de soja."

#. ~ Description of "FEMA data"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"Evacuation plans, disaster risk projections, personnel lists, and last-"
"minute communications from just before the end, all scrubbed from FEMA "
"servers and stored in an external HDD."
msgstr ""
"Planes de evacuación, proyecciones de riesgo de desastres, listas de "
"personal y comunicaciones de última hora justo antes del final, todo ello "
"borrado de los servidores de FEMA y almacenado en un disco duro externo."

