"amarillas y empaquetados a su vez con gomas elásticas."

#. ~ Description of "twenty-dollar currency bundle"
#: data/json/items/generic/currency.json
msgid ""
"A thousand twenty-dollar bills, divided evenly between ten violet currency "
"straps, and bundled together with rubber bands."
msgstr ""
"Mil billetes de veinte dólares, divididos en diez fajos iguales con cintas "
"violetas y empaquetados a su vez con gomas elásticas."

#. ~ Description of "two-dollar currency bundle"
#: data/json/items/generic/currency.json
msgid ""
"A thousand two-dollar bills, divided evenly between ten green currency "
"straps, and bundled together with rubber bands."
msgstr ""
"Mil billetes de dos dólares, divididos en diez fajos iguales con cintas "
"verdes y empaquetados a su vez con gomas elásticas."

#. ~ Description of "twenty-dollar bill"
#: data/json/items/generic/currency.json
msgid "A twenty-dollar bill, featuring a portrait of Andrew Jackson."
msgstr ""
"Un billete de veinte dólares norteamericano, con el retrato de Andrew "
"Jackson."

#. ~ Description of "quarter"
#: data/json/items/generic/currency.json
msgid ""
"A twenty-five-cent coin, featuring a portrait of George Washington.  You "
"could flip it."
msgstr ""
"Una moneda de veinticinco centavos estadounidense con el perfil de George "
"Washington. Puedes usarla para un cara o cruz."

#. ~ Description of "two-dollar bill"
#: data/json/items/generic/currency.json
msgid "A two-dollar bill, featuring a portrait of Thomas Jefferson."
msgstr ""
"Un billete de dos dólares norteamericano, con el retrato de Thomas Jefferson."

