#. ~ Description of "cheap .22 caliber pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"Made from only the cheapest of budget metals, firing one of the weakest "
"cartridges, and having a hearty laugh at the concept of user safety, "
"this .22 caliber pocket pistol is of questionable utility at best.  "
"Affordably priced before the Cataclysm, the pistol's price point was "
"arguably its only positive element, an element which pertains zero bearing "
"on your current situation."
msgstr ""

