#. ~ Description of variant "M27 assault rifle" of gun "M27 IAR carbine"
#. ~ Description of variant "M27 IAR carbine" of item "M27 assault rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid ""
"A H&K416 carbine outfitted with a heavier barrel to enable higher amounts of "
"suppressive fire while retaining a good degree of mobility."
msgstr ""
"Es la carabina H&K 416 equipada con un cañón más pesado, para permitir "
"mayores cantidades de disparo supresivo manteniendo un buen grado de "
"movilidad."

#. ~ Description of gun "ZPAP M90 rifle"
#. ~ Description of "ZPAP M90 rifle"
#. ~ Description of gun "ZPAP 85 Mini Draco pistol"
#. ~ Description of "ZPAP 85 Mini Draco pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid ""
"A Serbian-made AK pattern rifle made by Zastava in 5.56x45mm NATO.  To avoid "
"import restrictions, Zastava USA has added a number of American-made parts."
msgstr ""
"Un rifle de tipo AK serbio fabricado por Zastava con calibre 5.56x45mm NATO. "
"Para evitar las restricciones de importación, Zastava USA le agregó algunas "
"partes fabricadas en Estados Unidos."

#. ~ Description of gun "SIG SG 556 rifle"
#. ~ Description of "SIG SG 556 rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid ""
"A civilian variant of an automatic Swiss rifle for military service.  "
"Accepts STANAG magazines."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "CZ 600 TRAIL rifle"
#. ~ Description of "CZ 600 TRAIL rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid ""
"A handy bolt-action offering from CZ, the 600 Trail is a box magazine-fed "
"ranch rifle that utilizes an aluminum chassis to keep its overall heft to a "
"minimum.  Possessing an extendable buttstock, extensive modularity, and a "
"quick-swap barrel assembly switchable to accommodate the firing of "
"either .223 or 7.62x39mm ammunition, the rifle was intended for use by "
"backpackers, trail hikers, and preppers."
msgstr ""
"Una oferta apañada de cerrojo de CZ, el 600 Trail es un rifle alimentado por "
"cargadores de caja que utiliza un armazón de aluminio para mantener su peso "
"total en mínimos. Con una culata extensible, modularidad extendida, y un "
"cañón fácilmente intercambiable para poder disparar munición calibre .223 o "
"7.62x39mm, el rifle estaba pensado para mochileros, montañeros o "
"supervivientes."

#. ~ Description of gun "FN SCAR-L rifle"
#. ~ Description of "FN SCAR-L rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid ""
"A highly accurate and modular assault rifle specially designed for the "
"United States Special Operations Command.  The 'L' in its name stands for "
"light, as it uses the lightweight .223 round."
msgstr ""
"Un rifle de asalto modular y muy preciso, especialmente diseñado para el "
"Comando de Operaciones Especiales de Estados Unidos. La 'L' (light) en el "
"nombre significa liviana, porque utiliza la liviana bala .223."

#. ~ Description of gun "M4 carbine"
#. ~ Description of variant "M4 carbine" of gun "M4A1 carbine"
#. ~ Description of "M4 carbine"
#. ~ Description of variant "M4A1 carbine" of item "M4 carbine"
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid ""
"A popular carbine, long used by the US military.  Though accurate, small, "
"and lightweight, it is infamous for its unreliability when not properly "
"maintained."
msgstr ""
"Es una carabina popular, muy utilizada por el Ejército de Estados Unidos. "
"Aunque es precisa, pequeña y liviana, se la conoce por su falta de "
"fiabilidad si no se la mantiene en buenas condiciones."

#. ~ Description of gun "CZ Bren 2 carbine"
#. ~ Description of "CZ Bren 2 carbine"
#. ~ Description of gun "Bren 7.62mm carbine"
#. ~ Description of "Bren 7.62mm carbine"
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json data/json/items/gun/762.json
msgid ""
"A semi-automatic clone of the Czech Republic's standard infantry carbine, "
"sold for civilian sport shooting and recreational use, this modular rifle "
"makes use of the 7.62x39mm Soviet cartridge and uses proprietary magazines."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "FS2000 carbine"
#. ~ Description of "FS2000 carbine"
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid ""
"A sleek bullpup carbine designed by FN Herstal, complete with an integrated "
"sight accessory rail.  The forward ejecting action and ambidextrous controls "
"make firing comfortable for both left and right-handed shooting.  The whole "
"rifle is well sealed from mud and dust for reliability, but this makes it "
"incompatible with many aftermarket magazines."
msgstr ""
"Una elegante carabina bullpup diseñada por FN Herstal, completa con un "
"carril para accesorios de mira integrado. La acción de expulsión hacia "
"delante y los controles ambidiestros hacen que el disparo sea cómodo tanto "
"para zurdos como para diestros. Todo el rifle está bien sellado contra el "
"barro y el polvo para mayor fiabilidad, pero esto lo hace incompatible con "
"muchos cargadores del mercado de accesorios."

#. ~ Description of gun "Ruger Mini-14 carbine"
#. ~ Description of "Ruger Mini-14 carbine"
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid ""
"A small, lightweight semi-auto carbine designed for civilian and police "
"use.  Its superb accuracy and low recoil makes it more suitable than full-"
"auto rifles for some situations."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeña y ligera carabina semiautomática diseñada para uso civil y "
"policial. Su excelente precisión y bajo retroceso hace que sea más adecuada "
"que los rifles completamente automáticos para algunas situaciones."

