#. ~ Description of gun "IWI Tavor X95 .300BLK carbine"
#. ~ Description of "IWI Tavor X95 .300BLK carbine"
#: data/json/items/gun/300BLK.json
msgid ""
"The IWI Tavor X95 (also called Micro-Tavor or MTAR) is an Israeli bullpup "
"assault rifle designed and produced by Israel Weapon Industries.  This is "
"the civilian version chambered for .300 AAC Blackout."
msgstr ""
"El IWI Tavor X95 (también llamado Micro-Tavor o MTAR) es un rifle de asalto "
"israelí diseñado y producido por Israel Weapon Industries. Esta es la "
"versión civil con cámara para un .300 AAC Blackout."

#. ~ Description of gun "Remington ACR .300BLK carbine"
#. ~ Description of "Remington ACR .300BLK carbine"
#: data/json/items/gun/300BLK.json
msgid ""
"This carbine was developed for military use in the early 21st century.  It "
"is damaging and accurate, though its rate of fire is a bit slower than "
"competing carbines.  This version is chambered for the .300 AAC Blackout "
"round."
msgstr ""
"Esta carabina fue desarrollada para uso militar a principios del siglo XXI. "
"Es dañina y precisa, aunque su velocidad de disparo es un poco más lenta que "
"la de las carabinas de la competencia. Esta versión está preparada para "
"balas de .300 AAC Blackout round."

#. ~ Description of variant "updated Enfield rifle" of gun "Lee-Enfield No. 4 Mk I rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "Lee-Enfield No. 4 Mk I rifle" of item "updated Enfield rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/303.json
msgid ""
"A Second World War progression of the British Commonwealth's Lee-Enfield "
"battle rifle, the No. 4 began its decades-long service life in 1939.  "
"Externally similar to its forefather, the rifle possesses a reinforced "
"receiver, an adjusted nose cap, and a heavier barrel.  Still chambered for "
"the same .303-caliber cartridge, the No. 4 represents one of the most "
"populous firearm imports in U.S. history."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "Enfield battle rifle" of gun "SMLE No. 1 Mk III rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "SMLE No. 1 Mk III rifle" of item "Enfield battle rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/303.json
msgid ""
"An English darling and icon of the First World War, the Short Magazine Lee-"
"Enfield Mk III was the standard issue battle rifle of the British "
"commonwealth from 1907.  Chambered for .303 ammunition, the rifle makes use "
"of ten-round detachable magazines.  With its full-length wooden handguard, "
"brass buttplate, and smooth action, the Lee-Enfield cuts a recognizable "
"profile in either the trenches of the Great War or the zombie-strewn "
"wastelands."
msgstr ""
"Una belleza inglesa y un ícono de la Primera Guerra Mundial, el Short "
"Magazine Lee-Enfield Mk III fue el rifle de batalla estándar de la "
"Commonwealth británica desde 1907. Con una recámara para munición .303, el "
"rifle utiliza cargadores desmontables de diez rondas. Con su guarda de "
"madera completa, culata de latón y acción suave, el Lee-Enfield tiene un "
"perfil reconocible tanto en las trincheras de la Gran Guerra como en los "
"páramos llenos de zombis."

#. ~ Description of gun "updated Enfield rifle"
#. ~ Description of "updated Enfield rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/303.json
msgid ""
"An evolution of Britain's First World War battle rifle, this bolt-action "
"firearm uses the same .303-caliber cartridge as its forerunner.  Much "
"beloved across the globe by collectors, rifles like this served as England's "
"infantry rifle well into the 1950s, with a specialized sniper variant "
"remaining in service until the early nineties."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "Enfield battle rifle"
#. ~ Description of "Enfield battle rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/303.json
msgid ""
"An iconic weapon of both the First and Second World Wars, this bolt-action "
"rifle has seen deployment in the hands of Commonwealth troops across Europe "
"and beyond.  Firing the .303-caliber cartridge and making use of 10-round "
"Enfield magazines, the firearm's reputation precedes it."
msgstr ""
"Una emblemática arma de la Primera y Segunda Guerra Mundiales, este rifle de "
"cerrojo ha servido en las manos de las tropas de la Commonwealth por toda "
"Europa y mas allá. Usando la munición calibre .303 y haciendo uso de "
"cargadores Enfield de 10 balas, la reputación de este arma le precede."

