#. ~ Description of gun "S&W 619 revolver"
#. ~ Description of "S&W 619 revolver"
#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
msgid ""
"A seven-round .357 revolver sold by Smith & Wesson.  Can also fire .38 "
"Special.  It features a fixed rear sight and a reinforced frame."
msgstr ""
"Un revólver de siete disparos calibre .357, vendido por Smith & Wesson. "
"También puede usar el .38 Special. Posee una mira trasera fija y una "
"estructura reforzada."

#. ~ Description of gun ".357 revolver"
#. ~ Description of ".357 revolver"
#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
msgid ""
"A six inch revolver chambered in .357 Magnum/.38 Special.  Favorite of "
"sheriffs and post-Cataclysm survivor group leaders."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "S&W Model 10 revolver"
#. ~ Description of "S&W Model 10 revolver"
#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
msgid ""
"A six-shot revolver, produced since 1899 and known as the most popular "
"handgun of the 20th century.  It has a swing-out cylinder for ease of "
"reloading."
msgstr ""
"Un revólver de seis disparos, producido desde 1899 y conocido como el arma "
"de mano más popular del siglo XX. Tiene un cilindro giratorio para facilitar "
"su recarga."

#. ~ Description of variant ".357-caliber snub-nosed revolver" of gun "Rossi RP63 revolver"
#. ~ Description of variant "Rossi RP63 revolver" of item ".357-caliber snub-nosed revolver"
#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
msgid ""
"A small frame, stainless-steel Brazilian wheel gun with rubberized grips, a "
"serrated front sight, and a satin finish, boasting a 6-round cylinder "
"of .357-magnum persuasion.  Affordable, before the world collapsed, and "
"confidently asserted by Rossi themselves to be the ideal carry gun for its "
"rounded butt and 3-inch barrel, you aren't wholly sure that such assertions "
"accounted for zombies."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "COP .357 Derringer pistol"
#. ~ Description of "COP .357 Derringer pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
msgid ""
"A small, chubby derringer pistol bearing a slight resemblance to the "
"Mossberg Brownie.  It uses a rotating firing pin to fire the individual "
"hammers of the four barrels arranged in a square formation."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña y regordeta pistola Derringer con un ligero parecido a la "
"Brownie de Mossberg. Utiliza un percutor giratorio para disparar los "
"martillos individuales de los cuatro barriles dispuestos en una formación "
"cuadrada."

#. ~ Description of variant ".357 revolver" of gun "Chiappa Rhino revolver"
#. ~ Description of variant "Chiappa Rhino revolver" of item ".357 revolver"
#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
msgid ""
"An innovative, futuristic looking revolver designed by Emilio Ghisoni after "
"developing the Mateba, its most distinctive feature is its barrel, aligned "
"with the bottom chamber of its hexagonal cylinder to alleviate muzzle flip.  "
"This positions the bore lower relative to the sights, effectively making the "
"gun easier to shoot but harder to aim."
msgstr ""

