msgid ""
"Short, stout, and compact, this stainless steel revolver is a handy "
"dispenser of .357-magnum, or lower-power .38-caliber, cartridges.  Six "
"rounds fit within the weapon, though its small stature and short barrel "
"ensure that each pull of the trigger is all but a pyrotechnic spectacle: "
"flashy, loud, and jumpy."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "reproduction .357 lever-action rifle" of gun "Uberti 1873 rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "Uberti 1873 rifle" of item "reproduction .357 lever-action rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
msgid ""
"The 1873 is a rifle platform developed all the way in, unsurprisingly, "
"1873.  This one is a fairly faithful Uberti reproduction, although the "
"original 1873s pre-dated .357 Magnum, and even .38 Special.  This one has a "
"case-hardened finish, wood furniture, and octagonal barrel."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant ".357 lever-action rifle" of gun "Rossi R92 16" rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "Rossi R92 16" rifle" of item ".357 lever-action rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
msgid ""
"The R92 is a widely successful line of lever-action rifles from Rossi, "
"featuring a wide array of different calibers and barrel lengths.  These aim "
"to be less reproductions of old rifles, but rather modern takes on the lever-"
"action formula.  This particular one features wooden furniture, a 16\" "
"barrel, and 8 rounds of .357 Magnum or .38 Special."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant ".357 lever-action rifle" of gun "Rossi R92 20" rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "Rossi R92 20" rifle" of item ".357 lever-action rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/38.json
msgid ""
"The R92 is a widely successful line of lever-action rifles from Rossi, "
"featuring a wide array of different calibers and barrel lengths.  These aim "
"to be less reproductions of old rifles, but rather modern takes on the lever-"
