msgstr[1] "subfusiles de la Segunda Guerra Mundial calibre .45"
msgstr[2] "subfusiles de la Segunda Guerra Mundial calibre .45"

#. ~ Description of gun "Luty SMG"
#. ~ Description of "Luty SMG"
#: data/json/items/gun/45.json
msgid ""
"A Luty pattern makeshift smoothbore SMG crudely constructed out of various "
"steel parts using advanced powered hand tools; likely one of the most "
"complex guns that is feasible to make outside of a machine shop, but still "
"very unreliable.  This one is chambered for .45 ACP cartridges and accepts "
"MAC-10 compatible magazines."
msgstr ""
"Un patrón de Luty hace que el subfusil de cañón liso sea construido "
"toscamente con varias piezas de acero usando algunas de las herramientas "
"manuales más avanzadas; probablemente una de las armas más complejas que son "
"factibles de hacer fuera de un taller de máquinas, pero aún así muy poco "
"fiable. Esta tiene una cámara para cartuchos de .45 ACP y acepta cargadores "
"compatibles con MAC-10."

#. ~ Description of gun ".45 WWII submachine gun"
#. ~ Description of ".45 WWII submachine gun"
#: data/json/items/gun/45.json
msgid ""
"A WWII submachine gun, lacking semi-auto fire selector and chambered in .45 "
"ACP."
msgstr ""
"Un subfusil de la segunda guerra mundial, sin el selector de tiro "
"semiautomático y con recamara .45 ACP."

#. ~ Description of gun "H&K USC carbine"
#. ~ Description of "H&K USC carbine"
#: data/json/items/gun/45.json
msgid ""
"A compact, lightweight carbine chambering the .45 ACP pistol round.  "
"Resembling the popular UMP submachine gun in both its blowback operating "
"system and lightweight polymer frame construction, this civilian variant is "
"distinguished by its skeletonized stock and 16 inch barrel, leaving it "
"unable to accommodate standard UMP parts."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "Glock pistol" of gun "Glock 21 pistol"
#. ~ Description of variant "Glock 21 pistol" of item "Glock pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/45.json
msgid ""
"A full-sized version of the highly successful Glock.  This model is "
"chambered in .45 ACP."
msgstr ""
"Una versión de tamaño completo de la exitosa Glock. Este modelo tiene la "
"recámara en .45 ACP."

#. ~ Description of gun "homemade pistol"
#. ~ Description of "homemade pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/45.json
msgid ""
"A large and heavy pistol evidently welded from scrap.  It's not pretty, but "
"the .45 it's chambered with packs a serious punch.  Just watch out for the "
"kick."
msgstr ""
"Una pistola grande y pesada, evidentemente fabricada con chatarra. No es "
"linda, pero el calibre .45 la hace ser muy potente. Pero ten cuidado con el "
"culatazo."

#. ~ Description of gun "UMP submachine gun"
#. ~ Description of "UMP submachine gun"
#: data/json/items/gun/45.json
msgid ""
"A modern polymer-body sub-machine gun, once quite popular with police "
"departments until recently.  Can be configured in 9x19mm, .40 S&W, or .45 "
"ACP using conversion kits and the appropriate UMP magazine."
msgstr ""
"Un moderno subfusil de cuerpo de polímero, antes muy popular entre los "
"departamentos de polibot hasta hace poco. Puede ser configurada en "
"9x19mm, .40 S&W o .45 ACP utilizando kits de conversión y el cargador UMP "
"correspondiente."

#. ~ Description of variant "USP pistol" of gun "H&K USP pistol"
#. ~ Description of variant "H&K USP pistol" of item "USP pistol"
#. ~ Description of gun "H&K USP pistol"
#. ~ Description of "H&K USP pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/45.json data/json/items/gun/9mm.json
msgid ""
"A popular pistol, widely used among law enforcement.  Extensively tested for "
"durability, it has been found to stay accurate even after being subjected to "
"extreme abuse."
msgstr ""
"Es una pistola popular, muy utilizada por las fuerzas de la ley. Su "
"durabilidad ha sido extensivamente probada, se sabe que puede mantener su "
"precisión incluso luego de sufir maltrato extremo."

#. ~ Description of gun "Glock pistol"
#. ~ Description of "Glock pistol"
