msgid_plural "A7 laser rifles"
msgstr[0] "rifle láser A7"
msgstr[1] "rifles láser A7"
msgstr[2] "rifles láser A7"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
msgid "CMES laser cannon"
msgid_plural "CMES laser cannons"
msgstr[0] "Cañón láser CMES"
msgstr[1] "Cañones láser CMES"
msgstr[2] "Cañones láser CMES"

#. ~ Description of gun "salvaged RMES marksman laser"
#. ~ Description of "salvaged RMES marksman laser"
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
msgid ""
"Formerly belonging to an RMES mech-suit, this powerful long-range laser "
"rifle was never designed for human hands.  You might be able to make it work "
"if you deployed it or mounted it to a vehicle, though, and its long range "
"and potency could be pretty handy if you can keep it powered."
msgstr ""
"Este potente rifle láser de largo alcance, que antes pertenecía al traje "
"meca RMES, nunca fue diseñado para manos humanas. Sin embargo, podrías hacer "
"que funcionara si lo desplegaras o lo montaras en un vehículo, su largo "
"alcance y potencia podrían ser bastante útiles si puedes mantenerlo con "
"cargado."

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
msgid "RMES marksman system"
msgid_plural "RMES marksman systems"
msgstr[0] "Sistema de puntería RMES"
msgstr[1] "Sistemas de puntería RMES"
msgstr[2] "Sistemas de puntería RMES"

#. ~ Description of gun "V29 laser pistol"
#. ~ Description of "V29 laser pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
msgid ""
"The V29 laser pistol was one of the first handheld laser weapons.  It is "
"larger than most traditional handguns, but has no recoil whatsoever."
msgstr ""
"Esta pistola láser V29 fue una de las primeras armas láser de mano.  Es más "
"grande que la mayoría de las armas de mano tradicionales, pero no tiene "
"ningún tipo de retroceso."

#. ~ Description of gun "CMES laser cannon"
#. ~ Description of "CMES laser cannon"
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
msgid ""
"The integral weapon system for the CMES exoskeleton mech-suit, a rotating-"
"barrel actively-cooled rapid-fire laser system."
msgstr ""
"El sistema integrado de armas para el exoesqueleto CMES es un sistema de "
"cañón rotativo de enfriado activo con disparo rápido láser."

#. ~ Description of gun "RMES marksman system"
#. ~ Description of "RMES marksman system"
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
msgid ""
"The integral weapon system for the RMES exoskeleton mech-suit, a quiet and "
"accurate marksman laser rifle."
msgstr ""
"El sistema integrado de armas para el exoesqueleto RMES es un rifle láser de "
"francotirador silencioso y preciso."

#. ~ Description of gun "hm12 dazzle rifle"
#. ~ Description of "hm12 dazzle rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
msgid ""
"This bulky anti-drone gun molded from black polymer was once beloved on all "
"sides of the Eastern European theater.  It disrupts navigation and "
"communcation systems by firing a brief but powerful burst of microwave "
"energy.  A direct hit may cause robots, drones, and even cyborgs to "
"malfunction for a short time."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "salvaged CMES laser cannon"
#. ~ Description of "salvaged CMES laser cannon"
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
msgid ""
"This gatling-laser has been stripped from its CMES mech-suit and is far too "
"heavy to use on its own.  You will need to deploy it or mount it to a "
"vehicle, but it could be devastating if you have deep battery reserves."
msgstr ""
"Este gatling-láser ha sido recuperado de un traje meca y es demasiado pesado "
"para ser usado por sí solo. Tendrás que desplegarlo o montarlo en un "
"vehículo, pero podría ser devastador si tienes grandes reservas de batería."

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
