#. ~ Description of gun mod "belt clip"
#. ~ Description of "belt clip"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/accessories.json
msgid ""
"A belt clip that attaches to the grip or slide of a pistol to facilitate "
"'Mexican carry', the practice of carrying without a holster.  It does not "
"offer any protection for the trigger, so users are strongly advised to carry "
"with the chamber empty or select a firearm with a very heavy trigger pull."
msgstr ""
"Un clip para cinturón que se pone en la empuñadura o al costado de una "
"pistola para facilitar la 'llevarlo a la mexicana', que es llevar encima el "
"arma sin funda. No ofrece ninguna protección para el gatillo así que se "
"recomienda a los usuarios llevarla con la recámara vacía o seleccionar un "
"arma con un gatillo difícil de apretar."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "bow stabilizer"
#. ~ Description of "bow stabilizer"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/accessories.json
msgid ""
"A counterweight placed forward of the bow's grip allows for greater "
"accuracy.  Aside from increased weight and size, there are no drawbacks."
msgstr ""
"Un contrapeso puesto delante del agarre del arco, que permite mejorar la "
"precisión. La única desventaja que tiene es el incremento del peso."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "electric spanner"
#. ~ Description of "electric spanner"
#. ~ Description of gun mod "electric spanner (on)"
#. ~ Description of "electric spanner (on)"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/accessories.json
msgid ""
"A homemade device consisting of a little electric motor that runs a pulley "
"system which, when attached to a crossbow and powered, aids in pulling the "
"string and cocking the bow.  This mod is not compatible with crossbows of "
"unusual design, nor those which are spanned with a lever or some other "
"device."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun mod "bow dampening kit"
#. ~ Description of "bow dampening kit"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/accessories.json
msgid ""
"A set of simple pads and rubber with adhesive backing, designed to stick on "
"the limbs and string of a bow to absorb vibrations.  This substantially "
"reduces noise during firing and can help with accuracy."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de almohadillas y goma adhesiva diseñado para pegarse en las "
"palas y cuerda del arco para absorber las vibraciones. Reduce "
"sustancialmente el ruido al disparar y puede ayudar en la precisión."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "primitive bow dampening kit"
#. ~ Description of "primitive bow dampening kit"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/accessories.json
msgid ""
"A set of simple pads and strips of fur with adhesive backing, designed to "
"stick on the limbs and string of a bow to absorb vibrations.  This "
"substantially reduces noise during firing and can help with accuracy."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de almohadillas y correas de piel con adhesivo, diseñado para "
"pegarse en las palas y cuerda del arco para absorber las vibraciones. Reduce "
"sustancialmente el ruido al disparar y puede ayudar en la precisión."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "bow stabilizer system"
#. ~ Description of "bow stabilizer system"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/accessories.json
msgid ""
"A set of stabilizing rods with dampeners and an adjustable mount.  This "
"system will significantly reduce shaking at full draw."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de varas estabilizadoras con sordinas y una montura ajustable. "
"Este sistema reducirá significativamente el temblor a máxima tensión de la "
"cuerda."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "arrow rest"
#. ~ Description of "arrow rest"
#. ~ Description of gun mod "wooden arrow rest"
#. ~ Description of "wooden arrow rest"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/accessories.json
msgid ""
"A small extension above the grip which an arrow rests upon while being "
"aimed.  Improves accuracy with no drawbacks."
msgstr ""
"Es una pequeña extensión sobre el agarre que permite apoyar la flecha "
"mientras se está apuntando. Mejora la precisión y no tiene desventajas."

