#. ~ Description of gun mod "Desert Eagle .357 conversion kit"
#. ~ Description of "Desert Eagle .357 conversion kit"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/conversions.json
msgid ""
"This is a caliber conversion for a Desert Eagle pistol, allowing it to "
"shoot .357 Magnum ammunition.  It includes the barrel and the reduced-"
"diameter bolt.  Don't forget the .357 magazine!"
msgstr ""
"Esta es una conversión de calibre para una pistola Desert Eagle, que le "
"permite disparar munición .357 Magnum. Incluye el cañón y el perno de "
"diámetro reducido. ¡No olvides el cargador .357!"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "Desert Eagle .44 conversion kit"
#. ~ Description of "Desert Eagle .44 conversion kit"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/conversions.json
msgid ""
"This is a caliber conversion for a Desert Eagle pistol, allowing it to "
"shoot .44 Magnum ammunition.  It includes the barrel, sporting an integral "
"muzzle brake, and the standard-diameter bolt.  Don't forget the .44 magazine!"
msgstr ""
"Esta es una conversión de calibre para una pistola Desert Eagle, que le "
"permite disparar munición .44 Magnum. Incluye el cañón, que cuenta con un "
"freno de boca integrado, y el cerrojo de diámetro estándar. ¡No olvides el "
"cargador .44!"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "Desert Eagle .50 conversion kit"
#. ~ Description of "Desert Eagle .50 conversion kit"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/conversions.json
msgid ""
"This is a caliber conversion for a Desert Eagle pistol, allowing it to shoot "
"the infamous .50 Action Express round.  It includes the barrel, sporting an "
