"with a 7.5-inch barrel chambered for .223 Remington ammunition.  These are "
"most often found on stockless AR pistol lowers, to comply with legal "
"restrictions on short barrels on rifles.  No such laws exist now, or at "
"least people that can enforce them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun mod ".22 upper receiver"
#. ~ Description of ".22 upper receiver"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/conversions.json
msgid ""
"This is a complete upper receiver assembly containing a barrel, handguard, "
"and bolt carrier group that, given the right knowledge, is installable upon "
"an AR-15-style rifle's lower frame.  Swappable uppers enable compatible "
"firearms to be retooled for different cartridges and barrel lengths, with "
"this kit furnishing a weapon with a 16-inch barrel chambered for .22 rounds."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun mod "CQB .450 upper receiver"
#. ~ Description of "CQB .450 upper receiver"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/conversions.json
msgid ""
"This is a complete upper receiver assembly containing a barrel, handguard, "
"and bolt carrier group that, given the right knowledge, is installable upon "
"an AR-15-style rifle's lower frame.  Swappable uppers enable compatible "
"firearms to be retooled for different cartridges and barrel lengths, with "
"this kit furnishing a weapon with a high-caliber 10.5-inch barrel chambered "
"for .450 Bushmaster cartridges.  Special-purpose low-capacity magazines are "
"required to feed the large rounds, but the upper turns any AR-15 into a "
"short-range powerhouse."
msgstr ""
"Este es un ensamblaje de receptor superior completo que contiene un cañón, "
"guardamanos y cerrojo, que con los conocimientos adecuados, se puede "
"instalar en la parte baja de un rifle estilo AR-15. Los receptores "
"intercambiables permiten que armas compatibles sean reconvertidas para "
"diferentes municiones y longitudes de cañón, que este equipo provee a un "
"arma con un cañón de gran calibre de 10.5 pulgadas con balas calibre .450 "
"Bushmaster. Cargadores especializados de baja capacidad son necesarios para "
"alimentar adecuadamente las balas mas grandes, pero el receptor convierte "
"cualquier AR-15 en un arma potente a corto alcance."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "SBR .450 upper receiver"
#. ~ Description of "SBR .450 upper receiver"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/conversions.json
msgid ""
"This is a complete upper receiver assembly containing a barrel, handguard, "
"and bolt carrier group that, given the right knowledge, is installable upon "
"an AR-15-style rifle's lower frame.  Swappable uppers enable compatible "
"firearms to be retooled for different cartridges and barrel lengths, with "
"this kit furnishing a weapon with a high-caliber 7.5-inch barrel chambered "
"for .450 Bushmaster cartridges.  Special-purpose low-capacity magazines are "
"required to feed the large rounds, but the upper turns any AR-15 into a "
"short-range powerhouse."
msgstr ""
"Este es un ensamblaje de receptor superior completo que contiene un cañón, "
"guardamanos y cerrojo, que con los conocimientos adecuados, se puede "
"instalar en la parte baja de un rifle estilo AR-15. Los receptores "
"intercambiables permiten que armas compatibles sean reconvertidas para "
"diferentes municiones y longitudes de cañón, que este equipo provee a un "
"arma con un cañón de gran calibre de 7.5 pulgadas con balas calibre .450 "
"Bushmaster. Cargadores especializados de baja capacidad son necesarios para "
"alimentar adecuadamente las balas mas grandes, pero el receptor convierte "
"cualquier AR-15 en un arma potente a corto alcance."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "CZ .223 barrel-assembly"
#. ~ Description of "CZ .223 barrel-assembly"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/conversions.json
msgid ""
"This is a quick-detach .223-caliber barrel assembly and bolt-head, "
"installable within the frame of a CZ 600 rifle, and secured with three "
"fasteners.  With this assembly installed, a rifle is capable of feeding "
"ammunition from standard STANAG-style magazines."
msgstr ""
"Este es un ensamblado de cañón fácilmente intercambiable y perno, que se "
"puede instalar en el armazón de un rifle CZ 600, asegurado con tres "
"pasadores. Con este ensamblado instalado, el rifle es capaz de alimentarse "
"con cargadores comunes STANAG."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "CZ 7.62x39mm barrel-assembly"
#. ~ Description of "CZ 7.62x39mm barrel-assembly"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/conversions.json
msgid ""
"This is a quick-detach 7.62mm barrel assembly and bolt head, installable "
"within the frame of a CZ 600 rifle, and secured with three fasteners.  With "
"this assembly installed, a rifle is rendered compatible with 7.62x39mm CZ "
"Bren 2 magazines."
msgstr ""
"Este es un ensamblado de cañón 7.62mm fácilmente intercambiable y perno, que "
"se puede instalar en el armazón de un rifle CZ 600, asegurado con tres "
"pasadores. Con este ensamblado instalado, el rifle es capaz de alimentarse "
"con cargadores 7.62x39mm CZ Bren 2."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "AXMC .300 barrel-assembly"
#. ~ Description of "AXMC .300 barrel-assembly"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/conversions.json
msgid ""
"This is a specialized 24-inch .300-caliber barrel and bolt face that is "
