#. ~ Description of gun mod "rifle scope"
#. ~ Description of "rifle scope"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/sights.json
msgid ""
"A 3-18x44 rifle scope.  It is adjustable for windage and elevation in 1/10th "
"mrad increments and is remarkably small and light for its magnification."
msgstr ""
"Un visor de rifle de 3-18x44. Es ajustable en cuanto al viento y la "
"elevación en incrementos de 1/10 de mrad y es notablemente pequeño y ligero "
"para su magnificación."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "high end rifle scope"
#. ~ Description of "high end rifle scope"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/sights.json
msgid ""
"A 3-18x44 rifle scope.  It is adjustable for windage and elevation in 1/10th "
"mrad increments and is remarkably small and light for its magnification.  "
"This one has an additional rail on the top of its ring mounts for an "
"additional backup optic."
msgstr ""
"Es una mira de rifle 3-18x44. Se puede ajustar por desviación y elevación en "
"incrementos de 1/10mo mrad y es notablemente pequeña y liviana para su "
"aumento.  Tiene una ranura adicional arriba de sus monturas para una óptica "
"más."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "modified rifle scope"
#. ~ Description of "modified rifle scope"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/sights.json
msgid ""
"A 3-18x44 rifle scope.  It is adjustable for windage and elevation in 1/10th "
"mrad increments and is remarkably small and light for its magnification.  "
"This one was modified and customized to mount on pretty much any weapon "
"other than pistols and SMGs, if you so want."
msgstr ""
"Una mira de rifle de 3-18x44. Es ajustable en cuanto al viento y la "
"elevación en incrementos de 1/10 de mrad y es notablemente pequeño y ligero "
"para su aumento. Este fue modificado y personalizado para montarlo en casi "
"cualquier arma que no sean pistolas y SMGs, si así lo desea."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "ACOG scope"
#. ~ Description of "ACOG scope"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/sights.json
msgid ""
"A 4x32 TA01 Advanced Combat Optical Gunsight with a tritium illuminated "
"crosshair."
msgstr ""
"Una mira óptica de combate avanzada 4x32 TA01 con una retícula iluminada con "
"tritio."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "modified ACOG scope"
#. ~ Description of "modified ACOG scope"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/sights.json
msgid ""
"A 4x32 TA01 Advanced Combat Optical Gunsight with a tritium illuminated "
"crosshair.  This one was modified and customized to mount on pretty much any "
"weapon other than pistols, if you so want."
msgstr ""
"Una mira óptica de combate avanzada(ACOG) 4x32 TA01 con una retícula "
"iluminada con tritio. Este fue modificado y personalizado para montarlo en "
"casi cualquier arma que no sean pistolas, si así lo desea."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "Nagoya 99 gun scope"
#. ~ Description of "Nagoya 99 gun scope"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/sights.json
msgid ""
"A basic and antique 4x rifle optic: essentially a non-adjustable telescopic "
"sight built by the Nagoya Arsenal during the Second World War and issued for "
"mounting on Type 99 sniper rifles."
msgstr ""
"Una mira telescópica básica y antigua de 4 aumentos: esencialmente una mira "
"telescópica no ajustable construida por el Arsenal de Nagoya durante la "
"Segunda Guerra Mundial y emitida para montar en rifles de francotirador Tipo "
"99."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "iron sights"
#. ~ Description of "iron sights"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/sights.json
msgid "A basic set of iron sights"
msgstr "Un conjunto básico de miras de hierro"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "hybrid ACOG scope"
#. ~ Description of "hybrid ACOG scope"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/sights.json
msgid ""
"A high end 4x32 military grade ACOG scope.  This one has additional mounting "
"brackets on top for another sight."
msgstr ""
"Una mira ACOG militar 4x32 de alta gama. Esta tiene un brazo de soporte "
"adicional arriba para otra mira."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "red dot sight"
#. ~ Description of "red dot sight"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/sights.json
msgid ""
"A red dot optic meant to be attached to the top of the weapon, replacing the "
"iron sights.  Increases accuracy and weight."
msgstr ""
"Un punto rojo óptico que se pone en la parte de arriba del arma, "
"reemplazando la mira de metal. Incrementa la precisión y el peso."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "five pin bow sight"
#. ~ Description of "five pin bow sight"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/sights.json
msgid ""
"A set of adjustable optic fiber aiming pins with a bracket to mount on "
"modern bows.  It takes more time to calibrate but can improve accuracy more "
"effectively."
msgstr ""
"Un juego de clavijas de puntería de fibra óptica ajustable con un soporte "
"para montar en arcos modernos. Lleva más tiempo calibrarlo pero puede "
"mejorar la precisión de forma más efectiva."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "telescopic sight"
#. ~ Description of "telescopic sight"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/sights.json
msgid ""
"A simple hand-crafted telescopic sight, essentially a small telescope with "
"crosshairs.  Not as good as the ones made before the Cataclysm.  Increases "
"weight but improves accuracy."
msgstr ""
"Una simple mira telescópica hecha a mano, esencialmente un pequeño "
"telescopio con retículas. No tan bueno como los que se hicieron antes del "
"Cataclismo. Aumenta el peso pero mejora la precisión."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "telescopic pistol sight"
#. ~ Description of "telescopic pistol sight"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/sights.json
msgid ""
"A simple telescopic sight intended for use on a handgun.  Increases weight "
"but improves accuracy greatly."
msgstr ""
"Es una simple mira telescópica diseñada para usar en pistolas. Incrementa el "
"peso pero mejora mucho la precisión."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "single pin bow sight"
#. ~ Description of "single pin bow sight"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/sights.json
msgid ""
"A single aluminum pin with a bracket to mount on modern bows.  Quick to use."
msgstr ""
"Un solo pasador de aluminio con un soporte para montar en arcos modernos. "
"Rápido de usar."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "bow scope"
#. ~ Description of "bow scope"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/sights.json
msgid ""
"A single magnifying scope mounted on an adjustable bracket, with "
"accompanying clarifier peep sight.  Designed for extra long shots, but "
"easily adjusted for short range.  Spectacularly accurate."
msgstr ""
"Es una mira de aumento montada sobre un soporte ajustable, y con una mirilla "
"con clarificador. Diseñada para disparos muy distantes, pero fácil de "
"ajustar para el corto alcance. Excepcionalmente precisa."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "sight magnifier"
#. ~ Description of "sight magnifier"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/sights.json
msgid ""
"A sleek compact 3x magnifier designed to sit behind a modern holographic "
"sight.  Mounted on a lever to quickly flip in and out of the sights picture, "
"the magnifier allows the full functionality of a high end close quarters "
"sight while also allowing you to engage targets at range."
msgstr ""
"Una lente de aumento compacto y elegante de 3x diseñado para ponerse detrás "
"de una mira holográfica moderna.  Montado sobre una palanca para poder "
"moverse rápidamente, esta lente de aumentos permite la funcionalidad "
"completa de miras para espacios cerrados y también te permite atacar "
"objetivos a distancia."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "pistol scope"
#. ~ Description of "pistol scope"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/sights.json
msgid ""
"A small scope intended for use on a handgun.  Increases weight but improves "
"accuracy greatly."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeña mira telescópica diseñada para su uso en un arma de fuego. "
"Aumenta de peso, pero mejora la precisión en gran medida."

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/json/items/gunmod/sights.json
msgid "ACOG scope"
msgid_plural "ACOG scopes"
msgstr[0] "mira para ACOG"
msgstr[1] "miras para ACOG"
msgstr[2] "miras para ACOG"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "holographic sight"
#. ~ Description of "holographic sight"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/sights.json
msgid ""
"An advanced optic with an adjustable circular hologram reticle superimposed "
"on the field of view.  Used extensively by military forces, it increases "
"accuracy and weight.  This is a step up from a red dot sight."
msgstr ""
"Una óptica avanzada con retícula circular ajustable que se superpone en el "
"campo de visión. Muy utilizada por las fuerzas militares, incrementa la "
"precisión y el peso. Es una mejora de la mirilla de punto rojo."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "RS1219 scope"
#. ~ Description of "RS1219 scope"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/sights.json
msgid ""
"An integral component of the RM11B rifle system, the RS1219 Accipiter "
"digital scope provides auto-adjusting focal length, a user-selectable "
"reticle, and an offset reflex sight for close objectives."
msgstr ""
"Un componente integral del sistema de rifle RM11B, el alcance digital de "
"Accipiter RS1219 proporciona longitud focal de auto-ajuste, una retícula "
"seleccionable por el usuario, y una compensación en la mira para objetivos "
"cercanos."

