#. ~ Description of gun "LeMat revolver shotgun"
#. ~ Description of gun mod "LeMat revolver shotgun"
#. ~ Description of "LeMat revolver shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid ""
"The LeMat revolver is unique in that its cylinder axis pin is also a fully "
"functional 20 gauge percussion-primed smoothbore barrel.  It's irremovable."
msgstr ""
"El revólver Lemat es único porque su pasador de eje cilíndrico es también un "
"barril de 20ga de diámetro liso, totalmente funcional, con un sistema de "
