#. ~ Description of magazine ".50 Beowulf 10-round conversion magazine"
#. ~ Description of ".50 Beowulf 10-round conversion magazine"
#: data/json/items/magazine/50beowulf.json
msgid ""
"A detachable 10-round box magazine, nearly identical in size and shape to "
"standard 30-round STANAG magazines, and able to be inserted into the same "
"compatible rifles.  The magazine has been engineered to feed a single-stack "
"column of .50 Beowulf ammunition into the chamber of an appropriately "
"converted AR-style firearm."
msgstr ""
"Un cargador de caja de 10 balas intercambiable, casi idéntico en tamaño y "
"forma al cargador común STANAG de 30 balas, y capaz de ser insertado en los "
"mismos rifles compatibles. El cargador ha sido diseñado para alimentar con "
"una sola columna de munición .50 Beowulf en la recamara de un arma "
"apropiadamente convertida en un arma estilo AR."

#. ~ Description of magazine "retooled STANAG 20-round magazine"
#. ~ Description of "retooled STANAG 20-round magazine"
#: data/json/items/magazine/50beowulf.json
msgid ""
"This 20-round box magazine is compatible with STANAG rifles and has been "
"modified to hold a single-stack, seven round column of .50-caliber Beowulf "
"ammo.  The front lip of the magazine has been beveled to allow for reliable "
"feeding of the Beowulf rounds into a properly converted weapon's chamber, "
"and, happily, this modification hasn't interfered with the magazine's "
"ability to hold standard ammunition."
msgstr ""
"Este cargador de caja de 20 balas es compatible con rifles STANAG y ha sido "
"modificado para contener columnas de siete municiones calibre .50 Beowulf. "
"La parte frontal del cargador ha sido alisada para permitir alimentarlo de "
"una manera fiable en una recámara apropiadamente convertida, y, felizmente, "
"esta modificación no ha interferido con la habilidad del cargador de "
"contener munición común."

#. ~ Description of magazine "retooled STANAG 20-round magazine with ranger plate"
#. ~ Description of "retooled STANAG 20-round magazine with ranger plate"
#: data/json/items/magazine/50beowulf.json
msgid ""
"This 20-round box magazine is compatible with STANAG rifles and has been "
"modified to hold a single-stack, seven round column of .50-caliber Beowulf "
"ammo.  The front lip of the magazine has been beveled to allow for reliable "
"feeding of the Beowulf rounds into a properly converted weapon's chamber, "
"and, happily, this modification hasn't interfered with the magazine's "
"ability to hold standard ammunition.  The bottom has been modified with a "
"ranger plate attachment to allow it to clip to carabiners."
msgstr ""
"Este cargador de caja de 20 balas es compatible con rifles STANAG y ha sido "
"modificado para contener columnas de siete municiones calibre .50 Beowulf. "
"La parte frontal del cargador ha sido alisada para permitir alimentarlo de "
"una manera fiable en una recámara apropiadamente convertida, y, felizmente, "
"esta modificación no ha interferido con la habilidad del cargador de "
"contener munición común. La parte de abajo ha sido modificada con una tapa "
"para permitir que se enganche."

#. ~ Description of magazine "retooled STANAG 30-round magazine"
#. ~ Description of "retooled STANAG 30-round magazine"
#: data/json/items/magazine/50beowulf.json
msgid ""
"This 30-round box magazine is compatible with STANAG rifles and has been "
"modified to hold a single-stack, 10-round column of .50-caliber Beowulf "
"ammo.  The front lip of the magazine has been beveled to allow for reliable "
"feeding of the Beowulf rounds into a properly converted weapon's chamber, "
"and, happily, this modification hasn't interfered with the magazine's "
"ability to hold standard ammunition."
msgstr ""
"Este cargador de caja de 30 balas es compatible con rifles STANAG y ha sido "
"modificado para contener una columna de diez municiones calibre .50 Beowulf. "
"La parte frontal del cargador ha sido alisada para permitir alimentar de "
"manera fiable las municiones Beowulf en una recámara apropiadamente "
"convertida, y, felizmente, esta modificación no ha interferido con la "
"capacidad del cargador de contener munición común."

#. ~ Description of magazine "retooled STANAG 30-round magazine with ranger plate"
#. ~ Description of "retooled STANAG 30-round magazine with ranger plate"
#: data/json/items/magazine/50beowulf.json
msgid ""
"This 30-round box magazine is compatible with STANAG rifles and has been "
"modified to hold a single-stack, 10-round column of .50-caliber Beowulf "
"ammo.  The front lip of the magazine has been beveled to allow for reliable "
"feeding of the Beowulf rounds into a properly converted weapon's chamber, "
"and, happily, this modification hasn't interfered with the magazine's "
"ability to hold standard ammunition.  The bottom has been modified with a "
"ranger plate attachment to allow it to clip to carabiners."
msgstr ""
"Este cargador de caja de 30 balas es compatible con rifles STANAG y ha sido "
"modificado para contener una columna de 10 municiones calibre .50 Beowulf en "
"una sola pila. La parte frontal del cargador ha sido alisada para permitir "
"la alimentación confiable de las municiones Beowulf en una recámara de arma "
"convertida correctamente, y, felizmente, esta modificación no ha interferido "
"con la capacidad del cargador para contener munición estándar. La parte de "
"abajo ha sido modificada con una tapa para permitir que se enganche a "
"carabinas."

