#. ~ Description of variant "AK-74 30-round magazine" of magazine "5.45mm 30-round AK magazine"
#. ~ Description of variant "AK-74 30-round magazine" of item "5.45mm 30-round AK magazine"
#: data/json/items/magazine/545x39.json
msgid ""
"A 30-round, curved box magazine for Kalashnikov AK-74 pattern firearms "
"chambered in 5.45x39mm Soviet.  Generally made from steel-reinforced "
"polymer, surplus examples found most utility within the contemporary United "
"States in feeding semi-automatic examples of eastern bloc AK-74 rifles."
msgstr ""
"Un cargador curvo de 30 rondas para armas de fuego del patrón Kalashnikov "
"AK-74, calibradas en 5.45x39mm soviético. Generalmente fabricadas con "
"polímero reforzado con acero, los ejemplos excedentes encontraron mayor "
"utilidad en los Estados Unidos contemporáneos al alimentar ejemplos "
"semiautomáticos de rifles AK-74 del bloque oriental."

