"aluminum and made for use within vz. 58 pattern rifles and modern "
"derivatives.  Despite strongly resembling standard Kalashnikov magazines, "
"this curved box magazine is unsuitable for insertion into AK-pattern mag "
"wells due to changes made in its follower assembly to facilitate a last-"
"round-hold-open feature within the vz. 58."
msgstr ""
