#. ~ Description of gun "composite bow"
#. ~ Description of "composite bow"
#: data/json/items/ranged/archery.json
msgid ""
"A heavily recurved short bow made of wood, bone, and horn laminated "
"together.  Its shape and construction give it a formidable draw weight "
"despite its size."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "wooden war bow"
#. ~ Description of "wooden war bow"
#: data/json/items/ranged/archery.json
msgid ""
"A long bow as tall as a man, this is a convincing reproduction of the "
"weapons that ruled the battlefield prior to the invention of gunpowder.  The "
"incredible draw weight is too much for the average person, but in the right "
"hands it could be devastating."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "compound hunting bow (low)"
#. ~ Description of "compound hunting bow (low)"
#: data/json/items/ranged/archery.json
msgid ""
"A modern bow with shaped cams and extra cables for high-velocity shots that "
"can be used effectively by average archers.  Currently set to a low weight, "
"making it much easier to draw."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "compound hunting bow"
#. ~ Description of "compound hunting bow"
#: data/json/items/ranged/archery.json
msgid ""
"A modern bow with shaped cams and extra cables for high-velocity shots that "
"can be used effectively by fairly strong archers.  Currently set to a medium "
"weight."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "compound hunting bow (high)"
#. ~ Description of "compound hunting bow (high)"
#: data/json/items/ranged/archery.json
msgid ""
"A modern bow with shaped cams and extra cables for high-velocity shots that "
"can be used effectively by very strong archers.  Currently set to a high "
"weight, and ready to cause some real damage - if you can draw it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "fiberglass recurve bow (folded)"
#. ~ Description of "fiberglass recurve bow (folded)"
#: data/json/items/ranged/archery.json
msgid ""
"A modern fiberglass bow that has been taken down for storage.  Activate it "
"to assemble it for use."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "survival bow"
#. ~ Description of "survival bow"
#: data/json/items/ranged/archery.json
msgid ""
"A weak bow crudely crafted from a single uncured wood stave.  It could be "
"useful for hunting small game, or maybe even fish."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "wooden target bow"
#. ~ Description of "wooden target bow"
#: data/json/items/ranged/archery.json
msgid ""
"A wooden longbow nearly the height of a man.  Though it resembles a medieval "
"weapon of war, the modest draw weight means this weapon is more suited for "
"shooting targets or animals than penetrating chain mail."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "compound war bow"
#. ~ Description of "compound war bow"
#: data/json/items/ranged/archery.json
msgid ""
"An extremely large, powerful compound bow, made with enormous limbs and a "
"thick string to take an immense amount of energy.  A pulley system makes it "
"a bit easier to draw, though it would still be quite a feat of strength for "
"any human."
msgstr ""

