#. ~ Description of gun "Boeing XM-P plasma rifle"
#. ~ Description of "Boeing XM-P plasma rifle"
#: data/json/items/ranged/energy.json
msgid ""
"Boeing developed this focused plasma weaponry together with DARPA, though it "
"never advanced beyond the prototype stage.  It heats solid hydrogen to "
"create plasma and envelops it with polymers to reduce blooming.  While "
"powerful, it suffers from short range."
msgstr ""

