#. ~ Description of "alien fern branch"
#: data/json/items/resources/alien.json
msgid ""
"A branching trunk of leaves from a massive fern, about two feet long and a "
"couple of feet across in diameter when including the leaves.  Maybe one day "
"you'll think of something to make with a giant fern."
msgstr ""
"Un tronco con ramas y hojas de un mega helecho, de unos sesenta centímetros "
"de largo y sesenta de diámetro incluyendo las hojas. Tal vez algún día se te "
"ocurra qué hacer con un helecho gigante."

#. ~ Description of "sensor assembly"
#: data/json/items/resources/alien.json
msgid ""
"A carved sphere embedded with small black glass screens.  It's probably a "
"sensor of some kind."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "CBM interface wire kit"
#: data/json/items/resources/alien.json
msgid ""
"A collection of hand-soldered wires leading to plugs and what looks like a "
"micro controller.  The plugs look like they could be attached to you, "
"assuming you have a Standard Neurobionic Interface."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "external climate control kit"
#: data/json/items/resources/alien.json
msgid ""
"A collection of mismatched pipes, wires, and a central device that looks "
"like a micro controller.  It almost looks like it could be used for some "
"form of central cooling."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "alien metal scrap"
#: data/json/items/resources/alien.json
msgid ""
"A collection of tiny metal strips, spheres, and other geometric primitives "
"taken from a disassembled alien machine."
msgstr ""
"Una colección de pequeñas tiras, esferas y otros primitivas formas "
"geométricas de metal sacadas de una máquina extraterrestre desensamblada."

#. ~ Description of "alien resin pod"
#: data/json/items/resources/alien.json
msgid ""
"A large pod the size of a beer keg, filled with gooey alien resin.  "
"Squeezing it firmly causes resin to squirt from the broken stalk at the end, "
"hardening within a few seconds of being exposed to the air."
msgstr ""
"Una gran vaina, del tamaño de un barril, llena de resina alienígena "
"pegajosa. Al apretarla firmemente, la resina sale a chorros del tallo roto "
"del extremo, endureciéndose a los pocos segundos de ser expuesta al aire."

#. ~ Description of "robotic innards"
#: data/json/items/resources/alien.json
msgid ""
"A robotic assembly of unknown function.  Entirely made from tight-fitting "
"metal plates, it somewhat resembles the interior of a mechanical clock."
msgstr ""
"Un ensamblaje robótico de función desconocida. Enteramente hecho de placas "
"metálicas, se parece al interior de un reloj mecánico."

#. ~ Description of "alien resin chunk"
#: data/json/items/resources/alien.json
msgid ""
"A shattered fragment of alien resin.  It looks a bit like a large piece of "
"sea glass, frosted and gritty with the edges rounded off.  It is somewhat "
"warm to the touch."
msgstr ""
"Un fragmento destrozado de resina alienígena. Se parece un poco a un gran "
"trozo de cristal marino, escarchado y arenoso con los bordes redondeados. Es "
"algo cálido al tacto."

#. ~ Description of "alien metal plating"
#: data/json/items/resources/alien.json
msgid ""
"A slightly curved plate of white metal.  It readily collects low amounts of "
"static charge."
msgstr ""
"Una placa levemente curva de metal blanco. Fácilmente acumula pocas "
"cantidades de estática."

#. ~ Description of "monolithic machine"
#: data/json/items/resources/alien.json
msgid ""
"A very heavy sphere, presumably made almost entirely of gold.  The complex "
"pattern etched across its surface implies that it might serve some exotic "
"function."
msgstr ""
"Una esfera muy pesada, presuntamente hecha completamente de oro. Una "
"superficie grabada de forma compleja implica que puede tener alguna función "
"exótica."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/alien.json
