#. ~ Description of "tonewood"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid ""
"A block of tonally appropriate wood that has been air dried for a year in "
"preparation for being turned into a musical instrument."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "wooden door"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid ""
"A door complete with hinges and handle, ready to be installed in a frame."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "plank"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid ""
"A flat, thick plank of wood.  It's very awkward as a melee weapon, but "
"perhaps it could be carved into something better."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "giant wooden screw"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid ""
"A giant screw carved out of solid wood, a simple component used to convert "
"rotational energy into a downward movement of greater force."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "log"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid "A large section of tree trunk."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "soaking spear shaft"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid ""
"A long stick carved and sanded into a smooth staff with a slight taper, for "
"use in making spears. It's currently being soaked with oil and quite "
"slippery.  Once it's finished it will be ready for use in other projects."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "long plank"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid ""
"A long, thick plank of wood commonly known as a two by four, one of the most "
"common pieces of lumber.  In wood frame construction, these are the studs "
"that support drywall and give a building its structure."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "stick"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid ""
"A respectable length of wood.  It could serve as a weapon as-is, but it "
"might be better to carve it into something."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "short plank"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid "A short, thick plank of wood, about 1/4th of a two by four."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "small wood block"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid ""
"A small 2x2x5 inches block of wood, primarily used for carving out small "
"wooden objects."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño bloque de madera de 5x5x12 centímetros, principalmente usado para "
"tallar objetos pequeños."

#. ~ Description of "splintered wood"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid "A splintered piece of wood. It could be used as a skewer for cooking."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "large wooden sheet"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid ""
"A standard 4 by 8 sheet of flat wood.  Heavy and bulky, it is extremely "
"useful for all manner of construction, but you might have to cut it to size "
"before doing smaller projects."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "long pole"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid ""
"A stout pole, half again the height of a man.  It has been carefully oiled "
"to preserve its strength and flexibility."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "soaking long pole"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid ""
"A stout pole, half again the height of a man.  It is soaking in oil to give "
"it strength and flexibility, and it will be some time before it's ready for "
"further use."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "spear shaft"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid ""
"A very long stick, sanded and treated with oil for integrity and carved into "
"a smooth staff with a slight taper, for use in making spears."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "wooden panel"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid ""
"A wide, thin wooden board, already cut to shape.  It's good for all kinds of "
"construction, but for really big projects you'd need a proper sheet of uncut "
"wood or the like."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "short wooden post"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid ""
"A wooden post with a 4 by 4 square base.  Posts with a length similar to "
"this are commonly used as chair legs."
msgstr ""
"Un poste de madera de 4 por 4 con base cuadrada. Postes con una longitud "
"similar a este son usados comúnmente en patas de sillas."

#. ~ Description of "wooden post"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid ""
"A wooden post with a 4 by 4 square base.  Posts with a length similar to "
"this are commonly used in mailboxes or as table legs."
msgstr ""
"Un poste de madera de 4 por 4 con base cuadrada. Postes con una longitud "
"similar a este son usados comúnmente en buzones y patas de mesas."

#. ~ Description of "long wooden post"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid ""
"A wooden post with a 4 by 4 square base.  Posts with a length similar to "
"this are commonly used in the construction of walls and floors."
msgstr ""
"Un poste de madera de 4 por 4 con base cuadrada. Postes con una longitud "
"similar a este son usados comúnmente en la construcción de muros y suelos."

#. ~ Description of "heavy wooden beam"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid ""
"An enormous beam of solid wood, very heavy and hard to lug around, but also "
"very sturdy for construction.  You could saw or chop it into smaller pieces, "
"like planks or panels."
msgstr ""
"Una enorme viga de madera maciza, muy pesada y difícil de arrastrar, pero "
"también muy resistente para la construcción. Podrías serrarla o cortarla en "
"trozos más pequeños, como tablones o paneles."

#. ~ Description of "long stick"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid ""
"An unworked length of wood, half again the height of a man.  It's quite "
"unwieldy in its current state.."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "tuning peg"
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid ""
"Tuning pegs go on stringed instruments to both provide an anchor for the "
"strings and to control the tightness of the wire which in turn controls the "
"tune of the notes produced."
msgstr ""

