#. ~ Description of "plastic rake"
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid ""
"A cheap plastic rake.  Will break quite quickly if used for anything other "
"than raking leaves."
msgstr ""
"Un rastrillo de plástico barato. Se romperá bastante rápido si se utiliza "
"para otra cosa que no sea rastrillar hojas."

#. ~ Description of "plastic snow shovel"
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid ""
"A cheap plastic shovel used for picking up snow and moving it somewhere "
"else.  It was useful before the cataclysm, but now it's useless."
msgstr ""
"Una pala de plástico barata usada para recoger nieve y moverla a otro lado. "
"Era útil antes del Cataclismo, pero ahora es inútil."

#. ~ Description of "hedge trimmer (off)"
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid ""
"A cordless, double-sided, gasoline-powered hedge trimmer.  A long line of "
"sharp-edged teeth extends from the engine; turning the trimmer on will make "
"them rapidly vibrate.  The poor man's chainsaw as far as the zombies are "
"concerned."
msgstr ""
"Un cortasetos a combustible, sin cable y de doble filo. Una larga línea de "
"dientes afilados se extienden desde el motor. Al encender el cortasetos hace "
"que vibren rápidamente. Es la motosierra del pobre, en cuanto a lo que "
"concierne a los zombis."

#. ~ Description of "wooden shovel"
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid ""
"A crude shovel with a shovelhead made from wood, historically used as an "
"alternative to metal shovels when metal was too expensive.  It works "
"passably well, but really can't compare to a metal shovel."
msgstr ""
"Una tosca pala con cabeza de pala hecha de madera, utilizada históricamente "
"como alternativa a las palas de metal cuando éstas eran demasiado caras. "
"Funciona pasablemente bien, pero realmente no se puede comparar con una pala "
"de metal."

#. ~ Description of "shovel"
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid "A digging tool.  Use it to dig pits adjacent to your location."
msgstr ""
"Una herramienta para cavar. Úsala para cavar pozos en los espacios "
"adyacentes al lugar donde estés parado."

#. ~ Description of "bronze hoe"
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid ""
"A farming implement made from bronze.  The added heft and durability should "
"let you till soil for farming more easily as well."
msgstr ""
"Una herramienta de labranza hecha de bronce. El peso y la durabilidad que "
"posee debería permitirte labrar la tierra muy fácilmente."

#. ~ Description of "hoe"
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid ""
"A farming implement.  You can use it to turn tillable land into a slow-to-"
"cross pile of dirt, or dig a shallow pit."
msgstr ""
"Una herramienta para la agricultura. Úsala para convertir terreno cultivable "
"en una pila de tierra lenta de transitar, o cavar un hoyo poco profundo."

#. ~ Description of "bronze sickle"
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid ""
"A handheld grass-cutting tool with a cast bronze blade, fastened to a wood "
"handle wrapped with leather."
msgstr ""
"Una herramienta de mano con la cuchilla fundida en bronce para cortar el "
"pasto, ajustada a un mango de madera envuelto con cuero."

#. ~ Description of "digging stick"
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid ""
"A large stick with the end carved into a broad blade for digging.  It could "
"be used to dig shallow pits, but not deep ones."
msgstr ""
"Un palo largo, con una punta tallada en forma de pala ancha para cavar. Se "
"puede usar para cavar pozos poco profundos."

#. ~ Description of "stone sickle"
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid ""
"A primitive tool for cutting grass.  The sharp, crescent-shaped stone at the "
"end of the handle is barely good enough for the job."
msgstr ""
"Una herramienta primitiva para cortar la hierba. La afilada piedra en forma "
"de media luna en el extremo del mango apenas sirve para el trabajo."

#. ~ Description of "trowel"
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid ""
"A small, sharp gardening shovel, perfect for digging up grubs and worms."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña pala afilada de jardinería, perfecta para sacar larvas y gusanos."

#. ~ Description of "metal rake"
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid "A sturdy metal rake, a must-have during autumn."
msgstr "Un robusto rastrillo de metal, un obligatorio en otoño."

#. ~ Description of "snow shovel"
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid ""
"A sturdy metal shovel used for picking up snow and moving it somewhere "
"else.  It was useful before the cataclysm, but now it's useless."
msgstr ""
"Una pala de metal resistente usada para recoger nieve y moverla a otro lado. "
"Era útil antes del cataclismo, pero ahora es inútil."

#. ~ Description of "sickle"
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid "An old-fashioned farming tool for cutting tall grass."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "scythe"
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid ""
"An old-fashioned farming tool used to cut tall grass.  Despite being a giant "
"blade on the end of a stick, it is incredibly awkward to use for anything "
"but its intended purpose."
msgstr ""
"Una herramienta antigua de granja que se usa para cortar la hierba alta. "
"Aunque es una cuchilla gigante en la punta de un palo, es increíblemente "
"incómoda de usar para cualquier cosa que no sea su propósito previsto."

#. ~ value of variable 'sound_message' in effect in EoC "EOC_toolweapon_running__trimmer" in use action of item "hedge trimmer (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid "The hedge trimmer rumbles."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "hedge trimmer (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid ""
"This hedge trimmer is on and making a lot of noise.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr ""

#. ~ value of variable 'success_message' in effect in EoC "EOC_toolweapon_activate__trimmer" in use action of item "hedge trimmer (off)"
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid "With a roar, the hedge trimmer leaps to life!"
msgstr "¡Con un rugido, el cortasetos cobra vida!"

#. ~ value of variable 'failure_message' in effect in EoC "EOC_toolweapon_activate__trimmer" in use action of item "hedge trimmer (off)"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_toolweapon_activate__trimmer" in use action of item "hedge trimmer (off)"
