#. ~ Description of "electric lantern (off)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A battery-powered lamp.  It does not provide much light, but it lasts a long "
"time."
msgstr ""
"Una lámpara alimentada con baterías. No provee mucha luz, pero dura mucho "
"tiempo."

#. ~ Description of "active flare"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A bright burning flare that is producing light.  It will last for about a "
"minute before burning out."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "active flare"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A burning magnesium flare that is producing light.  It will last for about a "
"half hour before burning out."
msgstr ""
"Una bengala de magnesio encendida, produciendo luz. Durará por lo menos "
"media hora antes de apagarse."

#. ~ Description of "heavy-duty flashlight (off)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A heavy-duty aluminum LED flashlight, often used by security guards.  It "
"even works underwater, and it's not bad for smacking hooligans."
msgstr ""
"Una linterna extra fuerte LED de aluminio, usualmente usada por guardias de "
"seguridad. Funciona incluso bajo el agua, y no esta mal para golpear a "
"fanáticos."

#. ~ Description of "kerosene lamp"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A kerosene-fueled lamp.  It does not provide much light, but it lasts a long "
"time.  It is turned on.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "kerosene lamp (off)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A kerosene-fueled lamp.  It does not provide much light, but it lasts a long "
"time.  Use it to turn it on."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "torch"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A large stick wrapped in rags that are soaked with flammable material.  It "
"is burning, producing plenty of light."
msgstr ""
"Un palo largo con trapos mojados en material incendiable envueltos en la "
"punta. Está encendida, y produce bastante luz."

#. ~ Description of "torch"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A large stick wrapped in rags that are soaked with flammable material.  When "
"lit, it produces a fair amount of light.  You'll need a lighter or matches "
"to light it."
msgstr ""
"Un palo largo con trapos mojados en material inflamable envueltos en la "
"punta. Cuando se enciende, produce una buena cantidad de luz. Vas a "
"necesitar un encendedor o fósforos para encenderlo."

#. ~ Description of "reading light"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "A little clip-on LED light, meant for reading books in the dark."
msgstr ""
"Es una pequeña luz LED con un gancho, diseñada para leer libros en la "
"oscuridad."

#. ~ Description of "reading light (active)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A little clip-on LED light, meant for reading books in the dark.  This one "
"is turned on."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña luz LED de clip, destinada a leer libros en la oscuridad. Esta "
"está encendida."

#. ~ Description of "diving flashlight (off)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A little waterproof light.  It can easily be clipped to a belt or a helmet, "
"or to some diving masks."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "LED strip (inactive)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A one meter strip of LED lights, usually used for decoration or accent "
"lighting."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "flare"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A slow-burning magnesium flare.  Use it to strike the striker and light it.  "
"It will produce a bright light for about a half hour."
msgstr ""
"Una bengala de magnesio de quemado lento. Úsala para romper el sello y "
"encenderla. Producirá una luz brillante durante media hora, más o menos."

#. ~ Description of "glowstick"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A small blue-light glowstick.  Use it to bend the plastic and break the "
"glass cylinder inside to start the reaction.  It will produce a small amount "
"of light."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña barra de luz azul. Úsala para doblar el plástico y romper el "
"cilindro de cristal en su interior para iniciar la reacción. Producirá una "
"pequeña cantidad de luz."

#. ~ Description of "gasoline lantern (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A small gasoline-powered lantern.  It does not provide much light, but it "
"lasts a long time.  It is turned on.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña lámpara alimentada con gasolina. No provee mucha luz, pero dura "
"mucho tiempo. Está encendida. Usar para apagar."

#. ~ Description of "gasoline lantern (off)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A small gasoline-powered lantern.  It does not provide much light, but it "
"lasts a long time.  Use it to turn it on."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña lámpara alimentada con gasolina. No provee mucha luz, pero dura "
"mucho tiempo. Usar para encender."

#. ~ Description of "propane lantern (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A small propane-powered lantern.  It does not provide much light, but it "
"lasts a long time.  It is turned on.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña lámpara alimentada con propano. No provee mucha luz, pero dura "
"mucho tiempo. Está encendida. Usar para apagar."

#. ~ Description of "propane lantern (off)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A small propane-powered lantern.  It does not provide much light, but it "
"lasts a long time.  Use it to turn it on."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña lámpara alimentada con propano. No provee mucha luz, pero dura "
"mucho tiempo. Usar para encender."

#. ~ Description of "smart lamp (off)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "A smart lamp that can be activated remotely."
msgstr "Una lámpara inteligente que puede ser encendida de manera remota."

#. ~ Description of "smart lamp (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A smart lamp which can be deactivated remotely.  Currently it is turned on."
msgstr ""
"Una lámpara inteligente que puede ser apagada de manera remota. Ahora esta "
"encendida."

#. ~ Description of "clay oil lamp (off)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A specialized small clay container with a wick, an ancient form of oil "
"lamp.  Unlike newer designs, it isn't windproof, so the flame is likely to "
"be extinguished if exposed to wind; better use it indoors.  It does not "
"provide much light, but it lasts a long time.  Use it to light it."
msgstr ""
"Un recipiente pequeño de arcilla con una mecha, una antigua versión de una "
"lámpara de aceite. A diferencia de los diseños más nuevos, no esta aislada "
"contra el viento así que la llama se extinguirá fácilmente. Es mejor usarla "
"en interiores.  No brinda mucha iluminación pero dura mucho tiempo. Úsala "
"para encenderla."

#. ~ Description of "clay oil lamp"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A specialized small clay container with a wick, an ancient form of oil "
"lamp.  Unlike newer designs, it isn't windproof, so the flame is likely to "
"be extinguished if exposed to wind; better use it indoors.  It does not "
"provide much light, but lasts a long time.  It is lit, consuming oil and "
"providing light.  Use it to extinguish the flame."
msgstr ""
"Un recipiente pequeño de arcilla con una mecha, una antigua versión de una "
"lámpara de aceite. A diferencia de los diseños más nuevos, no esta aislada "
"contra el viento así que la llama se extinguirá fácilmente. Es mejor usarla "
"en interiores. No brinda mucha iluminación pero dura mucho tiempo. Está "
"encendida consumiendo el aceite e iluminando. Úsala para extinguir la llama."

#. ~ Description of "dead glowstick"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "A spent glowstick.  It is essentially trash."
msgstr "Una barra luminosa gastada. Esencialmente basura."

#. ~ Description of "candle"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A thick wax candle.  It doesn't provide very much light, but it can burn for "
"quite a long time.  This candle is lit."
msgstr ""
"Una vela de cera gruesa. No provee mucha luz, pero puede durar mucho tiempo. "
"Esta vela está encendida."

#. ~ Description of "candle"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A thick wax candle.  It doesn't provide very much light, but it can burn for "
"quite a long time.  You'll need a lighter or matches to light it."
msgstr ""
"Una vela gruesa. No provee mucha luz pero puede durar mucho tiempo. Vas a "
"necesitar un encendedor o fósforos para encenderla."

#. ~ Description of "flashlight (off)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A typical household flashlight with a plastic handle, powered by batteries."
msgstr ""
"Un linterna típica casera con un mango de plástico, alimentada con baterías."

#. ~ Description of "active glowstick"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"An active glowstick, currently producing light.  It will last for a few "
"hours before burning out."
msgstr ""
"Una barra luminosa activa que está produciendo luz. Va a durar unas horas "
"antes de gastarse."

#. ~ Description of "acetylene lamp (off)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"An antique brass lamp designed to run from a pressurized cylinder of "
"acetylene.  It is an efficient, if somewhat dangerous, light source."
msgstr ""
"Una antigua lámpara de latón diseñada para funcionar con un cilindro de "
"acetileno a presión. Es una fuente de luz eficaz, aunque algo peligrosa."

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "atomic headlamp"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "atomic lamp"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "Close cover"
msgstr "Cerrar cubierta"

