#. ~ Description of "refrigerated tank (100 L)"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/utilities.json
msgid ""
"A 100 L refrigerated tank for keeping liquids cool.  Provides some "
"insulation from outside weather."
msgstr ""
"Un tanque refrigerado de 100L para mantener los líquidos frescos. "
"Proporciona un poco de aislamiento del clima exterior."

#. ~ Description of "heated tank"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/utilities.json
msgid ""
"A 60 L heated tank for keeping liquids from freezing.  Provides some "
"insulation from outside weather."
msgstr ""
"Un tanque calentador de 60L para evitar la congelación de los líquidos. "
"Provee algo de aislamiento de la temperatura en exteriores."

#. ~ Description of "refrigerated tank (60 L)"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/utilities.json
msgid ""
"A 60 L refrigerated tank for keeping liquids cool.  Provides some insulation "
"from outside weather."
msgstr ""
"Un tanque refrigerado de 60L para mantener los líquidos frescos. Proporciona "
"un poco de aislamiento del clima exterior."

#. ~ Description of "programmable autopilot"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/utilities.json
msgid ""
"A computer system hooked up to the steering and engine of a vehicle to allow "
"it to follow simple paths."
msgstr ""
"Un sistema informático conectado a la dirección y al motor de un vehículo "
"para permitirle seguir caminos simples."

#. ~ Description of "electric oil press"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/utilities.json
msgid ""
"A heavy-duty press used to create vegetable oil from nuts or seeds.  It "
"needs to be mounted on a vehicle due to its high power draw."
msgstr ""
"Una prensa grande utilizada para crear aceite vegetal desde frutos secos o "
"semillas.  Necesita estar montada en un vehículo ya que consume mucha "
"energía."

#. ~ Description of "water faucet"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/utilities.json
msgid "A metal faucet that can be attached to a water tank for easy access."
msgstr ""
"Una canillas de metal que puede ser puesta en un tanque de agua para "
"facilitar el uso."

#. ~ Description of "battery charger"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/utilities.json
msgid ""
"A small device for recharging batteries, given a source of electricity.  It "
"could easily be wired into a vehicle with power.  It will slowly charge all "
"rechargeable batteries (battery cells, lead-acid batteries, etc) placed "
"directly within its storage space.  It can only be installed onto existing "
"storage compartments."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño dispositivo para recargar las baterías, dada una fuente de "
"electricidad. Podría ser fácilmente conectado a un vehículo con energía. "
"Cargará lentamente todas las baterías recargables (células de batería, "
"baterías de plomo, etc.) colocadas directamente en su espacio de "
"almacenamiento. Sólo puede instalarse en los compartimentos de "
"almacenamiento existentes."

#. ~ Description of "small integrated cooler"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/utilities.json
msgid "A small vehicle-mounted area cooler."
msgstr "Un pequeño aire acondicionado de área montado en un vehículo."

#. ~ Description of "small vehicle heater"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/utilities.json
msgid "A small vehicle-mounted area heater."
msgstr "Un pequeño calentador de área montado en un vehículo."

#. ~ Description of "towel hanger"
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "towel hanger"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/utilities.json
#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
msgid "A towel hanger with towels."
msgstr "Una colgador de toallas con toallas."

#. ~ Description of "recharging station"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/utilities.json
msgid ""
"A universal recharging station designed to operate on vehicle power.  While "
"on, it will steadily charge all rechargeable batteries (battery cells, lead-"
"acid batteries, etc) placed directly within its storage space.  The system "
"can only be installed onto existing storage compartments, and is controlled "
"from a dashboard or electronics control unit."
msgstr ""
"Una estación de recarga universal diseñada para funcionar con la energía del "
"vehículo. Se cargarán constantemente todas las baterías recargables (células "
"de batería, baterías de plomo, etc.) colocadas directamente en su espacio de "
"almacenamiento. El sistema sólo puede instalarse en los compartimentos de "
"almacenamiento existentes y se controla desde un tablero o una unidad de "
"control electrónico."

#. ~ Description of "vehicle cooler"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/utilities.json
msgid ""
"A vehicle-mounted area cooler.  Install a muffler in another part of the "
"vehicle to direct the exhaust heat to that location."
msgstr ""
"Un refrigerador de zona montado en el vehículo. Instala un silenciador en "
"otra parte del vehículo para dirigir el calor del escape a ese lugar."

#. ~ Description of "vehicle heater"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/utilities.json
msgid "A vehicle-mounted area heater."
msgstr "Un calentador de área montado en un vehículo."

#. ~ Description of "portable dishwasher"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/utilities.json
msgid "A very small dishwasher designed for use in vehicles."
msgstr "Es un lavavajillas chico diseñado para ser usado en vehículos."

#. ~ Description of "washing machine"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/utilities.json
msgid "A very small washing machine designed for use in vehicles."
msgstr "Una lavadora muy pequeña diseñada para su uso en vehículos."

#. ~ Description of "military black box"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/utilities.json
msgid ""
"An aircraft's black box, seemingly pulled from some sort of military vehicle "
"wreckage.  If you can find a system to analyze this, you may find something "
"of interest."
msgstr ""
"Una caja negra, aparentemente sacada de los restos de un vehículo militar. "
"Si puedes encontrar un sistema para analizar esto, podrías encontrar algo de "
"interés."

#. ~ Description of "mountable autoclave"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/utilities.json
msgid "This autoclave has been rigged to run off a vehicle power grid."
msgstr ""
"Este autoclave ha sido modificado para funcionar con el sistema eléctrico de "
"un vehículo."

