#. ~ Description of loot zone "Storage: Unsorted"
#: data/json/loot_zones.json
msgid ""
"A space for items which are to be sorted into other storage zones.  You can "
"use the \"sort out items\" zone action to automatically move items from here "
"to any valid destinations, including ones contained within this zone."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of loot zone "Storage: Unload Everything"
#: data/json/loot_zones.json
msgid ""
"Any containers in this zone you don't otherwise sort will have their "
"contents dumped out and placed on the same tile.  This includes corpses, "
"magazines, and magazine wells."
msgstr ""
"Todos los contenedores en esta zona que no tengas organizados de otra manera "
"serán vaciados y su contenido será puesto en el mismo espacio. Esto incluye "
"cadáveres, municiones y aberturas de cargador."

#. ~ Description of loot zone "Storage: Strip Corpses"
#: data/json/loot_zones.json
msgid ""
"Corpses in this zone you don't otherwise sort will have everything taken off "
"them and dropped on the same tile."
msgstr ""
"A los cadáveres de esta zona que no clasifiques de otra manera se les "
"quitará todo y se dejará caer en el mismo lugar."

#. ~ Description of loot zone "Storage: Bionics"
#: data/json/loot_zones.json
msgid "Destination for Compact Bionic Modules, a.k.a. CBMs."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of loot zone "Storage: Ammo"
#: data/json/loot_zones.json
msgid "Destination for ammo."
msgstr "Lugar para la munición."

#. ~ Description of loot zone "Storage: Default"
#: data/json/loot_zones.json
msgid "Destination for any loot without a more specific zone defined."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of loot zone "Storage: Armor"
#: data/json/loot_zones.json
msgid ""
"Destination for armor.  Does include filthy armor if such zone is not "
"specified."
msgstr ""
"Lugar para armaduras. Incluye armadura sucia si no tiene una zona específica."

#. ~ Description of loot zone "Storage: Artifacts"
#: data/json/loot_zones.json
msgid "Destination for artifacts."
msgstr "Lugar para artefactos."

#. ~ Description of loot zone "Storage: Books"
#: data/json/loot_zones.json
msgid "Destination for books and magazines."
msgstr "Lugar para libros y revistas."

#. ~ Description of loot zone "Storage: Chemical"
#: data/json/loot_zones.json
msgid "Destination for chemicals."
msgstr "Lugar para químicos."

#. ~ Description of loot zone "Storage: Clothing"
#: data/json/loot_zones.json
msgid ""
"Destination for clothing.  Does include filthy clothing if such zone is not "
"specified."
msgstr ""
"Lugar para la ropa. Incluye ropa sucia si no se tiene una zona específica "
"para ella."

#. ~ Description of loot zone "Storage: Food"
#: data/json/loot_zones.json
msgid ""
"Destination for comestibles.  If a more specific food zone is not defined, "
"all food is moved here."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of loot zone "Storage: Corpses"
#: data/json/loot_zones.json
