#. ~ Description of monster "black widow spiderling"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"The horrid spawn of a giant black widow spider.  Though, given the size that "
"it currently is, it appears relatively harmless."
msgstr ""
"La horrible descendencia de una gigantesca viuda negra. Aunque, dado el "
"tamaño que tiene actualmente, parece relativamente inofensiva."

#. ~ Description of monster "giant caterpillar"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"The larval stage of a butterfly or a moth.  This one appears to be about "
"your size so you can only imagine the size of the insect that it will grow "
"into."
msgstr ""
"El estado larval de una mariposa o de una polilla. Este parece ser de tu "
"tamaño así que te puedes imaginar el tamaño del insecto cuando crezca."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "monstrous cellar spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "The maimed legs start twitching erratically!"
msgstr "¡Las patas mutiladas comienzan a retorcerse erráticamente!"

#. ~ Description of monster "cicada nymph"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"The mutated larval form of a cicada.  It doesn't produce noise like the "
"adults but its digging claws seem suited for scratching."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "giant lady bug"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"The normal-sized version of this red and black beetle is generally "
"considered cute, and is adored by children and associated with good luck.  "
"This monster, on the other hand is clearly a ferocious predator capable of "
"killing swarms of ants, aphids, and unprepared humans."
msgstr ""
"La versión de tamaño normal de este escarabajo rojo y negro se considera "
"generalmente simpática, y es adorada por los niños y asociada a la buena "
"suerte. Este monstruo, en cambio, es claramente un feroz depredador capaz de "
"matar enjambres de hormigas, pulgones y humanos desprevenidos."

#. ~ Description of monster "water scorpion nymph"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"The nymph of a water scorpion, looks like a smaller version of its parents."
msgstr ""
"La ninfa de un escorpión de agua, parece una versión más pequeña de sus "
"padres."

#. ~ Description of monster "giant water tiger"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"The predatory, aquatic larva of a diving beetle grown to large proportions.  "
"It is quite slow but still a good ambusher."
msgstr ""
"La larva acuática depredadora de un escarabajo buceador que ha crecido hasta "
"alcanzar grandes proporciones. Es bastante lenta pero sigue siendo una buena "
"emboscadora."

#. ~ Death message of monster "mommy long-legs"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "The spiderlings fall to the ground!"
msgstr "¡Las crías caen al suelo!"

#. ~ Description of monster "detached spider leg"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"The strangely branching leg of a mutated cellar spider that… fell?  "
"crawled?  off of the main body when hurt.  It now flails about blindly, "
"irregular clawed appendages grasping at anything that comes close."
msgstr ""
"Esta extrañamente ramificada pata de una araña de patas largas mutada que… "
"¿se cayó? ¿se arrastró? del cuerpo cuando fue herido. Ahora se agita "
"ciegamente, con apéndices agarrando cualquier cosa que tenga cerca."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "motionless deer"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "The sudden motion of their host cause some dermatik larvae to flee!"
msgstr ""
"¡El movimiento repentino de su huésped hace que algunas larvas de dermatik "
"huyan!"

#. ~ Description of monster "great mantis"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"This ferocious cow-sized mantis stalks the fields of New England.  It's "
"probably capable of killing a moose with its powerful arms."
msgstr ""
"Esta feroz mantis del tamaño de una vaca acecha los campos de Nueva "
"Inglaterra. Probablemente sea capaz de matar a un alce con sus poderosos "
"brazos."

#. ~ Description of monster "plague vector"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"This giant cockroach has been feeding on the undead for some time and has "
"started to mutate chaotically.  Extra limbs and growths sprout from its "
"thorax, and it is notably aggressive even to creatures much larger than "
"itself."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "fire ant queen"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"This horse-sized red ant drags its distended abdomen behind it slowly, "
"burdened by its own eggs."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized aphid"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"This huge aphid is as big as a hamster.  It's not as thirsty as bigger ones, "
"but a herd of these could eat your crops easily."
msgstr ""
"Este enorme pulgón es del tamaño de un hámster. No es tan sediento como los "
"más grandes pero una horda de estos te podrían comer tu cosecha fácilmente."

#. ~ Description of monster "giant antlion"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"This huge grub has powerful mandibles and a hungry look.  It hides in the "
"dirt and awaits its prey."
msgstr ""
"Esta enorme larva tiene mandíbulas poderosas y una apariencia hambrienta. Se "
"esconde en la tierra y espera a su presa."

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized lady bug"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"This is a mutated lady bug the size of a big dog.  While not as dangerous as "
"her giant sisters, she's still troublesome to deal with."
msgstr ""
"Una mariquita de San Antonio mutada del tamaño de un perro grande. Aunque no "
"es tan peligrosa como sus hermanas gigantes, puede ser un problema lidiar "
"con ella."

#. ~ Description of monster "giant lacewing"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"This mutant bug superficially resembles a dragonfly the size of a human "
"child, but its smaller eyes and the rearward tilt of its wings give it away "
"as the adult form of an antlion."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "mommy long-legs"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"This surprisingly shy giant cellar spider holds a head-sized ball of "
"crawling spiderlings of different ages in its mandibles, carefully balancing "
"on her long legs not to drop the precious cargo.  She seems uninterested in "
"you."
msgstr ""
"Esta sorprendentemente tímida araña gigante de patas largas sostiene en sus "
"mandíbulas una bola de crías de diferentes edades, y se balancea "
"cuidadosamente en sus patas largas para no dejar caer su preciada carga. No "
"parece tener interés en tu persona."

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized water strider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"This water bug is several times larger than a regular one.  Its movements "
"are fast and fluid."
msgstr ""
"Este insecto acuático es varias veces más grande que uno normal. Sus "
"movimientos son rápidos y fluidos."

#. ~ Description of monster "giant water strider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"This water glider is about as big as a domestic cat.  Its legs are more fin-"
"like and a swollen body is mostly submerged underwater."
msgstr ""
"Este zapatero es del tamaño de un gato. Sus patas son más parecidas a aletas "
"y tiene el cuerpo hinchado en su mayoría sumergido en el agua."

#. ~ Description of monster "giant diving beetle"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"Water beetles can be found in all freshwater environments, with diving "
"beetles being their predatory variant.  These however seem to have grown far "
"larger with the Cataclysm."
msgstr ""
"Los escarabajos acuáticos pueden encontrarse en ambientes de agua dulce, "
"siendo los escarabajos buceadores la variante depredadora. Sin embargo, este "
"parece haber crecido mucho más grande durante el Cataclismo."

#. ~ Description of monster "fused dragonflies"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"What appears to be a single, enormous insect with a swollen abdomen is "
"actually the unholy union of two dragonflies in the act of mating, bodies "
"still locked into the telltale heart shape.  The remains of their wings and "
"abdomens form an egg sac they sluggishly pull between them, periodically "
"dropping a handful of glistening eggs."
msgstr ""
"Lo que parece un único y enorme insecto con el abdomen hinchado es, en "
"realidad, la impía unión de dos libélulas en el acto de apareamiento, con "
"los cuerpos todavía encerrados en la reveladora forma de corazón. Los restos "
"de sus alas y abdómenes forman un saco de huevos que arrastran lentamente "
"entre ellos, dejando caer periódicamente un puñado de huevos relucientes."

#. ~ Description of monster "giant bee"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"With a stinger the size of a kitchen knife, this dog-sized insect's black "
"and yellow markings warn you to leave it undisturbed."
msgstr ""
"Con un aguijón del tamaño de una cuchilla, este insecto del tamaño de un "
"perro es negro con rayas amarillas, que te advierten que te alejes y no "
"molestes."

#. ~ Description of monster "woodlouse manca"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"Woodlice reproduce by carrying their eggs in a pouch and releasing them as "
"juveniles.  Their mancae look like small adults except for their pale color."
msgstr ""
"Los bichos bolita se reproducen cargando sus huevos en una bolsa y "
"liberándolos cuando son jóvenes. En su etapa manca es como un adulto más "
"pequeño pero con un color pálido."

