#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/codger.json
msgid ""
"Be patient!  I'm almost done.  Now up the top o' Mount Greenwood there used "
"to be a ranger station, that woulda been before you were born.  It got burnt "
"down that one year, they said it were lightnin' but you an' I both know it "
"were college kids partyin'.  Rusty G an' I left ol' yeller behind and wen' "
"in to check it out.  Burnt out ol' husk looked haunted, we figgered there "
"were some o' them damn kids rummagin' around in it.  Rusty G brought his 18 "
"gauge, and lucky thing cuz o' what we saw."
msgstr ""
"¡Tengan paciencia! Ya casi he terminado. En la cima del Monte Greenwood "
"había un puesto de guardabosques, que habia estado allí antes de que "
"nacieras. Se quemó ese año, dijeron que era un relámpago, pero tú y yo "
"sabemos que eran universitarios que estaban de fiesta. Rusty G y yo dejamos "
"al viejo ruidoso atrás y entramos a comprobarlo. La cáscara quemada parecía "
"embrujada, creíamos que había algunos de esos malditos niños rebuscando en "
"ella. Rusty G trajo su calibre 18, y por suerte, por lo que vimos."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/codger.json
msgid ""
"Dammit I'm gettin' there, bite yer tongue.  As I was sayin', Rusty G - "
"that's my ol' pal Marty Gumps - were in the passenger seat with his trusty "
"18 gauge lyin' on his lap.  That were his dog's name, only we all just "
"called him 18 gauge for short."
msgstr ""
"Maldita sea, ya estoy llegando, muérdete la lengua. Como decía, Rusty G., mi "
"viejo amigo Marty Gumps, estaba en el asiento del pasajero con su fiel "
"calibre 18 acostado en su regazo. Ese era el nombre de su perro, sólo que "
"todos le llamábamos \"calibre 18\" para abreviar."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/codger.json
#: data/mods/innawood/npcs/Backgrounds/codger.json
msgid "Fireflies.  Got it."
msgstr "Luciérnagas. Entiendo."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/codger.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Go on."
msgstr "Continua."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/codger.json
#: data/mods/innawood/npcs/Backgrounds/codger.json
msgid "How does this relate to what I asked you?"
msgstr "¿Cómo se relaciona esto con lo que te pregunté?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/codger.json
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_ALLY_TUTORIAL.json
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
#: data/json/npcs/militia/GM_Militia_Merchant.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
