msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I spent a lot of time rummaging for rhubarb and bits of vegetables in the "
"forest before I found the courage to start picking off some of those dead "
"monsters.  I guess I was getting desperate."
msgstr ""
"Pasé mucho tiempo rebuscando ruibarbo y restos de verduras en el bosque "
"antes de encontrar el valor para empezar a recoger algunos de esos monstruos "
"muertos. Supongo que me estaba desesperando."

