msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"There's nothing too special about me, I'm not sure why I survived.  I got "
"evacuated with a handful of others, but we were too late to make the second "
"trip to a FEMA center.  We got attacked by the dead… I was the only one to "
"make it out.  I never looked back."
msgstr ""
"No hay nada demasiado especial en mí, no estoy seguro de por qué he "
"sobrevivido. Fui evacuado junto a otros, pero llegamos demasiado tarde para "
"hacer el segundo viaje al centro FEMA. Fuimos atacados por los muertos... yo "
"fui el único que logró salir. Nunca miré atrás."

