#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_6.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well, I was at home when the cell phone alert went off and told me to get to "
"an evac shelter.  So I went to an evac shelter.  And then the shelter got "
"too crowded, and people were waiting to get taken to the refugee center, but "
"the buses never came.  You must already know about all that.  It turned into "
"panic, and then fighting.  I didn't stick around to see what happened next; "
"I headed into the woods with what tools I could snatch from the lockers.  I "
"went back a few days later, but the place was totally abandoned.  No idea "
"what happened to all those people."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, estaba en casa cuando sonó la alerta del móvil y me dijo que fuera a "
"un refugio de evacuación. Así que fui a un refugio de evacuación. El refugio "
"se llenó de gente, y la gente esperaba que la llevaran al centro de "
"refugiados, pero los autobuses nunca llegaron. Ya debes saber todo eso. Se "
"convirtió en pánico, y luego en lucha. No me quedé para ver qué pasaba "
"después; me dirigí al bosque con las herramientas que pude coger de las "
"taquillas. Volví unos días después, pero el lugar estaba totalmente "
"abandonado. No tengo ni idea de lo que le pasó a toda esa gente."

