"geared up and started puttin' them back down."
msgstr ""
"Nada especial antes del <the_cataclysm>. Cuando los muertos empezaron a "
"caminar, me equipé y empecé a matarlos de nuevo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
