#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_1.json
msgid ""
"What difference does it make?  Why waste brain cells on that?  I'm a finely "
"tuned killing machine.  Point me at the zombies and I'll do my thing.  I "
"don't want to get up in it, and find something that takes the magic out of "
"it."
msgstr ""
"¿Qué diferencia hay? ¿Por qué desperdiciar células cerebrales en eso? Soy "
"una máquina de matar bien afinada. Apúntame a los zombis y haré lo mío. No "
"quiero ponerme a ello y encontrar algo que le quite la magia."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_2.json
msgid ""
"Is all this just based on the goop from zombies being black and slimy, like "
"the black slimes?"
msgstr ""
"¿Todo esto se basa en que el pringue de los zombis es negro y viscoso, como "
"los légamos negros?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_2.json
msgid ""
"Oh, probably the same stuff everyone's thinking.  No special ideas.  Like, "
"maybe this is some kind of military superweapon gone wrong.  Or maybe the "
"world just is like this every so often, and that's what killed the "
"dinosaurs.  Who knows."
msgstr ""
"Oh, probablemente lo mismo que todo el mundo está pensando. Ninguna idea "
"especial. Como, que tal vez esto es una especie de superarma militar que "
"salió mal. O tal vez el mundo es así de vez en cuando, y eso es lo que mató "
"a los dinosaurios. Quién sabe."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_2.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Oh, you know.  Blah blah blah, had a job and a life, everyone died.  Boo "
"hoo.  I gotta be straight with you though: I honestly think I like this "
"better.  Fighting for survival every day?  I've never felt so alive.  I've "
"killed hundreds of those bastards.  Sooner or later one of them will take me "
"out, but I'll go down knowing I did something actually important."
msgstr ""
"Oh, ya sabes. Bla, bla, bla, bla, tenía un trabajo y una vida, todos "
"murieron. Boo hoo. Tengo que ser sincero contigo: honestamente creo que esto "
"me gusta más. ¿Luchando por la supervivencia todos los días? Nunca me he "
"sentido tan vivo. He matado a cientos de esos bastardos. Tarde o temprano "
"uno de ellos me eliminará, pero caeré sabiendo que hice algo realmente "
"importante."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
