msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Lord no.  I'll be fucked if I let a kid in a too-big uniform tell me what "
"the hell to do.  I had my Hummer loaded out and ready to go offroading, I "
"had a ton of gas, and I even had as many rifles as the border was gonna let "
"me bring over.  I didn't know what I was supposed to be running from, but I "
"sure as shit didn't run."
msgstr ""
"Señor, no. Estaría jodido si dejara que un chico con un uniforme demasiado "
"grande me dijera qué demonios hacer. Tenía mi Hummer cargado y listo para ir "
"todoterreno, tenía una tonelada de gasolina, e incluso tenía tantos rifles "
"como la frontera me permitía traer. No sabía de qué se suponía que tenía que "
"huir, pero de todas formas no funcionó."

