#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_1.json
msgid "Did you get evacuated?"
msgstr "¿Y te evacuaron?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hospital_1.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I saw it all pretty early, before it all really started.  I worked at the "
"hospital.  It started with a jump in the number of code whites - that's an "
"aggressive patient.  Wasn't my training so I didn't hear about it until "
"later… but rumors started flying about hyperaggressive delirious patients "
"that coded and seemed to die, then started attacking staff, and wouldn't "
"respond to anything we hit them with.  Then a friend of mine was killed by "
"one of them, and I realized it wasn't just a few weird reports.  I called in "
"sick the next day."
msgstr ""
"Lo vi todo con antelación, antes de que todo empezara de verdad. Trabajaba "
"en el hospital. Empezó con un salto en el número de códigos blancos - eso es "
"un paciente agresivo. No era mi especialidad, así que no me enteré hasta más "
"tarde... pero empezaron a circular rumores sobre pacientes delirantes "
"hiperagresivos que codificaban y parecían morir, para empezaron a "
"continuación a atacar al personal y no respondían a nada de lo que les "
"aplicábamos. Entonces un amigo mío fue asesinado por uno de ellos, y me di "
"cuenta de que no eran sólo unos pocos informes extraños. Al día siguiente, "
"llamé y dije que no podía ir porque estaba enfermo."

