#: data/mods/innawood/npcs/Backgrounds/lab_1.json
msgid "I don't see where this is going."
msgstr "No veo a dónde va esto."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/lab_1.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Listen, I know it's incredibly cheesy.  That's D&D for you.  Anyway, "
"something about the tone really got to me.  I knew it was important.  I "
"wasted a little time waffling, then decided to use my outstanding vacation "
"time and skip town for a while.  I packed for the end of the world.  Turns "
"out, I packed the right stuff."
msgstr ""
"Escucha, sé que es increíblemente cursi. Eso es D&D para ti. De todas "
"formas, algo en el tono me ha afecto. Sabía que era importante. Desperdicié "
"un poco de tiempo haciendo waffles, y luego decidí usar mi tiempo de "
"vacaciones pendientes y salir de la ciudad por un tiempo. Hice las maletas "
"para el fin del mundo. Resulta que empaqué las cosas correctas."

