#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_3.json
#: data/mods/innawood/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_3.json
msgid "How did you survive?"
msgstr "¿Cómo has sobrevivido?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_3.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I honestly don't know.  I wonder if some of the others would have come back "
"to their senses, given time.  I don't think I'm anything special.  Maybe a "
"lot of them did, and just weren't on the edge of the crowd at the time.  "
"I'll tell you, almost as soon as I came back to myself, I could see some of "
"the rioters looking at me like I was prey.  I didn't stick around to see "
"what would happen."
msgstr ""
"Sinceramente, no lo sé. Me pregunto si algunos de los otros habrías vuelto a "
"sus cabales, con tiempo. No creo que yo sea nada especial. Tal vez muchos de "
"ellos lo hicieron, y simplemente no estaban en el borde de la multitud en "
"ese momento. Te diré que, casi tan pronto como volví en mí, pude ver que "
"algunos de los manifestantes me miraban como si fuera una presa. No me quedé "
"para ver qué pasaba."

