#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/lost_partner_2.json
msgid "You said you lost someone."
msgstr "Dijiste que habías perdido a alguien."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/meteorologist.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Before <the_cataclysm>, I was just a regular meteorologist.  I worked for "
"the local weather station doing data analysis and stuff.  In general, "
"ordinary boredom.  In my free time I was studying electronics and radio "
"engineering, a bit for work but mostly just as a hobby.  When the riots got "
"serious, my neighborhood was looking pretty sketchy.  I gathered all my "
"things that I managed to carry with me and settled in a radio station that "
"seemed abandoned.  I lived there for a while, doing all sorts of nonsense, "
"until I met you.  I guess you know the rest."
msgstr ""
"Antes del <the_cataclysm>, era un simple meteorólogo. Trabajaba en la "
"estación local de clima haciendo análisis de datos y otras cosas. En "
"general, cosas aburridas. En mi tiempo libre, estudiaba electrónica e "
"ingeniería sobre la radio, un poco por el trabajo pero más que nada como "
"hobby. Cuando los disturbios se pusieron serios, mi vecindario se veía "
"bastante inseguro. Cogí todas las pertenencias que pude cargar y me acomodé "
"en la estación de radio que parecía abandonada. Viví ahí por un tiempo "
"haciendo toda clase de sinsentidos, hasta que te conocí. Supongo que ya "
"conoces el resto."

