#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/no_past_3.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well, not having a memory is weird as heck, but I'll be honest: I think it "
"might be better?  With what's going on, I bet you my memories weren't happy "
"ones.  Besides my driver's license, there were pictures of kids in my "
"wallet… not that that sparked any reaction from me.  I didn't see any kids "
"around.  Maybe losing my mind is a mercy.  Hell, maybe it's some kind of "
"psychotic break and my brain did this to itself.  To be honest with you I "
"think I'd rather focus on surviving, and not worry about it."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, no tener memoria es raro del carajo, pero seré honesto: ¿creo que "
"podría ser mejor?. Con lo que está pasando, apuesto a que mis recuerdos no "
"eran felices. Además en mi licencia de conducir, había fotos de niños en mi "
"billetera... no es que eso haya provocado alguna reacción por mi parte. No "
"vi ningún niño por aquí. Tal vez perder la cabeza es una misericordia. "
"Diablos, tal vez es una especie de brote psicótico y mi cerebro se lo hizo a "
"sí mismo. Para ser honesto contigo, creo que prefiero concentrarme en "
"sobrevivir, y no preocuparme por ello."

