#: data/mods/innawood/npcs/Backgrounds/no_past_4.json
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Listen.  I said it clearly, and if you keep picking at it I'm gonna get "
"mad.  Who I was is gone.  Dead.  I don't give a shit about your 'healthy', "
"don't <swear> ask again."
msgstr ""
"Escuchen. Lo dije claramente, y si sigues metiéndote con eso me voy a "
"enojar. Quien era yo se ha ido. Muerto. Me importa una mierda tu \"salud\", "
"no <swear> preguntes de nuevo."

