msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I wish.  That would have been a mercy.  She was letting out an awful, "
"choking scream, and her body was shredding itself apart.  Mushrooms were "
"busting out of every part of her.  I… I ran.  Now I wish that I'd put her "
"out of her misery, but going back there now would be suicide."
msgstr ""
"Ojalá. Eso habría sido mejor. Ella estaba soltando un horrible grito de "
"asfixia, y su cuerpo se estaba destrozando a sí mismo. Los hongos estaban "
"saliendo de cada parte de ella. Yo... corrí. Ahora desearía haberla sacado "
"de su miseria, pero volver allí ahora sería un suicidio."

