#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"Let's get moving.  I feel like it's useless worrying who they are when "
"they're some of the only friends we've got…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Let's just keep moving.  We don't have time for this nonsense…"
msgstr "Sigamos moviéndonos. No tenemos tiempo para este sinsentido."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"Let's keep moving.  This is a topic for another day, when we've actually "
"found some answers…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Let's not dwell on it.  I'm ready to get a move on…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"Maybe the explanation is more scientific.  Zombies and flesh-eating monsters "
"only come from supervillains and gods in fiction."
msgstr ""
"Puede que la explicación sea algo mas científico. Zombis y monstruos come "
"carne solo salen de la ficción de supervillanos y dioses."

#. ~ Description of mission "Check out that LMOE shelter"
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Maybe there's something left in that LMOE shelter you heard about."
msgstr ""
"Tal vez haya quedado algo en el refugio LMOE del que escuchaste hablar."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"Maybe.  I guess multiple things could be possible.  You really don't think "
"that there's someone or something behind this?  Someone who flew a little "
"too close to the sun?  Poked the beast?"
msgstr ""
"Quizás. Supongo que muchas cosas podrían ser posibles. ¿De verdad no crees "
"que hay alguien o algo detrás de esto? ¿Alguien que voló un poco demasiado "
"cerca del sol? ¿Que molestó a la bestia?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "My… what do you mean?  How would YOU know what the sign says?"
msgstr ""
"Madre mía... ¿que quieres decir? Como que TU no sabías lo que significaban "
"las señales?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"No, I barely got two miles.  I crashed into some kind of hell-spawn bio-"
"weapon, a crazy screeching <monster> made of arms and legs and heads from "
"all sorts of creatures, humans too.  I think I killed it, but I know for "
"sure I killed the truck.  Grabbed my duffel bag and ran, after putting a "
"couple bullets into it for good measure.  I hope I never see something like "
"that again."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
