#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "No, you're right!  I'm sorry for intruding!"
msgstr "¡No, si tienes razón! ¡Perdona por entrometerme!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Nope, that's it.  Got the idea for the door from a book on medieval castles, "
"in case you were wondering.  But instead of a counterweight holding a "
"drawbridge up, I just ram a hex key in a hole."
msgstr ""
"No, eso es todo. La idea de la puerta la saqué de un libro sobre castillos "
"medievales, si te preguntabas eso. Pero en lugar de un contrapeso que "
"sostiene el puente levadizo levantado, le mandé una llave octogonal en un "
"agujero."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
