#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Our conference was at a retreat by a lake.  We all got the emergency "
"broadcast on our cells, but I was the only one to read between the lines and "
"see it for what it was: large scale bio-terrorism.  I wasn't about to stay "
"and find out who of my coworkers was a sleeper agent.  Although I'd bet "
"fifty bucks it was Lee.  Anyway, I stole the coordinator's pickup and headed "
"straight for my shelter."
msgstr ""
"Nuestra conferencia fue en un retiro junto a un lago. Todos recibimos la "
"transmisión de emergencia en nuestras móviles, pero yo fui el único que leyó "
"entre líneas y lo vio como lo que era: bio-terrorismo a gran escala. No iba "
"a quedarme para averiguar quién de mis compañeros de trabajo era un agente "
"durmiente. Aunque apostaría cincuenta dólares a que era Lee. De todos modos, "
"robé la camioneta del coordinador y me dirigí directamente a mi refugio."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
