#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "The wall thing is pretty nifty, I have to admit."
msgstr "Eso de la pared está bastante bueno, lo tengo que admitir."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"The whole front door had been blown off and everything had been looted.  "
"Nothing left.  It seemed like something major had happened, that's all."
msgstr ""
"La puerta frontal estaba destrozada y todo había sido saqueado. No quedaba "
"nada. Parecía que algo gordo había ocurrido, eso es todo."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"There was a bunch of notes about Chinese bio-weapons and this guy who worked "
"at an airport…  If you want to talk about it, we can."
msgstr ""
"Había un montón de notas sobre armas bioquímicas chinas y este chaval que "
"trabajaba en el aeropuerto... Si quieres hablar de ello, podemos."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"There was a dead guy inside.  It didn't take much to make that connection."
msgstr "Había una persona muerta dentro. No me llevo mucho sumar uno mas uno."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "They were talking a LOT in that time, that's for sure."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "This is the world now.  If I didn't take it, someone else would have."
msgstr "Así es el mundo ahora. Si no lo hubiera cogido, otro lo hubiera hecho."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"Those bad people are probably all dead now.  If bad things continue to "
"happen, it's just the nature of the universe.  Entropy and chaos are the "
"natural order of things."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"We should keep moving…  No sense dwelling on fate.  If those people are "
"right, then this is all we've got: survival."
msgstr ""
"Deberíamos seguir adelante... No tiene sentido lamentarse por el destino. Si "
"esas personas tienen razón, entonces esto es todo lo que nos queda: "
"sobrevivir."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"Well, I certainly wouldn't tell you.  The way you talk… the questions you "
"ask… they're extremely suspicious.  Why did you ask about the shelter "
"anyway?  What do you want from me?"
msgstr ""
"Bueno, la verdad es que no te lo diría. La manera en que hablas… las "
"preguntas que haces… son extremadamente sospechosas. ¿Por qué me preguntaste "
"por el refugio? ¿Qué pretende usted de mí?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"Well, I got inside one and found a computer with a bunch of… conspiracy "
"theory documents?  I'm not sure how to put it.  It seemed like whoever wrote "
"it wasn't doing well."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, conseguí entrar en uno y encontré un ordenador con un montón de... "
"¿documentos de teorías de la conspiración? No se como decirlo. Parecía que "
"quien lo escribió no estaba muy cuerdo."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"Well, let's get going.  I'm trying to stick it to 'The Man' while we've "
"still got a chance."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, vamos a empezar. Estoy tratando de enfrentarme a 'El Hombre' mientras "
"todavía tengamos una oportunidad."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well, that's one way to say 'fuck you'!  How…  Why…  I was still trying to "
"get back there, surviving and struggling just like you!  How would you feel "
"if I came and stole all YOUR stuff right when you needed it most?!"
msgstr ""
"¡Bueno, eso es una manera de decir \"que te den\"! Como... Porque... ¡Estaba "
"intentando volver allí, sobreviviendo y sufriendo como tu! ¡¿Como te "
"sentirías si yo viniera y te robara todo lo que TU tienes cuando mas lo "
"necesitas?!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
