"get back there, surviving and struggling just like you!  How would you feel "
"if I came and stole all YOUR stuff right when you needed it most?!"
msgstr ""
"¡Bueno, eso es una manera de decir \"que te den\"! Como... Porque... ¡Estaba "
"intentando volver allí, sobreviviendo y sufriendo como tu! ¡¿Como te "
"sentirías si yo viniera y te robara todo lo que TU tienes cuando mas lo "
"necesitas?!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"Well…  I did.  And that's just how it goes.  It wasn't even that difficult."
msgstr ""
"Bueno... Pues lo hice. Y así es como funcionan las cosas. No fue tan difícil."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"Well… I'm actually a government agent sent to assassinate you.  I just had "
"to find out the location of your secret stash before I took you out!"
msgstr ""
"Bueno… en realidad soy un agente secreto del gobierno que enviaron para "
"asesinarte. ¡Solo quería saber el lugar de tu escondite secreto antes de "
"eliminarte!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#: data/mods/innawood/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "What about your shelter?"
msgstr "¿Y qué pasó con tu refugio?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "What do you mean?  Who is 'they'?"
msgstr "¿Qué quiere decir? ¿Quienes son \"ellos\"?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"What do you think happened?  You must have some interesting theories on why "
"everything went to shit."
msgstr ""
"¿Que crees que paso aquí? Debes tener interesantes teorías de porque todo se "
"fue al carajo."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
#: data/mods/innawood/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "What happened to you?"
msgstr "¿Qué te ha pasado?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"What, like some secret Batcave?  Pull back the curtain and it turns out I'm "
"the communist <name_b> who brewed up a demon bio-weapon in their basement?  "
"I just gave you food, all the tools in my workshop, and the safest hole in "
"the ground in the county.  If I've got any secrets left, they're mine to "
"keep."
msgstr ""
"¿Qué? ¿Cómo una batcueva secreta? ¿Corres la cortina y resulta que soy el "
"comunista de <name_b> que creo una bioarma demoníaca en su sótano? Te acabo "
"de dar comida, todas las herramientas de mi taller y el agujero más seguro "
"en todo el condado. Si me queda algún secreto, me lo voy a quedar para mí."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
