msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"You're not really a good liar.  I built that thing like a fortress.  No one "
"would just break into it."
msgstr ""
"No eres muy buen mentiroso. Construí esa cosa como una fortaleza. Nadie "
"podría entrar sin mas."

