msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I heard gunshots, even from down in lockup.  Didn't hear much screaming or "
"anything.  That was my first clue something was up.  Food stopped showing "
"up, next.  Then, the lights went out.  I was down there for maybe hours, "
"maybe days, when finally a flashlight in the bars blinded me.  It was a "
"guard.  He let me out, filled me in on what was going on.  I wanted to think "
"he was crazy, but something in his eyes… I believed him."
msgstr ""
"Escuché disparos, incluso desde abajo, en el calabozo. No oí muchos gritos "
"ni nada. Esa fue mi primera pista de que algo estaba pasando. La comida dejó "
"de aparecer, la siguiente. Luego, las luces se apagaron. Estuve allí abajo "
"tal vez horas, tal vez días, cuando finalmente una linterna en los barrotes "
"me cegó. Era un guardia. Me dejó salir, me informó de lo que estaba pasando. "
"Quería pensar que estaba loco, pero algo en sus ojos... le creí."

