"pretty ragged.  Lots of car crashes, uh, violence, which is weird thinking "
"about it now.  The hospitals were filling up, but not 'cause of a pandemic, "
"not like COVID anyway.  Everybody was just running wild, beating on each "
"other, shootouts.  The hospital looked like Fallujah or something, everyone "
"all banged up, bleeding out in the waiting rooms.  Then there wasn't any "
"more room, and they didn't have time to start burying dead people before "
"they started getting back up…  So the army rolled in with like, jeeps and a "
"tank and everything.  Took over the whole operation.  A lot more people died."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rescue_pilot_1.json
msgid "What about when things went bad?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rescue_pilot_1.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Yeah, for sure.  They mostly weren't any better.  It was just like…I thought "
"I knew what hate was, you know?  But it was demonic, how people started "
"acting, and I don't say that lightly.  I just wish we'd realized sooner that "
"it wasn't them, it was…I don't know, something that got into everybody, "
"brought all the zombies back to life.  Demonic, like I said."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
