#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_2.json
#: data/mods/innawood/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_2.json
msgid "I'm sorry about Buck.  <done_conversation_section>"
msgstr "Siento lo de Buck. <done_conversation_section>"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_2.json
#: data/mods/innawood/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_2.json
msgid "I'm sorry about Buck.  <end_talking>"
msgstr "Siento lo de Buck. <end_talking>"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_2.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"We got to my buddy's ranch, but the <swear> g-men had been there first.  It "
"was all boarded up and there was a police barricade out front.  One of those "
"<swear> turrets… <swear> shot Buck.  Almost got me too.  I managed to get my "
"pup… get him outta there, that… it wasn't easy, had to use a police car door "
"as a shield, had to kill a cop-zombie first.  And then, well, while I was "
"still cryin', Buck came back.  I had to… <swear!>.  I… I can't say it.  You "
"know."
msgstr ""
"Llegamos al rancho de mi amigo, pero los <swear> hombres del gobierno habían "
"llegado primero. Todo estaba cerrado con tablas y había una barricada "
"policial en el frente. Una de esas <swear>torretas... <swear> disparó a "
"Buck. Casi me mata a mí también. Me las arreglé para sacar a mi cachorro... "
"sacarlo de allí, eso... no fue fácil, tuve que usar la puerta de un coche de "
"policía como escudo y matar a un policía-zombi primero. Y bueno, mientras yo "
"seguía llorando, Buck regresó. Tuve que ... <swear! >. Yo... no puedo "
"decirlo. Ya sabes."

