msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"No dice.  You asked me to come along.  This is what you get.  If you don't "
"like it, I'll take my fee and go back to the center.  Ain't hard to find "
"contracts."
msgstr ""
"No hay nada que hacer. Me pediste que viniera. Esto es lo que obtienes. Si "
"no te gusta, cobraré mis honorarios y volveré al centro. No es difícil "
"encontrar contratos."

