msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"  Unfortunately, when I arrived here, I forgot to tie my boat, and during "
"yesterday's storm it was carried off somewhere.  Well, you don't always have "
"to be lucky, right?"
msgstr ""
" Por desgracia, cuando llegué aquí, me olvidé de atar mi barco, y la "
"tormenta de ayer se lo llevó a alguna parte. Bueno, no siempre tienes "
"suerte, ¿verdad?"

