msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I heard it's bad in the cities, back when the radio was still working.  Some "
"of those things came through here.  I want to stay out in the country if I "
"can stay safe."
msgstr ""
"He oído que estan mal las ciudades, cuando la radio aún funcionaba. Algunas "
"de esas cosas pasaron por aquí. Quiero quedarme en el campo si puedo estar a "
"salvo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
