#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid "What'd you do?"
msgstr "¿Qué has hecho?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Yeah, it was awhile before it was quiet again.  I heard all kinds of sounds: "
"explosions, jets flying by, helicopters, screaming, and rapid gunfire.  I "
"swear I even heard what sounded like a freaking tank drive by at one time!  "
"I've been hiding here since."
msgstr ""
"Sí, pasó un tiempo antes de que volviera a estar tranquilo. Escuché todo "
"tipo de sonidos: explosiones, cazas volando, helicópteros, gritos y disparos "
"rápidos. ¡Juro que incluso oí lo que sonó como un maldito tanque pasando en "
"un momento! Me he estado escondiendo aquí desde entonces."

