msgid "Alright…"
msgstr "Está bien..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/bunker_shop/TALK_BUNKER_MERCHANT.json
msgid "Did you build this place?"
msgstr "¿Construiste este lugar?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/bunker_shop/TALK_BUNKER_MERCHANT.json
msgid "Heya, scav."
msgstr "Hola, carroñero."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/bunker_shop/TALK_BUNKER_MERCHANT.json
msgid "Hmm…"
msgstr "Hmm..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/bunker_shop/TALK_BUNKER_MERCHANT.json
msgid "I need some supplies."
msgstr "Necesito algunos recursos."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring Boris a circular saw."
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring Boris his son's lost writing."
#: data/json/npcs/bunker_shop/TALK_BUNKER_MERCHANT.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/dialog_statue.json
msgid "I see…"
msgstr "Ya veo..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/bunker_shop/TALK_BUNKER_MERCHANT.json
msgid ""
"I suppose I am.  Scavs like you need supplies, right?  And I could always "
"use more money."
msgstr ""
"Supongo que sí. Los carroñeros como tú necesitan provisiones, ¿verdad? Y "
"siempre me vendría bien más dinero."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/bunker_shop/TALK_BUNKER_MERCHANT.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Just a scav who got lucky.  Now I'm content to sit around here on my pile of "
"treasure.  I'm more than willing to trade if you've got the cash."
msgstr ""
"Sólo un carroñero que tuvo suerte. Ahora me contento con sentarme aquí en mi "
"pila de tesoros. Estoy más que dispuesto a negociar si tienes el dinero."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
