#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/bunker_shop/TALK_BUNKER_MERCHANT.json
msgid "Need help with anything?"
msgstr "¿Necesitas ayuda con algo?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/bunker_shop/TALK_BUNKER_MERCHANT.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"No, no… well, maybe a little.  It was just as wrecked down here as it is up "
"top when I found it, wasn't too hard to fix up.  You're welcome to stay in "
"the spare room awhile, just don't hog it.  You're not the only scav out "
"there."
msgstr ""
"No, no... Bueno, tal vez un poco. Estaba tan destrozado aquí abajo como "
"arriba cuando lo encontré, no fue muy difícil de arreglar. Puedes quedarte "
"en el cuarto de invitados un rato, pero no lo acapares. No eres el único "
"carroñero ahí fuera."

