#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"EMPLOYEE NAME: Joseph Shert\n"
" EMPLOYEE TITLE: Receptionist\n"
" REVIEW DATE: 06-xx-xxxx\n"
" REVIEW BY: Bryan Rooters, Reception Manager\n"
"\n"
" Joseph is always on time for work and gets along well with coworkers.  "
"However, he has trouble taking direction and often speaks out against his "
"superiors [See attached email: Housekeeping].\n"
" Joe speaks a big game but unfortunately does not perform to the Shady Hills "
"standard.\n"
" As our standard is extremely important for the health and wellbeing of our "
"residents, I have no choice but to recommend termination.\n"
"\n"
" Signed,\n"
" Bryan Rooters\n"
" Reception Manager"
msgstr ""
"NOMBRE EMPLEADO: Joseph Shert\n"
" OCUPACIÓN: Recepcionista\n"
" FECHA REVISIÓN: 06-xx-xxxx\n"
" HECHA POR: Bryan Rooters, Gerente de Recepción\n"
"\n"
" Joseph siempre llega a tiempo al trabajo y se lleva bien con los "
"compañeros. Sin embargo, tiene problemas recibiendo instrucciones y a menudo "
"habla mal de sus superiores [Ver correo adjunto: Servicio de Limpieza].\n"
" Joe habla como si supiera mucho pero lamentablemente no llega a cumplir con "
"el estándar de Shady Hills.\n"
" Ya que nuestro estándar es extremadamente importante para la salud y el "
"bienestar de nuestros residentes, no me queda otra opción que recomendar la "
"culminación del contrato.\n"
"\n"
" Firmado,\n"
" Bryan Rooters\n"
"Gerente de Recepción"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Amanda Hugentskis, Receptionist\n"
" TO: Bryan Rooters, Reception Manager\n"
" RE: Housekeeping\n"
"\n"
" Seriously?  This is ridiculous.  This place was a mess even with "
"housekeeping personnel.\n"
" I quit."
msgstr ""
"DE: Amanda Hugentskis, Recepcionista\n"
" PARA: Bryan Rooters, Gerente de Recepción\n"
" RE: Servicio de Limpieza\n"
"\n"
" ¿En serio? Es ridículo, Este lugar era un desastre incluso con el personal "
"de limpieza.\n"
" Renuncio."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"FROM: Big Science Supply Depot\n"
" TO: Kristi Gordee, SVP Operations\n"
" RE: Kristi, Act Now and Save!\n"
"\n"
" Hi KRISTI GORDEE,\n"
"\n"
" We appreciate you choosing BIG SCIENCE SUPPLY DEPOT for all your laboratory "
"needs!  Based on your purchase history, might we recommend some of the below "
"items?\n"
" Now on sale for 15% off!\n"
"\n"
" * Book: Advanced Physical Chemistry\n"
" * 1,000pc Medical Gauze\n"
" * Jumbo Chemistry Kit\n"
"\n"
" Thank you for shopping BIG SCIENCE SUPPLY DEPOT!\n"
"\n"
" Please do not reply to this message as your reply will be routed to an "
"unmonitored inbox.\n"
" Questions?  Contact customer service xxx-xxx-xxxx."
msgstr ""
"DE: Suministros Big Science\n"
" PARA: Kristi Gordee, SVP de Operaciones\n"
" RE: Kristi, Actuá Ahora y Ahorrá!\n"
"\n"
" Buenas tardes, KRISTI GORDEE,\n"
"\n"
" ¡Agradecemos que haya elegido SUMINISTROS BIG SCIENCE para todas las "
"necesidades de su laboratorio! Basándonos en su historial de pedidos, "
"queremos recomendarle algunos elementos.\n"
" ¡Ahora con un 15% de descuento!\n"
"\n"
" * Libro: Físico-química Avanzada\n"
"* 1,000pc Gasa Médica\n"
"* Equipo de química Jumbo\n"
"\n"
" ¡Gracias por confiar en SUMINISTROS SUPPLY DEPOT!\n"
"\n"
" Por favor, no responda este mensaje ya que su respuesta será enviada a una "
"casilla no monitoreada.\n"
" ¿Preguntas? Contacte nuestro servicio al consumidor al xxx-xxx-xxxx."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Big Science Supply Depot\n"
" TO: Kristi Gordee, SVP Operations\n"
" RE: Thank you for your order\n"
"\n"
" Hi KRISTI GORDEE,\n"
"\n"
" We have received your order and will begin processing it immediately.\n"
" 1x Jet Injector, RX12 by Rivtech\n"
"\n"
" You will receive an additional email when your order has shipped.\n"
" Thank you for shopping BIG SCIENCE SUPPLY DEPOT!\n"
"\n"
" Please do not reply to this message as your reply will be routed to an "
"unmonitored inbox.\n"
" Questions?  Contact customer service xxx-xxx-xxxx."
msgstr ""
"DE: Suministros Big Science\n"
" PARA: Kristi Gordee, SVP de Operaciones\n"
" RE: Gracias por su pedido\n"
"\n"
" Buenas tardes, KRISTI GORDEE,\n"
"\n"
" Hemos recibido su pedido y será procesado inmediatamente.\n"
" 1x Inyector de Presión, RX12 de Rivtech\n"
"\n"
" Recibirá un correo adicional cuando su orden haya sido despachada.\n"
" ¡Gracias por confiar en SUMINISTROS SUPPLY DEPOT!\n"
"\n"
" Por favor, no responda este mensaje ya que su respuesta será enviada a una "
"casilla no monitoreada.\n"
" ¿Preguntas? Contacte nuestro servicio al consumidor al xxx-xxx-xxxx."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Bryan Rooters, Reception Manager\n"
" TO: Joe Shert, Receptionist\n"
" RE: Performance Eval\n"
"\n"
" Hi Joe.\n"
" Your 90-day performance evaluation is due.  Please plan to meet with me in "
"my office on Tuesday.\n"
" Thanks."
msgstr ""
"DE: Bryan Rooters, Gerente de Recepción\n"
" PARA: Joe Shert, Recepcionista\n"
" RE: Eval de Desempeño\n"
"\n"
" Hola Joe.\n"
" Tu evaluación de desempeño de los 90 días concluyó. Por favor, ven a mi "
"oficina el martes.\n"
" Gracias."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Bryan Rooters, Reception Manager\n"
" TO: Receptionists\n"
" RE: Housekeeping\n"
"\n"
" Hi team,\n"
" Please be aware that the decision has been made to let go some of the "
"housekeeping staff.\n"
" This decision was made by management to ensure that our operation can run "
"as smoothly and efficiently as possible by passing on these cost savings to "
"the residents.\n"
" To keep up with our high standards of elder care, I will be assigning some "
"additional small tasks to you in the near future.\n"
" As you know, here at Shady Hills we value each and every employee and see "
"this as an excellent opportunity to grow, learn, and provide for the Shady "
"Hills family.\n"
" Please let me know if you have any questions.\n"
" Thanks."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Connie Malackey, Receptionist\n"
" TO: Joe Shert, Receptionist\n"
" RE: Ghosts!?\n"
"\n"
" Joe!  After we heard those weird noises the other night, I talked to some "
"of the nurses.\n"
" We aren't the only ones!  Everyone has heard weird noises coming from the "
"walls.\n"
" Do you think this place is haunted!?"
msgstr ""
"DE: Connie Malackey, Recepcionista\n"
" PARA: Joe Shert, Recepcionista\n"
" RE: Fantasmas!?\n"
"\n"
" ¡Joe! Cuando escuchamos esos ruidos raros la otra noche hablé con algunas "
"de las enfermeras.\n"
" ¡No somos los únicos! Todos escucharon ruidos raros saliendo de las "
"paredes.\n"
" ¡¿A ver si este lugar está embrujado!?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Connie Malackey, Receptionist\n"
" TO: Joe Shert, Receptionist\n"
" RE: Mrs.  Palmero\n"
"\n"
" Hi Joe.\n"
" So - you know how Mrs.  Palmero has been acting weird and constantly "
"talking about baking cookies?\n"
" I was talking to one of the nurses and they said that Mrs.  Palmero was "
"prescribed this new medicine?\n"
" It's this weird powder stuff.  Apparently the nurses aren't even qualified "
"to give it to her - she needs a special doctor to come in every day!\n"
" Crazy, right?  I wish all I had to worry about was baking cookies…"
msgstr ""
"DE: Connie Malackey, Recepcionista\n"
" PARA: Joe Shert, Recepcionista\n"
" RE: Sra. Palmero\n"
"\n"
" Hola Joe.\n"
" Viste que la sra. Palmero se estuvo comportando de manera extraña y hablaba "
"constantemente de cocinar ¿galletitas?\n"
" Estaba hablando con una de las enfermeras y me dijo que a la sra. Palmero "
"le prescribieron un medicamento ¿nuevo?\n"
" Es un poco raro. Aparentemente, las enfermeras no están calificadas para "
"dárselo - ¡necesita que un médico especialista venga todos los días!\n"
" ¿Raro, no? Espero que las galletitas sean lo único que tenga que "
"preocuparme…"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Joe Shert, Receptionist\n"
" TO: Bryan Rooters, Reception Manager\n"
" RE: Housekeeping\n"
"\n"
" Hi Mr. Rooters, with all due respect I feel that I may have been assigned "
"more of these tasks than the other Receptionists.\n"
" Jim said he hasn't had to do any cleaning in two weeks, yet I have been on "
"cleaning duty 3 times.\n"
" To be clear, I certainly do not mind the extra work!  I just want to ensure "
"you're aware in case there is a computer glitch.\n"
" Thank you and have a great day!"
msgstr ""
"DE: Joe Shert, Recepcionista\n"
" PARA: Bryan Rooters, Gerente de Recepción\n"
" RE: Servicio de Limpieza\n"
"\n"
" Hola, Sr. Rooters, con respeto quiero decirle que siento que me han "
"asignado más de estas tareas que al resto de los recepcionistas.\n"
" Jim dijo que no tuvo que hacer ninguna tarea de limpieza en dos semanas, y "
"sin embargo yo he estado en turno de limpieza 3 veces.\n"
" Para ser claro, ¡no me molesta el trabajo extra! Solo quiero asegurarme que "
"usted está al tanto por si hay algún error con el ordenador.\n"
" ¡Gracias y que tenga un buen día!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Joe Shert, Receptionist\n"
" TO: Bryan Rooters, Reception Manager\n"
" RE: Performance Evaluation\n"
"\n"
" Hi Mr. Rooters, I look forward to seeing you Tuesday for my evaluation.  "
"I've been working really hard to show that I am Shady Hills material!"
msgstr ""
"DE: Joe Shert, Recepcionista\n"
" PARA: Bryan Rooters, Gerente de Recepción\n"
" RE: Evaluación de Desempeño\n"
"\n"
" Hola, Sr. Rooters, espero con ganas verlo el martes para mi evaluación. ¡He "
"estado trabajando mucho para demostrar que puedo trabajar en Shady Hills!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Kristi Gordee, SVP Operations\n"
" TO: Bryan Rooters, Reception Manager\n"
" RE: Connie Malackey\n"
"\n"
" Bryan,\n"
" Connie has been asking a lot of weird questions about 'Ghosts' and other "
"such nonsense.\n"
" This could look bad for us.  To make it worse, she is hanging out with Joe "
"Shert a lot.\n"
" Shut it down."
msgstr ""
"DE: Kristi Gordee, SVP de Operaciones\n"
" PARA: Bryan Rooters, Gerente de Recepción\n"
" RE: Connie Malackey\n"
"\n"
" Bryan,\n"
" Connie estuvo preguntando muchas cosas raras acerca de 'Fantasmas' y otros "
"sinsentidos.\n"
" Esto podría hacernos quedar mal. Y para hacerlo peor, pasa mucho tiempo con "
"Joe Shert.\n"
" Termina con esto."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Kristi Gordee, SVP Operations\n"
" TO: Bryan Rooters, Reception Manager\n"
" RE: Do Your Job\n"
"\n"
" Bryan,\n"
" Do you not conduct thorough background checks and reviews on new hires?  "
"Joe is related to the Mayor of Springfield.  His 90 day New Employee "
"evaluation is coming up.  Do your job."
msgstr ""
"DE: Kristi Gordee, SVP de Operaciones\n"
" PARA: Bryan Rooters, Gerente de Recepción\n"
" RE: Hacé Tu Trabajo\n"
"\n"
" Bryan,\n"
" ¿No chequeaste el historial y las revisiones de las nuevas contrataciones? "
"Joe es pariente del intendente de Springfield. Se acerca su evaluación de 90 "
"días de Empleado Nuevo. Haz tu trabajo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Kristi Gordee, SVP Operations\n"
" TO: Peter St. Travers, SVP Research & Development\n"
" RE: Budget\n"
"\n"
" Peter,\n"
" You need to find a way to reverse what you did ASAP.\n"
" What exactly do you expect me to do to get us out of this?\n"
" The police are investigating us now for foul play."
msgstr ""
"DE: Kristi Gordee, SVP de Operaciones\n"
" PARA: Peter St. Travers, SVP de Investigación y Desarrollo\n"
" RE: Presupuesto\n"
"\n"
" Peter,\n"
" Tienes que encontrar una manera de revertir lo que hiciste lo antes "
"posible.\n"
" ¿Qué esperas que haga yo para sacarnos es esto?\n"
" La policía nos está investigando buscando algo raro."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Kristi Gordee, SVP Operations\n"
" TO: Peter St. Travers, SVP Research & Development\n"
" RE: Shepherds\n"
"\n"
" Peter,\n"
" Leah Shepherds keeps sending me emails, and we just received the papers for "
"yet another lawsuit.\n"
" I don't know what you're thinking but this one is going to be really "
"difficult and could cost us.\n"
" The Board is going to be furious."
msgstr ""
"DE: Kristi Gordee, SVP de Operaciones\n"
" Para: Peter St. Travers, SVP de Investigación y Desarrollo\n"
" RE: Shepherds\n"
"\n"
" Peter,\n"
" Leah Shepherds me sigue mandando correos y acabamos de recibir los papeles "
"de otra demanda judicial.\n"
" No sé qué piensas acerca de esto pero esta va a ser muy difícil y nos puede "
"llegar a costar mucho.\n"
" La junta se va a poner furiosa."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Leah Shepherds\n"
" TO: Kristi Gordee, SVP Operations\n"
" RE: I am going to sue you\n"
"\n"
" I don't know what kind of sick game your sham of a home is playing, but I "
"am getting to the bottom of it.\n"
" I've hired a lawyer and we are going to sue you.\n"
" I should never have left grandpa in your care.\n"
" How does a PERSON go missing from a NURSING HOME!?  I have pictures of how "
"dirty and disgusting that place is.\n"
" You should be ashamed!"
msgstr ""
"DE: Leah Shepherds\n"
" PARA: Kristi Gordee, SVP de Operaciones\n"
" RE: Los voy a demandar\n"
"\n"
" No sé qué clase de juego sucio están jugando en ese hogar vergonzoso pero "
"voy a llegar hasta el fondo del tema.\n"
" Contraté un abogado y los vamos a demandar.\n"
" Nunca debería haber dejado a mi abuelo al cuidado de ustedes.\n"
" ¿¡Cómo se puede perder una PERSONA en una HOGAR DE ANCIANOS!? Tengo fotos "
"de lo sucio y desagradable que es ese lugar.\n"
" ¡Deberían tener vergüenza!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Peter St. Travers, SVP Research & Development\n"
" TO: Kristi Gordee, SVP Operations\n"
" RE: Budget\n"
"\n"
" Hi KRISTI GORDEE,\n"
"\n"
" Kristi, please see attached for my budget proposal.\n"
" We need more jet injectors.\n"
"  I am on the verge of a breakthrough - you need to run interference on this "
"Shepherds issue.\n"
" - Peter"
msgstr ""
"DE: Peter St. Travers, SVP de Investigación y Desarrollo\n"
" PARA: Kristi Gordee, SVP de Operaciones\n"
" RE: Presupuesto\n"
"\n"
" Buenos días, KRISTI GORDEE,\n"
"\n"
" Kristi, por favor revisa nuestra propuesta adjunta de presupuesto.\n"
" Necesitamos más inyectores de presión.\n"
" Estoy a punto de hacer un descubrimiento - tienes que realizar una "
"interferencia en eso de los Shepherds.\n"
" - Peter"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Unknown Sender\n"
" TO: Peter St. Travers, SVP Research & Development\n"
" RE: Results\n"
"\n"
" Looking forward to your report at the next meeting.\n"
" I put a lot on the line for you, don't disappoint me, Peter.\n"
" Get me results."
msgstr ""
"DE: Desconocido\n"
" PARA: Peter St. Travers, SVP de Investigación y Desarrollo\n"
" RE: Resultados\n"
"\n"
" Espero con ansias tu reporte en la próxima reunión.\n"
" Arriesgué mucho por ti, no me decepciones, Peter.\n"
" Quiero resultados."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Vincent Fuels, Researcher\n"
" TO: Peter St. Travers, SVP Research & Development\n"
" RE: This is bad!\n"
"\n"
" While you were gone last night, the old man started to wake up and become "
"cranky.\n"
" We had to give him another dose of that elephant tranquilizer!\n"
" I think he might actually be strong enough to break out of his cell now.\n"
" We really need to do something before he kills someone!\n"
" I know this experiment meant a lot to you, but it isn't worth the risk "
"anymore!"
msgstr ""
"DE: Vincent Fuels, Investigador\n"
" TO: Peter St. Travers, SVP de Investigación y Desarrollo\n"
" RE: Estamos complicados!\n"
"\n"
" Cuando saliste anoche, el viejo empezó a despertarse y se puso de mal "
"humor.\n"
" ¡Le tuvimos que dar otra dosis de tranquilizante de elefantes!\n"
" Creo que en realidad es lo suficientemente fuerte como para escaparse de su "
"celda ahora.\n"
" ¡Tenemos que hacer algo antes de que mate a alguien!\n"
" ¡Ya sé que este experimento significa mucho para ti pero ya no vale la pena "
"el riesgo!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Will Higgins, VP Information Technology\n"
" TO: Peter St. Travers, SVP Research & Development\n"
" RE: Security\n"
"\n"
" Hello sir,\n"
" I understand your concerns about security.  Rest assured, myself and my "
"team take this very seriously.  I assure you that high-level encryption "
"protects all of our systems.\n"
" Nobody will be able to access any of our PCs without use of the owner's "
"fingerprint authentication, even in the event that the main power supply is "
"cut.\n"
" Nobody unauthorized will ever be able to read our emails or documents."
msgstr ""
"DE: Will Higgins, VP Información Tecnológica\n"
" PARA: Peter St. Travers, SVP de Investigación y Desarrollo\n"
" RE: Seguridad\n"
"\n"
" Buenos días, señor,\n"
" Entiendo sus preocupaciones por la seguridad. Quédese tranquilo, mi equipo "
"y yo tomamos esto de una manera muy seria. Le aseguro que el cifrado de alto "
"nivel protege todos nuestros sistemas.\n"
" Nadie podrá acceder a ninguno de nuestros PC sin utilizar la autenticación "
"por huella digital, incluso llegado el caso de que el sistema eléctrico esté "
"cortado.\n"
" Nadie que no esté autorizado podrá nunca leer nuestros correos ni "
"documentos."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid "JAMES NEONDORTHALL; RECEPTIONIST"
msgstr "JAMES NEONDORTHALL; RECEPCIONISTA"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid "JOSEPH SHERT; RECEPTIONIST"
msgstr "JOSEPH SHERT; RECEPCIONISTA"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid "Mord R. Yuni-Korne"
msgstr "Mord R. Yuni-Korne"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid "New Assignments [1]"
msgstr "Nuevas Tareas [1]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid "Nina Palmero"
msgstr "Nina Palmero"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"PROJECT CODE NAME: 'Big Pappy'\n"
" PROJECT RESIDENT: Nina Palmero\n"
" PROJECT STATUS: Active\n"
" PROJECT START DATE: xx-xx-xxxx\n"
"\n"
" Entry Log 1: Started subject on assigned dosage.  Will monitor over 7 "
"days.\n"
" Entry Log 2: Subject added to growing list of recent residents that are "
"rejecting the dosage due to an unknown cause.  Attempting supplement of "
"benzoylmethylecgonine to study possible results.  Will monitor over 7 days.  "
"Maintaining subject in general population.\n"
" Entry Log 3: Subject appears to have become obsessed with baked goods, "
"unknown reason."
msgstr ""
"NOMBRE CÓDIGO DE PROYECTO: 'Gran Papi'\n"
" RESIDENTE: Nina Palmero\n"
" ESTADO: Active\n"
" FECHA DE INICIO: xx-xx-xxxx\n"
"\n"
" Registro 1: Se inició al sujeto con la dosis asignada. Se monitoreará por 7 "
"días.\n"
" Registro 2: Sujeto agregado a la lista de residentes recientes que rechazan "
"la dosis debido a alguna causa desconocida. Se intenta suplementar "
"benzoilmetilecgonina para estudiar los posibles resultados. Se monitoreará "
"por 7 días. Se mantiene al sujeto entre los habitantes generales.\n"
" Registro 3: El sujeto parece haberse vuelto obsesionado con los alimentos "
"horneados, por razón desconocida."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"PROJECT CODE NAME: 'Big Pappy'\n"
" PROJECT RESIDENT: Pablo Shepherds\n"
" PROJECT STATUS: Active\n"
" PROJECT START DATE: xx-xx-xxxx\n"
"\n"
" Entry Log 1: Started subject on assigned dosage.  Will monitor over 7 "
"days.\n"
" Entry Log 2: Subject within expected parameters.  Subject will remain in "
"general population.\n"
" Entry Log 3: Subject within expected parameters.  Subject will remain in "
"general population.\n"
" Entry Log 4: Subject showing signs of severe dementia.  Unexpected result.  "
"Following removal protocol.  Moving patient to Secure room for 2 day "
"period.\n"
" Entry log 5: Subject stabilizing.  Attempting RA21E dosage.\n"
" Entry Log 6: Subject within expected parameters.  Returning to general "
"population.\n"
" Entry Log 7: Subject within expected parameters.  Attempting Mutagenic "
"Serum dose.  Following removal protocol.  Moving patient to Secure room for "
"2 day period.\n"
" Entry Log 8: Subject has shown tremendous increase in girth and power.  "
"Reduction in cognitive decline.  Symptoms of dementia nearly eliminated.\n"
" Entry Log 9: Subject becoming belligerent.  Unknown cause.  Purifier Serum "
"failing.  Initiated sedation protocol.  15mg Carfentanil required.  "
"Initiating Failsafe protocol; subject cannot be returned to general "
"population.\n"
" Entry Log 10: Subject remains sedated.  Maintaining Failsafe protocol.  "
"Attempting purifier serum trial."
msgstr ""
"NOMBRE CÓDIGO DE PROYECTO: 'Gran Papi'\n"
" RESIDENTE: Pablo Shepherds\n"
" ESTADO: Active\n"
" FECHA DE INICIO: xx-xx-xxxx\n"
"\n"
" Registro 1: Se inició al sujeto con la dosis asignada. Se monitoreará por 7 "
"días.\n"
" Registro 2: Sujeto dentro de los parámetros esperados. El sujeto quedará "
"entre los habitantes generales.\n"
" Registro 3: Sujeto dentro de los parámetros esperados. El sujeto quedará "
"entre los habitantes generales.\n"
" Registro 4: El sujeto muestra signos de demencia severa. Resultado no "
"esperado. Se continúa con el protocolo de remoción. Moviendo paciente a "
"Habitación segura por un período de 2 días.\n"
" Registro 5: El sujeto se está estabilizando. Intentando dosis RA21E.\n"
" Registro 6: Sujeto dentro de los parámetros esperados. Volviendo a los "
"habitantes generales.\n"
" Registro 7: Sujeto dentro de los parámetros esperados. Intentando dosis de "
"Suero Mutagénico. Se continúa con el protocolo de remoción. Moviendo "
"paciente a Habitación segura por un período de 2 días.\n"
" Registro 8: El sujeto muestra un incremento tremendo en energía y "
"corpulencia. Reducción de deterioro cognitivo. Síntomas de demencia casi "
"eliminados.\n"
" Registro 9: El sujeto se está volviendo beligerante. Causa desconocida. "
"Falla el suero Purificador. Se comenzó protocolo de sedación. 15mg de "
"Carfentanilo requeridos. Iniciando protocolo de Plan de Respaldo; el sujeto "
"no puede volver a los habitantes generales.\n"
" Registro 10: El sujeto continúa sedado. Se mantiene el protocolo de Plan de "
"Respaldo. Intentando prueba de suero purificador."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"PROJECT PROCEDURES: Big Pappy\n"
" Goals\n"
"\n"
" 1) Study effects of cognitive and physical decline in geriatric residents.\n"
" 2) Study effects of advanced medical and mutagenic serums on select "
"patients.\n"
" 3) Eliminate, or reverse, the physical and mental aging process in humans."
msgstr ""
"PROCEDIMIENTOS DE PROYECTO: Gran Papi\n"
" Objetivos\n"
"\n"
" 1) Estudiar los efectos del deterioro cognitivo y físico en residentes "
"geriátricos.\n"
" 2) Estudiar los efectos de la medicina avanzada y sueros mutagénicos en "
"pacientes seleccionados.\n"
" 3) Eliminar, o revertir, el proceso de envejecimiento físico y mental en "
"humanos"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"PROJECT PROCEDURES: Big Pappy\n"
" PAGE 1\n"
"\n"
" 1) Review patients for possible induction.  As a failsafe, patients "
"selected for this program should have minimal or no contact with outside "
"individuals and should additionally not be removed from their assigned rooms "
"for longer than two days.  See 'Chapter 1: Induction' for greater detail.\n"
" 2) Administer standard alchemical dosage according to patient profile.  See "
"'Chapter 2: Dosages' on typical process.\n"
" 3) Monitor results over 7 days.  Patient will remain in general population "
"outside of scheduled physicals unless determined otherwise by SVP Research & "
"Development.\n"
" 4) Patients deemed unworthy for general population are to remain in Secure "
"lab room for special monitoring.  Official documentation will denote "
"hospitalization in this circumstance to mitigate chance of suspicion.\n"
" 5) To ensure unbiased compliance, selected patients and their families will "
"not be informed of this process."
msgstr ""
"PROCEDIMIENTOS DEL PROYECTO: Gran Papi\n"
" PÁGINA 1\n"
"\n"
" 1) Revisar pacientes para posible iniciación. Como plan de respaldo, los "
"pacientes seleccionados para este programa deben tener un contacto mínimo o "
"nulo con individuos del exterior y además no deben ser sacados de sus "
"habitaciones designadas por más de dos días. Ver 'Capítulo 1: Iniciación' "
"para más detalles.\n"
" 2) Administrar la dosis química estándar de acuerdo al perfil del paciente. "
"Ver 'Capítulo 2: Dosis' sobre procesos típicos.\n"
" 3) Monitorear los resultados durante 7 días. El paciente quedará entre los "
"residentes generales fuera de los estudios físicos programados excepto que "
"se indique lo contrario por el SVP de Investigación y Desarrollo.\n"
" 4) Los pacientes considerados no merecedores de los residentes generales "
"quedarán en el Laboratorio seguro para un monitoreo especial. La "
"documentación oficial denotará hospitalización en esta circunstancia para "
"mitigar la posibilidad de sospechas..\n"
" 5) Para asegurar el desarrollo imparcial, los pacientes seleccionados y sus "
"familiares no serán comunicados acerca del proceso."

