msgid "Let's talk about something else."
msgstr "Hablemos de otra cosa."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"Maybe some day.  If you can survive for long enough I may decide to come and "
"stay with you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"Maybe.  Is it worse to be unhappy with a goal or to be unhappy without a "
"goal?  You're all right, I feel like we get each other."
msgstr ""
"Tal vez. ¿Es peor ser infeliz con un objetivo o ser infeliz sin un objetivo? "
"Tu me caes bien, siento como si nos entendiéramos."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "No idea what you mean."
msgstr "Ni idea de lo que hablas."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"No problem, a lot of people are going through some hard times right now.  "
"Honestly, you're doing better than most.  You should follow me, I have a "
"pretty good handle on reality."
msgstr ""
"No hay drama, mucha gente está pasando por momentos difíciles en este "
"momento. Honestamente, tu vas mejor que la mayoría. Deberías venir conmigo, "
"sé bastante bien cómo manejarme."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "No, I just made it up."
msgstr "No, me lo acabo de inventar."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "No, my name has been a name here for a very long time too."
msgstr "No, mi nombre ha sido un nombre aquí por mucho tiempo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "Not enough given what's happening."
msgstr "No lo suficiente, dado lo que está pasando."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"Of course, that all makes as much sense as anything I guess.  So you have "
"crazy supernatural powers then?  Can you stop whatever is happening and make "
"it like before?"
msgstr ""
"Por supuesto, eso tiene tanto sentido como cualquier otra cosa, creo. ¿Así "
"que tienes unos poderes sobrenaturales? ¿Puedes parar lo que está pasando y "
"hacer que todo vuelva a como era antes?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "So.  You're dressed like a hunter.  Are you a hunter?"
msgstr "Así que. Estás vestido como un cazador. ¿Eres un cazador?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "Sure sure.  So are you on drugs?"
msgstr "Seguro, seguro. ¿Tomás drogas?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "This is awkward.  I need to leave."
msgstr "Esto es raro. Me tengo que ir."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "We are not good and I'm done talking to you."
msgstr "No estamos bien y no quiero hablar más contigo."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "Whatever, I don't have time for creepy stuff."
msgstr "Como quieras, no tengo tiempo para estas cosas extrañas."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"Whatever, I don't have time for whatever this is.  Try not to get your face "
"eaten I guess."
msgstr ""
"No importa, no tengo tiempo para lo que sea eso. Intenta que no te coman la "
"cara y eso."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"Whoah whoah, calm down.  Yikes.  Yeah fine, we're good.  Just stop making "
"that face, it's too much for me.  Gives me feelings."
msgstr ""
"Uy, uy, cálmate. Uf. Sí, listo, está todo bien. Pero deja de poner esa cara, "
"es demasiado para mí. Me hace sentir cosas."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"Whoah whoah, calm down.  Yikes.  Yeah fine, we're good.  Just stop trying to "
"spook me, I don't like it."
msgstr ""
"Uy, uy, calmate. Uf. Sí, listo, está todo bien. Pero tratá de no asustarme, "
"no me gusta."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "Yes, I just got here.  What's happening?"
msgstr "Sí, recién llegue. ¿Qué pasa?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"Yes, I'm a very smart survivor of the apocalypse.  Anyway, I need to move "
"along.  Later Glooscap."
msgstr ""
"Sí, soy un sobreviviente muy inteligente del apocalipsis. De todas maneras, "
"me tengo que ir. Hasta luego, Glooscap."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"Yes, thank you for sharing with me.  So what are you doing here?  What are "
"you trying to accomplish?"
msgstr ""
"Sí, gracias por compartirlo conmigo. ¿Qué estás haciendo aquí? ¿Qué estás "
"intentando lograr?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "Yes, that worked great."
msgstr "Sí, eso anduvo genial."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "You know the real people's stories?  Yes, a lot like that."
msgstr "¿Conoces las historias de la gente real? Sí, muy parecido a eso."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "You know you're not really Glooscap right?  You're joking right?"
msgstr ""
"¿Entiendes que tu no eres realmente Glooscap, no? ¿Estás bromeando, no?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"You seem cool and I'd like to talk more but I don't have anything fun.  I'll "
"try and find something and come back so we can share."
msgstr ""
"Pareces buena gente y me gustaría hablar mas pero no tengo nada para "
"divertirnos. Voy a intentar conseguir algo y después vuelvo para compartirlo."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"You seem cool but I don't have anything fun.  I'll try and find something "
"and come back so we can share."
msgstr ""
"Pareces buena gente pero no tengo nada para divertirnos. Voy a intentar "
"conseguir algo y después vuelvo para compartirlo."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "You shouldn't follow me, but I guess I can't stop you."
msgstr "No deberías venir conmigo pero supongo que no puedo detenerte."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "[GLORIOUS] Worship my beauty."
msgstr "[ESPLÉNDIDO] Admirá mi belleza."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "[INT 11]  Like the Wabanaki myth?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "[INT 14] Do you have a twin named Malsumis?"
msgstr "[INT 14] ¿Tienes un gemelo que se llama Malsumis?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "[INT 14] I think you're Malsumis.  Where is Glooscap?"
msgstr "[INT 14] Creo que eres Malsumis. ¿Dónde está Glooscap?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"[INT 14] I'll look out then, thanks.  Of course if you were Malsumis you "
"probably wouldn't admit it because no one likes Malsumis.  Who would your "
"twin say you are?"
msgstr ""
"[INT 14] Voy a estar atento entonces, gracias. Por supuesto que si fueras "
"Malsumis probablemente no lo admitirías porque a nadie le cae bien Malsumis. "
"Si le pregunto a tu gemelo ¿quién dirías que sos vos?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"[INT 14] I'm trying to understand what happened and see if I can make "
"something better happen."
msgstr ""
"[INT 14] Estoy intentando entender qué pasó y ver si puedo hacer que pase "
"algo mejor."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "[INT 14] Yes, that all makes sense to me.  Forget I asked."
msgstr "[INT 14] Sí, eso tiene sentido. Olvídate que pregunté."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"[Offer Beer] I am extremely into your smile yes.  I have some drinks with "
"me, want to have some?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"[Offer Beer] I don't know about friends, but I have some drinks with me, "
"want to have some?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"[Offer Cigarettes] I am extremely into your smile yes.  I have some "
"cigarettes, want one with me?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"[Offer Cigarettes] I don't know about friends, but I have some cigarettes, "
"want one with me?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"[Offer India Pale Ale] I am extremely into your smile yes.  I have some "
"drinks with me, want to have some?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"[Offer India Pale Ale] I don't know about friends, but I have some drinks "
"with me, want to have some?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"[Offer Joint] I am extremely into your smile yes.  I have something to "
"smoke, want to have some with me?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"[Offer Joint] I don't know about friends, but I have something to smoke, "
"want to have some with me?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "[PRETTY] I think we're going to be great friends, don't you agree?"
msgstr "[BONITO] Creo que vamos a ser grandes amigos, ¿no te parece?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "[PRETTY] That smile is very nice.  It makes me smile too."
msgstr "[LINDURA] Esa es una sonrisa muy linda. Me hace sonreír a mí también."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"[SKILLED LIAR] Then you're definitely not Malsumis and everything is cool.  "
"So Malsumis wants to kill everybody right?  I guess they're feeling pretty "
"great right now huh?"
msgstr ""
"[MENTIROSO EXPERTO] Entones definitivamente no sos Malsumis y está todo "
"bien. Así que Malsumis quiere matar a todos, ¿no? Supongo que se están "
"sintiendo bastante bien ahora, eh."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "[TERRIFYING] Destroy me!"
msgstr "[ATERRADOR] ¡Destrózame!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "[TERRIFYING] Fear me!  I am disgusting!"
msgstr "[ATERRADOR] ¡Ten miedo de mi! ¡Soy repugnante!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid ""
"Ayuh, I was thinkin' it's just another monstah skulkin' about.  Who are you?"
msgstr "Ayuh, estaba pensando que eras otro monstruo merodeando. ¿Quién eres?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid ""
"Can't say I can think of summin' specific right now.  Gotta say though, "
"maybe it oughta be a good idea for us ta travel togetha' - safety in numbers "
"an' all that."
msgstr ""
"No puedo decir que pueda pensar en algo específico ahora mismo. Tengo que "
"decir, sin embargo, que tal vez debería ser una buena idea para nosotros "
"viajar juntos - la seguridad en los números y todo eso."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "Can't say I really agree.  I'll be going now."
msgstr "No puedo decir que esté de acuerdo. Voy a irme ahora."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid ""
"Don't have much of a choice, do I?  On my own, a monstah will get lucky "
"sooner or later, and even if I kill it, bleedin' out in some alley is not "
"summin' I fancy.  Plus, we just had a nice, civil chat where no one tried ta "
"kill the otha', so I reckon we're off to ah' good start, all things "
"considered."
msgstr ""
"No tengo muchas opciones, ¿verdad? Por mi cuenta, un monstruo tendrá suerte "
"tarde o temprano, e incluso si lo mato, desangrarme en un callejón no es "
"algo que me guste. Además, acabamos de tener una agradable y civilizada "
"charla en la que nadie ha intentado matar al otro, así que creo que hemos "
"empezado con buen pie."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "Fair enough.  Want to travel with me, then?"
msgstr "Me parece bien. ¿Quieres viajar conmigo, entonces?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "Great!  Let's go."
msgstr "¡Genial! Vamos."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "How about we travel together?"
msgstr "¿Qué tal si viajamos juntos?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "I hate it."
msgstr "Lo odio."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "I like it."
msgstr "Me gusta."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was just sort of wanderin' around, hoping ta maybe find some bettah gear.  "
"Decided ta rest up, 'eard someone walkin', and, well, here we are."
msgstr ""
"Estaba vagando por ahí, esperando encontrar algún equipo mejor. Decidí "
"descansar, escuché a alguien caminando, y, bueno, aquí estamos."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I was just sort of wanderin' around, hoping ta maybe find some bettah gear.  "
"Decided ta rest up, 'eard someone walkin', and, well, here we are."
msgstr ""
"Estaba vagando por ahí, esperando encontrar algún equipo mejor. Decidí "
"descansar, escuché a alguien caminando, y, bueno, aquí estamos."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I was just sort of wanderin' around, hoping ta maybe find some bettah gear.  "
"Decided ta rest up, 'eard someone walkin', and, well, here we are."
msgstr ""
"Estaba vagando por ahí, esperando encontrar algún equipo mejor. Decidí "
"descansar, escuché a alguien caminando, y, bueno, aquí estamos."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I worked on a ranch not too fah from here 'fore it all went down.  I'd love "
"ta get back ta what I did - taking care of horses, cows, all sorts of "
"animals, makin' sure the fields stay safe an' all that.  But now?  I dunno, "
"man.  Just tryin' ta survive, I suppose.  Hopefully, tha world will get back "
"togetha' one day and I can put mah skills ta use doin' what I like."
msgstr ""
"Trabajé en un rancho no muy lejos de aquí antes de que todo se fuera al "
"traste. Me encantaría volver a hacer lo que hacía: cuidar de los caballos, "
"las vacas, todo tipo de animales, asegurarme de que los campos estén a salvo "
"y todo eso. ¿Pero ahora? No sé, hombre. Sólo trato de sobrevivir, supongo. "
"Con suerte, el mundo volverá a funcionar algún día y podré usar mis "
"habilidades para hacer lo que me gusta."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I worked on a ranch not too fah from here 'fore it all went down.  I'd love "
"ta get back ta what I did - taking care of horses, cows, all sorts of "
"animals, makin' sure the fields stay safe an' all that.  But now?  I dunno, "
"man.  Just tryin' ta survive, I suppose.  Hopefully, tha world will get back "
"togetha' one day and I can put mah skills ta use doin' what I like."
msgstr ""
"Trabajé en un rancho no muy lejos de aquí antes de que todo se fuera al "
"traste. Me encantaría volver a hacer lo que hacía: cuidar de los caballos, "
"las vacas, todo tipo de animales, asegurarme de que los campos estén a salvo "
"y todo eso. ¿Pero ahora? No sé, hombre. Sólo trato de sobrevivir, supongo. "
"Con suerte, el mundo volverá a funcionar algún día y podré usar mis "
"habilidades para hacer lo que me gusta."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I worked on a ranch not too fah from here 'fore it all went down.  I'd love "
"ta get back ta what I did - taking care of horses, cows, all sorts of "
"animals, makin' sure the fields stay safe an' all that.  But now?  I dunno, "
"man.  Just tryin' ta survive, I suppose.  Hopefully, tha world will get back "
"togetha' one day and I can put mah skills ta use doin' what I like."
msgstr ""
"Trabajé en un rancho no muy lejos de aquí antes de que todo se fuera al "
"traste. Me encantaría volver a hacer lo que hacía: cuidar de los caballos, "
"las vacas, todo tipo de animales, asegurarme de que los campos estén a salvo "
"y todo eso. ¿Pero ahora? No sé, hombre. Sólo trato de sobrevivir, supongo. "
"Con suerte, el mundo volverá a funcionar algún día y podré usar mis "
"habilidades para hacer lo que me gusta."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "I'll think about it."
msgstr "Voy a pensarlo."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "Is it a good idea to trust a stranger like me this easily?"
msgstr "¿Es una buena idea confiar en un extraño como yo tan fácilmente?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
#: data/json/npcs/militia/GM_Militia_Merchant.json
msgid "Is there something I can do for you?"
msgstr "¿Hay algo que pueda hacer por ti?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "Just a survivor, looking around.  What are you doing here?"
msgstr "Sólo un sobreviviente, mirando alrededor. ¿Qué estás haciendo aquí?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "Let's hope it will."
msgstr "Esperemos que así sea."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "Okay then."
msgstr "Bien entonces."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "On a second thought, let me think about it a bit more"
msgstr "Pensándolo bien, déjame pensarlo un poco más"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "Sounds like a good idea - want to join me, then?"
msgstr "Me parece una buena idea, ¿quieres unirte a mí, entonces?"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ A rural holdout survivor trying to stay safe
#. ~ A rural holdout survivor completely unwilling to talk
#. ~ A rural holdout survivor that gave up on life
#. ~ A rural holdout survivor willing to trade items
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Survivor cowboy"
msgstr "Vaquero superviviente"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid ""
"Wha', nevah been ta Boston 'ave ya?  Hope you're not 'avin a hahd time "
"keepin' up with me, but if ya get used ta it, wicked good fun, let me tell "
"ya."
msgstr ""
"¿Qué? ¿Nunca has estado en Boston, verdad? Espero que no lo estés pasando "
"mal para seguirme el ritmo, pero si te acostumbras, es muy divertido, déjame "
"decirte."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "What did you before all this?"
msgstr "¿Qué hacías antes de todo esto?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "What's with the accent?"
msgstr "¿Por qué el acento?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid ""
"Wicked.  Been around the old road long enough ta know how ta handle myself "
"in a pinch.  Knew my way around a gun ever since my da taught me when I was "
"a kid, so ya don't have ta worry about me doing my part."
msgstr ""
"Malvado. He estado en el viejo camino lo suficiente como para saber cómo "
"manejarme en caso de necesidad. Sabía cómo manejar un arma desde que mi "
"padre me enseñó cuando era un niño, así que no tienes que preocuparte de que "
"no haga mi parte."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "Alright, I'm leaving."
msgstr "Muy bien, me voy."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "Alright, alright, I'm going."
msgstr "Muy bien, muy bien, me voy."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid ""
"Did you just fucking threaten me?!  This is your last chance to piss off or "
"I swear I will end you!"
msgstr ""
"¡¿Acabas de amenazarme?! ¡Esta es tu última oportunidad de largarte o te "
"juro que acabaré contigo!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "Does private property even exist anymore?"
msgstr "¿Existe todavía la propiedad privada?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "Don't threaten me or you will regret it."
msgstr "No me amenaces o lo lamentarás."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid ""
"For the last goddamn time, leave or I will defend myself!  I will kill you!"
msgstr "¡Por última vez, vete o me defenderé! ¡Te mataré!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid ""
"Hey!  Stop right there!  This here is private property!  Not one step "
"closer, you got it?!"
msgstr ""
"¡Oye! ¡Detente ahí! ¡Esto es propiedad privada! Ni un paso más, ¡¿lo tienes?!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "I just want to talk."
msgstr "Sólo quiero hablar."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "I really just want to talk - I mean no harm."
msgstr "En realidad, sólo quiero hablar, no pretendo hacer daño."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "I said stay away!  Don't get any closer or I swear I will kill you."
msgstr "¡He dicho que te alejes! No te acerques más o te juro que te mato."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "I'd like to see you try."
msgstr "Me gustaría verte intentarlo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "It does on my property!  Now blow off!"
msgstr "¡Lo hace en mi propiedad! ¡Ahora lárgate!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "Okay, I'll leave."
msgstr "Bien, me iré."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "Whoa, calm down, no reason to get heated."
msgstr "Whoa, cálmate, no hay razón para calentarse."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "Yeah that's right!  And don't bother me again, you hear?!"
msgstr "¡Sí, eso es! Y no me vuelvas a molestar, ¿me oyes?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "You better calm down right now."
msgstr "Será mejor que te calmes ahora mismo."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Alright.  Goodbye."
msgstr "Muy bien. Adiós."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Alright.  Take care."
msgstr "Muy bien. Cuídate"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid ""
"For how long?  You've seen what's out there.  If we survive today, we'll die "
"the day after.  Or the day after that.  And if we live beyond that, we'll "
"just see everyone we care about die.  All of them.  Might as well get it "
"over with."
msgstr ""
"¿Durante cuánto tiempo? Ya has visto lo que hay ahí fuera. Si sobrevivimos "
"hoy, moriremos el día después. O el día después de ese. Y si vivimos más "
"allá de eso, veremos morir a todos los que nos importan. Todos ellos. Será "
"mejor que acabemos con esto."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Good.  Take care."
msgstr "Bien. Cuídate."

#. ~ Success message in teleportation in effect in EoC "EOC_SWIRLING_VORTEX"
