#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json data/json/traps.json
msgid "How did you get here?"
msgstr "¿Cómo has llegado hasta aquí?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I didn't leave the town alone.  I arrived here alone."
msgstr "No dejé la ciudad sola. Llegué aquí solo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid "I didn't leave the town alone.  I arrived here alone."
msgstr "No dejé la ciudad sola. Llegué aquí solo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid "I didn't leave the town alone.  I arrived here alone."
msgstr "No dejé la ciudad sola. Llegué aquí solo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "I dunno.  Waiting.  Seeing if something happens I guess."
msgstr "No sé. Esperando. A ver si pasa algo, supongo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I told you to just leave me alone."
msgstr "Te dije que me dejaras en paz."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid "I told you to just leave me alone."
msgstr "Te dije que me dejaras en paz."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid "I told you to just leave me alone."
msgstr "Te dije que me dejaras en paz."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid ""
"I'm sorry for your loss.  But you still can't give up.  You have a lot to "
"live for!"
msgstr ""
"Lamento tu pérdida. Pero aún no puedes rendirte.  ¡Tienes mucho por lo que "
"vivir!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "I'm sure your loved one would want you to live on for them."
msgstr ""
"Estoy seguro de que tu ser querido querría que siguieras viviendo por él."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "It will.  Let's get going."
msgstr "Lo hare. Vamos."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "I… I mean… huh.  I guess."
msgstr "Yo... quiero decir... eh. Supongo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Just leave me alone."
msgstr "Solo dejame en paz."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Lived in a nearby town.  Normal life.  9 to 5 job.  When it all happened, we "
"ran away to find some safety.  But there's no safety anymore, is there?"
msgstr ""
"Vivía en un pueblo cercano. Vida normal. Trabajo de 9 a 5. Cuando todo "
"sucedió, huimos para encontrar algo de seguridad. Pero ya no hay seguridad, "
"¿verdad?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Lived in a nearby town.  Normal life.  9 to 5 job.  When it all happened, we "
"ran away to find some safety.  But there's no safety anymore, is there?"
msgstr ""
"Vivía en un pueblo cercano. Vida normal. Trabajo de 9 a 5. Cuando todo "
"sucedió, huimos para encontrar algo de seguridad. Pero ya no hay seguridad, "
"¿verdad?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Lived in a nearby town.  Normal life.  9 to 5 job.  When it all happened, we "
"ran away to find some safety.  But there's no safety anymore, is there?"
msgstr ""
"Vivía en un pueblo cercano. Vida normal. Trabajo de 9 a 5. Cuando todo "
"sucedió, huimos para encontrar algo de seguridad. Pero ya no hay seguridad, "
"¿verdad?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "No one gets out alive.  Always been that way.  So we keep going."
msgstr "Nadie sale vivo. Siempre ha sido así. Así que seguimos adelante."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Oh.  Hey there."
msgstr "Oh, Hola."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "On a second thought, wait here a while."
msgstr "Pensándolo bien, espera aquí un rato."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Right.  Okay."
msgstr "Correcto. Bien."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "So shouldn't you be more concerned?  Trying to survive?"
msgstr "¿No deberías estar más preocupado? ¿Intentar sobrevivir?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "So you're just going to give up?"
msgstr "¿Así que te vas a rendir?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "That's a start."
msgstr "Eso es un comienzo."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Thought I heard someone.  What are you doing here?"
msgstr "Me pareció oír a alguien. ¿Qué estás haciendo aquí?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Wait, 'we'?"
msgstr "Espera, ¿\"nosotros\"?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "We all lost someone.  No reason to sit down and die."
msgstr "Todos hemos perdido a alguien. No hay razón para sentarse y morir."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Would you like to come with me?"
msgstr "¿Te gustaría venir conmigo?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Yeah.  I do."
msgstr "Sí, así es."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Yeah.  I think I will."
msgstr "Sí. Creo que lo haré."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "You can't let yourself be consumed by grief.  It will get better."
msgstr "No puedes dejarte consumir por la pena. Todo mejorará."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "You do realize there is an apocalypse going on, right?"
msgstr "Te das cuenta de que hay un apocalipsis en marcha, ¿verdad?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid ""
"Ah, not much really.  Passing through, trying to make a living by trading "
"with folk.  If you're interested, I got a lot of good things on sale, "
"stranger."
msgstr ""
"Ah, no mucho en realidad. De paso, tratando de ganarme la vida comerciando "
"con la gente. Si te interesa, tengo un montón de cosas buenas en venta, "
"extraño."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Any news on that Remington?"
msgstr "¿Alguna noticia sobre esa Remington?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Fair enough.  Goodbye."
msgstr "Justo. Adiós."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid ""
"Fantastic!  I'll try and get it to the buyer, if he's still alive.  If not, "
"well, still a good gun to sell.  Now, how would you like to be compensated?"
msgstr ""
"¡Fantástico! Intentaré llevársela al comprador, si es que sigue vivo. Si no, "
"bueno, sigue siendo una buena arma para vender. Ahora, ¿cómo te gustaría ser "
"compensado?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid ""
"Great!  Let me know when you get it, and I'll try to get in touch with him."
msgstr ""
"¡Genial! Avísame cuando lo tengas y trataré de ponerme en contacto con él."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid ""
"Hah, real cute.  Seem the End times didn't take your sense of humor, eh, "
"stranger?"
msgstr ""
"Hah, muy lindo. Parece que el Fin de los Tiempos no se llevó tu sentido del "
"humor, ¿eh, forastero?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Hey!  Who goes there?"
msgstr "¡Oye! ¿Quién va allí?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "How did you even get this option to display the hell."
msgstr "¿Cómo has conseguido esta opción para mostrar el infierno?."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid ""
"I am a ghost.  I died here 37 years ago, yet I cannot depart this mortal "
"realm."
msgstr ""
"Soy un fantasma. Morí aquí hace 37 años, pero no puedo abandonar este reino "
"mortal."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "I have my moments.  So what are you doing here?"
msgstr "Tengo mis momentos. Entonces, ¿qué estás haciendo aquí?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "I'm you, from the future.  I've come to warn you."
msgstr "Soy tú, del futuro. He venido a advertirte."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "If you think so."
msgstr "Si lo crees así."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Is there something I can help you with?"
msgstr "¿Hay algo en lo que pueda ayudarte?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Just another survivor.  What are you doing here?"
msgstr "Sólo otro superviviente. ¿Qué estás haciendo aquí?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Not a bad way to live."
msgstr "No es una mala manera de vivir."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
msgstr "Conseguir una escopeta Remington 870 Express"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Speaking of which, I'd like to see your wares."
msgstr "Hablando de eso, me gustaría ver tu mercancía."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Suit yourself.  Ain't a rush."
msgstr "Como quieras. No hay prisa."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Then where is it?"
msgstr "Entonces, ¿dónde está?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid ""
"Well, a gun store is a solid bet, but the model is common enough.  Maybe you "
"can find one in a police station, or a store with hunting gear."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, una tienda de armas es una apuesta sólida, pero el modelo es bastante "
"común. Tal vez usted puedas encontrar uno en una estación de policía, o una "
"tienda con equipo de caza."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Well, now that you mention it…"
msgstr "Bien, ahora que lo mencionas..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid ""
"Worked as a salesman - high end farming equipment.  Now I know, it may not "
"sound that fancy, but you'd be shocked at how pricy those machines can get.  "
"I was lucky enough to be on a fairly remote farm when everything went to "
"shit.  In a way, being a salesman saved me and the experience from the job "
"might allow me to make a living in the apocalypse, bartering for gear and "
"trinkets, so I got that going for me, I suppose."
msgstr ""
"Trabajé como vendedor de equipos agrícolas de alta gama. Lo sé, puede que no "
"suene tan elegante, pero te sorprendería lo caras que pueden llegar a ser "
"esas máquinas. Tuve la suerte de estar en una granja bastante remota cuando "
"todo se fue a la mierda. En cierto modo, ser vendedor me salvó y la "
"experiencia del trabajo podría permitirme ganarme la vida en el apocalipsis, "
"haciendo trueques por equipos y baratijas, así que supongo que tengo eso a "
"mi favor."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "You do?  Let me take a look."
msgstr "¿tienes? Déjame ver."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid ""
"You see, some time ago, I ran into this guy who offered me a substantial "
"payment in exchange for a Remington 870 Express.  I asked if he'd like "
"another weapon, since nowadays, any gun will do, but for some reason, he's "
"dead set on that particular model.  If you could obtain one for me, well, "
"I'd be quite grateful."
msgstr ""
"Verás, hace algún tiempo, me encontré con un tipo que me ofreció un "
"importante pago a cambio de una Remington 870 Express. Le pregunté si quería "
"otra arma, ya que hoy en día, cualquier arma sirve, pero por alguna razón, "
"se ha quedado con ese modelo en particular. Si pudiera conseguirme una, te "
"lo agradecería mucho."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid ""
"You seem like a decent sort, but I'm not really looking for company right "
"now.  Think I'm better off on my own."
msgstr ""
"Pareces un tipo decente, pero no estoy buscando compañía en este momento. "
"Creo que estoy mejor por mi cuenta."

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ A rural holdout survivor living in a barn or a forest or something, all by themselves.  At some point this NPC should get special dialogue.
#. ~ A member of the Gray Moose Militia, trying to safe in their isolated location
#. ~ A survivor who sometimes visits the refugee center.
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ A wandering survivor, a pretty tough and capable dude.  Represents an NPC version of a person much like the player.
#. ~ A random scavenger visiting the refugee center to check it out, just like you.
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/rural.json
#: data/json/npcs/militia/GM_Militia_Merchant.json
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "Survivor"
msgstr "Superviviente"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"&There's a person reclined on the sofa here.  They're very tall, with their "
"legs reaching to the other armrest, and they're wearing a set of dubious-"
"looking military gear.  They raise a hand in greeting.  \"Placeholder text.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Active Noise Control"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "*frowns at you.  \"I've been with you this whole time, dude.  C'mon."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"*goes quiet.  They chew their lip, looking off towards a point in space."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"*smiles at you, genuine and warm.  \"It feels nice to tell it.  You're "
"welcome.\""
msgstr ""
"*te sonríe de manera cálida y genuina. \"Se siente bien contarlo. De nada.\""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"*stares at a point at the wall, thinking.  Their wedding ring glints on "
"their left hand."
msgstr ""
"*mira fijo un punto en la pared, pensando. Su anillo de casamiento brilla en "
"su mano izquierda."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "*waits expectantly."
msgstr "*espera con ansiedad."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"A while later, I made it here.  The gate was open, so I just walked right "
"in.  I tried the intercom, but nobody answered, which I'm sure you had "
"happen to you, too.  Then I realize: this building is super reinforced, "
"unlocked, and seems abandoned now.  Why don't I just stay here?  So I set up "
"my stuff in this here lobby and I spend the night there.  Then I try the "
"intercom again."
msgstr ""
"Un tiempo después, llegué hasta aquí. La puerta estaba abierta así que me "
"metí. Intenté el intercomunicador pero no me respondió nadie, que seguro que "
"te pasó a vos también. Después me di cuenta: este edificio está muy "
"reforzado, abierto y ahora parece abandonado. ¿Por qué no me quedo acá? Así "
"que dejé mis cosas en el hall y pasé la noche acá. Después, volví a probar "
"con el intercomunicador."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "About the gold you wanted…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "About those jobs…"
msgstr "Sobre esos trabajos..."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Active Noise Control"
msgstr "Control de Ruido Activo"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Actually, I don't think I have time for that, sorry."
msgstr "En realidad, no creo que tenga tiempo para eso, lo siento."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Actually, I have some places to be right now.  Good to meet you."
msgstr "En realidad, tengo que ir a otro lugar ahora. Un gusto conocerte."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Active Noise Control"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Return to Hub 01"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Alright, let's be off.  You don't mind taking point, right?"
msgstr "Bueno, vamos yendo. ¿No te molesta ir al frente, no?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "And *now* the rest is history."
msgstr "Y *ahora sí* el resto es historia."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "And the rest is history."
msgstr "Y el resto es historia."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Anything on your mind?"
msgstr "¿Tienes algo en mente?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Return to Hub 01"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Are we there yet?"
msgstr "¿Ya llegamos?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"But like, I was a park ranger.  I wasn't exactly making six figures, and you "
"know how bad rent was.  I couldn't buy a ton of canned food, but what I "
"*could* do is can things myself.  Not in tin cans, but in jars; the old "
"way.  So every paycheck, I'd use a little bit to buy one or two big glass "
"jars, and on the weekends I'd spend a few hours filling them up with food "
"and sealing them.  I started brushing up at the range too.  Proud gun owner, "
"baby."
msgstr ""
"Pero como digo, era guardabosques. No estaba ganando mucho que digamos y ya "
"sabemos lo difícil que era alquilar. No me podía comprar mucha comida "
"enlatada pero lo que *podía* hacer era enlatar las cosas yo mismo. Pero no "
"en latas de estaño si no en frascos, a la manera antigua. Así que cada vez "
"que cobraba, usaba una parte para comprar uno o dos frascos grandes de "
"vidrios y los fines de semana me pasaba unas horas llenándolos con comida y "
"sellándolos. Empecé a practicar puntería también. Orgulloso portador de "
"arma, amigo."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "But what?"
msgstr "Pero ¿qué?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Computer network?"
msgstr "¿Red de ordenadores?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Cool."
msgstr "Mola."

#. ~ Unique name of an NPC
#. ~ Appears in the the surface of Hub 01 as an external mercenary.
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Cranberry Foster"
msgstr "Cranberry Foster"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Did they answer that time?"
msgstr "¿Y esa vez te contestaron?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Did you want something?"
msgstr "¿Quieres decir algo?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"Dude, I wish.  It sounds like there's different people on the mic at "
"different times, but all of them give me the same spiel: nobody's allowed in "
"right now.  I guess I shouldn't raise a fuss about it, honestly.  All being "
"considered, this compound is pretty safe, and the couch ain't so bad."
msgstr ""
"Chaval, eso me gustaría. Parece que hay distintas personas con el micrófono "
"en diferentes momentos pero todas dan el mismo discurso: no se permite que "
"ingrese nadie ahora. Supongo que no tengo que liarla con eso, honestamente. "
"Considerando todo lo que pasa, este recinto es bastante seguro y el sillón "
"no está tan mal."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"Exchanging my money for goods and services.  Just as the founding fathers "
"intended."
msgstr ""
"Cambiando mi dinero por bienes y servicios. Tal y como querrían los padres "
"fundadores."

#. ~ Job description of "Hub Mercenary" NPC class
#. ~ Job description of "Mercenary" NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid "Fighting for the all-mighty dollar."
msgstr "Luchando por el poderoso caballero Don Dinero."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Good to have some company."
msgstr "Es bueno tener un poco de compañía."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Got some gold for me?"
msgstr "¿Me trajiste algo de oro?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Have something to say?"
msgstr "¿Tienes algo que decir?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
