msgid ""
"Hey, did you notice that there's working wi-fi here?  Not that anything else "
"is online anymore, but still."
msgstr ""
"Eh, ¿te diste cuenta que aquí hay wifi que funciona? Aunque no hay nada en "
"linea la verdad, pero igualmente."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
