msgid ""
"A 'nanofabricator template', it seems, no idea what it's good for, but it "
"sure looks valuable.  Are you buying it or not?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_template_seller.json
