#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_template_seller.json
msgid ""
"Well I'm sure someone who values it will come around, thanks for hearing the "
