#. ~ Job description of "Mercenary" NPC class
#. ~ An experienced survivor doing low importance work for Hub 01, or working under another ancillary. Has no access to Hub 01s custom gear.
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NC_ANCILLA_GRUNT.json
msgid "Fighting in the name of Hub 01 and money, mostly money."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<ANCILLA_barkeep_suggestion>"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid ""
"Ahh but if you want suggestions and are one for craft beers, I certainly "
"suggest having some old world brew before it all goes flat or sour."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<ANCILLA_barkeep_suggestion>"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "Also good for a chat if you don't want anything."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<ANCILLA_barkeep_suggestion>"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "Also have some old world sodas if alcohol isn't your kind of thing."
msgstr ""
"También podrías beber alguna soda del viejo mundo si el alcohol no es tu "
"estilo."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<ANCILLA_barkeep_suggestion>"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid ""
"And you can also try chatting with some of the other patrons if networking "
"is your thing."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "Any good rumors?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<ANCILLA_barkeep_suggestion>"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "Can also sell some dry foods if you want to stock for a trip somewhere."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "I'll ask around, thank you."
msgstr "Voy a preguntar por ahí, gracias."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid "I'll be going…"
msgstr "Me iré..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid ""
"If what you want are jobs and opportunities, you'll probably be better off "
"asking to my other patrons.  Have regulars from well across the state, I'm "
"sure some can offer what you want.\"\n"
"\n"
" \"Really, I just tend the bar and don't ask many questions.  Things tend "
"work out better that way."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<ANCILLA_barkeep_suggestion>"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid ""
"Just bought some of this new \"Free Whiskey\" from the caravaneer up above.  "
"It's vile if you ask me, but it packs a good punch.  A real drink of the "
"apocalypse I suppose."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Affirmative response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "Just some water."
msgstr "Un poco de agua."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid ""
"Just the best spirits the whole of New England has to offer.  Well the best "
"we've managed to loot so far at least.\n"
"\n"
" <ANCILLA_barkeep_suggestion>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid "Let me see what you keep behind the counter."
msgstr "Dejame ver qué guardás atrás del mostrador."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<ANCILLA_barkeep_suggestion>"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid ""
"Not much fruit juice to make fancy drinks, but I can scrounge up some still."
msgstr ""
"No hay mucho zumo de frutas para hacer bebidas sofisticadas, pero puedo "
"conseguir algo todavía."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid ""
"Oh yes of course, think this should be all, well that's all there is anyhow."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid "On second thought, don't bother."
msgstr "Pensándolo bien, no te molestes."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<ANCILLA_barkeep_suggestion>"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid ""
"Speaking off, Cranberry here brought me a whole cask of Cabernet a few days "
"ago.  So if red wines are your thing I can offer that by the gallon."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<ANCILLA_barkeep_suggestion>"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid ""
"The water I boiled from a pool by the rails, so I don't suggest you get some."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "There should be a package for me here."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid ""
"Welcome to the Terminal, scavenger, longest standing underground bar in the "
"state.  Feel free to ask if you need something."
msgstr ""
"Bienvenido a la Terminal, rebuscador, el bar subterráneo que más dura en el "
"estado. Siéntete libre de pedirme si necesitas algo."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
msgid "What do you have on tap?"
msgstr "¿Qué tienes en el grifo?"

#. ~ Negative response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "[$2] Just some water."
msgstr "[$2] Un poco de agua."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "[$3] Get me a cup of red wine"
msgstr "[$3] Dame un vaso de vino rojo"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "[$3] I'll take a beer"
msgstr "[$3] Quiero una cerveza"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "[$3] I'll take a shot of rum"
msgstr "[$3] Me gustaría un trago de ron"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_BARKEEP.json
msgid "[$3] I'll take a shot of whiskey"
msgstr "[$3] Dame un trago de whisky"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid ""
"A few of us joined up to make this a safe house, and it's just my turn "
"watching the gates."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid "Getting paid for standing around.  And you are getting in the way."
msgstr "Me pagan por estar parado. Y tu me estás molestando."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid "I'm just on watch, move along."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid ""
"If you are looking for the Terminal, it's in the first basement, right down "
"the stairs and to the left."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid "Is there any way I can join your team?"
msgstr "¿Hay alguna forma de que me pueda unir a tu equipo?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid "Just go down to the Terminal if you want in."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid "Just making sure people don't ask stupid questions."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid ""
"Me?  Just standing around, looking scary.  Think I'm doing a good job?\n"
"\n"
"Don't answer that."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid ""
"Well you certainly look like you could.  Try ringing the box in the bunker "
"across the street, or see if someone in the Terminal has a need for help."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, la verdad que tienes aspecto de que podrías. Prueba en la caja del "
"búnker cruzando la calle, o fíjate si alguien en la Terminal necesita ayuda."

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ Generic Mercenary Guard for the ancilla hq.
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid "mercenary"
msgstr "mercenario"

#. ~ Unique name of a female NPC
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Andrea_Dzvonko.json
msgid "Andrea Dzvonko"
msgstr "Andrea Dzvonko"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Andrea_Dzvonko.json
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Darla_Novak.json
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Jonathan_Farrier.json
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Sunil_Narayana.json
msgid ""
"Hold on, hold on.  I'm not here to hurt anyone, and there aren't enough of "
"us left to just start fighting."
msgstr ""
"Detente, detente. No estoy aquí para hacer daño a nadie, y no quedamos "
"suficientes para empezar a luchar entre nosotros."

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ Andrea Dzvonko is a software engineer with a limited understanding of how melchior actually functions.
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Andrea_Dzvonko.json
msgid "Hub 01 Software Engineer"
msgstr "Ingeniero de Software del Hub 01"

#. ~ Job description of "Hub 01 Software Engineer" NPC class
#. ~ Andrea Dzvonko is a software engineer with a limited understanding of how melchior actually functions.
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Andrea_Dzvonko.json
msgid "I work for Hub 01 as a software engineer."
msgstr "Trabajo como ingeniero de software en el Hub 01."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Andrea_Dzvonko.json
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Darla_Novak.json
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Jonathan_Farrier.json
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Sunil_Narayana.json
msgid "Nice to meet you too."
msgstr "Encantado de conocerte también."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Andrea_Dzvonko.json
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Darla_Novak.json
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Jonathan_Farrier.json
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Sunil_Narayana.json
msgid "Who the fuck are you?  How did you get down here?  Security!"
msgstr "¿Quién cojones eres tu? ¿Cómo has llegado hasta aquí? ¡Seguridad!"

#. ~ Name suffix of a female NPC
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Andrea_Dzvonko.json
msgid "software engineer"
msgstr "ingeniero de software"

#. ~ Unique name of a female NPC
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Darla_Novak.json
msgid "Darla Novak"
msgstr "Darla Novak"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ HVAC maintenance.  Keeps melchior from boiling to death and you from choking on stale bunker air.
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Darla_Novak.json
msgid "Hub 01 HVAC maintenance"
msgstr "Mantenimiento Climatización del Hub 01"

#. ~ Job description of "Hub 01 HVAC maintenance" NPC class
#. ~ HVAC maintenance.  Keeps melchior from boiling to death and you from choking on stale bunker air.
#. ~ Job description of "Hub 01 Server Maintenance" NPC class
#. ~ HVAC maintenance.  Resident dungeon master.
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Darla_Novak.json
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Sunil_Narayana.json
msgid "I'm part of Hub 01's maintenance crew."
msgstr "Soy parte del equipo de mantenimiento del Hub 01."

#. ~ Name suffix of a female NPC
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Darla_Novak.json
msgid "building maintenance"
msgstr "mantenimiento de instalaciones"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ Trucker and now general handyman.  Used to work as a cargo driver for a company supplying Hub 01, is only inside the lab by chance.
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Jonathan_Farrier.json
msgid "Hub 01 Assistant"
msgstr "Asistente del Hub 01"

#. ~ Job description of "Hub 01 Assistant" NPC class
#. ~ Trucker and now general handyman.  Used to work as a cargo driver for a company supplying Hub 01, is only inside the lab by chance.
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Jonathan_Farrier.json
msgid "I do miscellaneous jobs within Hub 01."
msgstr "Me encargó de varias tareas dentro del Hub 01."

#. ~ Unique name of a male NPC
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Jonathan_Farrier.json
msgid "Jonathan Farrier"
msgstr "Jonathan Farrier"

#. ~ Name suffix of a male NPC
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Jonathan_Farrier.json
msgid "assistant"
msgstr "asistente"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ HVAC maintenance.  Resident dungeon master.
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Sunil_Narayana.json
msgid "Hub 01 Server Maintenance"
msgstr "Mantenimiento de Servidores del Hub 01"

#. ~ Unique name of a male NPC
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Sunil_Narayana.json
msgid "Sunil Narayana"
msgstr "Sunil Narayana"

#. ~ Name suffix of a male NPC
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_basement_npcs/NPC_Sunil_Narayana.json
msgid "server maintenance"
msgstr "mantenimiento de servidores"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid ""
"&An intercom is embedded into the wall here, just next to the card reader.  "
"It's a metal box about as big as a dinner plate, with a speaker shaped like "
"a downwards curve and a large camera prominently featured in the center.  "
"You see a single metal button with a dark LED next to it.  The intercom is "
"silent."
msgstr ""
"&Aquí hay un intercomunicador metido en la pared, al lado de un lector de "
"tarjetas. Es una caja de metal del tamaño de un plato con un altavoz y una "
"cámara grande prominente en el centro. Ves un solo botón metálico con un LED "
"oscuro al lado. El intercomunicador está en silencio."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid ""
"&The intercom crackles with static as it turns on.  The LED next to the "
"button lights up a bright red, and the camera lens whirrs as it focuses on "
"you.  There is no immediate response."
msgstr ""
"&El intercomunicador hace un crujido de estática y se enciende. El LED al "
"lado del botón se enciende con un rojo brillante y la cámara hace un zumbido "
"al enfocarse en ti. No hay una respuesta inmediata."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid ""
"&The intercom erupts into static.  Then, it resolves into a voice.  It "
"clears its throat, then speaks slowly and carefully.  \"Understood.  There "
"is a tray embedded beneath the intercom.  Please place the drive into it.\"  "
"On cue, a small portion of the wall beneath the intercom slides out along "
"rails, revealing a large tray several inches deep.  \"You are welcome to "
"leave afterwards.\""
msgstr ""
"&El intercomunicador estalla de estática. Luego, se convierte en una voz. "
"Aclara su garganta, habla suave y cuidadosamente. \"Entendido. Hay una "
"bandeja debajo del intercomunicador. Por favor, pon el disco ahí.\" En ese "
"momento, una pequeña porción de la pared debajo del intercomunicador se "
"desliza revelando una gran bandeja. \"Eres bienvenido de retirarte después "
"de dejarlo.\""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid ""
"&The intercom hisses.  A voice of indeterminate sex speaks flatly.  \"I "
"don't know who you are or how you got to this location, but we have nothing "
"to gain from one another.  If you have a reason to be here, then please "
"state your business.  Otherwise, please leave the area.\""
msgstr ""
"&El intercomunicador hace un siseo. Una voz de género indeterminado habla "
"monótonamente. \"No sé quién eres o cómo llegaste hasta aquí pero no tenemos "
"ninguna forma de beneficiarnos mutuamente. Si tienes alguna razón para estar "
"aquí, entonces por favor, declara tus intenciones. Si no, por favor, sal de "
"este lugar.\""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "&The intercom is silent."
msgstr "&El intercomunicador está en silencio."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid ""
"&The tray slides shut.  \"Thank you.\"  The intercom turns off without "
"another word."
msgstr ""
"&La bandeja se cierra. \"Gracias.\" El intercomunicador se apaga sin decir "
"palabra."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "About that hard drive…"
msgstr "Acerca de ese disco duro…"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "And the trading we agreed on?"
msgstr "¿Y el trato que habíamos acordado?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Ask Gavin."
msgstr "Preguntale a Gavin."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid ""
"Certainly.  I've just finished speaking with a certain individual, who has "
"authorized you limited access to a selection of our internal stores.  We "
"will provide you with pay for contracts in the form of tokens to be used as "
"an exchange currency, which you can then trade for goods.  We are also "
"amenable to bartering in exchange for supplies that are currently difficult "
"for us to obtain from outside the facility, and are especially interested in "
"any…especially unusual items you may find."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Don't do anything stupid."
msgstr "No hagas nada estúpido."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Don't loiter."
msgstr "No te entretengas."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Get with it."
msgstr "Hazte cargo.Hazte cargo."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Hold on, who are you?  And what do you want with the data?"
msgstr "Un momento, ¿quiénes son ustedes? ¿Y para qué quieren la información?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid ""
"I don't have the drive with me right now; I'll give it to you when I have it."
msgstr "No tengo el disco duro en este momento, se lo daré cuando lo tenga."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid ""
"I have a delivery from the Free Merchants.  You requested a hard drive from "
"them."
msgstr ""
"Tengo una entrega de los Mercaderes Libres. Ustedes pidieron un disco duro "
"de ellos"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "I have to go."
msgstr "Me tengo que ir."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid ""
"I promise you, there is nothing you can do for us.  Now leave, before I'm "
"forced to-\"  They stop suddenly.  You hear a short, muffled conversation "
"from the other end.  There's a brief pause.  \"Alright.  We might be able to "
"gain some mutual benefit.  It's a dangerous task, but if you complete it "
"then we would be willing to open up limited trading access."
msgstr ""
"Te juro que no hay nada que puedas hacer por nosotros. Ahora, vete antes de "
"que me vea forzado a-\" Se detiene súbitamente. Escuchas una conversación "
"corta y apagada en el otro lado. Hay una breve pausa. \"Está bien. Puede que "
"haya una forma de tener un beneficio mutuo. Es una tarea peligrosa pero si "
"la realizas vamos a estar dispuestos a abrirte acceso a comerciar de forma "
"limitada."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "I'll keep that in mind.  Let's get down to business."
msgstr "Voy a tener eso en cuenta. Vamos a ponernos a trabajar."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "I'm just looking for valuables.  Maybe we can trade?"
msgstr ""
"Solo estoy buscando algo de valor, ¿tal vez podamos intercambiar cosas?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "If/you speak to/understand… you/me. Yes?"
msgstr "Si hablas/entiendes... tú/yo. ¿Sí?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "It's the apocalypse out here!  Please just let me in!"
msgstr "¡Es el apocalipsis aquí afuera! ¡Por favor, déjenme entrar!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Let's discuss contracts."
msgstr "Vamos a discutir los contratos."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Look, there must be something we can work out."
msgstr "Mira, tiene que haber alguna forma de poder resolverlo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Make it quick."
msgstr "Hazlo rápido."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Mercenary."
msgstr "Mercenario."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid ""
"Oh!  Good.  We had written that off as a non-starter.  Just drop it into the "
"tray and we'll bring it in."
msgstr ""
"¡Oh! Bien. Ya lo habíamos descartado por imposible. Déjalo en la bandeja y "
"nosotros lo meteremos."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Please don't bother us senselessly."
msgstr "Por favor, no nos molestes sin sentido."

#. ~ Job description of "intercom" NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Reading this line is a bug"
msgstr "Leer esta línea es un bug"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid ""
"Right.  Your handling of this situation was exemplary, and it's clear to us "
"that we greatly underestimated our potential for mutual benefit.  If you are "
"interested, we are willing to offer you more work going forward, and all of "
"it will have proper compensation from now on."
msgstr ""
"Correcto. Tu manejo de la situación fue ejemplar y está claro para nosotros "
"que subestimamos nuestro potencial para el beneficio mutuo. Si estás "
"interesado, estamos dispuestos a ofrecerte más trabajo de aquí en adelante y "
"todos tendrán la compensación adecuada."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid ""
"Risk my neck for the privilege of trading with you?  Maybe another time."
msgstr ""
"¿Arriesgarme por el privilegio de comerciar con ustedes? Tal vez en otro "
"momento."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Say again?"
msgstr "¿Repítelo?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Say it."
msgstr "Dilo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "So, do you need something?"
msgstr "Entonces, ¿necesitas algo?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Sorry, forgot to grab the drive.  I'll return with it."
msgstr "Perdón, me olvidé de coger el disco duro. Ahora vuelvo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Speak slowly and clearly.  Please."
msgstr "Habla despacio y claramente. Por favor."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Thank you.  Was there anything else you needed?"
msgstr "Gracias. ¿Necesita algo más?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid ""
"The merchant at the refugee center sent me.  You were looking for a hard "
"drive from them?"
msgstr ""
"Me manda el comerciante del centro de refugiados. ¿Estabas buscando un disco "
"duro de ellos?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid ""
"The traders at the refugee center asked me to deliver this drive of FEMA "
"data…"
msgstr ""
"Los comerciantes del centro de refugiados me pidieron que entregara este "
"disco con datos de la FEMA…"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "The traders mentioned you were looking for help."
msgstr "Los comerciantes me dijeron que estabais buscando ayuda."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Ugh, I hate intercom duty… oh, um.  Hello."
msgstr "Ugh, odio contestar el intercomunicador… oh, eh. Hola."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Um, can anyone hear me?"
msgstr "Um, ¿Me escuchan?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Wait, what?"
msgstr "Espera, ¿qué?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "We look forward to working with you."
msgstr "Tenemos ganas de trabajar contigo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Talk to the Rescue Pilot"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "Well?"
msgstr "¿Y bien?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "What am I getting out of this?"
msgstr "¿Y yo qué recibo a cambio de esto?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "What's up with the interference in this thing?"
msgstr "¿Qué pasa con la interferencia en esta cosa?"

#. ~ Reason for a shopkeeper blacklist entry
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Will not buy back their own gear"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Yes, mercenary?"
msgstr "¿Sí, mercenario?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "You do realize that the front door is just open?"
msgstr "¿Te das cuenta de que la puerta principal está abierta?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid ""
"You may rarely come across certain items which have been affected by the…"
"ongoing phenomena.  They may seem like mundane household objects, but "
"exhibit properties which seem to defy casual explanation.  I'm afraid that "
"we cannot be clearer on this matter - suffice to say that you will likely "
"know it when you see it.  We are willing to barter for these items at a high "
"value."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "You mentioned wanting unusual items?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "You mentioned you had a map of the area?"
msgstr "¿Dijiste que tenías un mapa del área?"

#. ~ Refusal reason for a shop item group
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "You're not yet qualified to buy this"
msgstr "No estas cualificado para comprar esto"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "[Bang on the metal door.]"
msgstr "[Golpear la puerta metálica.]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "[Hand over the FEMA data.]"
msgstr "[Entregar la información de FEMA.]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "[Identify yourself before the intercom.]"
msgstr "[Identificarte ante el intercomunicador.]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "[Press the button.]"
msgstr "[Apretar el botón.]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid ""
"[Tap the camera lens.]  Look, I know someone's listening.  What is this "
"place?"
msgstr ""
"[Golpear la lente de la cámara.] Oye, sé que alguien está escuchando. ¿Qué "
"es este lugar?"

#. ~ Unique name of a female NPC
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "the intercom"
msgstr "el intercom"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "…Hello?"
msgstr "…Hola?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"\"Other dangers\" is a little vague.  Do you have anything more substantial?"
msgstr ""
"\"Otros peligros\" es un poco vago. ¿Tienes algo más sustancial para decirme?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"&Over the course of several minutes, you calmly detail the events at the "
"facility: the unexpected zombie presence underground, the anomalous nature "
"of the experiment floor, and the encounter with the warped and hostile "
"research staff trapped in the corridor.  Throughout, the voice interjects "
"with questions, the sounds of typing filling the pauses.\n"
"\n"
"\"We appreciate your thorough report,\" the voice finally responds.  \"Your "
"handling of the circumstances was commendable considering the anomalous and "
"unpredictable nature of the facility.  If you seek further contract work, "
"rest assured, we'll take into account the potential for anomalous "
"circumstances in future assignments and relay them accordingly.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"&Over the course of several minutes, you explain what happened at the ruins: "
"the zombie presence and gigantic tendrils on the surface, and the biological "
"infestation completely taking over the basement, as well as the hostile "
"threats encountered therein.  The voice periodically interjects with "
"questions or statements; the whole time, you hear the sounds of typing on a "
"keyboard.\n"
"\n"
"\"We would like to extend our thanks for your detailed report.  It is clear "
"to us that the threat level present at the manufacturer was far higher than "
"we had originally anticipated, and your performance in the situation was "
"exemplary.  Should you desire further contract work, we will bear these "
"facts in mind, and ensure that the threat prognoses of your future "
"assignments are adequately assessed.\""
msgstr ""
"&Durante varios minutos, explicas lo que pasó en las ruinas: la presencia "
"zombi y los zarcillos gigantescos en la superficie, y la invasión biológica "
"cubriendo completamente todo el sótano, y también las amenazas hostiles que "
"había dentro. Periódicamente, la voz interrumpe con preguntas o "
"afirmaciones; todo el tiempo, escuchas el sonido de escribir en un teclado.\n"
"\n"
"\"Nos gustaría extender nuestro agradecimiento por tu informe detallado. Nos "
"queda claro que el nivel de amenaza presente en el fabricante es más alto de "
"lo que habíamos anticipado, y tu desempeño en la situación fue ejemplar. Si "
"deseas algún contrato más, vamos a tener estas cosas en consideración, y nos "
"aseguraremos que el diagnóstico de las amenazas de tus futuras tareas sean "
"evaluadas adecuadamente.\""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"&The intercom is silent for a few seconds while the tray slides back in.  "
"\"Yes it is.  It's unfortunate that only the data was salvageable, but you "
"have our thanks for returning it nonetheless.\""
msgstr ""
"&El intercomunicador se queda en silencio por unos segundos mientras la "
"bandeja vuelve a deslizarse dentro. \"Sí. Es una lástima que solo pudo "
"recuperarse la información pero de todas maneras, te agradecemos que lo "
"hayas traído.\""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"&The intercom tray quickly slides shut.\n"
"\n"
"\"We expected nothing less.  We hope you found the hm12's performance to be "
"satisfactory.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"&The intercom tray quickly slides shut.  After a pause, the voice on the "
"other end sighs.\n"
"\n"
"\"…we requested that the subject remain intact.  This outcome is… "
"unfortunate.  We will process the specimen, but it is unlikely that it will "
"yield usable information as to its purpose.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"You may keep the dazzle rifle.  You are dismissed.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "&The intercom waits patiently."
msgstr "&El intercomunicador espera pacientemente."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"&The intercom's tray slides shut.\n"
"\n"
"\"This is the case; thank you.  Transferring the stipulated amount now.\"  "
"The tray slides back open with your payment.  \"As an additional form of "
"payment, you have been given clearance to receive a map of the area around "
"this site, to assist in your work.  The standing price is 1 HGC; please "
"inform us if you'd like to follow up on that offer going forward."
msgstr ""
"&La bandeja del intercomunicador se cierra.\n"
"\n"
"\"Este es el estuche; gracias. Transfiriendo el montante estipulado en este "
"momento.\" La bandeja se abre con tu pago. \"Como pago adicional, te hemos "
"otorgado autorización para recibir un mapa del área de este lugar, para "
"ayudarte en tu trabajo. El precio es de 1 MOH; por favor, infórmanos si "
"quieres continuar con esa oferta."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"&The voice hesitates.  \"About that.  Give me a moment.\"  After a pause, "
"you hear muffled back-and-forth conversation.  You can't make out what's "
"being said, but you can make out at least two other distinct voices."
msgstr ""
"&La voz duda. \"Acerca de eso. Danos un momento.\" Luego de una pausa, "
"escuchas una conversación apagada. No llegas a entender qué dicen pero por "
"lo menos escuchas que hay dos voces diferentes."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "&The voice on the other side of the intercom is silent with disbelief."
msgstr ""
"&La voz al otro lado del intercomunicador se queda incrédula en silencio."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"About that.\"  You hear papers shuffling.  \"Our drones are unable to "
"approach the structure too closely, as a large amount of interference "
"prevents surveillance, but long-distance measurements reveal a high "
"concentration of toxic compounds in the air, as well as densely-clustered "
"heat signatures.  We expect a high concentration of undead, and other "
"dangers are likely."
msgstr ""
"Acerca de eso.\" Escuchas como mueve unos papeles. \"Nuestros drones no son "
"capaces de acercarse a la estructura porque una gran cantidad de "
"interferencia evita la vigilancia, pero medidas a larga distancia revelan "
"una gran concentración de compuestos tóxicos en el aire, y también signos de "
"calor densamente agrupado. Esperamos una gran concentración de muertos "
"vivientes y es probable que haya otros peligros."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"All I can tell you is that they were conducting cutting-edge research "
"related to-\" The intercom abruptly cuts off for several seconds before "
"coming back on, the voice sounding apologetic, \"Sorry, but as it turns out "
"I'm not at liberty to divulge that information."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Alright, I'll see if I can't get that data for you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Alright, I've done my part.  What now?"
msgstr "Bien, ya hice mi parte. ¿Y ahora qué?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Alright, alright."
msgstr "De acuerdo, esta bien."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"And after ALL THAT, I find your manufacturing lab on the other end of this "
"thing straight out of a fever dream nightmare, and after ALL THAT, I find "
"your photonics, and then I have to get ALL THE WAY out of the ENTIRE ZOMBIE-"
"INFESTED TOWN so I could bring you your stupid fucking template.  Are you "
"happy now?"
msgstr ""
"Y después de TODO ESO, encontré el laboratorio de fabricación en la otra "
"punta de esta cosa salida de una pesadilla febril, y después de TODO ESO, "
"encontré sus fotónicas y después tuve que RECORRER TODO el pueblo INFESTADO "
"DE ZOMBIS para poder traer la plantilla de mierda esta. Espero que estén "
"contentos."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"As we discussed during acceptance of the contract, we were aware of "
"hazardous ground conditions, but we were unable to deduce further "
"information other than what was available through long-range sensing.  If "
"you would like to provide a description of the hazards present, we are "
"willing to document them."
msgstr ""
"Como lo discutimos durante la negociación del contrato, conocemos las "
"condiciones peligrosas del lugar, pero no pudimos deducir más información "
"que lo disponible a través de sensor de la larga distancia. Si nos brindas "
"una descripción de los peligros presentes, estaremos dispuestos a "
"documentarlo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"At the moment, their origin is unclear.  The temperature profile of the "
"building is highly unusual, despite the damage, and is much denser than "
"wandering hordes observed through remote scouting.  A large amount of heat "
"consistent with an extremely high density of organisms appears to be "
"emanating from the basement itself.  We are, unfortunately, in the dark "
"about the cause of this density.  We would advise you remain observant and "
"note down any abnormalities."
msgstr ""
"Por el momento, su origen es incierto. El perfil de temperatura del edificio "
"es altamente inusual a pesar del daño, y es mucho más denso que las hordas "
"errantes observadas de manera remota. Una gran cantidad de calor consistente "
"con una densidad extremadamente alta de organismos parece estar emanando del "
"mismo sótano. Lamentablemente, no sabemos nada sobre la causa de su "
"densidad. Te recomendamos mantenerte atento y anotar cualquier anormalidad."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Back to the contract itself…"
msgstr "Volviendo al contrato…"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Correct.  The source of the chemicals is unknown, as is the exact "
"composition; only trace amounts are present in the air itself.  We can, "
"however, extrapolate that something within the ruins is creating highly "
"poisonous emissions.  We do not know how strong these emissions will become, "
"or what form they will take."
msgstr ""
"Correcto. La fuente de los químicos es desconocida, como tampoco conocemos "
"su composición exacta; solo hay muestras presentes en el mismo aire. "
"Podemos, sin embargo, extrapolar que algo dentro de las ruinas está creando "
"emisiones altamente venenosas. No sabemos qué tan fuertes son esas emisiones "
"o qué forma tomaran."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Data Retrieval"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Description, huh?  Where to begin?  Let's start with the giant mob of "
"zombies that was infesting the building.  Oh, and there were also horrors "
"full of toxic gas that exploded when I got near them or killed one, so I was "
"constantly choking on fumes the whole time."
msgstr ""
"¿Descripción? ¿Por dónde empezar? Empecemos por la gigante horda de zombis "
"que estaba infestando el edificio. Ah, y también había horrores llenos de "
"gas tóxico que explotaban cuando me acercaba o cuando mataba a uno, así que "
"estuve atragantándome con esos gases todo el tiempo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Did you have any other concerns?"
msgstr "¿Tienen alguna otra preocupación?"

#. ~ Description of mission "Iron Safari"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Disable and retrieve the unusual robot by <color_yellow>successfully "
"stunning it with the provided hm12 dazzle rifle or a scrambler grenade,</"
"color> then <color_yellow>quickly running up and deactivating the robot "
"before it recovers from the stun</color>.  You can keep shooting it while "
"it's stunned to prolong the time until it is active again.  You can "
"intercept the robot indicated by Hub 01, or find an inactive robot somewhere "
"else.  <color_yellow>You'll need some experience in electronics or mechanics "
"to disable it</color>."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Do you have any idea what I just went through?"
msgstr "¿Tienen alguna idea de lo que tuve que hacer?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Do you have any more work for me right now?"
msgstr "¿Tenéis algún otro trabajo para mí en este momento?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Dr. Prado knew the risks, and she chose to follow through with the test "
"anyway.  Her death is cause for sadness, and it will affect us, but you "
"didn't even know her.  At least now, something of her work will remain."
msgstr ""
"La Dra. Prado conocía los riesgos y eligió hacer la prueba de todas maneras. "
"Su muerte es causa de tristeza y nos afectará pero tu no la conocías. Por lo "
"menos ahora, algo de su trabajo permanecerá."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"During the Cataclysm, we lost contact with one of our sister sites, LIXA.  "
"Aerial surveillance indicates that the facility's inhabitants are deceased, "
"and beyond the now-zombified security detail, the site should be sparsely "
"populated.  We want you to enter the facility and make a copy of what they "
"were researching on the provided thumb drive.  Additionally, we will be "
"providing you with a keycard that should at the very least get you in the "
"front door.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"We're offering a standard 5 HGC for successful retrieval of the data.  If "
"that isn't enough of an incentive, we do have a manifest from before we lost "
"contact with the facility showing a handful of specialized powered suits in "
"inventory.  You are free to take any that are left."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Excellent.  Thank you very much.\"  The intercom recites a series of "
"coordinates.  \"Exercise a great deal of caution.  We do not know what the "
"conditions on the ground are like.  Use your best judgment.  As before, we "
"are willing to offer you protective gear, if you would like it."
msgstr ""
"Excelente. Muchas gracias.\" El intercomunicador recita una serie de "
"coordinadas. \"Procede con mucha cautela. No sabemos qué condiciones son en "
"el suelo. Utiliza tu juicio. Como antes, estamos dispuestos a ofrecerte "
"equipamiento protector, si quieres."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Extremely dangerous?  What kind of danger should I expect?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Fantastic.\"  The intercom's tray slides shut, and then opens shortly "
"afterwards with your payment.  \"You have our thanks and our payment."
msgstr ""
"Fantástico.\" La bandeja del intercomunicador se cierra y luego se abre con "
"tu pago. \"Tienes nuestro agradecimiento y nuestro pago."

#. ~ Description of mission "Return to sender"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Find the corpse of a Hub 01's AI researcher and retrieve the hard case they "
"brought with them during the evacuation."
msgstr ""
"Encuentra el cadáver del investigador de IA del Hub 01 y recupera el estuche "
"rígido que llevaba durante la evacuación."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Give me a moment to look at your file… here we are.  Valid assignments are "
"turning up empty at the moment.  I'm afraid we have no open contracts for "
"you."
msgstr ""
"Dame un momento que miro tu archivo… aquí está. Las asignaciones válidas "
"están vacías en este momento. Lamentablemente, no tenemos contratos para "
"ofrecerte."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "I can handle it.  Where is the test site?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"I don't believe I'm cleared to-\"  You hear brief chatter.  \"Apologies; I "
"was mistaken.  The manufacturer was, technically speaking, kept secret from "
"the public.  As a result, it operated using an office tower as a front, and "
"was located underground.  An elevator in the back of the building led to the "
"basement, but it was likely destroyed in the damage - as a result, you will "
"need to find a way down yourself.  While there were stairs as well, it's "
"highly likely that they have been destroyed.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"We advise bringing a way to safely enter and exit the lower level; a "
"grappling hook would work well for this purpose.  Given the damage, the "
"elevator shaft itself probably remains intact, and would be your likeliest "
"point of entry to the underground portion of the building."
msgstr ""
"\"No creo que esté autorizado a...\" Se oye una breve charla. \"Mis "
"disculpas; me equivoqué. El fabricante, técnicamente hablando, se mantenía "
"en secreto para el público. Por eso, operaba utilizando una torre de "
"oficinas como fachada, y estaba situada en el subsuelo. Un ascensor en la "
"parte trasera del edificio conducía al sótano, pero probablemente fue "
"destruido por los daños. Aunque también había escaleras, es muy probable que "
"hayan sido destruidas\".\n"
"\n"
"\"Aconsejamos llevar una forma de entrar y salir con seguridad del nivel "
"inferior; un gancho de agarre funcionaría bien para este propósito. Dados "
"los daños, es probable que el hueco del ascensor siga intacto, y sería el "
"punto de entrada más probable a la parte subterránea del edificio.\""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"I found it.  I found your template.  [Hand over the silicon photonics "
"template.]"
msgstr ""
"Lo encontré. Encontré tu plantilla. [Entregar plantilla fotónica con "
"silicona.]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "I found the robot, but…  [Hand over the trifacet remains.]"
msgstr "Encontré el robot pero… [Entregar los restos del tricara.]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "I think I'll pass."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "I would like that gear, yes.  Tell me about it."
msgstr "Sí, me gustaría tener ese equipo protector. Cuéntame un poco de eso."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "I'll be back soon."
msgstr "Volveré enseguida."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "I'll do it.  Where is the test site?"
msgstr "Lo voy a hacer. ¿Dónde queda ese lugar de pruebas?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "I'll pass on getting killed today, thanks."
msgstr "Mejor paso en eso de hacer que me maten, gracias."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "I'll take it.  Where's the convoy?"
msgstr "Acepto. ¿Dónde está la caravana?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "I'm back from LIXA.  [Hand over the data.]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "I'm back from the convoy.  [Hand over the hard case.]"
msgstr "Ya volví de la caravana. [Entregar el estuche duro.]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "I'm interested in that map."
msgstr "Estoy interesado en ese mapa."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "If I lose the ID card or the memory stick, what should I do?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"If you'll give me a moment…\"  You hear the sounds of typing.  \"Its "
"designation is hm12, you may have seen it in the news.  It is a weapon which "
"is mostly harmless to living targets, but is specifically designed to "
"incapacitate robots without harming their internals.  Once a subject is "
"stunned, it can be manually deactivated; That is, you must approach it and "
"turn it off before it reactivates.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"A shot will only stun the robot if you manage to hit its main sensory "
"array, which will require good aim.  In short, try to use the weapon to stun "
"it, then run up to it and examine it to find the, er, off switch."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mission "Return Field Data"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Investigate a nearby field and return with Dr. Prado and the robot prototype "
"she was testing.  Failing that, retrieve the I/O recorder stored within the "
"robot.  If the robot remains operational, avoid direct confrontation and use "
"EMP grenades to disable it."
msgstr ""
"Investiga un campo cercano y vuelve con el Dr. Prado y el prototipo de robot "
"que ella estaba probando. En caso de que eso no funcione, recupera la "
"grabadora de E/S almacenada en el robot. Si el robot sigue operativo, evite "
"la confrontación directa y use granadas EMP para desactivarlo."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Iron Safari"
msgstr "Safari de Hierro"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Is \"unfortunate\" how you usually describe someone being eviscerated by a "
"robot?"
msgstr ""
"¿\"Lástima\" es la manera en que describen usualmente que alguien haya sido "
"destripado por un robot?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"It was ambushed on the road.\"  The intercom recites a series of "
"coordinates.  \"Report back with the hard case.  If the researcher brought "
"it with him, it will be intact; have no doubt about that."
msgstr ""
"Fue emboscado en la ruta.\" El intercomunicador recita una serie de "
"coordenadas. \"Vuelve con el estuche rígido. Si el investigador lo tenía con "
"él, debería estar intacto; no tengas duda de eso."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"It's an acronym that stands for Laser Interferometer eXodimensional "
"resonance Assay."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"It's built with experimental combat programming and some heavy-duty armor.  "
"Despite the armor, it's pretty nimble, so unless you've got a vehicle don't "
"expect to outrun it.  We decided to hold off on adding long-range weapons "
"until we finished the initial field testing, so if you can keep your "
"distance, you should be safe."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "It's fine.  At least now we know for the future."
msgstr "Está bien. Por lo menos, ahora ya lo sabemos para el futuro."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Let's do this, then.  Transfer the location."
msgstr "Hagámoslo, entonces. Denme la ubicación."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Let's never do that again."
msgstr "No volvamos a hacer eso otra vez."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Light retrieval"
msgstr "Recuperación de la luz"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Lovely.  Just a moment; we will transfer the hm12 and handling procedures, "
"which includes information of its last recorded location.\"\n"
"\n"
"The intercom tray thumps several times as objects are placed into it.  After "
"about a minute, it slides open, revealing a slender weapon that looks a bit "
"like a radar gun, a heavy battery, a sheaf of papers in a binder, and a "
"power bank.  \"The hm12 draws power from a power bank, ensure it is charged "
"before engaging.  Please remember to bring the specimen back *intact* - "
"battered salvage is of no use to us.  To safely perform the task of "
"deactivation, please review the provided documentation, and pay special "
"attention to the procedures detailed in subsections IV and VII."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Not yet.  I'll get back to it."
msgstr "Todavía no. Sigo en eso."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Officially speaking, they were a senior DARPA researcher.  Their corpse "
"should stick out; it's likely the only one not wearing camouflage.  That's "
"all you need to know."
msgstr ""
"Hablando oficialmente, había un investigador superior de DARPA. Su cadáver "
"debería sobresalir; debería ser el único que no tiene camuflaje. Eso es todo "
"lo que necesitas saber."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Oh, but that's not all!  They were coming from a pair of giant fucking "
"tentacles coming out of the ground like a monster movie that were constantly "
"roaring and shaking the whole building, and toxic exploding spiders kept "
"crawling off and shooting poison darts at me until I got away or stopped the "
"tentacles themselves, which wasn't easy because the entire building had come "
"down around them."
msgstr ""
"¡Ah, pero eso no fue todo! Venían de un par de tentáculos gigantes de mierda "
"que salían del suelo como un monstruo de película que constantemente rugían "
"y hacían temblar todo el edificio, y unas arañas tóxicas me disparaban "
"dardos con veneno hasta que me alejaba o frenaba a los tentáculos, que no "
"era fácil porque el edificio entero se había caído alrededor de ellos."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"One of our scientists recently left the building to perform a field test of "
"a prototype robot, but failed to return.  We have not been able to contact "
"them.  Your job would be to investigate the testing site, and return with "
"her and the prototype.  Failing that, return with the data recorder that was "
"attached to our prototype."
msgstr ""
"Una de nuestros científicos fue hace poco al laboratorio para realizar una "
"prueba de campo en un robot prototipo pero no regresó. No hemos podido "
"contactar con ella. Tu trabajo sera investigar el lugar de pruebas y volver "
"con ella y el prototipo. Si no lo puedes hacer, recupera la grabadora de "
"información que está en el prototipo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"One of our scout drones spotted a partially-malfunctioning robot of "
"unconventional make while tracking an anomalous radiation spike close by.  "
"We project that much knowledge could be gained from a close examination of "
"this subject, and you would be tasked to retrieve it for us intact.  We will "
"equip you with a prototype rifle and instructions on how to use it and "
"deactivate the robot, if you accept.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"The success of this contract requires that the subject be brought back in "
"an inactive state, and *not* destroyed.  A ruined robot is of no scientific "
"value.  We emphasize that you use the hm12 to complete this task, though it "
"will likely be a diffcult shot to make.  A scrambler grenade might also "
"suffice, but an EMP blast would likely destroy the target outright.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Completion of this contract awards 2 HGC, and you will be able to keep the "
"hm12 rifle and the equipment used to operate it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Our facility once sourced advanced photonic circuitry from a nearby robotics "
"manufacturer.  Their building suffered major damage during the portal "
"storms, and collapsed almost entirely.  However, preliminary scouting "
"reveals that the basement prototyping lab likely remains intact.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"We ask you to investigate the ruins, and if possible, retrieve a template "
"for the fabrication of said photonic circuitry.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Completion of this contract awards 8 HGC, the standard heightened-hazard "
"rate.  We are also willing to provide you with a set of protective gear at a "
"considerable discount upon acceptance of the contract."
msgstr ""
"Nuestras instalaciones produjeron una vez un circuito fotónico avanzado de "
"un fabricante cercano de robótica. Su edificio sufrió un gran daño durante "
"las tormentas del portal y se derrumbó casi completamente. Sin embargo, unas "
"exploraciones indican que el laboratorio de prototipos del sótano quedó "
"intacto.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Te pedimos que investigues las ruinas y si es posible, recuperes la "
"plantilla para la fabricación de dicho circuito fotónico.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Completar este contrato se recompensa con 8 MOH, el pago estándar para un "
"peligro elevado. También estamos dispuestos a brindarte equipo protector con "
"un descuento considerable después de aceptar el contrato."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Pardon me.\"  The voice briefly turns away from the microphone and asks "
"something.  \"Very well.  I am cleared to tell you that it appeared near the "
"beginning of the portal storms, and during this time, it was logged and "
"documented.  No attempt was ever made to retrieve it before the government "
"collapsed.  That is all I am able to share with you at this time."
msgstr ""
"Disculpas.\" La voz se aleja brevemente del micrófono y pregunta algo. \"Muy "
"bien. Me habilitaron a decirte que apareció al inicio de las tormentas de "
"portales y durante ese tiempo, fue registrado y documentado. Nunca se "
"intentó recuperarlo antes de que colapsara el gobierno. Eso es todo lo que "
"puedo compartir contigo en este momento."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Please slow down-"
msgstr "Por favor, más despacio-"

#. ~ Description of mission "Data Retrieval"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Reach the LIXA facility, and search the area for anything of interest.  The "
"intercom warned you about a number of undead aboveground, and the high "
"probability of more underground."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mission "Light retrieval"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Reach the collapsed tower basement, and search the ruins for a photonic "
"circuitry template.  The intercom warned you about heavy enemy presence, and "
"of the existence of a hazardous environment."
msgstr ""
"Llega al sótano de la torre colapsada y busca en las ruinas una plantilla de "
"circuitos fotónicos. El intercomunicador te advirtió de la fuerte presencia "
"del enemigo, y de la existencia de un ambiente peligroso."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Return Field Data"
msgstr "Devuelve los Datos de Campo"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Return to sender"
msgstr "Devolver al remitente"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Tell me about these heat signatures."
msgstr "Háblame de esos signos de calor."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Tell me about this rifle."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "That makes-"
msgstr "Eso es-"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "That seems trivial.  Is there a catch?"
msgstr "Eso parece trivial. ¿Hay alguna trampa?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"The convoy was composed of vehicles and personnel from the US Army, and it "
"was heavily armed.  Our surveillance of the area has shown that the majority "
"of the slain military personnel have revivified.  Resistance will be heavy, "
"but if possible, you may be able to locate and retrieve the hard case, then "
"exfiltrate without direct combat as long as you can outpace the undead "
"there.  Otherwise, bring a rifle and plenty of ammo."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"The handling procedures you gave me seemed to predate the Cataclysm.  How "
"long had that robot been here?"
msgstr ""
"El procedimiento de manejo que me dieron parece ser anterior al Cataclismo. "
"¿Hace cuánto que está este robot por aquí?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "The more I hear about this, the worse it sounds."
msgstr "Cuanto más escucho acerca de esto, peor suena."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "The weapon worked!  [Hand over the inactive trifacet.]"
msgstr "¡El arma funcionó! [Entregar el tricara inactivo.]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Then it took me half an hour to find the way down, because there were holes "
"in the floor everywhere, and when I finally did, I was in the insides of a "
"goddamn flesh pit with flooding up to my ankles, and to complement the "
"innards hanging from the ceiling that I couldn't see through the gas that "
"would throw me ten feet and make me start drowning, there were dozens of "
"people fused together in lumps everywhere, and did I mention the poison "
"gas?  Because they were full of it too, and so everything reeked and it felt "
"like being in a giant fucking intestine full of people."
msgstr ""
"Y me llevó meda hora encontrar la manera de bajar porque había agujeros en "
"el suelo por todas partes y cuando pude bajar, estaba dentro de un pozo de "
"carne enterrado hasta los tobillos, y para complementar, las tripas que "
"colgaban del techo que no podía ver por el gas que me haría ahogarme, había "
"decenas de personas fusionadas juntas en conglomerados por todas partes, y "
"¿te conté lo del gas venenoso? Porque estaba lleno de eso y todo tenía mal "
"olor y se sentía como estar en un intestino gigante lleno de gente."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"There is.  If the robot is operational, it's very likely to be hostile and "
"extremely dangerous.  I don't recommend fighting it directly.  Dr. Prado "
"left the building with a handful of EMP grenades.  If you can locate those "
"grenades, use them to disable the prototype instead."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"To be specific, there have been anomalous readings that we are unable to "
"explain.  Seismic disturbances have been recorded emanating from the ruins, "
"with a magnitude ranging from two to four, and periodic vocalizations have "
"been documented to exceed 150 decibels.  We are uncertain why or how these "
"phenomena are created."
msgstr ""
"Para ser específico, han habido lecturas anómalas que no podemos explicar. "
"Se han grabado perturbaciones sísmicas emanando de las ruinas, con una "
"magnitud de dos a cuatro, y se documentaron vocalizaciones periódicas que "
"exceden los 150 decibelios. No estamos seguros de por qué o cómo se crean "
"estos fenómenos."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Toxic compounds?"
msgstr "¿Compuestos tóxicos?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Transferring the items now.\"  The intercom tray slides open, revealing an "
"ID card for the facility and what looks like a USB thumb drive.  \"Again: "
"please take care not to lose either of these since we can't exactly make "
"more of them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<acknowledged>"
#. ~ Generic acknowledgment of a command.  Comes up a lot and could use more variety.
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/old_guard/NPC_Old_Guard_FOB_officer.json
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Understood."
msgstr "Comprendido."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Very close by.\"  The voice lists off some relative coordinates.  \"Good "
"luck."
msgstr "Muy cerca.\" La voz dice unas coordinadas relativas. \"Buena suerte."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"We are as of yet uncertain of its origin and purpose.  Its body most closely "
"resembles a pyramid on what we believe are three sets of legs for mobility.  "
"It is lightly armed, and has attacked our cam-spy drones using high-voltage "
"electric discharge.  We theorize that this is most likely for deterrence, "
"and not to cause direct harm.  Nonetheless, we need to emphasize that its "
"full capabilities are unknown, and we do not know how it will react when "
"confronted with a living threat."
msgstr ""
"No estamos seguros de su origen y propósito. Su cuerpo recuerda una pirámide "
"en lo que pensamos que son tres conjuntos de patas para moverse. Está muy "
"armado y ha atacado nuestros drones espías utilizando descargas eléctricas "
"de alto voltaje. Tenemos la teoría que es mayormente para disuadir y no para "
"causar daño directo. Sin embargo, tenemos que enfatizar en que sus "
"capacidades son desconocidas y no sabemos cómo reaccionará cuando sea "
"confrontado por una amenaza viviente."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Well, the ID card wouldn't strictly speaking be necessary if you were to "
"find some way of breaching the facility's security doors.\" The voice pauses "
"for a moment, \"But that said we only have the one ID card, so unless you're "
"confident you can get in without it, please don't lose it.  As for the "
"memory stick I would highly recommend you not lose that as portable drives "
"with the required hardware security modules to interface with secure "
"terminals are in short supply these days.  However there may very well be "
"some on-site for you to scavenge if you're lucky."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "What can you tell me about what they were doing there?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "What do you mean by-"
msgstr "¿A qué te referís con-"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "What does LIXA even mean?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "What else do you have available?"
msgstr "¿Qué mas tienen disponible?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "What is this robot, and what does it look like?"
msgstr "¿Qué es este robot y qué apariencia tiene?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "What should I expect to go up against?"
msgstr "¿Y qué tengo que esperar encontrarme en contra?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "What would you like to discuss?"
msgstr "¿Qué te gustaría discutir?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"When the portal storms started, the government issued an evacuation order "
"for critical personnel and sent convoys to retrieve them, with our head of "
"AI research among the recalled.  We recently discovered that he died when "
"the convoy transferring him was ambushed in the initial chaos, but his "
"corpse and belongings might remain intact enough to benefit from his "
"research.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"We want you to travel to the convoy and locate the body, if possible.  His "
"evacuation protocol included retrieving and storing as much of the data from "
"his facility as possible, to be stored in a code-locked hard case.  If this "
"hard case is present, retrieve it, and bring it back here.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"We offer the standard hazard pay of 4 HGC for this contract."
msgstr ""
"Cuando comenzaron las tormentas del portal, el gobierno ordenó una "
"evacuación para el personal fundamental y envió vehículos para escoltarlos, "
"con nuestro director de investigación de IA entre los retirados. Descubrimos "
"recientemente que murió cuando el equipo que lo estaba trasladando fue "
"emboscado dentro del caos inicial, pero su cadáver y pertenencias pueden "
"mantenerse intactos como para beneficiarnos de sus investigaciones.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Queremos que vayas hasta la caravana y encuentres el cuerpo, de ser "
"posible. Su protocolo de evacuación incluía conseguir y almacenar  la mayor "
"cantidad posible de información de estas instalaciones, para ser almacenada "
"en un estuche rígido con código. Si ese estuche está presente, traelo.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Ofrecemos el pago estándar por peligro de 4 MOH por este contrato."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Where is this manufacturer?"
msgstr "¿Dónde está este fabricante?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Who was this person, and what do they look like?"
msgstr "¿Quién era esta persona y qué apariencia tiene?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Will this weapon work on other robots, as well?"
msgstr "¿Esta arma funciona con otros robots también?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Yeah, yeah.  You're welcome."
msgstr "Sí, sí. De nada."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Yes, almost certainly.  UGVs, autonomous CROWS units, manhacks, and other "
"drones should all be vulnerable to the weapon, although we advise great "
"caution; as you might have found, it can be difficult to precisely hit the "
"target."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "You certainly gave me a run for my money, I'll say that much."
msgstr "Ciertamente, me pusieron un reto digno, eso hay que decirlo."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "You mention hazard pay.  What dangers are there?"
msgstr "Mencionaste paga por peligro. ¿Qué peligros hay?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "You're back.  Do you have anything to report?"
msgstr "Ya has vuelto. ¿Tienes algo para reportar?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "You've got a deal.  I'll track down your robot."
msgstr "Quedamos así entonces. Voy a rastrear a ese robot."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Your hesitation is understandable.  Unfortunately, we have already taken all "
"possible measures to obtain data and information remotely, but we are unable "
"to develop our understanding further without a physical presence."
msgstr ""
"Tu duda es entendible. Lamentablemente, ya hemos tomado todas las medidas "
"posibles para obtener información remotamente pero no podemos comprender más "
"sin estar físicamente presentes."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"Your scientist was dead, but I disabled the prototype.  Is this what you "
"were looking for?  [Hand over the prototype I/O recorder.]"
msgstr ""
"Tu científico está muerto pero pude deshabilitar el prototipo. ¿Esto es lo "
"que estaban buscando? [Entregar la grabadora I/O prototipo]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "[Contract: Data Retrieval]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "[Contract: Iron Safari]"
msgstr "[Contrato: Safari de Hierro]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "[Contract: Light retrieval]"
msgstr "[Contrato: Recuperación ligera]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "[Contract: Return to sender]"
msgstr "[Contrato: Devolver al remitente]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"[Detail the conditions at the collapsed tower and its basement.  This will "
"advance time by ten minutes.]"
msgstr ""
"[Detallar las condiciones de la torre colapsada y su sótano. Esto hará "
"avanzar diez minutos la hora.]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"[Detail the conditions at the research facility.  This will advance time by "
"ten minutes.]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "[Let them know how bad that mission REALLY was.]"
msgstr "[Hacerles saber lo VERDADERAMENTE difícil que fue la misión.]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"[PER 8] The original markings on that case had been scratched out.  Who did "
"it really belong to?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "[Stop talking.]"
msgstr "[Dejar de hablar.]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "…Just forget it.  Let's never speak of this again."
msgstr "…Olvídate. No volvamos a hablar de esto."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid ""
"…Uh.  We are- thank you for finding the photonics.  We will, ah, make sure "
"that the threat conditions of your future contracts are adequately "
"assessed.  Um.  Thank you."
msgstr ""
"…Uh. Estamos- gracias por encontrar las fotónicas. Nos aseguraremos que las "
"amenazas de tus contratos futuros sean evaluadas adecuadamente. Um. Gracias."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_trades.json
msgid ""
"Given the context of your assignment, we are willing to sell you a set of "
"our protective gear - a gas mask and an environmental suit - at a "
"considerable discount.  We will part with it for two exchange coins.\"  The "
"intercom waits expectantly.  \"Actually, hold on, we might not have one in "
"your size…"
msgstr ""
"Dado el contexto de tu tarea, estamos dispuestos a venderte un conjunto de "
"equipo protector - una máscara de gas y un traje ambiental - con un "
"descuento considerable. Te lo dejamos por dos monedas de cambio.\" El "
"intercomunicador espera expectante. \"En realidad, espera, tal vez no "
"tengamos uno de tu talla…"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_trades.json
msgid "I have to give it a thought."
msgstr "Tengo que pensarlo."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_trades.json
msgid "I'll have to give it some thought."
msgstr "Me lo pensare."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_trades.json
msgid ""
"To assist your operations, we are willing to sell you a map of the local "
"area, as surveyed by our cam-spy drones.  Its standing price is 1 HGC."
msgstr ""
"Para ayudar en tus operaciones estamos dispuestos a venderte un mapa del "
"área local, trazado por nuestros drones espías. Su precio es de 1 MOH."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_trades.json
msgid ""
"What the gas mask does should be obvious; we'll provide you with a "
"cartridge, of course.  The environment suit is full-body, and protects you "
"from water, harmful radiation, and environmental hazards.  It's also rated "
"to protect from electric shocks of up to twelve thousand volts.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Bear in mind that the suit isn't armor.  It will keep you safe from the "
"environment, but it's just Nomex and it won't protect you from anything "
"stronger than a punch.  The modular defense system is designed to fit over "
"it, so I'd urge you to bring them both if fighting is unavoidable."
msgstr ""
"Lo que hace una máscara de gas debería ser bastante obvio, te vamos a dar "
"una carga para ella, por supuesto. El traje ambiental es de cuerpo entero y "
"te protege del agua, radiación dañina y peligros ambientales. También puede "
"proteger contra descargas eléctricas de hasta doce mil voltios.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Acuerdate que el traje no es una armadura. Te protege del ambiente pero es "
"nomex solamente y no te va a proteger de algo más fuerte que una piña. El "
"sistema defensivo modular está diseñado para ponerse encima así que te diría "
"que utilices las dos cosas si no puedes evitar las peleas."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_trades.json
msgid "What will it do for me?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_trades.json
msgid "[1 HGC] Deal!"
msgstr "[1 HGC] ¡Trato hecho!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_trades.json
msgid "[2 HGC] Deal!"
msgstr "[2 HGC] ¡Trato hecho!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid ""
"As I said, that's the thing I need.  You don't need to know what's that "
"exactly.  Just grab all things you find in the safe, and call it a day."
msgstr ""
"Como he dicho, eso es lo que necesito. No necesitas saber qué es eso "
"exactamente. Simplemente coge todas las cosas que encuentres en la caja "
"fuerte, y dalo por hecho."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get the military ID card from the chief's office"
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid ""
"At last!  Give me a second to check if it isn't damaged.  Here, take this "
"for your troubles."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Can we just talk it over?"
msgstr "¿Podemos hablarlo?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get the military ID card from the chief's office"
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Did you get the card already?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid ""
"Do I have a <swear> exclamation sign over my <swear> head, like I'm a "
"<swear> quest-giver from some <swear> video game?"
msgstr ""
"¿Tengo un <swear>signo de exclamación sobre mi <swear>cabeza, como si fuera "
"un <swear>buscador de algún <swear>videojuego?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get the military ID card from the chief's office"
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Fine, I'll get it sooner or later."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Gee, what's the matter with you?  Okay, okay, I'm leaving."
msgstr "Caray, ¿qué te pasa? Vale, vale, me voy."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Get the military ID card from the chief's office"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get the military ID card from the chief's office"
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Great!  Don't try to use the card now, just bring it straight to me."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid ""
"Hello there.  Haven't seen you around before.  You must be from the other "
"wing.  Managed to survive, huh?"
msgstr ""
"Hola. No te he visto antes por aquí. Debes ser del otro pabellón. Te las "
"arreglaste para sobrevivir, ¿eh?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get the military ID card from the chief's office"
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Here's the job…"
msgstr "Este es el trabajo..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Hey, <fuck_you>!"
msgstr "¡Oye, <fuck_you>!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Hey, <fuck_you>!  You'll regret that!"
msgstr "¡Eh <fuck_you>! ¡Te vas a arrepentir!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Hey, no need to be hostile.  Here you go, I don't need it anyway."
msgstr ""
"Eh, no hay necesidad de ser hostil. Aquí tienes, no lo necesito de todos "
"modos."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid ""
"Hey, where did you get it?  Nevermind, just give it to me.  Just <swear> now."
msgstr ""
"Eh, ¿de dónde lo has sacado? No importa, sólo dámelo. Ahora <swear> mismo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Hey, who the fuck are you?  I haven't seen you 'round.  Ah, fuck it, it "
"doesn't matter.\n"
"Here's the rules.  The first and most important one: ALWAYS CLOSE THE "
"FUCKING ENTRY DOOR BEHIND YOUR ASS!  If you're okay with that, the following "
"rules are: don't fuck with us, don't steal from us, don't start a fight "
"without a reason with someone from us.  Got it, punk?  Now get lost."
msgstr ""
"Oye, ¿quién coño eres tú? No te he visto por aquí. Ah, a la mierda, no "
"importa.\n"
"Estas son las reglas. La primera y más importante: ¡CIERRA SIEMPRE LA PUTA "
"PUERTA DE ENTRADA DETRÁS DE TU CULO! Si te parece bien, las siguientes "
"reglas son: no nos jodas, no nos robes, no empieces una pelea sin motivo con "
"alguien de nosotros. ¿Entendido, gamberro? Ahora piérdete."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
