#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
msgid ""
"Well, I'd rather not get into my life before all this.  I have a farm to "
"maintain, after all.  Would be nice, sharing our tales while sipping cold "
"brew beer.  Not at a time like this.  Now if you'll excuse me, I'll be back "
"to work."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
msgid "What's the poor attitude about?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
