msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Always good to see you, friend."
msgstr "Siempre es bueno verte, amigo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Amazing!  My lucky day.  Let's see here.  What can I offer… I can scrounge "
"up some merch bucks for, say, five joints or joints-worth of the good stuff."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Anything you buying or selling, by chance?"
msgstr "¿Algo que compres o vendas, por casualidad?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Boring.  I'm going to go destroy something."
msgstr "Aburrido. Voy a ir a destruir algo."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Bring an acoustic guitar"
msgstr "Trae una guitarra acústica"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Can you play heavy metal on an acoustic guitar?"
msgstr "¿Puedes tocar heavy metal con una guitarra acústica?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Cheers!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Cheers!  Later."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Couldn't hurt."
msgstr "No podría hacer daño."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Daym.  You're probably the best dancer I've ever had the honor of meeting.  "
"Well done.  Well done indeed."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Daym.  You're probably the best dancer I've ever had the honor of meeting.  "
"Well done.  Well done indeed."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Daym.  You're probably the best dancer I've ever had the honor of meeting.  "
"Well done.  Well done indeed."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Do you know any tunes good to dance to?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Unique name of a male NPC
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Draco Dune"
msgstr "Draco Dune"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring an acoustic guitar"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Great!  We'll be makin' music in no time!"
msgstr "¡Genial! ¡Estaremos haciendo música en poco tiempo!"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring an acoustic guitar"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Hell yeah, bud!  You just made a lot of people really happy!  In thanks, "
"I'll have enough cash to offer you more recompense for our little dealings."
msgstr ""
"¡Claro que sí, amigo! ¡Acabas de hacer muy feliz a mucha gente! En "
"agradecimiento, tendré suficiente dinero para ofrecerte más recompensas por "
"nuestros pequeños negocios."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Hey, don't get all serious on me all of a sudden.  It helps me relax.  "
"Lubricates my joints.  Eases the pain, ya know?  Makes every day a bit more "
"bearable."
msgstr ""
"Eh, no te pongas tan serio conmigo de repente. Me ayuda a relajarme. Lubrica "
"mis articulaciones. Alivia el dolor, ¿sabes? Hace cada día un poco más "
"soportable."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Hi Draco, nice to meet you.  I gotta go though."
msgstr "Hola Draco, encantado de conocerte. Tengo que irme."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Hi Draco, nice to see you too.  I gotta go though."
msgstr "Hola Draco, yo también me alegro de verte. Pero tengo que irme."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Hi again, Draco, nice to see you too."
msgstr "Hola de nuevo, Draco, yo también me alegro de verte."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Hi, Draco, how are you doing?"
msgstr "Hola, Draco, ¿cómo estás?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring an acoustic guitar"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "How's my guitar comin', friend?"
msgstr "¿Cómo va mi guitarra, amigo?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring an acoustic guitar"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Huh.  This… is something, isn't it."
msgstr "Huh. Esto... es algo, ¿no?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "I can help."
msgstr "Puedo ayudar."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "I could be persuaded."
msgstr "Podría ser persuadido."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "I don't need to hear amateur-hour karaoke around here.  Goodbye."
msgstr "No necesito escuchar karaoke de aficionados por aquí. Adiós."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "I fight stuff."
msgstr "Yo lucho con cosas."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring an acoustic guitar"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"I just want a functional acoustic guitar.  Preferably one that hasn't been "
"used to cave in any zombie skulls."
msgstr ""
"Sólo quiero una guitarra acústica funcional. Preferiblemente una que no haya "
"sido usada para cavar en ningún cráneo de zombi."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "I think I would've done the same.  Nobody around here has a guitar?"
msgstr "Creo que yo habría hecho lo mismo. ¿Nadie de aquí tiene una guitarra?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "I want to see it all."
msgstr "Quiero verlo todo."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "I'll consider it.  Thanks for the tunes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "I'll tell you what type I am."
msgstr "Te diré qué tipo de persona soy."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "I'm not comfortable with where this is going."
msgstr "No me siento cómodo con el rumbo que está tomando esto."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "I'm not doing this."
msgstr "No voy a hacer esto."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "I'm not your drug dealer, buddy."
msgstr "No soy tu traficante de drogas, amigo."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "I've been thinking about that deal you mentioned."
msgstr "He estado pensando en el trato que mencionaste."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "It's called dub-step and I like it.  Goodbye, old man."
msgstr "Se llama dub-step y me gusta. Adiós, viejo."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Just a sec, got something I need to do first."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Leaving."
msgstr "Me voy."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Let me ask you something.  What type are you?"
msgstr "Déjame preguntarte algo. ¿Qué tipo de persona eres?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Let's talk about getting you that guitar."
msgstr "Hablemos de conseguirte esa guitarra."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Man, just imagine what I could do with a new guitar."
msgstr "Tío, imagina lo que podría hacer con una nueva guitarra."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Maybe I could help with something?"
msgstr "¿Quizás podría ayudar con algo?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Me too!  For now, anyway, that's not really possible for me.  I mean, I "
"guess you know better than me about that.  Man, I used to travel all "
"around.  Saw halfa the States with my guitar on my back.  Now, though, well, "
"I think I'll stay inside til this all flies over."
msgstr ""
"¡Yo también! Por ahora, de todos modos, eso no es realmente posible para mí. "
"Quiero decir, supongo que sabes mejor que yo sobre eso. Hombre, yo solía "
"viajar por todas partes. Vi la mitad de los Estados Unidos con mi guitarra "
"en mi espalda. Ahora, sin embargo, bueno, creo que me quedaré dentro hasta "
"que todo esto se acabe."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Me too!  I did stand-up comedy at a club once.  Well, outside a club "
"anyway.  You know what'd be funny?  Next time one of those stupid ferals "
"starts running around chasing after a squirrel or something, if I had me a "
"guitar I could play the Benny Hill tune and get everybody crackin' up.  "
"Places needs some laughter badly."
msgstr ""
"¡Yo también! Una vez hice una comedia de stand-up en un club. Bueno, fuera "
"de un club de todos modos. ¿Sabes qué sería divertido? La próxima vez que "
"uno de esos estúpidos salvajes empiece a correr detrás de una ardilla o algo "
"así, si tuviera una guitarra podría tocar la canción de Benny Hill y hacer "
"que todo el mundo se partiera de risa. La gente necesita las risas con "
"urgencia."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Me too!  Times are hard for folks and that's no laughing matter.  People "
"need some normality in these times.  Some reminders of how things used to "
"be.  I think a sing-along or two could do folks good."
msgstr ""
"¡Yo también! Los tiempos son duros para la gente y eso no es motivo de risa. "
"La gente necesita algo de normalidad en estos tiempos. Algunos recordatorios "
"de cómo solían ser las cosas. Creo que una o dos canciones podrían hacer "
"bien a la gente."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Me too!  You can understand how folks be wantin' some liveliness in these "
"times.  Some music sure would help with that.  Damn, I miss it.  All I hear "
"is those MP3 players with their tin-can drum machines and whiny vocals.  "
"Help me find a guitar and we'll really get this place smokin'!"
msgstr ""
"¡Yo también! Puedes entender como la gente quiere algo de vida en estos "
"tiempos. Algo de música seguro que ayudaría con eso. Maldición, lo extraño. "
"Todo lo que oigo son esos reproductores MP3 con sus tambores de hojalata y "
"sus voces quejumbrosas. ¡Ayúdame a encontrar una guitarra y conseguiremos "
"que este lugar funcione!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Me too.  It's fight a stay afloat in these times.  Some music would lift all "
"spirits, though, don't you think?"
msgstr ""
"Yo también. Es luchar para mantenerse a flote en estos tiempos. Aunque algo "
"de música levantaría el ánimo, ¿no crees?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Nice to meet you too.  What brings you to these parts?  Got any stories to "
"share?  Happy ones, hopefully… we've had our fill of sadness around here."
msgstr ""
"Encantado de conocerte también. ¿QuEncantado de conocerte también. ¿Qué te "
"trae por aquí? ¿Tienes alguna historia para compartir? Felices, con "
"suerte... ya hemos tenido nuestra ración de tristeza por aquí.é te trae por "
"aquí? ¿Tienes alguna historia para compartir? Felices, con suerte... ya "
"hemos tenido nuestra ración de tristeza por aquí."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Nice to meet you, Draco."
msgstr "Encantado de conocerte, Draco."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "No more indeed."
msgstr "No más, de hecho."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "No problem, Draco."
msgstr "No hay problema, Draco."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring an acoustic guitar"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "No worries.  They don't grow from trees, but we have time."
msgstr "No te preocupes. No crecen de los árboles, pero tenemos tiempo."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "No, not playing this game."
msgstr "No, no estoy jugando este juego."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Nope, sorry."
msgstr "No, lo siento."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Not in the mood to dance, huh?  Or perhaps you should try wearing something "
"less encumbering.  You know, if you want to."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Oh my oh my.  That was impressive!  Sweet moves!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
