msgid ""
"*tips his cowboy hat and sets his feet far apart as he faces you.  \"Howdy, "
"pardner.\""
msgstr ""
"*inclina su sombrero de vaquero y pone sus pies separados cuando se pone "
"delante de ti. \"Buenas, compañero.\""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_John_Clemens.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"*turns to look at you, lifting an enormous cowboy hat off his eyes.  He "
"appears to be in the process of growing out a set of bushy muttonchops and a "
"handlebar moustache.  Bright blue eyes peer out from his wrinkled face.  "
"\"Howdy, pardner.  They call me Clemens.  John Clemens.  I'm an ol' cowhand."
"\""
msgstr ""
"*se gira para mirarte, levantando un enorme sombrero de vaquero para "
"descubrir sus ojos. Parece estar en proceso de dejarse crecer una barba "
"mutton chops. Unos ojos azules brillantes se asoman de su cara arrugada. "
"\"Buenas, compañero. Me dicen Clemens. John Clemens. Soy un viejo vaquero.\""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
