msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Sorry, no.  That's too much to ask from me.  I was back there when it went "
"wrong."
msgstr ""
"Lo siento, no. Eso es demasiado pedir de mí. Yo estaba allí cuando salió mal."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
