msgstr ""
"Lo siento, no. Eso es demasiado pedir de mí. Yo estaba allí cuando salió mal."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/shared_dialogue.json
msgid "That's a big ask, for sure.  Okay, I'll see what I can do."
msgstr "Eso es una gran petición, sin duda. Bien, veré lo que puedo hacer."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/shared_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"This is for Boris?  Yeah, Boris is has been through a lot, I'll do it for "
"him."
msgstr "¿Esto es por Boris? Sí, Boris ha pasado por mucho, lo haré por él."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/shared_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"You won't get much luck asking those of us who were back there I'm afraid.  "
"Sorry."
msgstr ""
"Me temo que no tendrás mucha suerte preguntando a los que estuvimos allí. Lo "
"siento."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid ""
"All three are easy to locally produce in significant quantities and are non-"
"perishable.  We have a local farmer or two and a few hunter types that have "
"been making attempts to provide us with the nutritious supplies.  We do "
"always need more suppliers though.  This stuff is rather cheap in bulk, so I "
"can pay a premium for any you have on you.  Canned food and other edibles "
"are handled by the merchant in the front in trade."
msgstr ""
"Las tres son fáciles de producir localmente en cantidades significativas y "
"no son perecederas. Tenemos un agricultor local o dos y unos pocos tipos de "
"cazadores que han estado haciendo intentos para proporcionarnos los "
"suministros nutritivos. Sin embargo, siempre necesitamos más proveedores. "
"Estas cosas son bastante baratas a granel, por lo que puedo pagar una prima "
"por cualquier cosa que tengas encima. Los alimentos enlatados y otros "
"comestibles son manejados por el mercader del frente en el comercio."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "Are you able to buy some canning supplies?"
msgstr "¿Puedes comprar algunas provisiones enlatadas?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "Are you looking to buy anything else?"
msgstr "¿Quieres comprar algo más?"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ Appears in the refugee center as a bulk trader.  Promotes production of nonperishable food.
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "Broker"
msgstr "Agente de bolsa"

#. ~ Description of mission "In a Pickle Pt. 2"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid ""
"Deliver 50 large three-liter jars in exchange for <reward_count:FMCNote> "
"certified notes."
msgstr ""
"Entrega 50 grandes tarros de tres litros a cambio de <reward_count:FMCNote> "
"notas certificadas."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "Do you know about those beggars in the lobby?"
msgstr "¿Sabes lo de esos mendigos en el vestíbulo?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid ""
"Even once we got things sorted out, there weren't enough beds for everyone, "
"and definitely not enough supplies.  These are harsh times.  We're doing "
"what we can for those folks… at least they've got shelter."
msgstr ""
"Incluso una vez que se habian arreglado las cosas, no hubo suficientes camas "
"ni suministros para todos. Son tiempos difíciles. Hacemos lo que podemos por "
"esa gente... al menos tienen refugio."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "Excellent.  What've you brought us?"
msgstr "Excelente. ¿Qué nos has traído?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "In a Pickle Pt. 2"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "In a Pickle"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_missions.json
msgid "Grocery stores, house kitchens, there's plenty of places to look."
msgstr ""
"Tiendas de comestibles, cocinas de casa, hay muchos lugares donde buscar."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "In a Pickle Pt. 2"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "I do have some work for you."
msgstr "Tengo algún trabajo para ti."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I oversee the food stocks for the center.  There was significant looting "
"during the panic when we first arrived so most of our food was carried "
"away.  I manage what we have left and do everything I can to increase our "
"supplies.  We've got a few growing sources of fresh meats and vegetables, so "
"I prioritize non-perishable food, such as cornmeal, jerky, and fruit wine."
msgstr ""
"Superviso las reservas de alimentos para el centro. Hubo un saqueo "
"significativo durante el pánico cuando llegamos, así que la mayoría de "
"nuestros alimentos fueron arrebatados. Me ocupo de lo que nos queda y hago "
"todo lo que puedo para aumentar nuestros suministros. Tenemos algunas "
"fuentes de carnes y verduras frescas, así que doy prioridad a los alimentos "
"no perecederos, como la harina de maíz, la cecina y el vino de frutas."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
