#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "I was told you had work for me?"
msgstr "Me dijeron que tenías un trabajo para mí."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "In a Pickle Pt. 2"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "I wonder where all the jars went…"
msgstr "Me pregunto adónde fueron todos los tarros..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "I'd better get going.  Bye!"
msgstr "Será mejor que me vaya. ¡Adiós!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid ""
"I'm actually accepting a number of different foodstuffs: beer, sugar, flour, "
"smoked meat, smoked fish, dried fruit and vegetables, cooking oil, "
"preservatives like salt and vinegar; and as mentioned before, jerky, "
"cornmeal, and fruit wine."
msgstr ""
"En realidad estoy aceptando una serie de alimentos diferentes: cerveza, "
"azúcar, harina, carne ahumada, pescado ahumado, frutas y verduras secas, "
"aceite de cocina, conservantes como la sal y el vinagre; y como se mencionó "
"antes, cecina, harina de maíz y vino de frutas."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "I'm here to deliver some food supplies."
msgstr "Estoy aquí para entregar algunas provisiones de comida."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm so glad we've got that up and running.  One of the people evacuated here "
"had a connection to a functioning ranch, and we got him and a crew out there "
"as quickly as we were able.  We're hoping they'll be able to supply us in "
"enough foodstuffs to make this place self-sufficient and even to trade with "
"other communities as they arise."
msgstr ""
"Me alegro de que tengamos eso en marcha. Una de las personas evacuadas aquí "
"tenía una conexión con un rancho en funcionamiento, y lo llevamos a él y a "
"un grupo tan rápido como pudimos. Esperemos que puedan suministrarnos "
"suficientes alimentos para que este lugar sea autosuficiente e incluso para "
"comerciar con otras comunidades mientras aparezcan."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
