msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm a doctor, one of the several at the outpost.  We were the lucky ones.  "
"Came here right went things started to go wrong, never left."
msgstr ""
"Soy médico, uno de los varios que hay en el puesto de avanzada. Nosotros "
"fuimos los afortunados. Vinimos aquí cuando las cosas empezaron a ir mal, "
"nunca mejoraron."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
