msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Have you asked the scavenger boss if they'd have anything?"
msgstr "¿Has preguntado al jefe de los rebuscadores si tienen algo?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_generic.json
msgid "I don't know what I could offer."
msgstr "No sé qué podría ofrecer."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_generic.json
msgid "Maybe the scrapper would have some spare parts?"
msgstr "¿Tal vez el desguace tenga algunas piezas de repuesto?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_generic.json
msgid "Unfortunately, I don't have anything that can help."
msgstr "Por desgracia, no tengo nada que pueda ayudar."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 100 Aspirin"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Aspirin is pretty common in homes and convenience stores."
msgstr "La aspirina es bastante común en los hogares y en las tiendas."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Collect 100 Aspirin"
msgstr "Recolectar 100 Aspirinas"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Collect 200 Multivitamin Pills"
msgstr "Recolectar 200 Pastillas de Multivitaminas"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Collect 3 Hotplates"
msgstr "Recolectar 3 Placa térmica eléctrica Eléctricas"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 4 Charcoal Purifiers"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid ""
"Despite my recommendations, we continue to have travelers come in with "
"illnesses that I've been able to trace back to contaminated drinking water.  "
"When boiling water isn't an option, they need some form of charcoal water "
"filter that they can use.  If you could build me four charcoal water "
"filters, I'll distribute them to groups as they pass through."
msgstr ""
"A pesar de mis recomendaciones, seguimos teniendo viajeros que llegan con "
"enfermedades que he podido rastrear hasta el agua potable contaminada. "
"Cuando hervir el agua no es una opción, necesitan algún tipo de filtro de "
"agua a carbón que puedan usar. Si me construyes cuatro filtros de agua de "
"carbón, los distribuiré a los grupos a medida que pasen."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 200 Multivitamin Pills"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid ""
"Disease is spreading rapidly due to poor nutrition and there is little that "
"I can do about it.  With food being scarce, people are willing to survive on "
"whatever they can.  I need to start supplementing the outpost's diet with "
"vitamins to prevent potential deaths indirectly attributable to nutrition.  "
"I know it is a lot, but if you could bring me 200 multivitamin pills, I'd be "
"able to treat the most vulnerable before they spread anything to the rest of "
"us."
msgstr ""
"La enfermedad se está extendiendo rápidamente debido a la mala nutrición y "
"hay poco que pueda hacer al respecto. Con la escasez de alimentos, la gente "
"está dispuesta a sobrevivir con lo que pueda. Necesito empezar a "
"complementar la dieta del puesto de avanzada con vitaminas para prevenir "
"posibles muertes indirectamente atribuibles a la nutrición. Sé que es mucho, "
"pero si me trajeran 200 píldoras multivitamínicas podría tratar a los más "
"vulnerables antes de que contagien al resto de nosotros."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Advanced Emergency Care"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Do you have the Guide to Advanced Emergency Care?"
msgstr "¿Tienes la Guía de Cuidados de Emergencia Avanzados?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 100 Aspirin"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Do you have the aspirin?"
msgstr "¿Tienes aspirina?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 4 Charcoal Purifiers"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Do you have the charcoal water filters?"
msgstr "¿Tienes filtros de carbón para el agua?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a Chemistry Set"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Do you have the chemistry set?"
msgstr "¿Tienes el equipo de química?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 Syringes"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Do you have the empty syringes?"
msgstr "¿Ya conseguiste las jeringas vacías?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 Filter Masks"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Do you have the filter masks?"
msgstr "¿Tienes las mascarillas de filtro?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 3 Hotplates"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Do you have the hotplates?"
msgstr "¿Tienes placa térmica eléctricas?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 4 Pairs of Rubber Gloves"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Do you have the rubber gloves?"
msgstr "¿Tienes un par de guantes de goma?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 2 Scalpels"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Do you have the scalpels?"
msgstr "¿Tienes los bisturís?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 200 Multivitamin Pills"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Do you have the vitamins?"
msgstr "¿Tienes vitaminas?"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Find 10 Filter Masks"
msgstr "Encontrar 10 Máscaras con filtro"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Find 10 Syringes"
msgstr "Encontrar 10 Jeringas"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Find 2 Scalpels"
msgstr "Encontrar 2 Escalpelos"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Find 4 Pairs of Rubber Gloves"
msgstr "Encontrar 4 Pares Guan. de Goma"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Find Advanced Emergency Care"
msgstr "Encontrar Guía de C. Méd. Avanzado"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Find a Chemistry Set"
msgstr "Encontrar Equipos de Química"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Advanced Emergency Care"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid ""
"Have you heard of a book called the 'Guide to Advanced Emergency Care?'  I "
"really need a copy.  The doctor is requesting a lot of supplies that I'm not "
"familiar with, but I believe I could make if I could get a copy of the book."
msgstr ""
"¿Ha oído hablar de un libro llamado \"Guía de Cuidados Avanzados de "
"Emergencia\"? Realmente necesito una copia. El doctor está solicitando un "
"montón de suministros que no conozco pero creo que podría hacer si pudiera "
"conseguir una copia del libro."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 2 Scalpels"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Hospitals and crafting stores should have a few."
msgstr "Los hospitales y las tiendas de fabricación deberían tener algunos."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "How can I help you?"
msgstr "¿En qué te puedo ayudar?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid ""
"I can take a look at you if you like.  I'm not a doctor, but I know my way "
"around a clinic.  The cost is nine merch."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 2 Scalpels"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid ""
"I heard that we may have a physician on his way here.  The workers have "
"already begun expanding the clinic, but I need you to locate a pair of "
"scalpels to use in surgery when he arrives.  I'm sure you should be able to "
"find them in a hospital or craft shop."
msgstr ""
"Oí que puede que tengamos un médico de camino aquí. Los trabajadores ya han "
"empezado a ampliar la clínica pero necesito que localices un par de bisturís "
"para usar en la cirugía cuando llegue. Estoy seguro de que podrá "
"encontrarlos en un hospital o en una tienda de artesanías."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "I should be fine."
msgstr "Voy a estar bien."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid ""
"I was a practicing nurse, so I've taken over the medical responsibilities of "
"the outpost till we can locate a physician."
msgstr ""
"Yo era auxiliar de enfermería practicante por lo que me he hecho cargo de "
"las responsabilidades médicas del puesto hasta que podamos conseguir un "
"médico."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 3 Hotplates"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid ""
"I was given a few bottles of bleach when I arrived, but I need a number of "
"hotplates to actually sterilize equipment.  I'm sure you can find them in "
"any old house or appliance store.  Three should be enough for now."
msgstr ""
"Me dieron unas cuantas botellas de lejía cuando llegué, pero necesito varios "
"hornillos para esterilizar realmente el equipo. Estoy seguro de que puedes "
"encontrarlos en cualquier casa vieja o tienda de electrodomésticos. Tres "
"deberían ser suficientes por ahora."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid ""
"I'm willing to pay a premium for medical supplies that you might be able to "
"scavenge up.  I also have a few miscellaneous jobs from time to time."
msgstr ""
"Estoy dispuesto a pagar un extra por los suministros médicos que puedas ser "
"capaz de rebuscar. También tengo algunos trabajos variados de vez en cuando."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a Chemistry Set"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid ""
"I've been working on producing some of our own medical supplies, but I'm "
"going to need a chemistry set to get everything that I need in order.  Is "
"there any way you could go through one of the school chemistry labs and "
"steal me a chemistry set?"
msgstr ""
"Estuve trabajando en la producción de algunos suministros médicos propios, "
"pero voy a necesitar un equipo de química para poner todo lo que necesito en "
"orden. ¿Hay alguna forma de que puedas ir a los laboratorios de las escuelas "
"y me robes un equipo de química?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 100 Aspirin"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid ""
"I've got a handful of bandages and a few first aid kits to work with at the "
"moment… in other words I'm completely unable to treat most serious medical "
"emergencies.  I'm supposed to have priority on any medical supplies that the "
"scavengers bring in, but I imagine the black market for the stuff will "
"prevent me from ever seeing it.  I could use your help getting me 100 "
"aspirin pills to start with."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 3 Hotplates"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 200 Multivitamin Pills"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "It should be a fairly common item.  Don't know what else to say."
msgstr "Debería ser un objeto bastante común. No sé qué otra cosa decirte."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Advanced Emergency Care"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Libraries are the only place I'd think to look."
msgstr "Las bibliotecas son los únicos lugares donde los buscaria."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Make 4 Charcoal Purifiers"
msgstr "Hacer 4 Purif. de Agua a Carbón"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Not now."
msgstr "No ahora."

#. ~ Name suffix of a female NPC
#. ~ Mission source for clinic.  Provides medical attention.
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Nurse"
msgstr "Enfermera"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "That's the best I can do on short notice."
msgstr "Eso es lo mejor que puedo hacer con poco tiempo."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 4 Pairs of Rubber Gloves"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid ""
"The bodily fluids that I often have to clean up and the caustic chemicals I "
"deal with have done a number on my current pair of gloves.  Could you find "
"me four pairs of heavy rubber gloves?  That should be enough that I can task "
"a few laborers with cleanup details in the event of an outbreak."
msgstr ""
"Los fluidos corporales que a menudo tengo que limpiar y los químicos "
"cáusticos que uso han mermado mi cantidad de guantes. ¿Podrías conseguirme "
"cuatro pares de guantes de goma resistente? Eso debería ser suficiente para "
"asignarle tareas de higiene a algunos trabajadores en el caso de un brote."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 Filter Masks"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid ""
"The number of airway infections that I've encountered in the past week has "
"depleted my supply of masks.  Could you find me 10 filter masks?  I tend to "
"only distribute them in severe cases, so I'll be sure to make them last."
msgstr ""
"El número de infecciones de las vías respiratorias que he encontrado en la "
"última semana ha agotado mi suministro de máscaras. ¿Podría encontrarme 10 "
"máscaras con filtro? Tiendo a distribuirlas sólo en casos severos, así que "
"me aseguraré de que duren."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 Syringes"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid ""
"We are starting to isolate a few natural antibiotic serums, but we don't "
"have the supplies to administer the cocktails.  I need you to bring me 10 "
"empty syringes to use.  I'll take care of cleaning them to prevent "
"transferring infections."
msgstr ""
"Estamos empezando a aislar algunos sueros antibióticos naturales pero no "
"tenemos los suministros para administrar los cócteles. Necesito que me "
"traigas 10 jeringas vacías para usar. Me encargaré de limpiarlas para "
"prevenir la transferencia de infecciones."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 100 Aspirin"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "We'll go through this pretty quickly, but it does help."
msgstr "Pasaremos por esto bastante rápido, pero ayuda."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "What kind of jobs do you have for me?"
msgstr "¿Qué tipo de trabajo tienen para mí?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 4 Charcoal Purifiers"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid ""
"With some basic survival and crafting skills, you should be able to make "
"them with little effort."
msgstr ""
"Con alguna habilidad básica en supervivencia y fabricación, deberías poder "
"construirlos sin mucho esfuerzo."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 Filter Masks"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "You may be able to make one if you had the right guide."
msgstr "Podrías hacer uno si tuvieras la guía adecuada."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a Chemistry Set"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "You might be able to find one in a pharmacy if you can't find a school."
msgstr ""
"Podrías encontrar una en una farmacia si no puedes encontrar una escuela."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 4 Pairs of Rubber Gloves"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "You should be able to find them in cleaning closets."
msgstr "Deberías poder encontrarlos en los armarios de limpieza."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 12 Molotov Cocktails"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid ""
"Alcohol or kerosene is probably easier to refine rather than find in large "
"quantities."
msgstr ""
"El alcohol o aceite para lámparas es probablemente más fácil de refinar que "
"de encontrar en grandes cantidades."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Alright, thanks."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Any lucky find?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid ""
"Are you interested in the scavenging runs or one of the other tasks that I "
"might have for you?"
msgstr ""
"¿Estás interesado en las salidas a buscar basura o alguna de las otras "
"tareas que puedo tener para ti?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 3 Suits of Leather Armor"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid ""
"Cutting up some leather clothes would probably be easier than trying to tan "
"fresh hides."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 12 Molotov Cocktails"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Do you have the Molotov cocktails?"
msgstr "¿Tienes Cocteles Molotov?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 5 Headlamps"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Do you have the headlamps?"
msgstr "¿Ya conseguiste las linternas frontales?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 3 Suits of Leather Armor"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Do you have the leather armor?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 6 Fire-Hardened Wooden Spears"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Do you have the wooden spears?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 6 Fire-Hardened Wooden Spears"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid ""
"I can usually use additional survival gear to kit out the new recruits.  The "
"most basic weapon that everyone gets is a fire-hardened wooden spear… "
"They're not the best weapons, but we need people who are used to making do.  "
"Could you make me a half dozen of them?  I may need more later, but that "
"should help the first few teams."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I organize scavenging runs to bring in supplies that we can't produce "
"ourselves.  I try and provide incentives to get migrants to join one of the "
"teams… it's dangerous work, but keeps our outpost alive.  Selling anything "
"we can't use helps keep us afloat with the traders.  If you wanted to drop "
"off a companion or two to assist in one of the runs, I'd appreciate it."
msgstr ""
"Organizo campañas de recolecciól para traer suministros que no podemos "
"producir nosotros mismos. Intento ofrecer incentivos para que los emigrantes "
"se unan a uno de los equipos... Es un trabajo peligroso pero mantiene vivo "
"nuestro puesto de avanzada. Vender cualquier cosa que no podamos usar nos "
"ayuda a mantenernos a flote con los comerciantes. Si quiere dejar uno o dos "
"compañeros para ayudar en una de las misiones, te lo agradecería."

