#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter1.json
msgid "<npc_name> drops the logs off in the garage…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter1.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm one of the migrants that got diverted to this outpost when I arrived at "
"the refugee center.  They said I was big enough to swing an axe, so my "
"profession became lumberjack… didn't have any say in it.  If I want to eat, "
"then I'll be cutting wood from now till kingdom come."
msgstr ""
"Soy uno de los migrantes que se desvió a este puesto de avanzada cuando "
"llegué al centro de refugiados. Dijeron que era lo suficientemente grande "
"como para mover un hacha, así que mi profesión se convirtió en leñador... no "
"tenía nada que decir al respecto. Si quiero comer, cortaré leña desde ahora "
"hasta que llegue el reino."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
