#. ~ Description of profession "Bionic Sniper" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"A top-secret military program sought to convert you into the perfect "
"sniper.  Your bionics, equipment, and extensive field training enable you to "
"drop targets from implausible distances, even after weeks of total isolation "
"in enemy territory."
msgstr ""
"Un programa militar ultrasecreto pretendía convertirte en la francotiradora "
"perfecto. Tu biónica, tu equipo y tu extenso entrenamiento de campo te "
"permiten abatir objetivos desde distancias inverosímiles, incluso tras "
"semanas de total aislamiento en territorio enemigo."

