"maybe you were at a nudist beach, or maybe you just enjoy the feeling of "
"liberation brought by the wind touching your skin.  Whatever the reason, you "
"lack clothes in a time when everyone wants a piece of you."
msgstr ""
"¡Por alguna razón, estás completamente desnudo!. Tal vez te robaron, tal vez "
"estuviste en una playa nudista, o tal vez simplemente disfrutas de la "
"sensación de liberación que produce el viento al tocar tu piel. Sea lo que "
"sea, te falta ropa en un momento en que todos quieren un pedazo de ti."

#. ~ Description of profession "Gangster" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The boss always said he could rely on you to pull through on the tough "
"jobs.  Shame he got himself smoked.  No problem; the world's always got a "
"place for someone with your kind of talents."
msgstr ""
"El jefe siempre decía que podía confiar en ti para los trabajos difíciles. "
"Es una pena que no lo haya logrado. No hay problema; el mundo siempre tiene "
"un lugar para alguien con tus talentos."

#. ~ Description of profession "Gangster" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
