"descansando de los gritos infernales de los niños, aunque empiezas a oír "
"otros nuevos..."

#. ~ Description of profession "MMA Fighter" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You might have once dreamed of fighting in the octagon, but the Cataclysm "
"presents a new venue for Mixed Martial Arts."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "MMA Fighter" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You might have once dreamed of fighting in the octagon, but the Cataclysm "
"presents a new venue for Mixed Martial Arts."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Military Holdout" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You must have paid attention to your survival training in boot camp; "
"otherwise, you would never have lived long enough to outlast the chain of "
"command and find yourself in this predicament.  The only mission now is to "
"survive."
msgstr ""
"Debiste prestar atención a tu entrenamiento de supervivencia en el "
"campamento de principiantes; de lo contrario, nunca habrías vivido lo "
"suficiente como para sobrevivir a la cadena de mando y encontrarte en esta "
"situación. La única misión que queda ahora es sobrevivir."

#. ~ Description of profession "Military Holdout" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You must have paid attention to your survival training in boot camp; "
"otherwise, you would never have lived long enough to outlast the chain of "
"command and find yourself in this predicament.  The only mission now is to "
"survive."
msgstr ""
"Debiste prestar atención a tu entrenamiento de supervivencia en el "
"campamento de principiantes; de lo contrario, nunca habrías vivido lo "
"suficiente como para sobrevivir a la cadena de mando y encontrarte en esta "
"situación. La única misión que queda ahora es sobrevivir."

#. ~ Description of profession "Delinquent" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You never cared for grown-ups telling you what to do, so you ended up "
"spending quite a few days in the principal's office.  Now, not needing grown-"
"ups to tell you what to do is the only reason you're alive.  Man, you really "
"should've played hooky today."
msgstr ""
"Nunca te importó que los adultos te dijeran lo que tenías que hacer, así que "
"acabaste pasando unos cuantos días en el despacho del director. Ahora, no "
"necesitar que los adultos te digan lo que tienes que hacer es la única razón "
"por la que estás viva. Tía, deberías haber hecho novillos hoy."

#. ~ Description of profession "Delinquent" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You never cared for grown-ups telling you what to do, so you ended up "
"spending quite a few days in the principal's office.  Now, not needing grown-"
"ups to tell you what to do is the only reason you're alive.  Man, you really "
"should've played hooky today."
msgstr ""
"Nunca te importó que los adultos te dijeran lo que tenías que hacer, así que "
"acabaste pasando unos cuantos días en el despacho del director. Ahora, no "
"necesitar que los adultos te digan lo que tienes que hacer es la única razón "
"por la que estás vivo. Tío, deberías haber hecho novillos hoy."

#. ~ Description of profession "Trucker" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You once ruled the road in your big rig.  When the riots hit, you hopped in "
"and drove it to safety.  Now it's just you and your truck against the world."
msgstr ""
"Una vez gobernaste la carretera en tu gran camión. Cuando llegaron los "
"disturbios, te subiste y condujiste hasta un lugar seguro. Ahora sólo estas "
"tú y tu camión contra el mundo."

#. ~ Description of profession "Trucker" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You once ruled the road in your big rig.  When the riots hit, you hopped in "
"and drove it to safety.  Now it's just you and your truck against the world."
msgstr ""
