#. ~ Description of gun "C8 carbine"
#. ~ Description of "C8 carbine"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/items/guns.json
msgid ""
"A carbine variant of the C7A1, recently introduced by the Canadian armed "
"forces.  Though accurate, small, and lightweight, it is infamous for its "
"unreliability when not properly maintained.  It is chambered in 5.56x45mm "
"and accepts STANAG magazines."
msgstr ""
"Una variante de carabina del C7A1, recientemente introducida en las fuerzas "
"armadas Canadienses. Aunque es precisa, pequeña y ligera, tiene la mala fama "
"de ser muy poco fiable cuando no se mantiene de forma adecuada. Usa una "
"recámara  del 5.56x45mm y es compatible con cargadores STANAG."

#. ~ Description of gun "Browning Hi-Power"
#. ~ Description of "Browning Hi-Power"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/items/guns.json
msgid ""
"A licensed copy of the Browning Hi-Power, made by John Inglis and Company.  "
"Issued to officers and infantry in need of a weapon for confined spaces, "
"this is chambered in 9x19 Parabellum."
msgstr ""
"Una copia licenciada de la Browning Hi-Power, hecha por John Inglis and "
"Company. Usada por oficiales e infantería que necesitan un arma para "
"espacios confinados. Esta tiene recamara de 9x19 Parabellum."

#. ~ Description of gun "C9"
#. ~ Description of "C9"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/items/guns.json
msgid ""
"A mountable machine gun used by Canadian infantry, feeding from a belt or "
"STANAG magazines in a pinch.  Quite inaccurate and difficult to control, the "
"C9 is designed to fire many rounds very quickly."
msgstr ""
"Una ametralladora plegable usada por la infantería canadiense, que se "
"alimenta con un cinturón o cargadores STANAG en caso de necesidad. Bastante "
"precisa y difícil de controlar, la C9 esta diseñada para disparar muchas "
"balas rápidamente."

#. ~ Description of variant "M1911A1" of gun "M1911A1"
#. ~ Description of variant "M1911A1" of item "M1911A1"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/items/guns.json
msgid ""
"An update to the original M1911, featuring an extended tang on the grip "
"safety to prevent hammer bite as well as a shorter trigger for smaller hands."
msgstr ""
"Un actualización del M1911 original, que tiene una espiga extendida en el "
"seguro para prevenir golpes de retroceso así como un gatillo mas corto para "
"manos pequeñas."

