msgstr ""

#: src/consumption.cpp:999
msgid "This is rotten and smells awful!"
msgstr "¡Esto está podrido y apesta!"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1008
msgid "The thought of eating human flesh makes you feel sick."
msgstr "La idea de comer carne humana te provoca nauseas."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1015
#, c-format
msgid "Consuming this %s probably isn't very healthy."
msgstr "Consumir %s probablemente no es muy sano."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1023
msgid "You still feel nauseated and will probably puke it all up again."
msgstr ""

#: src/consumption.cpp:1029
msgid "Your stomach won't be happy (allergy)."
msgstr "A tu estomago no le hará gracia (alergia)."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1034
msgid "Your stomach won't be happy (not rotten enough)."
msgstr "A tu estomago no le hará gracia (no suficientemente podrido)."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1043
msgid "You're full already and will be forcing yourself to eat."
msgstr "Ya estas lleno y te estarás obligando a comer."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1045
msgid "You're full already and will be forcing yourself to drink."
msgstr "Ya estas lleno y te estarás obligando a beber."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1062
#, c-format
msgid "Eat your %s anyway?"
msgstr "¿Comes tu %s de todas formas?"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1064
#, c-format
msgid "Drink your %s anyway?"
msgstr "¿Bebes tu %s de todas formas?"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1066
#, c-format
msgid "Consume your %s anyway?"
msgstr "¿Consumes tu %s de todas formas?"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1124
msgid ""
"You've begun stockpiling calories and liquid for hibernation.  You get the "
"feeling that you should prepare for bed, just in case, but… you're hungry "
"again, and you could eat a whole week's worth of food RIGHT NOW."
msgstr ""
"Has empezado a acumular calorías y líquido para la hibernación. Tienes la "
"sensación de que deberías prepararte para ir a la cama, por si acaso, "
"pero... tienes hambre de nuevo, y podrías comer toda una semana de comida "
"AHORA MISMO."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1133
#, c-format
msgid "Ick, this %s doesn't taste so good…"
msgstr "Agh, %s no sabe tan bien..."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1138
#, c-format
msgid "Mmm, this %s tastes delicious…"
msgstr "Mmm, %s sabe muy bien..."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1174
#, c-format
msgid "<npcname> assimilates a %s."
msgstr "<npcname> asimila %s."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1174
#, c-format
msgid "You assimilate your %s."
msgstr "Te incorporás tu %s."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1184 src/consumption.cpp:1198
#, c-format
msgid "Ick, this %s (rotten) doesn't taste so good…"
msgstr "Ick, este %s (podrido) no sabe tan bien..."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1185
#, c-format
msgid "You drink your %s (rotten)."
msgstr "Te bebes tu%s (putrefacción)."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1187
#, c-format
msgid "<npcname> drinks a %s."
msgstr "<npcname> bebe %s."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1187
#, c-format
msgid "You drink your %s."
msgstr "Te tomas tu %s."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1199
#, c-format
msgid "You eat your %s (rotten)."
msgstr "Te comes tu %s  (podrido)."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1202
#, c-format
msgid "<npcname> eats a %s."
msgstr "<npcname> come %s."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1202
#, c-format
msgid "You eat your %s."
msgstr "Te comes %s."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1226
msgid ""
"You try to ignore its mushy texture, but it leaves you with an awful "
"aftertaste."
msgstr ""
"Intentas ignorar su textura blanda, pero te deja con un sabor espantoso."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1230
msgid "You can't taste much of anything with this cold."
msgstr "No se puede saborear mucho de nada con este frío."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1233
msgid "You can't taste much of anything with this flu."
msgstr "No puedes saborear nada con esta gripe."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1372
msgid "The human blood tastes as good as any other."
msgstr ""

#: src/consumption.cpp:1374
msgid "It's meat, that's all that matters."
msgstr ""

#: src/consumption.cpp:1376
msgid "You feel a cold twinge of guilt.  It will pass."
msgstr ""

#: src/consumption.cpp:1379
msgid "This is wrong, but you can't stop yourself."
msgstr ""

#: src/consumption.cpp:1383
msgid ""
"Despite your cravings, you can't help feeling weird about drinking "
"somebody's blood."
msgstr ""

#: src/consumption.cpp:1387
msgid "This goes against everything you believe in."
msgstr ""

#: src/consumption.cpp:1391
msgid "You find this meal distasteful, but you'll get over it."
msgstr ""

#: src/consumption.cpp:1397
msgid "You feel horrible for eating a person."
msgstr "Te sientes horrible por haberte comido una persona."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1419
msgid "As you tear into the raw flesh, you feel satisfied with your meal."
msgstr ""
"Mientras desgarras la carne cruda, te sientes satisfecho con tu comida."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1424
msgid "Raw flesh doesn't taste all that bad, actually."
msgstr "La carne cruda no sabe tan mal, en realidad."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1429
msgid "This doesn't taste very good, but meat is meat."
msgstr "Esto no sabe muy bien, pero carne es carne."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1439 src/consumption.cpp:1459 src/consumption.cpp:1468
msgid "Your stomach begins gurgling and you feel bloated and ill."
msgstr "Tu estómago empieza a borbotear y te sientes hinchado y enfermo."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1444
msgid "Mmm, junk food."
msgstr "Mmm, comida basura."

#. ~ Translators: This is a quote from the 1973 animated film Charlotte's Web, where a rat is singing about eating trash off the ground. Do what you will with that information.
#: src/consumption.cpp:1450
msgid "A veritable smorgasbord!"
msgstr ""

#: src/consumption.cpp:1452
msgid "Snack attack!"
msgstr ""

#: src/consumption.cpp:1476
msgid "You find the sweet taste of honey surprisingly palatable."
msgstr "El dulce sabor de la miel te parece sorprendentemente sabroso."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1478
msgid "You feast upon the sweet honey."
msgstr "Te haces un festín con la dulce miel."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1496
msgid "You're not sure you're going to be able to keep that down."
msgstr ""

#: src/consumption.cpp:1497
msgid "<npcname> looks about ready to puke."
msgstr ""

#: src/consumption.cpp:1637
msgid "You gorge yourself, preparing to hibernate."
msgstr "Te atiborrás de comida, preparándote para hibernar."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1645
msgid "You feel stocked for a day or two.  Got your bed all ready and secured?"
msgstr ""
"Te sientes abastecido por un día o dos. ¿Tienes la cama lista y asegurada?"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1654
msgid ""
"Mmm.  You can still fit some more in… but maybe you should get comfortable "
"and sleep."
msgstr ""
"Mmm. Todavía puede caber un poco más dentro... pero tal vez deberías ponerte "
"cómodo y dormir."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1661
msgid "That filled a hole!  Time for bed…"
