#: src/iuse.cpp:480
#, c-format
msgid "You remove the radio modification from your %s."
msgstr "Eliminas la modificación de radio de tu %s."

#: src/iuse.cpp:499
#, c-format
msgid "You're already smoking a %s!"
msgstr "¡Ya estás fumandote un %s!"

#: src/iuse.cpp:503
msgid "You don't have anything to light it with!"
msgstr "¡No tienes nada para encenderlo!"

#: src/iuse.cpp:510
msgid "Are you sure you want to drink… this?"
msgstr "¿Estás seguro de que quieres beber... esto?"

#: src/iuse.cpp:527 src/iuse.cpp:8049 src/iuse.cpp:8060
#, c-format
msgid "You take some %s."
msgstr "Tomas un poco de %s."

#: src/iuse.cpp:562
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Please let the devs know you should be able to smoke a %s, but the smoking "
"code does not know how."
msgstr ""
"Por favor, hacerle saber a los desarrolladores que tu deberías poder fumar "
"un %s pero el código de fumar no sabe cómo hacerlo todavía."

#: src/iuse.cpp:570
#, c-format
msgid "You light a %s."
msgstr "Te prendes un %s."

#: src/iuse.cpp:586
msgid "You take a puff from your electronic cigarette."
msgstr "Le das una bocanada a tu cigarrillo electrónico."

#: src/iuse.cpp:590
msgid "You inhale some vapor from your advanced electronic cigarette."
msgstr "Inhalas un poco de vapor de tu cigarrillo electrónico avanzado."

#: src/iuse.cpp:595
msgid "You don't have any nicotine liquid!"
msgstr "¡No tienes nicotina líquida!"

#: src/iuse.cpp:606
msgid "You take some antibiotics."
msgstr "Te tomas unos anitibióticos."

#: src/iuse.cpp:607
msgid "<npcname> takes some antibiotics."
msgstr "<npcname> se toma unos antibióticos."

#: src/iuse.cpp:619
msgid "Your pinkeye seems to be clearing up."
msgstr ""

#: src/iuse.cpp:621 src/iuse.cpp:632
msgid "Your pinkeye doesn't feel any better."
msgstr ""

#: src/iuse.cpp:636
msgid ""
"Maybe this is just the placebo effect, but you feel a little better as the "
"dose settles in."
msgstr ""
"Tal vez sólo sea un efecto placebo, pero te sientes un poco mejor a medida "
"que la dosis se asienta."

#: src/iuse.cpp:649
#, c-format
msgid "You're out of %s."
msgstr "Te quedaste sin %s."

#: src/iuse.cpp:652
#, c-format
msgid "You use your %s."
msgstr "Usas %s."

#: src/iuse.cpp:656
msgid "You wash the slime from your eyes."
msgstr "Te limpiás las babas de tus ojos."

#: src/iuse.cpp:674
msgid "<npcname> uses some fungicide."
msgstr "<npcname> usa un poco de fungicida."

#: src/iuse.cpp:674
msgid "You use your fungicide."
msgstr "Usas fungicida."

#: src/iuse.cpp:680 src/iuse.cpp:727
msgid "You feel a burning sensation slowly radiating throughout your skin."
msgstr ""
"Sientes una sensación de ardor que se irradia lentamente por toda tu piel."

#: src/iuse.cpp:686 src/iuse.cpp:731
msgid "Your skin grows warm for a moment."
msgstr "Por un momento, la piel se te pone caliente."

#: src/iuse.cpp:703
#, c-format
msgid "The %s is covered in tiny spores!"
msgstr "¡El %s está cubierto por pequeñas esporas!"

#: src/iuse.cpp:742
msgid "You take some antiparasitic medication."
msgstr "Tomas un poco de medicación antiparasitaria."

#: src/iuse.cpp:745
msgid "The itching sensation under your skin fades away."
msgstr "El picor que sentías debajo de la piel desaparece."

#: src/iuse.cpp:751
msgid "Your bowels clench as something inside them dies."
msgstr "Tus intestinos se contraen porque algo adentro se muere."

#: src/iuse.cpp:753
msgid "Your bowels spasm painfully as something inside them dies."
msgstr ""
"Sientes espasmos dolorosos en tus intestinos ya que algo adentro se muere."

#: src/iuse.cpp:759
msgid "Your skin prickles and your veins itch for a few moments."
msgstr "Sientes un hormigueo en la piel y te pican las venas por un momento."

#: src/iuse.cpp:763
msgid "Your veins relax in a soothing wave through your body."
msgstr ""
"Tus venas se relajan en una onda tranquilizadora a través de tu cuerpo."

#: src/iuse.cpp:768
msgid "The pressure inside your head feels better already."
msgstr "La presión adentro de tu cabeza ya no te molesta tanto."

#: src/iuse.cpp:771
msgid "Your head pounds like a sore tooth as something inside of it dies."
msgstr ""
"Te late la cabeza como un dolor de muelas ya que algo adentro se muere."

#: src/iuse.cpp:778
msgid "The stiffness in your joints goes away."
msgstr "La rigidez de tus articulaciones desaparece."

#: src/iuse.cpp:780
msgid "The pain in your joints goes away."
msgstr "El dolor de tus articulaciones desaparece."

#: src/iuse.cpp:801
msgid "You stop shaking."
msgstr "Dejaste de temblar."

#: src/iuse.cpp:808
msgid "You snort a bump of coke."
msgstr "Te esnifás una línea de cocaína."

#: src/iuse.cpp:824
msgid "You inject the vaccine."
msgstr "Te inyectas la vacuna."

#: src/iuse.cpp:829
msgid "You no longer need to fear the flu, at least for some time."
msgstr "Ya no tienes que temerle a la gripe, al menos por un tiempo."

#: src/iuse.cpp:833
msgid ""
"You notice the date on the packaging is pretty old.  It may no longer be "
"effective."
msgstr ""
"Se nota que la fecha del envase es bastante antigua. Puede que ya no sea "
"válido."

#: src/iuse.cpp:851 src/iuse.cpp:873
msgid "Are you sure you want to eat this?  It looks poisonous…"
msgstr "¿Estás seguro de que quieres comer esto? Parece venenoso..."

#: src/iuse.cpp:899
#, c-format
msgid "This %s probably meant a lot to someone at one time."
msgstr "Este %s probablemente significó mucho para alguien, alguna vez."

#: src/iuse.cpp:920
msgid "You feel completely exhausted."
msgstr "Te sientes completamente exhausto."

#: src/iuse.cpp:924
msgid "You feel a bit wobbly."
msgstr "Te sientes un poco mareado."

#: src/iuse.cpp:941
msgid "A sense of dull ennui washes over you."
msgstr ""

#: src/iuse.cpp:955
msgid "You eat the datura seed."
msgstr "Te comes la semilla de datura."

#: src/iuse.cpp:964
msgid "You take a puff from your inhaler."
msgstr "Usas tu inhalador."

#: src/iuse.cpp:965
msgid "<npcname> takes a puff from their inhaler."
msgstr " <npcname> toma una bocanada de su inhalador."

#: src/iuse.cpp:980
#, c-format
msgid "You breathe deeply from the %s."
msgstr "Respirás profundamente desde  %s."

#: src/iuse.cpp:982
#, c-format
msgid "<npcname> breathes from the %s."
msgstr "<npcname> respiras desde el %s."

#: src/iuse.cpp:998
msgid "This seems like a bad idea, are you sure you want to drink it?"
msgstr ""

#: src/iuse.cpp:1002
msgid "This seems like a bad idea, are you sure you want to eat it?"
msgstr ""

#: src/iuse.cpp:1009
msgid "Blech, that tastes gross!"
msgstr "¡Puaj, tiene un gusto horrible!"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1020
msgid "Blech, that burns your throat!"
msgstr "¡Puaj, te quema la garganta!"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1026
msgid "Blech, you don't feel you can stomach much of that."
msgstr "Puaj, no te sientes capaz de soportar mucho de eso."

#: src/iuse.cpp:1037
msgid "Automatically eating the gross food because a test told us to."
msgstr ""

#: src/iuse.cpp:1041
msgid "This looks unclean; are you sure you want to drink it?"
msgstr "Esto parece sucio, ¿Seguro que quieres beberlo?"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1045
msgid "This looks unclean; are you sure you want to eat it?"
msgstr "Esto parece sucio, ¿Seguro que quieres comerlo?"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1059
msgid "The meal is revitalizing."
msgstr "La comida es revitalizadora."

#: src/iuse.cpp:1061
msgid "Oddly enough, this doesn't taste so bad."
msgstr "Aunque parezca mentira, esto no tiene mal gusto."

#: src/iuse.cpp:1087
msgid "You feel cleansed."
msgstr "Te sientes purificado."

#: src/iuse.cpp:1097
msgid "You feel a slight itching inside, but it passes."
msgstr "Sientes una pequeño picor por adentro, pero se te pasa."

#: src/iuse.cpp:1116
msgid "You don't have any mutations to purify."
msgstr "No tienes ninguna mutación para purificar."

#: src/iuse.cpp:1120
msgid "Choose a mutation to purify: "
msgstr "Elija una mutación a purificar:"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1128
msgid ""
"You inject the purifier.  The liquid thrashes inside the tube and goes down "
"reluctantly."
msgstr ""
"Inyecta el purificador. El líquido se agita dentro del tubo y baja a "
"regañadientes."

#: src/iuse.cpp:1186
#, c-format
msgid ""
"As you eat the %s, you have a near-religious experience, feeling at one with "
"your surroundings…"
msgstr ""
"A medida que comes el %s, tienes una experiencia casi religiosa, sintiéndote "
"uno con tu entorno..."

#: src/iuse.cpp:1218
msgid "It tastes extremely strange!"
msgstr "¡Tiene un gusto extremadamente extraño!"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1226 src/iuse.cpp:1376
msgid "You feel better all over."
msgstr "Te sientes bien otra vez."

#: src/iuse.cpp:1237
msgid "It is delicious, and very filling!"
msgstr "¡Es delicioso, y llena mucho!"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1242
msgid "It is delicious, but you can't eat any more."
msgstr "Es delicioso, pero no puedes comer más."

#: src/iuse.cpp:1245
msgid "You take one bite, and immediately vomit!"
msgstr "Le pegas una mordida, ¡Y vomitas inmediatamente!"

#: src/iuse.cpp:1250
msgid ""
"You feel a familiar warmth, but suddenly it surges into an excruciating burn "
"as you convulse, vomiting, and black out…"
msgstr ""
"Sientes un calor familiar, pero de repente se convierte en una insoportable "
"quemadura mientras convulsionas, vomitas y te desmayas..."

#: src/iuse.cpp:1253
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Suffered Marloss Rejection."
msgstr "Sufrió Rechazo de Marloss."

#: src/iuse.cpp:1254
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Suffered Marloss Rejection."
msgstr "Sufrió Rechazo de Marloss."

#: src/iuse.cpp:1270
msgid ""
"You feel a familiar warmth, but suddenly it surges into painful burning as "
"you convulse and collapse to the ground…"
msgstr ""
"Sientes un calor familiar, pero de repente se convierte en un doloroso ardor "
"al convulsionar y caer al suelo..."

#: src/iuse.cpp:1282 src/monattack.cpp:2001
msgid ""
"You wake up in a Marloss bush.  Almost *cradled* in it, actually, as though "
"it grew there for you."
msgstr ""
"Te despiertas en un arbusto Marloss. Casi acurrucado/a, actualmente como si "
"hubieras crecido ahí para ti."

#. ~ Beginning to hear the Mycus while conscious: that's it speaking
#: src/iuse.cpp:1285
msgid ""
"unity.  together we have reached the door.  we provide the final key.  now "
"to pass through…"
msgstr ""
"Unidad. Juntos hemos llegado a la puerta. Proporcionamos la última llave. "
"Ahora para pasar a través de..."

#: src/iuse.cpp:1287
msgid "You feel a strange warmth spreading throughout your body…"
msgstr "Sientes un extraño calor que se extiende por todo tu cuerpo..."

#. ~ "Nuh-uh" is a sound used for "nope", "no", etc.
#: src/iuse.cpp:1308
msgid ""
"After what happened that last time?  Nuh-uh.  You're not eating that alien "
"poison."
msgstr ""
"¿Después de lo que pasó la última vez? No. No vas a comer ese veneno "
"alienígena."

#: src/iuse.cpp:1313
msgid "we no longer require this scaffolding.  we reserve it for other uses."
msgstr ""
"nosotros ya no necesitamos estos andamios. nosotros los reservamos para "
"otros usos."

#: src/iuse.cpp:1334 src/iuse.cpp:5168
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to eat the %s?  You could plant it in a mound of dirt."
msgstr ""
"¿Seguro que quieres comer el %s? Podrías plantarlo en un montón de tierra."

#: src/iuse.cpp:1375
msgid "It tastes amazing, and you finish it quickly."
msgstr "Sabe increíble, y lo terminas rápidamente."

#: src/iuse.cpp:1380
msgid ""
"As it settles in, you feel ecstasy radiating through every part of your body…"
msgstr ""
"A medida que se asienta, sientes el éxtasis irradiando por cada parte de tu "
"cuerpo..."

#: src/iuse.cpp:1383
msgid ""
"Your eyes roll back in your head.  Everything dissolves into a blissful haze…"
msgstr ""
"Tus ojos se vuelven a poner en blanco en tu cabeza. Todo se disuelve en una "
"neblina de felicidad..."

#. ~ The Mycus does not use the term (or encourage the concept of) "you".  The PC is a local/native organism, but is now the Mycus.
#. ~ It still understands the concept, but uninitelligent fungal zombies and mind-bent symbiotes should not need it.
#. ~ We are the Mycus.
#: src/iuse.cpp:1392
msgid "we welcome into us.  we have endured long in this forbidding world."
msgstr ""
"Te damos la bienvenida a nosotros. Hemos sobrevivido en este mundo "
"prohibitivo."

#: src/iuse.cpp:1395
msgid ""
"A sea of white caps, waving gently.  A haze of spores wafting silently over "
"a forest."
msgstr ""
"Un mar de gorras blancas, agitándose suavemente. Una neblina de esporas que "
"flota silenciosamente sobre el bosque."

#: src/iuse.cpp:1397
msgid "the natives have a saying: \"e pluribus unum.\"  out of many, one."
msgstr "Los nativos tienen un dicho: \"E Pluribus Unum.\"  De muchos, uno."

#: src/iuse.cpp:1400
msgid ""
"The blazing pink redness of the berry.  The juices spreading across our "
"tongue, the warmth draping over us like a lover's embrace."
msgstr ""
"El rojo intenso de la baya. Los zumos que se extienden por nuestra lengua, "
"el calor que nos envuelve como el abrazo de un amante."

#: src/iuse.cpp:1402
msgid ""
"we welcome the union of our lines in our local guide.  we will prosper, and "
"unite this world.  even now, our fruits adapt to better serve local "
"physiology."
msgstr ""
"Bienvenimos la unión de nuestras guias locales, prosperaremos, y uniremos "
"este mundo, aun ahora, nuestros frutos se adaptan para servir a la "
"fisiología local."

#: src/iuse.cpp:1405
msgid ""
"The sky-blue of the seed.  The nutty, creamy flavors intermingling with the "
"berry, a memory that will never leave us."
msgstr ""
"El azul celeste de la semilla. Los sabores a nuez y crema que se mezclan con "
"la baya, un recuerdo que nunca nos dejará."

#: src/iuse.cpp:1407
msgid ""
"as, in time, shall we adapt to better welcome those who have not received us."
msgstr ""
"mientroas, con tiempo, nos adaptaremos para acoger mejor a los que no nos "
"han recibido."

#: src/iuse.cpp:1410
msgid ""
"The amber-yellow of the sap.  Feel it flowing through our veins, taking the "
"place of the strange, thin red gruel called \"blood.\""
msgstr ""
"El amarillo ámbar de la savia. Siéntelo fluir por nuestras venas, tomando el "
"lugar de las extrañas y delgadas gachas rojas llamadas \"sangre\"."

