msgid ""
"\n"
"Crafting bonus: %2d%%"
msgstr ""

#: src/newcharacter.cpp:1375
msgid ""
"\n"
"- Learning speed\n"
"- Teaching ability\n"
"- Bandaging wounds and stopping blood loss\n"
"- Chance of success when installing bionics\n"
"- Chance of success when manipulating with gun modifications\n"
"- Chance to learn a recipe when crafting from a book\n"
"- Chance of hacking/programming computers, card readers, robots, etc.\n"
"- Chance of bypassing vehicle security system\n"
"- Chance to get better results when disassembling items\n"
"- Bash damage with whips and flails\n"
"- Chance of being paralyzed by fear attack\n"
"- Speed of recovery from addiction"
msgstr ""

#: src/newcharacter.cpp:1393
msgid ""
"A measure of wits, proprioception, and acuity.  Perceptive characters excel "
"at ranged accuracy, critical hits, and striking weakpoints.  Perception is "
"broadly useful in combat, but most benefits stabbing weapons.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

