#~ msgid ""
#~ ".338 Lapua ammunition, loaded with a 256-grain armor-piercing incendiary "
#~ "bullet.  Developed as a joint venture between Accuracy International, "
#~ "SAKO, and Lapua, the .338 round is a long-range sniping cartridge that "
#~ "boasts impressive accuracy and devastating terminal ballistics.  This "
