#~ msgid ""
#~ "A pale white fungus, one meaty gray stalk supporting a bloom at the top.  "
#~ "Spores are periodically expelled from its gills, and a few tendrils "
#~ "extend from the base, allowing mobility and some basic means of defense."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Es un pálido hongo blanco, un tallo carnoso gris arriba del cual se apoya "
