#~ "sobre su experiencia como francotirador que sobre el propio acto de "
#~ "disparar."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "A small book offering insights into plant-based fuels, with detailed "
#~ "analyses of biodiesel types, and possible scenarios for their "
#~ "implementation.  Sadly most of the book just repeats itself, writing the "
#~ "same text over and over again, which makes you feel you stuck in a "
#~ "constant loop."
