#~ msgid ""
#~ "A student of the Diamond Mind discipline has honed their mind to defeat "
#~ "any opponent.  With quick reflexes and surgical precision, they are able "
#~ "to move so fast that their opponents are unable react.  Marked by "
#~ "unparalleled confidence, those that hesitate for even a moment will fall "
#~ "before them in the blink of an eye."
