#~ msgid ""
#~ "Before everything went to hell Jay was talking about going to some gun "
#~ "show.  There was a guy there who had managed to sneak some Russian gun "
#~ "into the US.  It was a massive deal for Jay, it was all he could talk "
#~ "about.  I know it's a long shot but maybe that guy was already at the gun "
#~ "show?  If you find the gun you can keep it, but it would mean a lot to "
#~ "Jay if he could take a look all he wanted was to pull it apart and put it "
#~ "back together."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Antes de que todo se fuera al infierno Jay hablaba de ir a una feria de "
#~ "armas. Había un tipo que había conseguido colar un arma rusa en los "
#~ "Estados Unidos. Era un asunto enorme para Jay, era todo de lo que podía "
#~ "hablar. Sé que es una posibilidad remota, pero tal vez ese tipo ya estaba "
#~ "en la feria de armas. Si encuentras el arma puedes quedarte con ella, "
#~ "pero significaría mucho para Jay si pudiera echar un vistazo, todo lo que "
#~ "quería era desmontarla y volver a montarla."

