#~ msgid "Even your eyes feel dry…"
#~ msgstr "Incluso tus ojos se sienten secos..."

#~ msgid "Evens out damage among your limbs."
#~ msgstr "Empareja el daño entre tus extremidades."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Eventually they took the bones from my body.  It's strange though, I "
