#~ msgid ""
#~ "One night I heard my neighbor calling for me to come help him.  I went "
#~ "outside wondering what he could possibly need my help with in the middle "
#~ "of the night."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Una noche oí que mi vecino me llamaba para que fuera a ayudarle. Salí a "
#~ "la calle preguntándome para qué podría necesitar mi ayuda en mitad de la "
#~ "noche."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "One of several species of the Tinamidae family.  These birds converged "
#~ "into shapes similar to fowl but are actually more closely related to the "
#~ "extinct moas."
