#~ msgid ""
#~ "Originating from big game express smoothbores and heavy fowling pieces "
#~ "adapted for wallguns, the Brogyeki '23 is an over/under break action "
#~ "'pistol' that is (unfortunately?) capable of launching its original 27.3 "
#~ "x 110 Diyua express slug and shot loads as well as the wide array of "
#~ "payloads in 27.3 x 44 Diyua.  A simple wire stock collapses neatly along "
#~ "its octagonal barrels, which feature a combination of sighting devices "
#~ "necessary for launching its numerous loads, in addition to the usual "
#~ "Exodii retrofits.  Unless you are a quadrupedal cyborg with this gun in a "
