#~ "something like that explains all the crazy shit I've seen either.  But "
#~ "collecting bones to… save the world?  Fuck it, give it a shot.  Maybe "
#~ "that's something just YOU do, though.  I'm happy believing a lie if "
#~ "that's the truth, I'll be honest."
