#~ "complete and absolute mastery of their weapon.  Users of Iron Heart are "
#~ "easily able to disable and dispatch opponents with superior skill and "
#~ "technique.  Only the fool would attempt to fight an Iron Heart student "
#~ "head-on."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "La disciplina Corazón de Hierro es el estudio del combate. Nada más pero "
