#~ msgid ""
#~ "The LV429 fires a series of extremely short high-energy laser pulses, "
#~ "more like bullets than a traditional laser beam, greatly reducing dwell "
#~ "time and increasing weapon effectiveness.  Matrix crystal technology has "
#~ "made the weapon compact enough to be man-portable and provided it with "
#~ "enough power for essentially unlimited combat operations, but heat "
#~ "dissipation is still a problem, preventing it from being fired more than "
#~ "once every few seconds."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "El LV429 dispara una serie de pulsos láser de alta energía extremadamente "
#~ "cortos, más parecidos a balas que a un rayo láser tradicional, lo que "
#~ "reduce en gran medida el tiempo de exposición y aumenta la efectividad "
