#~ msgid ""
#~ "The Soulfire is a phenomena of the caster's spirit binding to a fragment "
#~ "of a spirit of flame.  This makes it possible for the Soulfire to use its "
#~ "namesake as an element - much like fire, it does burn, but it burns away "
