#~ msgid ""
#~ "While biomancers focus on both life and death; Wither Mages set their "
#~ "sights on the transitional period between these two stages.  They wield "
#~ "entropy and decay hand and hand, using it to enhance their combat prowess "
#~ "to surgical precision.  This confluence of abilities are what lead to "
#~ "assassin mages gaining this attunement."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Mientras que los biománticos se centran en la vida y en la muerte, los "
#~ "Magos Marchitadores se centran en el periodo de transición entre estas "
#~ "dos etapas. Manejan la entropía y la decadencia mano a mano, y la "
#~ "utilizan para mejorar su destreza en el combate con una precisión "
#~ "quirúrgica. Esta confluencia de habilidades es lo que lleva a los magos "
#~ "asesinos a obtener esta sintonía."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "While fairly sturdy, the metal fence around this place won't hold out for "
#~ "long.  So, we've decided to replace it with a wall.  However, the nails "
#~ "we had were used to repair our existing structures, and they weren't "
#~ "nearly enough.  After some calculations, we need 6,800 nails to do it.  "
#~ "That may seem like a lot, but we're willing to give you a TON of credit "
#~ "for it."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Aunque la valla de metal es bastante resistente, no va a aguantar por "
#~ "mucho tiempo más. Así que decidimos reemplazarla con una pared. Sin "
