#~ msgid ""
#~ "While we were out on a hunting party a couple of those big ugly ones came "
#~ "back and ate a whole mob of the dead I wanted to take out.  We lost a lot "
#~ "of soldiers too while we were out too, good ones, and they died bad.  "
#~ "Slow.  I made sure of it, the traitors.  These dinosaurs have gone too "
