#~ msgid "Your essence flows around you, and the earth follows."
#~ msgstr "Tu esencia fluye a tu alrededor, y la tierra te sigue."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Your extensive field experience in bandaging and wound care is on par "
#~ "with that of a paramedic."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Tu amplia experiencia de campo en el vendaje y el cuidado de heridas está "
#~ "a la altura de la de un paramédico."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Your eye sockets have been surgically sealed with highly protective "
#~ "mirrored lenses and your tear ducts have been re-routed to your mouth.  "
#~ "When you cry, you must spit out or swallow your tears."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Las cuencas de tus ojos han sido selladas quirúrgicamente con unas lentes "
